�脢id�339629ba6477�body���气候正义强调，造成排放最少的发展中国家和年轻一代，往往最先、最重地承受气候灾害，因此减排责任、资金支持和适应资源应当公平分配。它把气候变化同时看作环境问题和人权问题。�-Climate justice stresses that those who emitted least—developing countries and younger generations—often suffer climate disasters first and worst, so emission duties, finance and adaptation aid must be distributed fairly. It treats climate change as both an environmental and a human-rights issue.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�39ac83b2dc59�body���自然资本指能带来惠益的森林、湿地、清洁空气和水等自然资产，是经济和社会运转的“底子”。把它算进国家和企业的账目，有助于避免为了短期增长而白白耗尽资源。��Natural capital is natural wealth—forests, wetlands, clean air and water—that yields benefits and underpins the economy and society. Counting it in national and corporate accounts helps avoid depleting resources for short-term growth.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3a94856b2899�body���黑碳是化石燃料和生物质不完全燃烧产生的黑色颗粒，飘在大气里会吸收阳光而增温。落到雪冰表面后降低反照率、加速融化，对极地和山区影响尤其明显。��Black carbon is dark particulate from incomplete burning of fossil fuels and biomass that absorbs sunlight and warms the air. When it lands on snow and ice it lowers reflectivity and speeds melting, with outsized effects in polar and mountain regions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�5c004fdce524�body���富营养化是氮、磷等营养盐过量进入水体，促使藻类暴发性繁殖。藻类死亡分解耗尽溶解氧，形成鱼虾无法存活的低氧死区，如墨西哥湾每年夏季出现大片缺氧区。�Eutrophication occurs when excess nitrogen and phosphorus spur algal blooms. As the algae die and decompose, they deplete dissolved oxygen, creating hypoxic dead zones where fish cannot survive, such as the large low-oxygen area in the Gulf of Mexico each summer.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6c8c5cb3fa4a�body���它把废物处理按优先顺序排列：最优先是源头减量，其次是重复使用、再循环、能量回收，最后才是焚烧和填埋。简单说就是“能不扔就不扔，能少用就少用”。��It ranks options by priority: prevention first, then reuse, recycling, energy recovery, and only lastly incineration and landfilling. In short: don't create waste, and use less in the first place.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�804d1b6abfa5�body���大气河是大气中又窄又长的强水汽输送带，能在短时间内把大量水汽从热带送到中纬度地区。它常给美国西海岸等地带来暴雨和洪水，但也能缓解干旱。�An atmospheric river is a narrow, elongated corridor of intense water-vapor transport that can move large amounts of moisture from the tropics to mid-latitudes. It often brings heavy rain and flooding to places like the U.S. West Coast, but can also relieve droughts.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8c5e8ae53148�body�ٺ含水层是地下能蓄存并导水的岩层或砾石层，像天然水库一样保存着地下水。合理开采可稳定供水，但长期超采会造成地面下沉和海水倒灌。��An aquifer is a rock or gravel layer underground that stores and transmits water, acting like a natural reservoir of groundwater. Used wisely it gives steady supply, but chronic over-pumping can cause land subsidence and seawater intrusion.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�94052627f10b�body���副渔获物指捕鱼时顺带捕获的非目标生物，包括其他鱼类、海龟、海鸟和海豚等，常被丢弃或死亡。减少副渔获物需要改进渔具（如海龟排除装置）和避开敏感海域。��Bycatch is the non-target life caught incidentally while fishing—other fish, turtles, seabirds, dolphins—often discarded or killed. Reducing it needs better gear like turtle excluder devices and avoiding sensitive areas.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9641c835144c�body��千年生态系统评估把它们分为供给服务（如食物、淡水）、调节服务（如净化空气、调节气候）、文化服务（如旅游、精神价值）和支持服务（如土壤形成、养分循环）。后两类常被忽视，却是前两类的基础。�!The Millennium Ecosystem Assessment divides them into provisioning (food, fresh water), regulating (air cleaning, climate control), cultural (recreation, spiritual value) and supporting services (soil formation, nutrient cycling). The last two are often overlooked yet underpin the others.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�ba96ec2fd974�body�٫不能。煮沸只能杀灭微生物，无法去除铅、砷、镉等重金属，反而因蒸发使浓度略升。去重金属需反渗透、离子交换或专门滤料。��No. Boiling kills microbes but cannot remove lead, arsenic or cadmium—and can even concentrate them as water evaporates. Removing metals needs reverse osmosis, ion exchange or special media.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�cc2c4723bda7�body���有，而且极其丰富：一汤匙健康土壤里可能有蚯蚓、跳虫、真菌菌丝和数以亿计的细菌。这个“土壤食物网”负责分解枯落物、循环养分、抑制病害，是地上生态系统的基础。��Yes, and it is extraordinarily rich: a spoonful of healthy soil can hold earthworms, springtails, fungal threads and billions of bacteria. This 'soil food web' decomposes litter, cycles nutrients and suppresses disease, underpinning the ecosystems above.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�cfc617648952�body���它用高温高压把空气中的氮气和氢气合成氨，进而制造氮肥，使人类能大规模提高粮食产量。但其能耗高、并带来氮流失造成的水体和大气污染，是“双刃剑”。�It synthesizes ammonia from atmospheric nitrogen and hydrogen under heat and pressure, enabling mass-produced nitrogen fertilizer and much higher crop yields. But it is energy-hungry and its nitrogen runoff drives water and air pollution—a double-edged sword.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d9b23f2e6455�body���过量施用的氮肥经雨水下渗会污染地下水，使井水中硝酸盐浓度升高。婴儿饮用后可能引发“蓝婴综合征”（高铁血红蛋白血症），成年人长期高暴露也与健康风险相关。��Excess nitrogen fertilizer seeps through rain into groundwater, raising nitrate levels in wells. In infants it can cause 'blue baby syndrome' (methemoglobinemia), and long-term adult exposure is also linked to health risks.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�env_25_007�body��6温室效应本身是大功臣:二氧化碳等气体像毯子裹住地球,没有它,平均气温会是零下18度,海洋也会结冰。问题是人类烧煤烧油排出太多二氧化碳,毯子越盖越厚,地球开始发低烧,一年比一年热。我们要做的不是扔掉毯子,而是别再把它加厚。�FThe greenhouse effect is a hero: gases like CO2 wrap Earth in a blanket; without it the average temperature would be minus eighteen Celsius and the oceans would freeze. The trouble is people burn coal and oil, thickening the blanket and giving Earth a slow fever that climbs year by year. Keep the blanket; stop thickening it.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�env_25_010�body��*雾是小水滴,太阳一出来就散,干净又无害。霾是无数细小颗粒物混在空气里,其中PM2.5细得能钻进肺的最深处,还会进入血液。霾天关窗开空气净化器、出门戴口罩,就像给身体装上过滤网。治理的关键是减少烧煤和汽车尾气排放。�%Fog is tiny clean droplets vanishing at sunrise. Smog mixes countless fine particles into air; PM2.5 is so small it reaches deep lungs and even blood. On hazy days shut windows, run purifiers and wear masks like fitting filters on your body — the real cure is cutting coal smoke and exhaust.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�f09433a95fb8�body���破碎的栖息地让动物被分隔，近亲繁殖和局部灭绝风险升高。生态廊道用连片的森林、河流或草原把保护地连通，让物种能迁移、扩散和交换基因，提升整体存活率。��Fragmented habitats isolate animals, raising inbreeding and local extinction risk. Corridors of forest, river or grassland link reserves so species can migrate, spread and exchange genes, improving overall survival.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f73eabbf75ab�body�٭不一定。'可回收'指技术可行，但能否回收取决于本地是否有对应分拣与再生产能；许多地方缺设施，标志物品仍会进填埋或焚烧。��Not necessarily. 'Recyclable' means technically feasible, but actual recovery depends on local sorting and reprocessing capacity; many places lack it, so labeled items still land in landfill or incineration.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�063010e7ecea�body�ٹ生物脱落的皮屑、黏液和排泄物释放 DNA 到水、土中，采集后通过 metabarcoding 扩增测序识别物种。它可非侵入、快速地普查难以目测的物种。��Organisms shed DNA via skin, mucus, and waste into water or soil; sampling followed by metabarcoding amplification and sequencing identifies species. It enables non-invasive, rapid surveys of hard-to-see taxa.�ans��src��《Science》eDNA 方法学�Science eDNA methods��id�0a44961d0eac�body���全球模式分辨率粗（百公里级），无法直接给城市尺度气候。降尺度用统计或动力方法把大尺度结果细化到局地，以评估极端事件、海平面与农业的地域影响。��Global models are coarse (hundreds of km) and can't directly give city-scale climate. Downscaling refines large-scale results to local detail—statistically or dynamically—to assess regional extremes, sea level and agriculture.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0dc0cf1c9526�body���PSS让企业卖“使用”而非“拥有”（如照明服务、轮胎按里程计费），厂商有动力做耐用、易修、可回收的产品，因为维修成本由其承担，从而脱钩增长与资源消耗。��PSS sells 'use' not 'ownership' (lighting-as-service, tires per km); makers gain incentive for durable, repairable, recyclable goods since they bear maintenance cost—decoupling growth from resource use.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�13619cccd365�body�ٮ常用植物修复、固化稳定化和热脱附等，需按污染物类型（重金属或有机）选择。修复后土地再利用应做风险评估，防止二次暴露。��Phytoremediation, solidification-stabilization, and thermal desorption are common, chosen by contaminant type (heavy metals or organics). Reuse needs risk assessment to prevent secondary exposure.�ans��src��9中国科学院生态环境研究中心土壤修复研究�CResearch Center for Eco-Environmental Sciences CAS soil remediation��id�25d1fc698b04�body���在修复污染的同时核算自身能耗、排放与二次影响，追求净环境效益最大：优先低风险自然衰减、原位技术，避免“为清污而制造更多排放”的尴尬。��It accounts for the remediation's own energy, emissions and secondary impacts, maximizing net environmental benefit: prefer low-risk natural attenuation and in-situ methods, avoiding 'cleaning soil by creating more emissions'.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�317a963893c4�body���多数研究显示植物肉在温室气体、用地、用水上显著低于牛肉，尤其在反刍排放占比高时；但加工能耗与配料（如椰子油）使差距并非无限大，且营养等价需校准。��Most studies show plant-based burgers far lower in GHG, land and water than beef, especially given ruminant emissions; but processing energy and ingredients (e.g., coconut oil) shrink—not erase—the gap, and nutritional equivalence must be calibrated.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4e2a4c6e372e�body���地球系统模式把冻土碳库与温度耦合，用活化度参数描述随升温加速的分解；部分模型加入 abrupt thaw（热融滑塌）模块以捕捉非线性释放，但仍存在较大不确定性。��Earth-system models couple permafrost carbon pools to temperature with activation parameters for warming-accelerated decomposition; some add abrupt-thaw (thermokarst) modules for nonlinear release, though uncertainty remains large.�ans��src�قWalter Anthony 等发表于《Nature Communications》的论文,关于湖下突变融化加速二十一世纪冻土碳排放(2018)ّWalter Anthony K M et al., 21st-century modeled permafrost carbon emissions accelerated by abrupt thaw beneath lakes, Nature Communications, 2018��id�501452731bd4�body���参照生态系统提供恢复目标基准；在干扰已除、种子源尚存时“被动恢复”靠自然更新更省钱，而在严重退化、缺失物种时需“主动恢复”补植与土壤改良。��A reference ecosystem sets the target baseline; where stress is removed and seed sources remain, cheap passive recovery via natural regeneration works, while severe degradation needs active replanting and soil repair.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�5492b3a3729b�body�ٴPLA需在工业堆肥的高温高湿与特定微生物下（常>58°C、数周）才能水解崩解；家庭堆肥或海洋中分解极慢，混进传统回收还会污染料流。��PLA needs industrial composting—high heat, humidity and specific microbes (often >58°C, weeks)—to hydrolyze; it degrades very slowly in home compost or the ocean, and contaminates conventional recycling streams.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�5de58384b7ec�body���BECCS 被视为负排放，但其净减排取决于土地利用变化、肥料与运输排放是否被计入。若以毁林或高投入换取生物质，其负排放可能被高估甚至反转。��BECCS is treated as negative emissions, yet net benefit depends on whether land-use change, fertilizer, and transport emissions are counted. Forest clearance or input-heavy biomass can overstate or reverse the negative balance.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�683221e3a4a4�body�ٷ海草对水质浊度、温度、摄食和底质敏感；种苗移栽常因水文扰动、光照不足或草食动物啃食而低成活。需先改善水质与栖息条件再种植。��Seagrass is sensitive to turbidity, temperature, grazing and substrate; transplants often die from hydrodynamic disturbance, low light or herbivores. Improve water quality and habitat first, then plant.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�78ed8fa1c9c1�body���蓝绿空间指公园、河流、湿地等自然区域；住得离它们近的人更易散步放松、社交与运动，研究把这种可达性与更低的焦虑、更高的生活满意度联系起来。ٿBlue-green space means parks, rivers and wetlands; living near them makes walking, socializing and exercise easier, and studies link such access to lower anxiety and higher life satisfaction.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7e178b0de642�body���指气候变化已造成、且无法靠适应避免的损害（如海岛被淹、极端天气损失）。它触及“谁该为历史排放买单”的公平与赔偿责任，是发达国家与发展中国家的核心分歧。��It means climate harms that occur and cannot be avoided by adaptation (e.g., submerged islands, disaster losses). It raises fairness and liability—who pays for historical emissions—a core divide between developed and developing nations.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�80e11e5358a1�body�٥咖啡多种植于热带，扩张的种植园会清掉森林、挤走野生动植物；选雨林联盟或有机认证、减少浪费，能让产地少砍一棵树。��Coffee grows in the tropics, and expanding plantations clear forests and displace wildlife; choosing Rainforest-Alliance or organic certified beans and wasting less helps producers spare trees.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�80fa951748e1�body���在无氧条件下，微生物把有机物分解成以甲烷为主的沼气和可沉污泥。既净化高浓有机废水（如养殖、食品），又回收能源，是“污染变资源”的典型。��Under anoxia, microbes split organics into methane-rich biogas and settleable sludge. It treats high-strength organic wastewater (livestock, food) while recovering energy—a classic 'pollution to resource'.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�87b7c5ed22c5�body���限塑是逐步限制厚度、使用场景与免费提供；禁塑是对特定一次性塑料（如某些塑料袋、吸管、餐具）直接禁用。范围从商超外卖扩展到电商快递，并鼓励替代与回收。��Limits gradually restrict thickness, settings and free giveaways; bans directly prohibit specific single-use plastics (some bags, straws, cutlery). Scope has spread from shops and takeout to e-commerce and delivery, pushing alternatives and recycling.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�90845707b21c�body���极地放大主要来自冰雪反照率反馈与大气热量向两极输送，而热带对流层温度直减率反馈较强，使热带地表增温小于全球平均。这些区域反馈叠加，造成增温在纬度上高度不均。�!Polar amplification arises mainly from ice-albedo feedback and poleward heat transport, while the tropical lapse-rate feedback is strongly negative, making tropical surface warming smaller than the global mean. These regional feedbacks combine to produce highly uneven warming by latitude.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�91e8e90924dc�body���当冰架退却、裸露的冰崖过高时，冰体因自身重力可能崩塌，暴露更内侧冰崖，形成自持退化，理论上可在百年尺度大幅抬升海平面。其触发阈值仍有争议。��When ice shelves retreat and expose overly tall ice cliffs, the ice can collapse under its own weight, exposing further cliffs and self-sustaining retreat—potentially raising seas substantially over centuries. Trigger thresholds remain debated.�ans��src��WDeConto 与 Pollard（2016）《Nature》；国际思韦茨冰川合作计划（ITGC）�PDeConto and Pollard (2016), Nature; International Thwaites Glacier Collaboration��id�97301a600a6d�body���涵盖气候变化、生物多样性丧失、氮磷循环、土地系统变化、淡水、海洋酸化、大气气溶胶、化学污染、平流层臭氧等九项，其中数项已被越过，提示地球系统风险。��It covers climate change, biosphere integrity, biogeochemical flows (N/P), land-system change, freshwater, ocean acidification, aerosols, novel chemicals and stratospheric ozone—several already crossed, signaling Earth-system risk.�ans��src��Stockholm Resilience Centre�Stockholm Resilience Centre��id�98bcfdd8b0c4�body���难以削减的排放（如水泥工艺、航空）称残余排放，常用碳汇或碳信用抵消。但抵消质量参差、可能“双重计算”或短期，会掩盖真实减排，故应优先直接减排。��Hard-to-abate emissions (cement process, aviation) are 'residual' and often offset by sinks or credits. But offset quality varies and may double-count or be temporary, masking real cuts—so direct reduction comes first.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9b434f2ded93�body���免耕减少扰动以保留土壤团聚体，覆盖作物持续输入根系碳并喂养微生物，轮牧促进草类再生与有机质回田。三者共同提升孔隙度、持水力和微生物多样性。��No-till preserves aggregates by reducing disturbance, cover crops continuously supply root carbon to feed microbes, and managed grazing renews grasses while returning organic matter. Together they raise porosity, water retention, and microbial diversity.�ans��src�ٖMubvumba 等,《Enhancing long-term no-till wheat systems with cover crops and flash grazing》,Soil Security,2022 (DOI: 10.1016/j.soisec.2022.100067)ٗMubvumba et al., 'Enhancing long-term no-till wheat systems with cover crops and flash grazing', Soil Security, 2022, DOI: 10.1016/j.soisec.2022.100067��id�a1885abe4fe6�body���滞留时间是单个 CO2 分子平均在大气停留约数年；调整时间是人为脉冲排放后大气总量恢复到接近初值所需的时间，因海洋与生物圈缓冲，可达数百年甚至更久。��Residence time is a single molecule's ~few years in air; adjustment time is how long the total excess from a pulse takes to fall back, buffered by ocean and biosphere, lasting centuries or more.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a4b80c4e751f�body���量化研究发现，红树林等自然屏障在减灾上常具更低单位成本与多重协同效益（如渔获、碳汇）。但 NbS 的效益具有空间异质性和不确定回报期，需与灰色工程互补而非简单替代。� Quantified studies show natural barriers such as mangroves often cost less per unit benefit and yield co-benefits like fisheries and carbon. Yet NbS benefits are spatially heterogeneous with uncertain payback periods, so they should complement rather than simply replace grey engineering.�ans��src��;《Nature Sustainability》2022 年防洪成本效益研究�-Nature Sustainability 2022 flood cost-benefit��id�a6dc172a268a�body���CO2是长效累积气体，其升温由累积量决定，故需在世纪中叶归零以锁定升温；甲烷寿命仅约12年但短期增温强，快速削减能对近期降温产生立竿见影的效果，为脆弱地区争取时间。�CO2 is a long-lived cumulative gas whose warming is set by cumulative emissions, so it must reach zero around mid-century to cap warming; methane lives ~12 years but is a potent short-term forcer, so rapid cuts yield near-term cooling and buy time for vulnerable regions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ac3157e5e168�body���需证明保护是额外于“照常”基线、且碳被真正长期封存的；同时保护一处湿地可能把开发压力转移到别处（泄漏）。监测、报告、核查（MRV）成本高也限制规模。��They must show protection is additional to business-as-usual and carbon is truly locked long-term; protecting one wetland may shift development elsewhere (leakage). High MRV cost also limits scale.�ans��src��Blue Carbon Initiative�Blue Carbon Initiative��id�ae182c0e7237�body���「30×30」目标要求到 2030 年保护至少 30% 的陆地和海洋区域。它是 2022 年联合国生物多样性公约通过、具里程碑意义的框架核心，并配套了资源调动与生物多样性主流化指标。��The '30×30' target aims to protect at least 30% of land and sea by 2030. Adopted in 2022 under the CBD, it is the centerpiece of a landmark framework backed by financing and mainstreaming indicators.�ans��src��X联合国生物多样性公约《昆明-蒙特利尔全球生物多样性框架》(2022)�9CBD Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework (2022)��id�b0c303c1a967�body���牛羊瘤胃发酵天然产生CH4，单位蛋白排放高；改善饲料、添加剂（如海藻）可降低但难清零，且涉及数十亿小农生计与饮食文化，政策需兼顾公平。��Cattle and sheep naturally emit CH4 via rumen fermentation, with high emissions per protein; feed and additives (e.g., seaweed) help but can't zero it, and it touches billions of smallholders and dietary culture, so policy must be fair.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b3bac65af518�body���历史累积排放、发展阶段、能源结构与贸易隐含碳差异巨大；人均平等会严重约束发展中大国工业化，而历史责任论又难被发达国家接受，需折中方案与资金技术转移。�=Historical cumulative emissions, development stage, energy mix and embedded trade carbon differ vastly; per-capita equality would severely constrain developing giants' industrialization, while historical-responsibility claims meet developed-nation resistance—needing compromise plus finance and technology transfer.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�bc748c9fbd64�body���临界点指系统被推过阈值后发生不可逆或自持的突变。例如格陵兰冰盖不可逆消融、亚马孙雨林向稀树草原转变——一旦越过，即便停止排放也难恢复。��A tipping point is a threshold beyond which a system shifts irreversibly or self-amplifies. Examples: irreversible Greenland ice-sheet loss and Amazon rainforest-to-savanna transition—once crossed, recovery is hard even if emissions stop.�ans��src��Lenton et al.�Lenton et al.��id�c5d8eb2cc487�body���收集珊瑚受精卵在可控环境中培育幼体，再固着到退化礁体；或先在苗圃中培养断枝再移植。配合耐热株系筛选，可提升修复礁对热胁迫的抵抗力。��Spawned gametes are reared in controlled settings and settled onto degraded reef, or fragments are grown in nurseries then transplanted. Selecting heat-tolerant genotypes improves restored reefs' resistance to thermal stress.�ans��src��"《Science》珊瑚礁修复研究�Science coral reef restoration��id�cd6a0c4dd9db�body���发达国家自工业革命起排放了大部分历史累积 CO2，因而在减排与资金技术上负有更大责任。该原则是《巴黎协定》区分国家自主贡献力度的依据之一。��Developed countries emitted most historical cumulative CO2 since industrialization, implying greater responsibility for mitigation and finance. This underpins differentiated nationally determined contributions in the Paris Agreement.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d117ce0005b2�body�ٸ电厂烟气CO2浓度可达10–15%，而空气仅约0.04%，DAC需处理巨量空气并克服极低分压差，能耗与设备巨大，故成本每吨数百美元，远高于点源。��Flue gas has 10–15% CO2 but air only ~0.04%; DAC must process huge air volumes against a tiny partial-pressure gap, with large energy and plant costs—hundreds of dollars per ton, far above point sources.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d26cfbbdcdc3�body�ٽMFA量化城市输入（水、能、材料）与输出（产品、废物、排放）的流量与存量，计算单位GDP物质强度、循环率等指标，识别泄漏点以优化代谢。��MFA quantifies a city's input (water, energy, materials) and output (products, waste, emissions) flows and stocks, computing metrics like material intensity per GDP and recycling rate to find leak points and optimize metabolism.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d2f233eead70�body�ٳRO用高压把海水压过仅允许水分子通过的半透膜以去除盐分。克服渗透压和浓水回流需要大量电能，故能耗高；但与热法相比仍更省能。��RO uses high pressure to push seawater through a semipermeable membrane that passes only water, removing salt. Overcoming osmotic pressure and handling brine needs much electricity, so it is energy-intensive—though still less than thermal methods.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d39ff491e043�body�ٱ垂直农场省水省地、运输短，但人工光照与温控耗电极高；若电网不清洁，其单位食物碳足迹可能高于田间种植，关键在于能源结构。��Vertical farms save water, land and transport, but artificial light and climate control are energy-hungry; on a dirty grid their per-food carbon can exceed fields—it hinges on the energy mix.�ans��src��Nature Food�Nat Food��id�d6e13a1e682e�body���棕榈油便宜用途广，种植园扩张常清掉热带雨林和泥炭地，摧毁红毛猩猩等家园。选标 RSPO 可持续认证、少买过度加工食品，能减少需求端的压力。��Palm oil is cheap and ubiquitous; plantation expansion clears rainforests and peatlands, destroying orangutan homes. Choosing RSPO-certified and fewer ultra-processed foods eases demand-side pressure.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�db51c8cec950�body���冰盖、AMOC、雨林、珊瑚等系统各有阈值且彼此关联（如暖化削弱 AMOC 又改变雨林降水），升温接近区间时多个子系统可能相继越过临界点，引发级联且难逆转的变化。��Ice sheets, AMOC, rainforests and reefs each have thresholds and are interlinked (warming weakens AMOC and shifts rainforest rains); near this range several may cross points in sequence, causing cascading, hard-to-reverse change.�ans��src��Nature / Science 综述�Nature; Science��id�e99390063efb�body���磷虾摄食表层藻类等，其排泄与尸体沉降至深海，将碳从表层带往海底（生物泵），并是鲸、企鹅、海豹的关键食物，影响整个南大洋碳与食物链。��Krill graze surface algae; their fecal pellets and carcasses sink, transporting carbon from surface to deep sea (biological pump), and they are key prey for whales, penguins and seals, shaping Southern Ocean carbon and food webs.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�f23c40cab94b�body�ٷ合成氨耗能排碳（哈伯法）、施肥后N2O（强温室气体）排放、淋溶造成水体富营养化与地下水硝酸盐超标，构成从能源到水体的多重代价。��Haber-Bosch ammonia synthesis is energy- and carbon-intensive; after application, N2O (potent GHG) emits and leaching causes eutrophication and nitrate contamination—multi-stage costs from energy to water.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f4dec9057043�body���SAR主动发射微波、接收回波，不受云雨黑夜影响；用干涉（InSAR）比对两时相相位差，可毫米级测出地面升降，广泛用于沉降、滑坡、冰川流速监测。��SAR actively emits microwaves and receives echoes, unaffected by clouds, rain or night; interferometry (InSAR) compares phase between dates to measure uplift/subsidence at millimeter scale—used for subsidence, landslides and glacier velocity.�ans��src��Massonnet 与 Feigl 1998 年发表于 Reviews of Geophysics 的综述:雷达干涉测量及其在地表变化探测中的应用لMassonnet, D. & Feigl, K.L., Reviews of Geophysics, 1998: Radar interferometry and its application to changes in the Earth's surface��id�fd277e482734�body���它标出产品从原料、制造、运输到废弃全过程的温室气体排放量（常折算成 CO2 当量）。看到标签，你就能在同一类商品里比较谁更低碳，用钱包投票。��It shows greenhouse-gas emissions across raw material, manufacturing, transport and disposal, usually as CO2-equivalent. The label lets you compare similar products and vote with your wallet for lower carbon.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�fd4f2db79ebb�body���主流替代是纸浆模塑、可堆肥 PLA 等。纸浆模塑易回收但怕油水；PLA 需工业堆肥才有降解意义。关键不是“看起来环保”，而是本地有无对应回收/堆肥末端。��Common swaps are molded pulp and compostable PLA. Pulp recycles easily but hates grease; PLA only matters if industrial composting exists. The point isn't 'looks green' but whether local end-of-life handling exists.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�011c256e70c0�body���实证研究表明，在控制收入等因素后，人口密度与就业混合度越高，人均出行距离与汽车依赖越低，交通碳排放随之下降。但过度紧凑若缺乏绿地与公共服务也会抬高热岛与生活质量成本。�$Empirical studies show that, controlling for income and other factors, higher population density and job mix lower per-capita trip distance and car dependence, reducing transport emissions. Yet excessive compactness without green space and services can raise heat-island and livability costs.�ans��src��1Nature Sustainability 城市形态碳排放研究�8Nature Sustainability — urban form and emissions study��id�01234cbeb02a�body���它由海水密度差驱动：高纬海面冷却并蒸发变重下沉、低纬暖轻水表层补充，形成“温（温度）盐（盐度）密度”驱动的深层大尺度环流，周期可达千年。��It is driven by density differences: high-latitude surface water cools and evaporates, grows dense and sinks, while light tropical water replaces it—a 'thermo-haline' density-driven deep circulation on millennial timescales.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�017d6428323a�body��2生态位描述物种在环境中如何生存和繁衍，包括它利用的资源、活动时间和与其他物种的关系，而不只是地理分布。哈钦森将其定义为物种能够存活繁殖的多维环境空间。竞争排斥原理指出两个物种难以长期占据完全相同的生态位。�oA niche describes how a species survives and reproduces, including the resources it uses, its timing and its relationships with other species, not merely its geographic range. Hutchinson defined it as the multidimensional environment space in which a species can persist. The competitive exclusion principle says two species cannot occupy the same niche indefinitely.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�022709b1535f�body���风光出力随天气剧烈波动，若电网不能快速调节，就会出现弃风弃光或供电缺口。灵活性来自储能、可调水电、需求响应和跨国互联等多种手段的组合，是脱碳同时保供电安全的枢纽。�Wind and solar swing sharply with weather, so without fast adjustment the grid faces curtailment or shortfalls. Flexibility comes from a mix of storage, dispatchable hydro, demand response and interconnections—central to decarbonizing without losing supply security.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�02d996884caf�body���LCA把产品的原料开采、制造、运输、使用和处置全环节的能耗与排放都纳入核算，再按功能单位（如装5公斤物品一次）对比。纸袋可再生但生产和运输耗水耗能，塑料袋轻便但难降解，谁更环保取决于回收率、重复使用次数等前提。LCA的价值正在于避免凭感觉下结论，用数据回答环境问题。��LCA counts every stage — raw-material extraction, production, transport, use and disposal — then compares options per functional unit, such as carrying 5 kg of goods once. Paper bags are renewable but energy- and water-hungry to make; plastic bags are light but persist in the environment. Which is greener depends on recycling rates and how often each is reused — precisely why LCA insists on data over intuition.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�03e024310d2a�body��5辐射强迫指由于某些因素（如温室气体增加、太阳辐射变化）导致地球能量收支在大气层顶的净变化，单位为瓦每平方米。正向强迫使地球吸收更多热量而变暖，负向强迫则起冷却作用。它是量化不同因素对气候影响程度的关键指标。�hRadiative forcing is the net change in Earth's energy balance at the top of the atmosphere caused by factors such as increased greenhouse gases or solar variability, measured in watts per square meter. Positive forcing warms the planet by adding absorbed energy, while negative forcing cools it. It is a key metric for quantifying each factor's climate impact.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�03ed9eb1d347�body�ٳPOPs是一类在环境中难降解、可在脂肪中累积并通过食物链放大的有毒化学品（如 DDT、二噁英），能远距离迁移并危害生殖与神经系统。٬POPs are toxic chemicals (e.g., DDT, dioxins) that resist degradation, accumulate in fat and magnify through food chains, traveling far and harming reproduction and nerves.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�04bb51401d24�body���临界点指气候系统的某个组成部分越过阈值后，即使外部驱动力停止，系统也会自我强化地滑向新状态、几乎不可逆。科学家关注的高风险“临界元素”包括格陵兰与南极冰盖崩解、亚马逊雨林大面积衰退、大西洋经向翻转环流减弱等。研究表明升温超过1.5–2°C后触发多个临界点的概率明显上升，这正是各国努力把升温控制在这个区间内的原因。�$A tipping point is a threshold beyond which a component of the climate system reorganises into a new state, often irreversibly, even if the original driver is removed. High-risk tipping elements studied by scientists include collapse of the Greenland and Antarctic ice sheets, large-scale dieback of the Amazon, and weakening of the Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation. Research shows the chance of triggering multiple tipping points rises markedly above 1.5–2°C of warming — exactly why countries aim to keep warming below that range.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�05038f068163�body�ٴ生物累积是单个生物体内有害物质随时间越积越多；生物放大是这些物质沿食物链向上传递时浓度逐级升高，顶级捕食者体内含量最高。ٟBioaccumulation is a toxin building up in one organism over time; biomagnification is its concentration increasing up the food chain, peaking in top predators.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�059dd591a886�body���生物累积指单个生物体内污染物的吸收量大于排出量，导致浓度随年龄增长，例如鱼体内的汞。生物放大则指污染物沿食物链逐级浓缩，每上升一个营养级，浓度可能增加数倍。两者叠加后，鲨鱼、猛禽、鲸类等顶级捕食者体内的浓度可比环境高出百万倍。即使水中浓度极低，也足以造成生殖和神经损害，这正是全球禁用DDT、限制汞排放的重要原因。�.Bioaccumulation is the buildup within a single organism when uptake exceeds elimination, so concentrations rise with age — as with mercury in fish. Biomagnification is the progressive concentration along the food chain: each trophic step can multiply concentrations several-fold. Combined, they mean top predators such as sharks, raptors, and whales carry concentrations millions of times higher than ambient levels. Even trace water concentrations can then cause reproductive and neurological damage — a key reason DDT was banned and mercury restricted.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�0a23a75feef5�body���北半球永久冻土区土壤中封存着约 1400 至 1600 吉吨有机碳，相当于当前大气碳库的两倍左右，这些碳在冻结状态下长期不参与循环。升温使活动层加深，微生物开始分解有机质，在有氧条件下释放二氧化碳，在积水的厌氧条件下释放甲烷；热喀斯特塌陷还会突然暴露深层碳。由于冻土形成需要千年尺度，一旦融化释放便难以在人类时间尺度内收回，因此被列为渐进而不可逆的反馈。�XSoils of the northern permafrost region hold roughly 1400–1600 gigatonnes of organic carbon, about twice the current atmospheric pool, locked out of the active cycle while frozen. Warming deepens the active layer so microbes begin decomposing that material, releasing carbon dioxide under aerobic conditions and methane in waterlogged anaerobic pockets, while abrupt thermokarst collapse exposes deep carbon suddenly. Because permafrost takes millennia to build, released carbon cannot be recaptured on human timescales, which is why the feedback is classed as gradual but effectively irreversible.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0bb6f02db19a�body��翁卡洛采用多重屏障理念：乏燃料先密封进铸铁内衬的铜罐，外面包裹膨润土缓冲层，再置于四百多米深的稳定结晶岩隧道中，最后用膨润土和混凝土回填封堵。铜抗腐蚀、膨润土遇水膨胀可阻滞地下水与核素迁移，围岩则提供地质隔离与低水力梯度。选址还需论证未来冰期、地震与人类误入等长期情景，安全评估时间尺度达十万年，该库是全球首个进入运行准备阶段的高放废物处置库。��Onkalo relies on multiple engineered barriers: spent fuel is sealed in copper canisters with cast-iron inserts, surrounded by a bentonite clay buffer, emplaced in tunnels more than four hundred metres down in stable crystalline bedrock, and finally backfilled and plugged. Copper resists corrosion, bentonite swells on contact with water to retard groundwater flow and radionuclide migration, and the host rock provides geological isolation with low hydraulic gradients. Siting also had to address future glaciations, earthquakes, and inadvertent human intrusion over a hundred-thousand-year safety case, making it the first deep repository for high-level waste to reach operational readiness.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0bf103c0f217�body���含水层系统中的粗颗粒砂层排水后可以部分回弹，但夹在其间的黏土与粉砂层在孔隙水压力下降时颗粒骨架被压密重排，属于非弹性固结，即使日后水位恢复也无法回到原状。加州中央谷地部分地区自 20 世纪 20 年代以来累计沉降达八米以上，同时永久损失了储水空间。合成孔径雷达干涉测量现在被用来毫米级监测沉降速率，为地下水可持续管理提供依据。�Coarse sand layers in an aquifer system rebound somewhat after drainage, but interbedded clay and silt undergo inelastic consolidation when pore pressure drops, as the grain skeleton compacts and rearranges permanently even if water levels later recover. Parts of California's Central Valley have subsided more than eight metres since the 1920s while permanently losing aquifer storage capacity. Interferometric synthetic aperture radar now tracks subsidence rates at millimetre precision, supporting sustainable groundwater management.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0ce6c966b26a�body��破碎化在同等面积下改变了空间格局：斑块变小使种群规模低于最小存活阈值，边缘比例上升带来光照、湿度和风的改变以及捕食者与入侵植物入侵，斑块间隔离则阻断扩散和基因交流。长期实验表明，破碎化的负面效应会随时间累积，物种数在数十年内继续衰减，出现所谓灭绝债务。因此保护规划必须同时考虑面积、形状、连通性与基质质量，廊道和踏脚石栖息地的作用就在于恢复个体流动。�`Fragmentation changes spatial configuration at a given area: smaller patches push populations below minimum viable size, a higher edge ratio alters light, humidity, and wind while admitting predators and invasive plants, and isolation between patches blocks dispersal and gene flow. Long-running experiments show these effects accumulate, with species numbers continuing to fall for decades in what is called extinction debt. Conservation planning therefore has to weigh area, shape, connectivity, and matrix quality together, which is why corridors and stepping-stone habitats matter for restoring movement.�ans��src�كHaddad 等（2015）《Science Advances》生境破碎化长期实验综述；Laurance 等亚马逊森林破碎化项目（BDFFP）٘Haddad et al. (2015), Science Advances, review of fragmentation experiments; Biological Dynamics of Forest Fragments Project (Laurance et al.), Amazonia��id�0d48e2af85c3�body�ٱ太阳能和风能时有时无，储能（如锂电池、抽水蓄能）把多余电力存起、缺电时放出，才能稳定供电、减少对化石燃料备用机的依赖。ٛSolar and wind are intermittent; storage (batteries, pumped hydro) saves surplus and releases it when needed, stabilizing supply and cutting fossil backup.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0daf9c7b66e9�body���溶解度泵靠低温高CO2溶解度把碳带入深层，占总海洋无机碳输送的大头且较稳定；生物泵靠浮游生物沉降输出有机碳，约贡献剩余部分但对变暖、分层与酸化敏感，升温可能削弱其效率。�"The solubility pump uses cold, CO2-soluble water to carry carbon deep and dominates inorganic transport, fairly stable; the biological pump relies on sinking plankton debris, contributes the rest, but is sensitive to warming, stratification and acidification, so it may weaken with heating.�ans��src��Nature;Oceanogr.�Nature;Oceanography��id�0f19de458862�body�� 气候临界点指系统在被推过某一阈值后会发生不可逆或自我强化的剧烈变化，如格陵兰冰盖消融和亚马孙退化。一旦触发，变化会自行推进而不依赖进一步升温。识别临界点有助于理解为何早期减排比事后补救更关键。�Climate tipping points are thresholds beyond which a system shifts irreversibly or self-reinforcingly, like Greenland ice loss or Amazon dieback. Once triggered, change proceeds without further warming. Recognising them shows why early cuts beat late fixes.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0fbd6548d31e�body���营养盐长期累积形成内源负荷、适宜的水文气象（高温、静风、弱混合）以及沉积物磷释放共同驱动了水华。围网养殖削减与引江济太调水可短期抑制，但根本治理仍需全流域控源截污。�]Long-term nutrient accumulation creating internal loading, favorable hydro-meteorology (high temperature, low wind, weak mixing) and sediment phosphorus release jointly drive the blooms. Reducing pen culture and inter-basin water transfers suppress blooms in the short term, but watershed-scale pollution control is essential for a lasting solution.�ans��src��\Qin 等, 2007, Environmental Management 40:635-642（太湖饮用水危机与水华驱动）�jQin et al., 2007, Environmental Management 40:635-642 (Lake Taihu drinking water crisis and bloom drivers)��id�101abda7f936�body�ٻ植物光合作用把 CO₂ 变身体组织，死后进入土壤或沉积物；海洋靠浮游生物和碳酸盐沉降；土壤靠有机质积累——三者都是巨大的长期碳库。��Photosynthesis turns CO₂ into plant tissue that becomes soil or sediment; oceans use plankton and carbonate settling; soils accumulate organic matter—all are vast, long-term carbon stores.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�1036a5968157�body���反照率是地表反射太阳辐射的比例，冰雪反照率高、海洋和森林反照率低。当冰雪融化露出深色地表，会吸收更多热量并形成正反馈，加速变暖。反照率变化是极地放大效应的重要机制之一。�7Albedo is the fraction of solar radiation a surface reflects; snow and ice have high albedo, while ocean and forest have low albedo. When ice melts to reveal darker surfaces, more heat is absorbed, creating a positive feedback that amplifies warming. Albedo change is a key mechanism behind polar amplification.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�10869b530c61�body���剩余碳预算基于累积二氧化碳排放与升温近似线性的关系，用瞬时气候响应指标（TCRE）乘以剩余可容许升温得出，再扣除非二氧化碳强迫和地球系统反馈的贡献。由于 TCRE 本身是一个分布，预算必须标注实现概率：AR6 估算自 2020 年起把升温控制在 1.5℃ 内、成功率 50% 的预算约为 5000 亿吨二氧化碳。若要求 83% 的成功率，预算会缩减到约 3000 亿吨。�The remaining carbon budget rests on the near-linear relationship between cumulative CO2 emissions and warming, obtained by multiplying the transient climate response to cumulative emissions (TCRE) by the allowable additional warming, then subtracting contributions from non-CO2 forcing and Earth-system feedbacks. Because TCRE is itself a distribution, budgets must be reported with a likelihood: AR6 put the budget from 2020 for a 50% chance of holding 1.5°C at roughly 500 GtCO2. Demanding an 83% chance shrinks it to about 300 GtCO2.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�112c3739844e�body��&临界点指气候系统在某些阈值被越过后发生的不可逆或自我强化的剧烈变化。例如亚马孙雨林退化、格陵兰冰盖崩解或大西洋经向翻转环流减弱。越过临界点后，即使停止排放也难以挽回，因此被认为是最危险的气候风险。�~A tipping point is an irreversible or self-reinforcing abrupt change that occurs once the climate system crosses certain thresholds. Examples include Amazon rainforest dieback, Greenland ice sheet collapse, or weakening of the Atlantic overturning circulation. Once crossed, recovery is difficult even if emissions stop, making tipping points among the most dangerous climate risks.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�1371c5bc3537�body���冒纳罗亚月均 CO₂ 每年呈锯齿状波动，振幅约 6–8 ppm，由北半球植物夏季吸碳、冬季释放造成。近几十年振幅略有增大，与北半球植被活动增强及生长季延长有关。�Monthly mean CO₂ at Mauna Loa shows a sawtooth of roughly 6–8 ppm amplitude from Northern Hemisphere plants absorbing carbon in summer and releasing it in winter. The amplitude has slightly grown in recent decades, linked to heightened vegetation activity and longer growing seasons.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�15c155ccf97d�body��1990 年《清洁空气法》修正案第四篇为发电厂二氧化硫设定总量上限，并允许配额自由买卖，同时强制安装连续排放监测系统以保证数据可信。电厂据此自主选择低硫煤、洗涤塔或购买配额，减排集中发生在成本最低的机组，全国二氧化硫排放到 2020 年比 1990 年下降九成以上。事后评估显示实际履约成本远低于立法时的预测，健康效益与成本之比达到数十倍，这一经验直接影响了后来欧盟碳市场的设计。�JTitle IV of the 1990 Clean Air Act Amendments capped power-plant sulphur dioxide, let allowances trade freely, and mandated continuous emission monitoring so the data could be trusted. Utilities chose among low-sulphur coal, scrubbers, or buying allowances, concentrating abatement where it was cheapest, and national SO2 emissions fell by more than 90% between 1990 and 2020. Retrospective analyses found compliance costs far below legislative forecasts and health benefits exceeding costs by an order of magnitude or more, lessons that shaped the later design of the EU carbon market.�ans��src��}美国环境保护署酸雨计划年度进展报告；Schmalensee 与 Stavins（2013）《Journal of Economic Perspectives》�mU.S. EPA Acid Rain Program progress reports; Schmalensee and Stavins (2013), Journal of Economic Perspectives��id�1666501a0bd1�body��/平衡气候敏感度指大气中二氧化碳浓度加倍、且气候系统达到新平衡后，全球平均地表温度的长期升幅。IPCC 第六次评估报告将ECS的可能范围定为2.5–4.0℃，最佳估计约为3℃，这一指标是评估长期变暖情景与政策目标的核心参数。�uEquilibrium climate sensitivity (ECS) is the long-term global mean surface warming that results once the climate system has re-equilibrated after atmospheric CO2 is doubled. The IPCC Sixth Assessment Report gives a likely range of 2.5–4.0°C with a best estimate of about 3°C, making ECS a central parameter for evaluating long-term warming scenarios and policy targets.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�16ecf17bb528�body��碳边境调节机制要求进口水泥、钢铁、铝、化肥、电力和氢等产品的申报人报告产品的隐含碳排放，并按欧盟排放交易体系的价格补缴差额，同时可扣除在原产国已支付的碳价。2023 至 2025 年为只报告不缴费的过渡期，2026 年起进入正式征收阶段，并与欧盟内部免费配额的退坡同步。其目标是防止碳泄漏，即在欧盟内部碳价上升时，高排放生产环节转移到监管宽松的国家，反而抬高全球排放。��The Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism obliges declarants importing cement, iron and steel, aluminium, fertilisers, electricity, and hydrogen to report the embedded emissions of those goods and pay the difference against the EU Emissions Trading System price, with credit for any carbon price already paid abroad. A transitional reporting-only phase runs from 2023 to 2025, with financial obligations starting in 2026 and phased in as free allocation inside the EU is withdrawn. The aim is to prevent carbon leakage, whereby a rising internal carbon price pushes emissions-intensive production to laxly regulated countries and raises global emissions.�ans��src��i欧盟《碳边境调节机制条例》（Regulation (EU) 2023/956）；欧盟委员会 CBAM 实施指南�~Regulation (EU) 2023/956 establishing the Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism; European Commission CBAM implementation guidance��id�170f60f91c8b�body��	PFAS是一类极难降解、可防水防油的含氟化合物，常用于防油纸和快餐包装。它们会从包装迁移到食物并在人体和环境中长期累积，与多种健康风险相关。由于持久性和流动性，处理和替代都十分困难。�<PFAS are fluorinated compounds that resist degradation and repel water and oil, used in grease-proof paper and fast-food packaging. They migrate into food and accumulate long-term in people and the environment, linked to several health risks. Their persistence and mobility make treatment and substitution very hard.�ans��src��"《Science》全氟化合物综述�Science PFAS review��id�1736c60dada4�body��,虚拟水是指生产一件商品（如粮食、衣物）所隐含消耗的全部水资源，又称“嵌入水”。例如生产一公斤牛肉可能需要上万升水。国际贸易实际上也是在“出口”和“进口”虚拟水，缺水地区进口高耗水农产品可缓解本地压力。�QVirtual water is the total water consumed to produce a good like grain or clothing, also called embedded water. Producing one kilogram of beef, for instance, can take over ten thousand liters. International trade effectively exports and imports virtual water, so water-scarce regions can ease pressure by importing water-intensive goods.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�173aca720e97�body��&绿氢是用可再生电力电解水制取的氢气，整个过程几乎不排放二氧化碳，被视为理想的清洁燃料和储能载体。它可用于难以电气化的重工业、长途运输和季节性储能。目前成本较高，但随着可再生能源降价正快速受到关注。�0Green hydrogen is produced by electrolyzing water with renewable electricity, emitting almost no CO2, and is seen as an ideal clean fuel and storage medium. It can serve hard-to-electrify heavy industry, long-haul transport, and seasonal storage. Costs are still high but falling with cheaper renewables.�ans��src��0国际能源署（IEA）《全球氢能评估》�9International Energy Agency (IEA), Global Hydrogen Review��id�1746c0f68ec3�body���它强调水资源、能源和粮食系统紧密耦合：发电和提水要耗能，种粮要大量用水和能源，能源生产也常需耗水冷却。只顾其中一个的政策可能意外损害另外两个，需要统筹决策。�It stresses that water, energy and food systems are tightly coupled: pumping and generating use energy, farming uses large water and energy, and energy production often needs water for cooling. Policies targeting one can unexpectedly harm the others, so coordinated decisions are needed.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�17f48b80508a�body��死区是水体中溶解氧极低（缺氧）以致大多数海洋生物无法生存的区域，常与陆源营养盐输入引发的富营养化和藻类分解耗氧有关。全球已记录的海岸带死区超过400处，密西西比河口的墨西哥湾死区是其中最大之一。�mA dead zone is an area of water with such low dissolved oxygen (hypoxia) that most marine life cannot survive, usually tied to eutrophication from land-based nutrient inputs and the oxygen consumed as algae decompose. More than 400 coastal dead zones have been documented worldwide, with the Gulf of Mexico hypoxic zone near the Mississippi Delta among the largest.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�1826d1605bca�body��该倡议在 2015 年巴黎气候大会上提出，主张全球土壤表层有机碳储量每年增加 0.4%，以抵消相当部分的人为排放。质疑集中在几点：0.4% 的增速在退化农田上可行，但在已接近饱和的草地与森林土壤中难以实现；固碳量随时间趋于饱和且高度依赖持续管理，一旦翻耕便迅速逆转；此外土壤碳测量的空间变异极大，几年内难以核查。多数学者认为它是有价值的农田健康议程，但不能替代化石燃料减排。��Launched at the 2015 Paris climate conference, the initiative proposes increasing topsoil organic carbon stocks by 0.4% per year to offset a meaningful share of anthropogenic emissions. Criticism focuses on feasibility: the rate is attainable on degraded croplands but not in grassland and forest soils already near saturation; gains saturate over time and depend on continued management, reversing quickly once soil is tilled; and soil carbon has such high spatial variability that verification over a few years is difficult. Most researchers regard it as a worthwhile soil-health agenda rather than a substitute for cutting fossil emissions.�ans��src��kMinasny 等（2017）《Geoderma》千分之四土壤碳评估；千分之四国际倡议（COP21，2015）�kMinasny et al. (2017), Geoderma, assessment of soil carbon 4 per mille; 4 per 1000 Initiative (COP21, 2015)��id�184efa2ce89c�body���鲸类通过垂直迁移和排泄把营养与碳在海洋不同深度间重新分配，促进浮游植物生长。它们死亡后沉入海底，将体内碳长期封存于深海。保护鲸群被视为一种自然的碳汇增强手段。�+Whales redistribute nutrients and carbon across ocean depths through their movements and feces, boosting phytoplankton growth. When they die and sink, their bodies lock away carbon in the deep sea for the long term. Protecting whale populations is viewed as a natural way to enhance the carbon sink.�ans��src��.《自然》;国际捕鲸委员会科学文献�Nature;IWC��id�18ecf35bed91�body���极地放大指北极和南极变暖速度比地球平均水平快得多，主要由冰雪融化后暴露出颜色更深的海面或陆地、吸收更多阳光的“反照率反馈”造成。ٯPolar amplification means the poles warm faster than the global average, driven mainly by ice-albedo feedback: as bright ice melts, darker ocean or land absorbs more sunlight.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�1ad54c541b43�body���通过条件价值评估或选择实验询问人们在假想市场中对清洁空气、物种保护等的支付意愿，再汇总为总经济价值。该方法能捕捉存在价值等非使用价值，但易受问卷设计与策略性偏误影响。�Contingent valuation or choice experiments ask people their WTP for clean air or species protection in a hypothetical market, aggregated into total economic value. It can capture non-use values such as existence value but is sensitive to questionnaire design and strategic bias.�ans��src��.Nature Sustainability 环境价值评估论文�9Nature Sustainability — environmental valuation article��id�1bd5cbd2da94�body��全球碳预算是指在把升温控制在某一目标（如1.5℃）内，人类累计还能排放的二氧化碳总量上限。它把气候目标换算成具体的排放“配额”。一旦预算耗尽，就难以实现温控目标，因此减排越早越有利。�The global carbon budget is the total remaining CO2 humanity can emit while keeping warming within a target like 1.5°C. It translates a climate goal into a concrete emission allowance. Once the budget is spent, the temperature goal becomes unreachable, so earlier cuts help most.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�1c786c975fd2�body���绿色 GDP 从传统 GDP 中扣除自然资源耗减与环境退化成本，以反映净福利。难点在于生态服务货币化方法不一、数据不足以及环境损害的归属与折现争议，导致跨国可比性较弱。�9Green GDP subtracts natural resource depletion and environmental degradation costs from traditional GDP to reflect net welfare. Difficulties lie in inconsistent monetization of ecosystem services, data gaps and disputes over attributing and discounting environmental damage, weakening cross-country comparability.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1ce7cac003a9�body��S《斯德哥尔摩公约》（2004生效）管控持久性有机污染物（POPs），如滴滴涕、多氯联苯和二噁英，这类物质难降解、可远距离迁移并在食物链富集。《水俣公约》（2017生效）则专门针对汞及其化合物，限制其开采、使用和排放，以保护神经健康和生态系统。�|The Stockholm Convention (entered into force 2004) controls persistent organic pollutants (POPs) such as DDT, PCBs, and dioxins—substances that resist degradation, travel long distances, and bioaccumulate in food chains. The Minamata Convention (2017) targets mercury and its compounds, restricting their mining, use, and emissions to protect neurological health and ecosystems.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1d18867b2e1b�body��总经济价值含使用价值与存在、遗赠等非使用价值。存在/遗赠价值反映人们为'让后代也能享有某物种或景观'而愿付的金额，虽难直接交易，却可通过条件估值、保护偏好调查进入成本效益分析与补偿机制。�Total economic value includes use plus non-use values like existence and bequest—what people pay simply to know a species or landscape persists for future generations. Hard to trade directly, it still enters cost-benefit analysis via contingent valuation and preference surveys.�ans��src��TEEB;Kahneman�TEEB;Kahneman��id�1d7703d6d91b�body��=分离功随被分离组分的浓度降低而上升：燃煤电厂烟气中二氧化碳体积分数约 12% 至 15%，而大气中只有约 0.04%，热力学最小分离能因此相差数倍以上。实际系统还要处理巨大的空气体积，风机能耗、吸附剂再生温度和设备规模都随之放大，目前示范项目每吨二氧化碳的能耗折算在数吉焦量级。这意味着直接空气捕集必须依托廉价的零碳能源才有净减排意义，通常被定位为处理难减排残余排放和历史排放的手段，而非替代源头减排。��The work of separation rises as the concentration of the target species falls: flue gas from a coal plant is roughly 12–15% carbon dioxide by volume while air is about 0.04%, so the thermodynamic minimum differs by more than a factor of several. Real systems must also move enormous volumes of air, scaling up fan power, sorbent regeneration heat, and equipment size, and demonstration plants consume energy on the order of gigajoules per tonne of carbon dioxide. Direct air capture therefore only delivers net removal when powered by cheap zero-carbon energy, and is best positioned for residual hard-to-abate and historical emissions rather than as a substitute for cutting emissions at source.�ans��src�ٙ美国国家科学院《Negative Emissions Technologies and Reliable Sequestration》（2019）；国际能源署《Direct Air Capture》报告（2022）�zU.S. National Academies, Negative Emissions Technologies and Reliable Sequestration (2019); IEA, Direct Air Capture (2022)��id�1f17e57360a8�body��8化石燃料燃烧和施肥使大气活性氮增加，过量沉降会打破森林的养分平衡，促进少数速生植物而抑制藓类和真菌。长期高氮沉降可造成土壤酸化、生物多样性下降并释放氧化亚氮等温室气体。临界负荷概念用于评估生态系统的承受阈值。�vFossil-fuel burning and fertiliser use increase reactive nitrogen in the atmosphere; excess deposition disrupts nutrient balance, favouring fast-growing plants over mosses and fungi. Chronic high nitrogen input acidifies soils, reduces biodiversity and releases greenhouse gases like nitrous oxide. The critical-load concept is used to assess ecosystem tolerance thresholds.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�1f459083deb0�body���再野化强调恢复自然过程的自我驱动能力，让生态系统的关键过程重新自行运转。其核心手段之一是重新引入狼、海狸、美洲野牛等关键种，例如顶级捕食者的级联效应会重新调节食草动物与植被的关系，同时允许自然演替占据主导。与传统修复相比，再野化干预更少、空间尺度更大、目标周期更长。其核心挑战是需要足够大的连片栖息地以及公众的接受度。�Rewilding focuses on restoring self-driving natural processes, letting key ecosystem processes run on their own again. Its core tool is reintroducing keystone species such as wolves, beavers, and bison; for example, predator cascades re-regulate herbivores and vegetation, while natural succession is allowed to take the lead. Compared with traditional restoration, rewilding involves less intervention, larger spatial scales, and longer horizons. Its key challenges are the need for large, connected habitats and public acceptance.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�1fb7d87f2455�body���热泵以电力搬移热量，能效（COP）可达3–4倍，但其排放等于耗电量乘以电网排放因子；在煤电占比高的电网，热泵减排有限甚至高于高效燃气，只有电网清洁化后优势才充分释放。��A heat pump moves heat electrically at COP 3–4, but its emissions equal electricity used times the grid emission factor; on coal-heavy grids the savings are slim or worse than efficient gas, and only materialize as the grid cleans up.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�210a8dcb2070�body���地球能量收支失衡产生的多余热量约有九成被海洋吸收，只有百分之几留在大气中，因此海洋热含量比地表气温更少受到年际噪声干扰。Argo 浮标阵列自 2000 年代起提供全球 2000 米以上的连续温盐剖面，使热含量曲线几乎逐年单调上升。相比之下，地表温度会因厄尔尼诺、火山与气溶胶变化出现明显起伏。��About 90% of the excess heat from Earth's energy imbalance is taken up by the ocean and only a few percent stays in the atmosphere, so ocean heat content carries far less interannual noise than surface air temperature. The Argo float array has delivered continuous global temperature and salinity profiles down to 2000 metres since the 2000s, producing a heat-content curve that rises almost monotonically. Surface temperature, by contrast, wobbles with El Niño, volcanic eruptions, and aerosol changes.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�230bca58fd91�body���与传统形态鉴定不同，DNA条形码通过比对特定基因片段来鉴定物种，动物通常使用线粒体COI基因。该方法能以参考数据库为对照，识别幼体、组织残片和形态相似的隐存种，弥补形态学的局限。环境DNA（eDNA）则更进一步，直接从水、土壤或空气样本中提取生物遗留的DNA，无需捕捉即可检出物种。eDNA因此特别适合入侵物种的早期预警和稀有物种的野外调查。�DUnlike morphology-based identification, DNA barcoding identifies species by matching a standardised gene segment against reference databases; for animals, the mitochondrial COI gene is commonly used. The method recognises larvae, tissue fragments, and morphologically similar cryptic species, overcoming the limits of morphology. Environmental DNA (eDNA) goes a step further, extracting DNA that organisms leave in water, soil, or air so species can be detected without capture. eDNA is therefore especially suited to early warning of invasive species and surveys of rare species.�ans��src��'中国科学院（DNA条形码研究）�+Chinese Academy of Sciences (DNA barcoding)��id�2523320e4a5e�body���临界点指地球系统某些部分一旦被推过阈值，就会自我强化、不可逆地转向新状态。常被列举的包括格陵兰冰盖崩解、亚马孙雨林干旱化、永久冻土融化和珊瑚礁大面积死亡。�A tipping point is a threshold beyond which part of the Earth system shifts irreversibly to a new state through self-reinforcing feedbacks. Often-cited examples are collapse of the Greenland ice sheet, dieback of the Amazon, permafrost thaw, and mass coral death.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�25d2fa5dddc6�body��=理论上单边碳约束会让高排放产业外移，但计量研究发现现实中的泄漏率通常低于产业界的预警。对《京都议定书》时期贸易流的分析显示，承担减排义务的国家进口品的隐含碳强度上升，存在可测的泄漏，但规模只相当于其减排量的一小部分。原因是能源成本在多数制造业成本中占比有限，选址还取决于劳动力、市场距离和基础设施，只有铝、水泥等少数电力或排放密集行业风险显著，这也是边境调节主要针对这些品类的原因。��Theory predicts unilateral carbon constraints will push emissions-intensive production abroad, but econometric work finds real-world leakage rates generally below industry warnings. Analyses of trade flows during the Kyoto period show the embodied carbon intensity of imports into committed countries rose, indicating measurable leakage, yet only a modest fraction of the abatement achieved. Energy costs are a limited share of most manufacturing costs and location also depends on labour, market proximity, and infrastructure, so significant exposure is concentrated in electricity- or emissions-intensive sectors such as aluminium and cement — precisely the products border adjustment targets.�ans��src�ٜAichele 与 Felbermayr（2015）《Review of Economics and Statistics》京都议定书与碳泄漏研究；经济合作与发展组织碳泄漏文献综述لAichele and Felbermayr (2015), Review of Economics and Statistics, Kyoto and carbon leakage; OECD reviews of carbon leakage evidence��id�27da557ea533�body��_全球土壤储存的碳约为大气碳库的两到三倍，主要是有机质。传统翻耕会让土壤团聚体破碎、有机质加速氧化分解，释放二氧化碳；而免耕、覆盖作物、施用有机肥等做法能逐年增加土壤碳。每提升土壤有机质0.1个百分点，对保水、肥力和固碳都有可观的累积效应。��Global soils hold about two to three times as much carbon as the atmosphere, mostly as organic matter. Conventional ploughing breaks up soil aggregates and speeds the oxidation of organic matter, releasing CO2, whereas no-till farming, cover crops and organic amendments steadily rebuild soil carbon. Even a 0.1-percentage-point rise in soil organic matter measurably improves water retention, fertility and carbon storage.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�27ebdcd0c906�body��单结电池受肖克利-奎塞尔极限约束，能量低于带隙的光子无法吸收，远高于带隙的光子多余能量以热量浪费掉，硅的实用上限约 29%。叠层结构把宽带隙钙钛矿放在顶层吸收蓝绿光，硅在底层吸收红外光，各自在更接近自身带隙处工作，从而降低热化损失。美国国家可再生能源实验室的效率纪录表显示，钙钛矿-硅叠层的认证效率已超过 33%，但钙钛矿的湿热与紫外稳定性仍是产业化瓶颈。�XA single junction is bound by the Shockley-Queisser limit: photons below the bandgap are not absorbed and the excess energy of high-energy photons is lost as heat, capping practical silicon near 29%. A tandem places a wide-bandgap perovskite on top to harvest blue and green light while silicon underneath takes the infrared, so each layer works closer to its own bandgap and thermalisation losses shrink. NREL's efficiency chart records certified perovskite-silicon tandems above 33%, though perovskite stability under heat, humidity, and ultraviolet exposure remains the barrier to mass production.�ans��src�َ美国国家可再生能源实验室（NREL）最佳研究电池效率图表；Shockley 与 Queisser（1961）《Journal of Applied Physics》�bNREL Best Research-Cell Efficiency Chart; Shockley and Queisser (1961), Journal of Applied Physics��id�27f4b6ed314b�body�٥泥炭是千万年积水植物残体，储存了全球土壤碳的很大一部分；一旦排水干旱，泥炭本身可燃，烧起来会释放巨量封存的碳。ٹPeat is waterlogged plant matter built over millennia, holding a large share of global soil carbon; drain it and it dries, becomes flammable and releases vast stored carbon when burned.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�289b6f326a1e�body���适应性管理把政策当作可检验的假设，在监测—评估—调整的循环中根据新证据迭代决策，以应对不确定性与系统变化。其关键在于保留学习空间、明确评价指标并允许策略修订。�Adaptive management treats policies as testable hypotheses, iterating decisions through monitor–evaluate–adjust cycles to cope with uncertainty and system change. Its keys are preserving room to learn, defining clear evaluation metrics and permitting strategy revision.�ans��src��JHolling 编, 1978, Adaptive Environmental Assessment and Management, Wiley�LHolling (ed.), 1978, Adaptive Environmental Assessment and Management, Wiley��id�2a7654f587b5�body��2容量因子是一段时间内发电厂实际发电量与其在满负荷下理论最大发电量的比值，反映设备的利用效率。太阳能和风能因受天气和时段限制，容量因子通常低于常年稳定运行的传统电站。它是评估电厂经济性和电网规划的重要指标。�/The capacity factor is the ratio of a plant's actual output over a period to its maximum possible output at full rating, reflecting utilization. Solar and wind, limited by weather and time, usually have lower factors than steady conventional plants. It is key for evaluating economics and grid planning.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2af6d3fa775d�body���SPI 仅基于降水概率分布进行标准化，能在不同气候区横向比较并区分气象干旱的时间尺度。它对数据需求低、计算简便，但忽略了蒸散与土壤水，故常与 SPEI 等结合使用。�SPI standardizes only the precipitation probability distribution, allowing cross-regional comparison and timescale-specific detection of meteorological drought. It needs little data and is simple, but ignores evapotranspiration and soil moisture, so it is often paired with SPEI.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2c20f79e98af�body��-研究指出格陵兰与西南极冰盖崩解、亚马逊雨林向稀树草原转变、北半球多年冻土大规模融化及大西洋经向翻转环流（AMOC）减弱等临界点存在级联风险。一旦越过，部分过程将在百年尺度上自我维持，即便升温回落也难以逆转。�:Studies flag cascading risks such as collapse of the Greenland and West Antarctic ice sheets, Amazon dieback, widespread permafrost thaw, and weakening of the Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation (AMOC). Once crossed, some of these can become self-sustaining for centuries even if warming is later reversed.�ans��src��,Nature 评论； Stockholm Resilience Centre�"Nature;Stockholm Resilience Centre��id�2c822696052a�body��多项长期观测表明，部分亚马孙区域已从净碳汇转为净碳源，主因是砍伐、火灾和干旱加剧。树木死亡与燃烧释放的碳开始超过新生林的固定量。若趋势持续，亚马孙可能越过退化临界点，转为释放碳的源。�aLong-term observations show parts of the Amazon have shifted from a net carbon sink to a net source, mainly due to logging, fire, and intensifying drought. Carbon released by dying and burning trees is beginning to exceed what regrowing forest fixes. If the trend continues, the Amazon could cross a degradation tipping point and become a carbon source.�ans��src��《自然》;全球碳计划�Nature;Global Carbon Project��id�2c8a5c99402c�body��NIPBES（生物多样性和生态系统服务政府间科学政策平台）是类似IPCC、但面向生物多样性的独立政府间机构。其2019年《全球评估》指出，约100万种动植物正面临灭绝威胁，人类活动已显著改变地球大部分陆地与海洋生态系统，呼吁转型性变革以扭转退化。��IPBES (the Intergovernmental Science-Policy Platform on Biodiversity and Ecosystem Services) is an independent intergovernmental body analogous to the IPCC but for biodiversity. Its 2019 Global Assessment concluded that around one million plant and animal species are at risk of extinction and that human activity has profoundly altered most terrestrial and marine ecosystems, calling for transformative change to reverse decline.�ans��src��KIPBES《生物多样性和生态系统服务全球评估报告》（2019）�LIPBES Global Assessment Report on Biodiversity and Ecosystem Services (2019)��id�2d3c33227a33�body���生物多样性信贷是为可验证的栖息地保护或恢复成果发放的凭证。企业购买这类信贷，用以支持自身的自然向好承诺。与碳信用不同，生物多样性缺乏统一的全球换算单位，保护成果难以标准化测量，因此这类信贷通常不允许交易或用于抵消。购买它意味着额外出资创造保护增益，而不是买破坏权，目前这类信贷主要在自愿市场试点。��Biodiversity credits are certificates issued for verifiable habitat protection or restoration outcomes. Companies buy them to back their own nature-positive pledges. Unlike carbon, biodiversity lacks a unified global accounting unit and outcomes are hard to standardise, so such credits are generally non-tradable and non-offsettable. Buying them means funding additional conservation gains rather than purchasing a right to harm; these credits are currently piloted in voluntary markets.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2d767bb79b40�body���电商把运输单元拆成大量小包裹，纸箱、塑料填充、胶带层层叠加，回收价值低且常被污染；轻视装、合并下单、保留纸箱循环，能显著削减这类垃圾。��E-commerce splits shipments into many small parcels with boxes, plastic fill and tape that are low-value and easily contaminated; minimal packaging, merged orders and reusing boxes sharply cut this waste.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2dbe4a871e91�body��<近地面臭氧由氮氧化物与挥发性有机物在阳光下的非线性光化学反应生成，其响应可用等浓度曲线图（EKMA 图）刻画。在交通密集的城市核心区，氮氧化物过量，一氧化氮会直接滴定消耗臭氧，此时体系处于挥发性有机物受限区，减少氮氧化物反而削弱了滴定作用，臭氧短期升高。这解释了周末效应：货车减少、氮氧化物下降的周末，市中心臭氧常高于工作日。有效对策是同时控制挥发性有机物，并按区域判断敏感性再制定策略。�tGround-level ozone forms through nonlinear photochemistry between nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds in sunlight, a response often mapped with ozone isopleth (EKMA) diagrams. In traffic-dense urban cores nitrogen oxides are in excess and nitric oxide titrates ozone away, so the system sits in a VOC-limited regime where cutting NOx weakens that titration and ozone rises in the short term. This explains the weekend effect, when fewer trucks and lower NOx leave downtown ozone higher than on weekdays. The remedy is to control VOCs simultaneously and to diagnose the regime region by region before setting strategy.�ans��src��sSeinfeld 与 Pandis《Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics》；美国环境保护署臭氧生成敏感性技术文件�sSeinfeld and Pandis, Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics; U.S. EPA technical documents on ozone formation sensitivity��id�2dcf9fcc953a�body���海平面上升主要来自四部分：海水受热膨胀、山地冰川消融、格陵兰冰盖亏损与南极冰盖亏损，另有陆地水储量变化的小量贡献。二十世纪中期热膨胀曾是最大项，但卫星测高时代以来冰川与两大冰盖的合计贡献已超过热膨胀，成为主导。IPCC 评估 1901 至 2018 年全球平均海平面上升约 0.20 米，且上升速率在加速。��Sea level rise comes mainly from four terms: thermal expansion of seawater, melting mountain glaciers, mass loss from the Greenland Ice Sheet, and mass loss from Antarctica, plus a smaller contribution from changes in land water storage. Thermal expansion dominated in the mid-twentieth century, but since the satellite altimetry era the combined ice contribution has overtaken it. The IPCC assessed a rise of about 0.20 metres in global mean sea level from 1901 to 2018, with the rate accelerating.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�2dd81822c9a6�body���约80%海洋塑料来自陆地河流输入，进入副热带环流后受地转流汇聚滞留，降解极慢而持续累积，形成如大太平洋垃圾带等环流垃圾带；其质量以碎片化微塑料为主，清理难度远大于拦截源头。�/Roughly 80% of marine plastic comes from land via rivers; entering subtropical gyres it converges and stagnates, accumulating far faster than it degrades, forming patches like the Great Pacific Garbage Patch whose mass is mostly fragmented microplastic—far harder to clean than to intercept at source.�ans��src��The Ocean Cleanup;Science�The Ocean Cleanup;Science��id�2e2317bbf7df�body���两者都让排放二氧化碳变得有成本。碳税直接按每吨排放定价，价格稳定、执行简单，但总排放量难以事先锁定；碳市场（总量控制与交易）先设总排放上限再发放配额，配额可在企业间交易，总量可控但价格随行就市。许多经济体同时使用两者，并逐步提高碳价，以引导资金流向低碳技术。��Both put a price on emitting CO2. A carbon tax charges a fixed rate per tonne — the price is stable and administration is simple, but total emissions are not capped in advance. A carbon market (cap-and-trade) sets a total cap and issues allowances that firms can buy and sell, so emissions are capped while the price floats. Many economies use both and ratchet prices up over time to steer investment toward low-carbon technology.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2fb6e4e55693�body���非CO2气体（甲烷、氮氧化物等）贡献了相当部分的升温，需在预算中折算；同时冻土融化、森林碳汇减弱等“反馈”会额外释放碳或削弱吸收，使等效CO2预算收紧。忽略它们会高估可排放空间。�Non-CO2 gases (methane, NOx, etc.) cause a substantial share of warming and must be converted into CO2-equivalent terms; feedbacks like permafrost thaw or weakening land sinks release extra carbon or reduce uptake, tightening the budget. Ignoring them overestimates the available space.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�309572b26e22�body���湿地长期淹水缺氧，有机碳分解极慢，逐渐累积成巨大的泥炭碳库，占全球土壤碳的很大份额。与此同时，厌氧分解会释放甲烷，而甲烷的温室效应远强于二氧化碳。因此评估不能只看单一方面，而要看净辐射强迫和碳库量级。健康湿地长期封存的碳超过其甲烷排放，恢复退化湿地还能减少额外释放，所以湿地在净效果上仍是气候资产。�3Waterlogged anoxic wetland soils slow organic-carbon decomposition, gradually building large peat carbon stocks that hold a big share of global soil carbon. At the same time, anaerobic decay releases methane, a greenhouse gas far stronger than CO2. Assessment therefore cannot look at one side alone but must weigh net radiative forcing and the magnitude of carbon stocks. Because carbon stored over the long term in healthy wetlands outweighs their methane emissions, and restoring degraded wetlands cuts additional releases, wetlands remain a net climate asset.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�30e379921f9e�body��SOA并非直接排放，而是挥发性有机物经氧化、成核、多相反应在大气中'长'出来的，前体物来源复杂（植被、燃烧、溶剂等），且其产率随氧化程度和气溶胶载荷非线性变化，使源解析与减排靶点都很模糊。�#SOA is not emitted directly; it grows in the atmosphere from VOC oxidation, nucleation, and multiphase reactions, with diverse precursors (vegetation, combustion, solvents) and yield that varies non-linearly with oxidation and loading—making source apportionment and control targets fuzzy.�ans��src��Atmos. Chem. Phys.�!Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics��id�32f083ecc674�body��全球约24亿人仍用固体燃料（薪柴、煤）在通风不良的室内烹饪取暖，释放PM、一氧化碳与多环芳烃，WHO估计其每年导致数百万例卒中、慢阻肺和儿童肺炎死亡，但因发生在家庭私密空间而长期缺乏监测与政策关注。�␀About 2.4 billion people still burn solid fuels indoors with poor ventilation, releasing PM, CO and PAHs; the WHO links this to millions of annual deaths from stroke, COPD and childhood pneumonia—yet it is under-monitored because it happens inside homes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�336a0af7c26f�body��8氮主要通过基质中硝化与反硝化细菌的耦合作用以氮气形式逸出，部分被植物吸收；磷则主要靠基质（如沸石、铁基材料）吸附沉淀及植物吸收固定。设计时需平衡水力停留时间、碳源供应与堵塞风险，否则除磷效率会随运行年限衰减。��Nitrogen is mainly removed through coupled nitrification–denitrification by microbes in the substrate, released as N2 gas, with some plant uptake; phosphorus is immobilized mainly by adsorption or precipitation on substrates (e.g., zeolite, iron-based media) and by plant uptake. Design must balance hydraulic retention time, carbon supply and clogging risk, or phosphorus removal declines over time.�ans��src��3《环境科学》人工湿地水处理研究论文�FEnvironmental Science journal — constructed wetland research article��id�33c6054108a2�body���人体主要靠汗液蒸发散热，而蒸发速率取决于空气的水汽压差，湿球温度正是把温度与湿度合并成一个反映蒸发潜力的指标。当湿球温度接近皮肤温度约 35℃ 时，蒸发散热在理论上完全失效，即使健康人在阴凉处休息也无法维持体温平衡。实验室研究进一步发现，实际的不可代偿阈值往往低至 30℃ 左右的湿球温度，因此干热的 45℃ 有时反而比湿热的 35℃ 更容易应对。�The body sheds heat mainly by evaporating sweat, and evaporation depends on the vapour pressure difference with the air, which is exactly what wet-bulb temperature folds temperature and humidity into. When wet-bulb temperature approaches skin temperature near 35°C, evaporative cooling fails in principle, so even a healthy person resting in the shade cannot maintain thermal balance. Laboratory work shows the real uncompensable threshold is often nearer 30°C wet-bulb, which is why a dry 45°C day can be safer than a humid 35°C one.�ans��src��sSherwood 与 Huber（2010）《美国科学院院刊》；Vecellio 等（2022）《Journal of Applied Physiology》�VSherwood and Huber (2010), PNAS; Vecellio et al. (2022), Journal of Applied Physiology��id�340ca0d929aa�body��弱可持续认为人造资本可以替代自然资本，只要总资本不减就行；强可持续则认为自然资本许多功能无可替代，必须单独保护其存量。这一分歧直接影响了政策该优先“增长”还是优先“保底”。�*Weak sustainability holds that manufactured capital can substitute for natural capital as long as total capital does not fall. Strong sustainability argues many natural functions are irreplaceable and must be preserved in their own right, shaping whether policy favors growth or a protective floor.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�369204138334�body���当Ωarag<1时方解石/文石开始自发溶解。极地海域因冷水溶CO2多已接近或低于Ω=1，珊瑚与翼足类首当其冲；该指标比pH更能直接预示钙化生物的存亡边界。��When Ωarag<1, aragonite begins to dissolve spontaneously. Polar waters, cold and CO2-rich, already approach or drop below Ω=1, hitting corals and pteropods first; this index predicts calcifier survival limits more directly than pH alone.�ans��src��Science;Geophys. Res. Lett.�Science;GRL��id�369b960ead71�body���美国等多国研究发现，少数族裔与低收入社区更邻近垃圾焚烧、污水处理厂和高速公路，污染暴露更高。统计上种族是污染分布的重要预测因子，独立于收入水平。��U.S. and other studies find minority and low-income communities are closer to incinerators, wastewater plants, and highways with higher exposure. Statistically, race predicts pollution distribution independently of income.�ans��src��%《Science》环境公平实证研究�"Science environmental equity study��id�396d448e9ff1�body���早期复垦常把废弃矿坑填平、种上单一草种，只形成表面绿化。现代复垦则先修复土壤结构，包括覆土、接种菌根真菌、调节酸碱度和重金属含量。在此基础上，再按地形重建水文过程与本土植被的演替序列，并持续监测动物群落是否回归。真正的复垦目标是恢复水源涵养、碳汇和栖息地等可持续的生态系统功能，而非仅仅追求绿色景观。�0Early reclamation often flattened abandoned pits and sowed a single grass species, producing little more than surface greening. Modern reclamation first rebuilds soil structure — capping, inoculating mycorrhizal fungi, and adjusting pH and heavy-metal levels. Only then does it reconstruct hydrological processes and native vegetation succession according to terrain, while monitoring whether animal communities return. The true goal is restoring sustainable ecosystem functions such as water retention, carbon storage, and habitat, not just a green surface.�ans��src��-中国科学院（矿山生态修复研究）�>Chinese Academy of Sciences (mine site ecological restoration)��id�3b026440193b�body���AR6 把平衡气候敏感度（ECS）的最佳估计定为约 3°C，可能范围收窄到 2.5–4°C，并认为低于 1.5°C 的可能性极低。相比 AR5 给出的 1.5–4.5°C 宽区间，估算的不确定性显著降低。��AR6 sets the central estimate of equilibrium climate sensitivity (ECS) at about 3°C, with a likely range narrowed to 2.5–4°C and a very low chance of being below 1.5°C. Compared with AR5's 1.5–4.5°C range, the uncertainty is substantially reduced.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�3bce01330c01�body��@LCOE把电站全生命周期内的建设、运营、燃料和退役等成本折算成单位发电量（通常为每千瓦时）的平均成本，便于跨技术横向比较。近年来光伏和陆上风电的LCOE大幅下降，在许多地区已低于新建化石燃料电站，成为能源转型的关键经济指标。��LCOE converts a plant's lifetime costs—construction, operation, fuel, and decommissioning—into an average cost per unit of electricity (usually per kWh), enabling fair comparison across technologies. In recent years solar PV and onshore wind LCOE have fallen sharply and are now often below new fossil plants in many regions, making LCOE a key economic metric for the energy transition.�ans��src��J国际能源署（IEA）《世界能源展望》（World Energy Outlook）�9International Energy Agency (IEA), 'World Energy Outlook'��id�3bde89706f6b�body���可交换态与碳酸盐结合态重金属易被植物吸收，而残渣态被晶格固定、几乎不迁移。因此同样总浓度的土壤，可提取态比例高者生态风险更大，风险评估需采用连续提取法分级。�7Exchangeable and carbonate-bound fractions are readily taken up by plants, whereas residual fractions are locked in mineral lattices and barely mobile. So at equal total concentration, soils with a higher extractable fraction pose greater ecological risk; risk assessment uses sequential extraction to speciate.�ans��src��3《环境科学》土壤重金属形态分析论文�EEnvironmental Science journal — soil heavy-metal speciation article��id�3c6c3fd12d54�body��8全氟和多氟烷基物质的骨架是碳氟键，键能在有机化学中位居最高之列，自然条件下几乎不发生水解、光解或生物降解，因此能在水体、土壤和生物体内长期累积并随地下水远距离迁移。流行病学研究把 PFOA、PFOS 暴露与血脂异常、免疫应答减弱、甲状腺功能改变和某些癌症风险联系起来，且在极低浓度下即可观察到效应。美国环保署 2024 年发布的国家饮用水法规把 PFOA 与 PFOS 的最大污染物浓度定为每升 4 纳克，即万亿分之四。��Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances are built around carbon-fluorine bonds, among the strongest in organic chemistry, so they resist hydrolysis, photolysis, and biodegradation and accumulate for decades in water, soil, and tissue while travelling far in groundwater. Epidemiology links PFOA and PFOS exposure to altered blood lipids, weakened immune response, thyroid effects, and elevated risk of certain cancers, with associations appearing at very low concentrations. The U.S. EPA's 2024 national drinking water regulation therefore set maximum contaminant levels of 4 nanograms per litre — four parts per trillion — for PFOA and PFOS.�ans��src��y美国环境保护署《PFAS 国家饮用水一级法规》（2024）；欧洲食品安全局 PFAS 风险评估（2020）�{U.S. EPA PFAS National Primary Drinking Water Regulation (2024); European Food Safety Authority PFAS risk assessment (2020)��id�3cf54afa8ab2�body���节能家电省下的电费可能诱使更多使用（直接回弹），或把省下的钱花到其他高碳消费（间接回弹），使预期减排打折；系统层面需配合碳价与总量约束，才能避免个人努力被行为反弹吞噬。�Efficient appliances save money that may invite more use (direct rebound) or be spent on other carbon-intensive goods (indirect rebound), eroding expected savings; only with carbon pricing and caps can individual effort avoid being swallowed by behavioral rebound.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3d912dcf66ac�body�٤树木固碳慢、容量有限，且火灾病虫害会把它吐回大气；它只能补一部分，不能替化石排放"买单"，减源仍是最根本的一步。ٲTrees store carbon slowly with limited capacity, and fire or pests return it to air; they cover only part, can't "pay" for fossil emissions—cutting sources remains fundamental.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3edd3ea204f6�body���半挥发性POPs（如PCBs和部分农药）在气温较高的地区蒸发进入大气。它们随气流向高纬度输送，遇冷重新沉降，然后再次蒸发、再次沉降，像蒸馏一样在冷陷阱中反复跳跃迁移，最终富集到极地。再叠加食物链的生物放大作用，北极熊乃至当地居民体内都检出了较高水平的污染物，尽管污染源远在数千公里之外。这正是POPs必须纳入全球管控（《斯德哥尔摩公约》）的经典证据。�ASemi-volatile POPs such as PCBs and some pesticides evaporate into the atmosphere in warmer regions. They are carried poleward by air currents, condense when it gets cold, then evaporate and condense again, hopping poleward like a distillation column through cold traps until they accumulate in the Arctic. Combined with biomagnification up the food chain, polar bears and even local residents show elevated contaminant levels even though sources lie thousands of kilometres away. This is the classic evidence for why POPs require global control under the Stockholm Convention.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�3fc6372af775�body���损失沿着能量链逐级累积：电解槽把电能转成氢的效率约六到七成，随后压缩或液化再运输又要消耗氢自身能量的一成以上，燃料电池或燃气轮机发电效率约五成。三段相乘后电到电的往返效率通常落在 25% 至 40% 之间，远低于电池的九成。因此国际能源署主张把绿氢优先用于难以直接电气化的钢铁、化工与远洋运输，而不是替代电池做日常储电。�?Losses compound along the chain: electrolysers convert electricity to hydrogen at roughly 60–70% efficiency, compression or liquefaction plus transport consumes more than a tenth of the hydrogen's own energy, and fuel cells or turbines convert back to electricity at around 50%. Multiplying the stages leaves a power-to-power round trip of about 25–40%, far below the 90% typical of batteries. That is why the IEA argues green hydrogen should be reserved for hard-to-electrify uses such as steel, chemicals, and deep-sea shipping rather than everyday electricity storage.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�400ae1f24570�body�ٴ纸杯常含塑料淋膜、生产耗水耗能，回收也难；塑料瓶虽难降解却可高值回收。谁更优要看用量、回收率与全程排放，而不是材质名字。��Paper cups often have plastic lining and cost heavy water-energy to make, and are hard to recycle; bottles degrade poorly yet recycle at high value. Which wins depends on use, recovery and full-chain emissions, not the material name.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�400f8e2e8d2b�body���MCB 通过向低云喷洒海盐增加云的反照率，可在局部（如大堡礁）降温，影响范围较小、可逆性较强，但效果不确定，且可能引发跨境降水争端，治理难度高。��MCB sprays sea salt to brighten low clouds, cooling locally (e.g., Great Barrier Reef) with smaller, more reversible scope, but effects are uncertain and could trigger transboundary rainfall disputes, raising governance issues.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�40ff58584d57�body���“污染者付费”原则要求造成污染的一方承担治理和赔偿的费用，而不是由公众或政府买单。它用经济手段倒逼企业减少排放、采用清洁技术。这一原则被许多国际环境公约和各国法律所采纳。�The polluter pays principle requires those who cause pollution to bear the cost of cleanup and compensation, not the public or government. It uses economic pressure to make firms cut emissions and adopt clean technology. Many international accords and national laws adopt it.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�416f92a2c6ad�body��PFAS含极稳定的碳-氟键，几乎不被生物或化学降解，可在人体与环境中累积数十年。其溶于水且沸点高，常规水处理的混凝、氯消毒无效，须用活性炭吸附或反渗透，成本高且产生含氟污泥难题。�+PFAS contain extremely stable carbon-fluorine bonds that resist biodegradation and persist for decades in bodies and ecosystems. They dissolve in water and resist coagulation or chlorination; only activated carbon or reverse osmosis works, at high cost and with fluorinated-sludge disposal problems.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�419eb09e1465�body��t传统电网围绕火电“说发就发”设计，而风光出力随风和光照波动。高比例可再生能源需要电网整体变“灵活”：用跨区特高压输电把风光资源与负荷中心相连，用储能和需求响应平衡波动，用智能调度实时匹配供需。电网脱碳因此是一个系统改造工程，而不只是增加清洁发电机。��Traditional grids were designed around thermal plants that can dispatch on demand, whereas wind and solar output fluctuates with the weather. High renewable shares demand a fundamentally more flexible grid: ultra-high-voltage lines to connect windy, sunny regions with load centres, storage and demand response to smooth variability, and smart dispatch to balance supply and demand in real time. Decarbonising the grid is therefore a system redesign, not just swapping generators.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�41ae65bceb41�body���多数标注「可降解」的塑料需工业堆肥的高温高湿条件，在低温、缺光的海水中分解极慢。若误入海洋，其环境行为与常规塑料相近，难以短期消解。��Most labelled biodegradable plastics need industrial-compost heat and humidity; in cold, low-light seawater they fragment very slowly. In the ocean their behavior resembles conventional plastic over short timescales.�ans��src��%《Science》塑料海洋降解研究�"Science plastic marine degradation��id�41fe1d2bc595�body���液态胺路线捕集每吨 CO2 约需 8–10 GJ 热能加电力，成本常达每吨数百到上千美元；瓶颈是再生吸附剂所需的高温热能与极低浓度带来的巨大气固接触量。��Liquid-amine DAC needs roughly 8–10 GJ of heat plus electricity per tonne CO2, costing hundreds to over a thousand USD per tonne. The bottleneck is the high-temperature sorbent regeneration and handling vast air volumes at low concentration.�ans��src��&美国国家科学院 DAC 评估报告� US National Academies DAC report��id�4244b75a3a74�body��G海洋酸化指海水因吸收过量大气二氧化碳，使碳酸平衡向生成更多氢离子（H⁺）偏移，导致表层海水pH下降的现象。自工业化以来，海洋表层pH已从约8.2降至约8.1，酸度（H⁺浓度）上升约30%，这会削弱珊瑚、贝类等钙化生物构建外壳与骨骼的能力。��Ocean acidification is the decrease in seawater pH caused by the ocean absorbing excess atmospheric CO2, which shifts carbonate chemistry toward more hydrogen ions (H+). Since pre-industrial times, surface ocean pH has fallen from about 8.2 to about 8.1—an approximately 30% increase in acidity—which impairs the ability of corals, shellfish, and other calcifying organisms to build shells and skeletons.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�4332839e7df4�body���BECCS是结合生物质能发电与碳捕集封存的技术：植物吸碳、燃烧发电、再把CO2注入地下。由于原料生长吸碳而尾端封碳，理论上可实现净负排放。其大规模部署面临土地、水和成本的激烈竞争。�VBECCS combines bioenergy power with carbon capture and storage: plants absorb carbon, combustion generates power, and the CO2 is injected underground. Because feedstock growth draws carbon while the tail end stores it, it can achieve net-negative emissions in theory. Large-scale deployment faces fierce competition for land, water, and cost.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�43391f2e856a�body�٫完整核算包括土地利用变化、农业生产、加工运输、零售浪费和消费端烹饪。仅算农场排放会低估冷链、甲烷与食物浪费的贡献。��Full accounting spans land-use change, farm production, processing and transport, retail waste, and household cooking. Farm-only counts understate cold-chain, methane, and food-waste contributions.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�43f098ec76b6�body���ESG评价把环境、社会与治理因素纳入投资决策，理论上会推高高污染项目的融资成本。绿色债券则把募集资金锁定到明确的绿色项目，并通常附带报告义务。但两者的实际环境影响取决于标准质量和漂绿风险。如果评分体系彼此不一致，或者绿色资金流向灰色项目，效果就会大打折扣，因此监管正在统一绿色标签和核查机制。�ESG rating folds environmental, social, and governance factors into investment decisions and, in theory, raises financing costs for polluting projects. Green bonds earmark proceeds to defined green projects and usually come with reporting obligations. But the actual environmental impact of both depends on standards quality and greenwashing risk. If rating systems are inconsistent or green money flows to grey projects, the effect weakens — which is why regulators are harmonising green labels and verification.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�44a354ca08ea�body��G一次污染物是直接从污染源排入大气的物质，如二氧化硫、一氧化碳、颗粒物；二次污染物则是在大气中由一次污染物经光化学反应等新生成的污染物，如地面臭氧、硫酸盐和硝酸盐气溶胶。许多城市的臭氧超标主要来自二次生成，而非直接排放。��Primary pollutants are emitted directly from sources, such as sulfur dioxide, carbon monoxide, and particulate matter. Secondary pollutants form in the atmosphere when primary pollutants undergo new reactions—such as photochemistry—producing ground-level ozone and sulfate or nitrate aerosols. Much urban ozone exceedance comes from secondary formation rather than direct emission.�ans��src�ٔ美国环保署（EPA）《我国空气：2020年现状与趋势》（Our Nation's Air）及国家环境空气质量标准（NAAQS）污染物分类٫U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), 'Our Nation's Air: Status and Trends Through 2020' and National Ambient Air Quality Standards (NAAQS) pollutant classifications��id�45104913e6f7�body���生态修复通过植树、退耕还林还草、河流自然化、矿山复绿等手段，帮助受损生态系统重建结构与功能，目标是恢复其自我维持能力，而非简单种回去。但修复周期以十年计、成本高昂，且几乎无法完全还原原始生态。因此生态学强调预防优于修复：保住完好的生态系统，永远是最合算的投资。��Ecological restoration rebuilds structure and function in damaged ecosystems — replanting, returning farmland to forest or grassland, re-naturalising rivers and greening mines — aiming for self-sustaining systems rather than simply replanting the original vegetation. Yet restoration takes decades and costs far more than prevention, and it can rarely recreate the original ecosystem. Ecologists therefore stress prevention over repair: protecting intact ecosystems is always the better investment.�ans��src��.中国科学院（生态修复研究）；UNEP�+CAS (ecological restoration research); UNEP��id�45f3fc375113�body��疏水性微塑料表面能吸附持久性有机污染物（POPs）与重金属，其浓度可比周围海水高数个数量级；被生物摄食后，污染物可在肠道释放并生物放大，使微塑料从'物理危害'升级为'化学传递载体'。��Hydrophobic microplastics adsorb POPs and heavy metals at concentrations orders of magnitude above seawater; once ingested, contaminants can desorb in the gut and biomagnify, upgrading microplastics from a physical hazard to a chemical delivery vector.�ans��src��Environ. Sci. Technol.�EST��id�465474e564a0�body�٬北极冻土里冻着数万年的植物残体和甲烷，升温让它解冻、微生物活跃，把旧碳分解成 CO₂ 和甲烷排向大气，又反过来加速变暖。ٹArctic permafrost locks plant matter and methane from tens of thousands of years; warming thaws it, microbes wake and break that old carbon into CO₂ and methane, feeding warming back.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�46f8b5855ab6�body�ٿ会。气温提前升高让花早开、虫早醒，而节气日期固定，于是"清明还未到、花已开"的现象变多；这正是物候监测能帮我们捕捉的气候变化信号。��Yes. Earlier warming makes flowers and insects appear sooner while term dates are fixed, so "flowers bloom before Qingming" grows common—exactly the climate signal phenology monitoring catches.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�471eaa2f549d�body���CBDR承认各国历史排放与发展阶段不同，要求发达国家带头减排并出资，发展中国家在资金技术支持下列出自主贡献（NDC）；这平衡了公平与可行，却也因责任界定模糊常成谈判拉锯点。�CBDR recognizes differing historical emissions and development stages, expecting developed nations to lead cuts and finance while developing countries submit NDCs with support; it balances equity and feasibility but its blurry responsibility lines fuel perennial negotiation standoffs.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4742a45078d6�body���厨余在填埋场缺氧分解会产生甲烷，其百年增温潜势约为 CO2 的 28–34 倍。堆肥让有机物好氧腐熟成土壤改良剂，既避免强温室气体，又把碳留在地里。��In landfills, food waste decomposes anaerobically into methane, about 28–34 times stronger than CO2 over a century. Composting aerobically turns it into soil amendment, avoiding that gas and keeping carbon in the ground.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�4e93a7fb66e4�body���虚拟水指生产一件商品所消耗的水量，当商品跨境流动时，这部分水以隐含形式转移，例如进口一吨小麦相当于进口约一千多立方米水。研究发现全球约五分之一的水足迹与国际贸易相关，一些干旱国家通过进口粮食缓解本国水压力，实质上把用水外包给出口国。这一视角提示节水政策不能只看境内取水量，还要看消费结构与进口来源地是否本身处于水资源紧张状态。�CVirtual water is the volume consumed in producing a good, transferred implicitly when that good crosses borders: importing a tonne of wheat effectively imports on the order of a thousand cubic metres of water. Analyses find roughly a fifth of humanity's water footprint is linked to international trade, and several arid countries relieve domestic pressure by importing food, outsourcing water use to exporters. The perspective shows conservation policy must look beyond domestic withdrawals to consumption patterns and whether the sourcing regions are themselves water-stressed.�ans��src��zHoekstra 与 Mekonnen（2012）《美国科学院院刊》人类水足迹研究；联合国粮农组织 AQUASTAT 数据库�ZHoekstra and Mekonnen (2012), PNAS, the water footprint of humanity; FAO AQUASTAT database��id�4f963f5842d7�body�ٰ他们的技能高度绑定煤炭，矿井关闭后很难直接转行；需要政府与企业提供培训、产业和公共服务，否则整座城市会陷入"矿停人困"。٦Their skills are tied to coal, so a mine closure leaves few direct options; governments and firms must offer training, industries and services, or whole cities stall.�ans��src��JILO 2015《公正转型指南：迈向环境可持续的经济与社会》�mILO 2015 Guidelines for a just transition towards environmentally sustainable economies and societies for all��id�50deac737b5c�body���氡是土壤岩石中铀衰变产生的放射性气体，在通风不良的室内累积，其衰变产物 α 粒子可损伤肺上皮 DNA。世界卫生组织将其列为继吸烟后肺癌的第二大诱因，防控以加强通风与建筑防潮为主。�-Radon is a radioactive gas from uranium decay in soil and rock that accumulates in poorly ventilated homes; its decay products emit alpha particles that damage lung epithelial DNA. WHO ranks it the second leading lung-cancer cause after smoking, controlled mainly by ventilation and moisture-proofing.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�51b8adee6574�body��M气溶胶是悬浮在空气中的微小颗粒，部分（如硫酸盐）反射阳光而产生冷却效应，部分（如黑碳）吸收热量而增温。它们寿命短、空间分布不均，使区域气候和降水复杂化，也给气候预测带来较大不确定性。气溶胶的减排可能短暂暴露被其掩盖的变暖。�[Aerosols are tiny suspended particles; some, like sulfates, reflect sunlight and cool the climate, while others, like black carbon, absorb heat and warm it. They are short-lived and unevenly distributed, complicating regional climate and rainfall and adding uncertainty to projections. Reducing aerosols may briefly reveal warming they had masked.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�52ad0ebd786d�body���PPCPs包括抗生素、激素、防晒剂等，污水处理厂难以完全去除，即使浓度极低也可能干扰野生动物内分泌、促进抗性基因传播，并通过饮水长期低剂量暴露，其混合物效应的毒理学证据仍不足。�PPCPs—antibiotics, hormones, sunscreens—pass through sewage treatment incompletely; even trace levels can disrupt wildlife endocrine systems and spread resistance genes, with long-term low-dose drinking-water exposure whose mixture toxicity is still poorly characterized.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�547c65c03fd4�body���能源转型依赖锂、钴、稀土等关键矿产来制造电池和电机。然而这些矿产的开采集中在少数国家，且环境代价高昂。回收利用能提供城市矿山，显著降低供应链风险。难点在于电子废弃物中这些金属含量低而分散，加上电池和磁铁设计各异、拆解成本高；为此，欧盟《电池法规》已规定再生金属的最低含量和回收目标，推动矿产循环走向制度化。�>The energy transition depends on critical minerals such as lithium, cobalt, and rare earths to make batteries and motors. Yet mining is concentrated in a few countries and carries high environmental costs. Recycling offers an urban mine that significantly lowers supply-chain risk. The difficulty is that these metals occur in low, dispersed concentrations in e-waste, and varied battery and magnet designs make dismantling costly; the EU Battery Regulation therefore sets recycled-content minimums and collection targets, institutionalising a circular economy for minerals.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�54fa94e581b7�body�٨再野化是撤除人为干预、恢复大面积自然过程，有时重新引入大型食草或食肉动物（如欧洲野牛、狼）来重建自愈的生态系统。٬Rewilding removes human intervention to restore natural processes, sometimes reintroducing large herbivores or predators (bison, wolves) to rebuild self-healing ecosystems.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�55b699d4dbc5�body���一棵小树年固碳仅几公斤，而一趟长途航班人均排放数百公斤，需种很多棵并等数十年才抵得上；更重要的是先减排，树木只能作为补充而非“免罪符”。��A sapling stores only a few kg of carbon a year, while one long flight emits hundreds of kg per person—needing many trees over decades. Cut emissions first; trees are a supplement, not a free pass.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�569dc3f97d8f�body���KBA 是按一套科学标准划定的、对全球生物多样性具有不可替代价值的地点，例如特有种集中地、濒危物种重要栖息地或聚集地。它们为全球保护选址和企业的“无净损失”承诺提供统一依据。�KBAs are sites identified by standardized scientific criteria as irreplaceable for global biodiversity, such as endemic hotspots, critical habitats or aggregation sites. They give a common basis for conservation siting and corporate 'no net loss' commitments.�ans��src��YIUCN《受保护地区分类系统》(The IUCN Category System for Protected Areas, 2008)�8IUCN, The IUCN Category System for Protected Areas, 2008��id�56f28b96ca44�body���主要路径包括热喀斯特坍塌暴露深层碳、泥炭自燃释放CO2/CH4、以及湿地化后厌氧产CH4。不确定在于微生物响应速率、地形水文放大及CH4氧化比例，导致全球模型对冻土排放估算跨度极大。�%Key paths are thermokarst collapse exposing deep carbon, peat fires emitting CO2/CH4, and wetlanding that anaerobically produces CH4. Uncertainty lies in microbial response rates, terrain-hydrology amplification and CH4 oxidation fraction, leaving global model estimates spanning a wide range.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�576af0e5c6e4�body��#直接空气捕集用化学吸附剂从大气中低浓度的二氧化碳中把它抓取，再用高温或电化学方式释放为高纯气流以便封存或利用。它不受排放源位置限制，但能耗和成本极高，目前规模很小。被视为难以减排领域的补充手段。�MDirect air capture uses chemical sorbents to grab CO2 from the atmosphere's low concentration, then releases it as a pure stream via heat or electrochemistry for storage or use. It is not tied to emission sources but extremely energy-intensive and costly, so scale is tiny today. It is seen as a supplement for hard-to-abate sectors.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�57a4a7a91f32�body���海洋脱氧指海水溶解氧浓度下降的现象，既因变暖降低海水携氧能力，也因富营养化导致藻类分解耗氧。低氧海域扩大威胁鱼类生存、改变物种分布，并可能释放更多温室气体。�Ocean deoxygenation is the drop in dissolved oxygen, driven both by warming (warmer water holds less O₂) and by eutrophication that consumes oxygen as algae decay. Expanding low-oxygen zones threaten fish, shift species and may release more greenhouse gases.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5808920b2ab8�body���太阳的短波辐射大部分能穿过大气加热地面，地面则向外发出长波红外辐射；二氧化碳等温室气体吸收部分红外辐射并向下重新辐射，把能量“锁”在地表附近，这就是温室效应。辐射强迫用来量化某一因素（如二氧化碳浓度变化）对地球辐射收支的净扰动，单位是瓦特每平方米。例如大气二氧化碳浓度翻倍造成的直接辐射强迫约为3.7 W/m²，正值意味着能量入大于出、系统升温。�(Shortwave sunlight passes through the atmosphere and warms the surface, which re-emits longwave infrared radiation. Greenhouse gases such as CO2 absorb part of that infrared and re-radiate it back downward, trapping energy near the ground — the greenhouse effect. Radiative forcing quantifies how strongly a factor (such as changing CO2 levels) perturbs the planet's energy balance, in watts per square metre. Doubling atmospheric CO2 produces a direct forcing of about 3.7 W/m²; a positive value means more energy in than out, so the climate warms.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�58d24e79e15e�body�ٟ灰氢用天然气重整制取、排放二氧化碳；绿氢用可再生电力电解水制取、过程几乎零碳，因而被视为未来清洁能源载体。٨Grey hydrogen is made from natural gas and emits CO₂; green hydrogen uses renewable electricity to split water and is nearly carbon-free, seen as a future clean fuel.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�59ed63502b2f�body�ٶ背景灭绝率是地球历史上没有大规模灾变时，物种自然灭绝的平均速度，通常约每年每百万个物种灭绝1个（1 E/MSY），当前速率远超此值。ٻThe background extinction rate is the natural average rate of species loss in the absence of mass catastrophes, roughly 1 extinction per million species-years; today's rate is far higher.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5cf4b0571fe2�body��w地下水的补给靠降水缓慢渗透，抽取速度常常远超补给，导致水位持续下降，进而引发地面沉降、海水入侵和泉河断流。地下水污染后几乎无法在合理时间内自净。华北地区通过跨流域调水、节水灌溉和回补工程，地下水水位已在回升，说明只要科学管理，地下水资源是可以修复的。��Groundwater is recharged only by slow rainfall infiltration, yet pumping often outpaces it, so water tables fall steadily, triggering land subsidence, saltwater intrusion and drying springs. Once polluted, groundwater cannot clean itself within any reasonable time. In the North China Plain, inter-basin water transfer, water-saving irrigation and recharge projects have brought water levels back up — proof that with sound management, groundwater can recover.�ans��src��0中国生态环境部（地下水保护）；WRI�!MEE (groundwater protection); WRI��id�5df2d7a76745�body���兼捕指渔具误捕非目标物种，如海豚、海龟和幼鱼，这类渔获在全球总渔获中可能占很高比例。减少兼捕首先要改良渔具，例如使用海龟排除装置（TED）和驱离海豚的声学威慑器。其次要在空间和时间上划定禁渔区和禁渔期，并改用圆钩和改良刺网。此外，推广全程可追溯的MSC可持续认证，可以让消费者用购买选择来支持负责任的渔业。��Bycatch is the unintended capture of non-target species such as dolphins, sea turtles, and juveniles, and it can account for a large share of global catch. Reducing it starts with modified gear, such as turtle excluder devices (TEDs) and acoustic pingers that deter dolphins. Next come spatially and seasonally closed areas, plus circle hooks and improved nets. In addition, promoting fully traceable MSC-certified fisheries lets consumer choice reward responsible fishing.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�5df8b2393572�body���生物泵指浮游植物光合作用固定碳，死亡后碎屑沉入深海把碳长期封存；溶解度泵指冷水溶解 CO₂ 能力强，下沉的冷水把碳带到深海洋。两者共同让海洋成为最大的活跃碳库之一。�The biological pump is carbon fixed by phytoplankton that sinks as dead matter to deep water, locking it away; the solubility pump is cold water's strong ability to dissolve CO₂, carrying carbon downward as it sinks. Together they make the ocean a major active carbon reservoir.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�5ebf92d4de37�body���轮胎磨损、纺织纤维、道路灰尘与农膜碎片产生的微米级颗粒质量极轻，可被风从城市和农田扬起进入自由大气，随高空气流输送数百至数千公里，再通过降雨或干沉降落地。比利牛斯山高海拔观测站记录到每平方米每天数百个微塑料颗粒沉降，美国西部保护区的调查估算年沉降量超过千吨。这说明微塑料已进入全球性的大气循环，而不只是水体问题。��Micrometre-scale particles from tyre wear, textile fibres, road dust, and fragmented agricultural film are light enough to be lifted from cities and farmland into the free atmosphere, carried hundreds to thousands of kilometres by upper-level winds, and delivered back by rain or dry deposition. A high-altitude station in the Pyrenees recorded hundreds of microplastic particles deposited per square metre per day, and surveys of protected lands in the western United States estimated more than a thousand tonnes deposited annually. Microplastics have therefore entered a global atmospheric cycle rather than remaining a purely aquatic problem.�ans��src��OAllen 等（2019）《Nature Geoscience》；Brahney 等（2020）《Science》�FAllen et al. (2019), Nature Geoscience; Brahney et al. (2020), Science��id�5ff7b3368569�body��海洋吸收了超过90%的地球能量盈余，热惯性巨大、年际噪声小，能平滑地反映气候系统的总能量积累；而地表气温受厄尔尼诺、火山等短期因素扰动明显。因此OHC趋势是温室气体强迫最稳健的物理证据之一。�2The ocean absorbs over 90% of Earth's energy surplus, with huge thermal inertia and low year-to-year noise, so it tracks the system's total energy gain smoothly; surface air temperature is noisier due to ENSO and volcanic swings. OHC trend is thus one of the most robust fingerprints of greenhouse forcing.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�61cfaed14d84�body��@IPCC 第六次评估（2021/2023）指出，2011–2020年全球地表已比1850–1900年工业化前水平升温约1.1℃，并且“毋庸置疑”地，人类活动是这一变暖的主要驱动，估计贡献了约1.07℃的升温。报告还强调若不迅速深度减排，1.5℃阈值将在2030年代被突破。�wThe IPCC Sixth Assessment (2021/2023) reports that from 2011–2020 the global surface was about 1.1°C warmer than the 1850–1900 pre-industrial level, and it is 'unequivocal' that human activity is the dominant driver, contributing an estimated ~1.07°C of that warming. The report stresses that without rapid, deep cuts the 1.5°C threshold could be crossed in the 2030s.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�61dbd79dbea3�body��该研究使用马氏网在多个保护区按统一方法连续采样二十七年，测量的是生物量而非难以标准化的物种计数，因此趋势不易被分类学差异干扰。结果显示夏季飞行昆虫生物量下降约 76%，且发生在受保护的地点，说明压力来自区域尺度的农业强度、农药与生境退化而非保护区内部管理。它把昆虫衰退从零散观察提升为公共议题，也推动了后续对方法学、基线选择与全球代表性的激烈讨论。�|The work used Malaise traps with a consistent protocol across multiple reserves for twenty-seven years and measured biomass rather than species counts that are hard to standardise, so the trend is less vulnerable to taxonomic inconsistency. Flying insect biomass in midsummer fell about 76%, and it happened inside protected sites, implying pressures from regional agricultural intensity, pesticides, and habitat degradation rather than reserve management. The paper turned scattered observations of insect decline into a public issue and also triggered vigorous debate about methodology, baseline choice, and global representativeness.�ans��src��cHallmann 等（2017）《PLOS ONE》；van Klink 等（2020）《Science》昆虫趋势荟萃分析�bHallmann et al. (2017), PLOS ONE; van Klink et al. (2020), Science, meta-analysis of insect trends��id�622352a79917�body��机械回收每轮都会因热历史与杂质使分子链变短、性能下降，产物只能用于更低端产品（如瓶到纤维到建材），数轮后终成废弃物；要闭环需化学回收或源头设计可循环单体，成本与规模仍是障碍。�Each mechanical recycling round shortens chains and adds impurities, dropping performance so output cascades to lower-grade uses (bottle→fiber→lumber) until it becomes waste; true looping needs chemical recycling or mono-material design, still blocked by cost and scale.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�6286608adacc�body��平衡气候敏感度指大气二氧化碳浓度加倍、气候系统重新达到平衡后全球平均地表温度的总升幅。AR6 把古气候记录、工业化以来的观测和过程理解三条证据线交叉约束，把最佳估计定为约 3℃，可能区间收窄到 2.5–4℃。收窄的关键突破是对低云反馈的量化，此前它是不确定性的最大来源。��Equilibrium climate sensitivity is the total rise in global mean surface temperature once the climate system re-equilibrates after a doubling of atmospheric carbon dioxide. AR6 combined three independent lines of evidence — paleoclimate records, the historical instrumental record, and process understanding — to set a best estimate near 3°C with a likely range of 2.5–4°C. The decisive advance was better quantification of low-cloud feedback, previously the dominant source of spread.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�64a3c496f6be�body���模型与古气候数据显示，当毁林与变暖使区域蒸发-降雨循环断裂、干季延长，雨林可能不可逆转为稀树草原；估计阈值在毁林20–25%或升温约3–4°C附近，但位置仍有不确定性。�4Models and paleoclimate data show that deforestation plus warming can break the regional evapotranspiration-rainfall loop and lengthen dry seasons, flipping the rainforest irreversibly to savanna; estimates place the threshold near 20–25% deforestation or ~3–4°C, though its exact position is uncertain.�ans��src��Nature;Science�Nature;Science��id�679a3f0eea17�body��/生物放大作用指某些难降解的有毒物质（如重金属、有机氯）沿食物链逐级富集，营养级越高浓度越大的现象。例如水体中的微量汞可在大鱼和捕食性鸟类中累积到危险水平。它解释了为什么顶级捕食者往往最先受到污染的毒害。�wBiomagnification is the process by which non-degradable toxic substances such as heavy metals and organochlorines accumulate along the food chain, reaching higher concentrations at higher trophic levels. For example, trace mercury in water can build to dangerous levels in large fish and predatory birds. It explains why top predators are often the first to suffer poisoning.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�6872f62bec67�body�١通过错开食物、空间、时间或行为，物种把资源"切"成不同份额，谁都不必正面硬抢；这种细分让有限资源养活更多种类。٩By splitting food, space, time or behavior, species carve resources into shares so none must fight head-on; that fine division lets limited resources support more kinds.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�688a72e56e35�body��暴露评估围绕暴露途径（吸入、食入、皮肤接触）、暴露剂量与暴露时长三个要素，结合环境监测与个体活动模式估算内剂量。不确定性主要来自时空变异性与行为参数，常需蒙特卡洛模拟量化。�CExposure assessment quantifies contact via exposure route (inhalation, ingestion, dermal), dose and duration, combining environmental monitoring with activity patterns to estimate internal dose. Uncertainty stems mainly from spatiotemporal variability and behavioral parameters, often addressed with Monte Carlo simulation.�ans��src��0《环境科学》环境暴露评估方法论文�EEnvironmental Science journal — exposure assessment methods article��id�6890e59f74e2�body���环境流指维持河流生态系统所需的自然水文节律，它不仅要求有足够的水量，还要求流量具有季节变化。周期性洪水漫滩能为鱼类产卵提供信号，为河岸植被和地下水补水，并塑造河道形态。过度调平流量虽然有利于防洪和蓄水，却会损害依赖洪水的生态过程。现代水管理因此在保障供水的同时，通过生态调度保留必要的过程性洪水。�Environmental flow is the natural hydrological regime needed to sustain river ecosystems: it demands sufficient volume and, crucially, seasonal variability in flow. Periodic flooding of the floodplain signals fish spawning, recharges riparian vegetation and groundwater, and shapes channel form. Over-flattening flows may aid flood control and storage but damages ecological processes that depend on floods. Modern water management therefore safeguards supply while retaining necessary process floods through ecologically designed releases.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6d74656eada2�body��环境承载力是指一定区域内生态系统在不被永久破坏的前提下，所能持续供养的人口或生物的最大数量。超过承载力会导致资源枯竭和环境污染。它是规划城市发展、放牧和渔获量的重要科学依据。�Carrying capacity is the maximum population or biomass an ecosystem can sustainably support without permanent degradation. Exceeding it leads to resource depletion and pollution. It is a key scientific basis for planning cities, grazing, and fishery catches.�ans��src��%Odum 与 Barrett《生态学基础》�3Odum, E.P. & Barrett, G.W., Fundamentals of Ecology��id�712daf204d37�body���甲烷在大气中的化学寿命约 12 年，因此把它的辐射效应摊到 100 年会被大幅稀释，而摊到 20 年则显得极强；AR6 给出化石源甲烷 GWP-100 约 29.8、GWP-20 约 82.5。这意味着削减甲烷能在十年尺度上快速压低升温速率，是争取时间的杠杆；但甲烷减排不能替代二氧化碳减排，因为只有累积二氧化碳决定长期峰值温度。用哪个时间尺度核算，会直接改变畜牧业、油气泄漏等部门的相对责任。�4Methane's atmospheric lifetime is about twelve years, so spreading its radiative effect over a century dilutes it heavily, while a twenty-year horizon makes it look far more potent; AR6 gives fossil methane a GWP-100 of about 29.8 and a GWP-20 of about 82.5. Cutting methane therefore slows the rate of warming within a decade, buying time, but it cannot substitute for CO2 cuts because only cumulative CO2 sets the long-term peak temperature. The choice of horizon directly reshapes the relative burden placed on livestock, oil and gas leakage, and waste sectors.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�72923a825388�body�� 太阳能和风能出力随天气变化，发电时多时少，而用电需求也要随时满足，因此电网需要储能来“削峰填谷”。电池（如锂电池）可在富电时充电、缺电时放电，平抑波动。储能是解决可再生能源并网难题的关键技术。�Solar and wind output varies with weather while demand must be met anytime, so the grid needs storage to shift energy from peaks to valleys. Batteries like lithium-ion charge when surplus and discharge when short, smoothing fluctuations. Storage is key to integrating renewables.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7353020b01b1�body��TCBDR是《联合国气候变化框架公约》的核心原则，承认所有国家都有应对气候变化的共同责任，但强调发达国家因历史排放更高、能力更强，应承担更大且率先的减排与资金技术支持义务。它在历次气候大会中是发达国家与发展中国家争议与博弈的焦点之一。��CBDR is a core principle of the UN Framework Convention on Climate Change: all nations share a common responsibility to address climate change, but developed countries, having emitted more historically and possessing greater capacity, should take larger and earlier mitigation and financial-support obligations. It has long been a focal point of negotiation between developed and developing countries.�ans��src��A《联合国气候变化框架公约》（UNFCCC，1992）原则3�EUN Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC, 1992), Principle 3��id�7386cf00b72d�body���SSP 是刻画未来人口、经济、能源与技术走向的几条叙事情景（如 SSP1 可持续发展、SSP3 分裂世界），与排放情景组合，供气候模型评估不同发展道路下的气候结果。��SSPs are narrative scenarios of future population, economy, energy and technology (e.g., SSP1 sustainable, SSP3 fragmented), combined with emissions to test climate outcomes under different development paths.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7464b835b00f�body���LCA 按 ISO 14040 标准，系统量化一件产品或一项服务从原料开采、制造、使用到废弃全过程的环境影响。它能避免“把污染从一个环节转移到另一个环节”的假优化，是绿色设计的重要工具。�Following ISO 14040, an LCA systematically quantifies a product or service's environmental impacts from raw material extraction through manufacturing, use and disposal. It prevents false optimizations that merely shift pollution from one stage to another, aiding green design.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�74c646587f55�body��在南极和格陵兰钻取的冰芯封存了数万年来被困在气泡中的古空气。分析这些气泡的气体成分即可直接测得当时的CO2和甲烷浓度。冰层厚度与同位素还提供了温度与年代信息，使过去80万年气候得以精确复原。�QIce cores drilled in Antarctica and Greenland trap ancient air in bubbles dating back hundreds of thousands of years. Analyzing the gas in those bubbles directly reveals past CO2 and methane concentrations. Layer thickness and isotopic ratios also give temperature and age information, reconstructing climate over the last 800,000 years.�ans��src��+美国国家冰雪数据中心;《自然》�NSIDC;Nature��id�74ec9973459a�body�ٱ20 世纪以来工业固氮使全球活性氮产量翻倍，如今人为固氮总量已与自然生物固氮相当甚至更多，深刻改变了全球氮循环并带来污染。��Since the 1900s, Haber-Bosch fixation has roughly doubled reactive nitrogen creation; anthropogenic fixation now rivals or exceeds natural biological fixation, reshaping the global N cycle and causing pollution.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�75b62d80ae32�body�٭冬季地面冷却快、逆温层像“盖子”抑制垂直扩散，加上低风速，污染物在近地面积累。采暖燃煤与静稳气象叠加，PM2.5浓度骤升。��In winter the surface cools fast and an inversion layer acts like a lid suppressing vertical mixing; with low wind, pollutants accumulate near ground. Heating coal plus stagnant weather spikes PM2.5.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�763338a27509�body�ٖ红树林、海草、盐沼把碳埋进缺氧的沉积物，分解极慢，可封存千年；而森林碳一旦火烧或腐烂会较快回到大气。٧Mangroves, seagrasses and salt marshes bury carbon in oxygen-poor sediment where decay is slow, locking it for millennia; forest carbon returns faster via fire or rot.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�768ba70a2c2e�body���不同温室气体的增温能力和在大气中的寿命差别很大。全球变暖潜势（GWP）把1千克某种气体在给定时间内（通常100年）的增温效果，折算成二氧化碳的倍数：如甲烷100年GWP约28，一氧化二氮约273（IPCC AR6最新值）。把各类排放乘以其GWP后相加，就得到“二氧化碳当量”，方便政策统计和比较减排效益。��Greenhouse gases differ hugely in warming strength and atmospheric lifetime. The Global Warming Potential (GWP) converts the warming caused by 1 kg of a gas over a set period (usually 100 years) into the equivalent amount of CO2: methane has a 100-year GWP of about 28, nitrous oxide about 273 (latest IPCC AR6 values). Multiplying each emission by its GWP and summing gives CO2-equivalent, which lets policymakers tally emissions and compare reduction options on one scale.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�781f24d1d51b�body��S奥加拉拉含水层是北美大平原下世界上最大的地下淡水系统之一，支撑着美国约五分之一的灌溉农业。但由于抽水量远超自然补给速度，部分区域水位已下降数十米，专家估计按当前速率部分区域可能在本世纪内趋于枯竭，凸显地下水不可持续的透支风险。��The Ogallala Aquifer is one of the world's largest underground freshwater systems beneath the North American Great Plains, supporting about one-fifth of U.S. irrigated agriculture. Because pumping far exceeds natural recharge, water levels in places have dropped by tens of meters, and some areas could be depleted within this century at current rates—highlighting unsustainable groundwater overdraft.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�7b2f479f72c4�body���白天自家发电优先自用、用不完卖给电网，等于把屋顶变成小型电站；它削减高峰用电、但大量分布式电源也考验电网的波动消纳与计量结算规则。��By day you use your own power first and sell the rest, turning the roof into a mini power plant; it cuts peak demand, but lots of distributed sources test the grid's balancing and metering rules.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�7b6322a1f1a4�body���参数保险（又称指数保险）预先约定降雨、台风等天气指标的赔付阈值，指标一旦达标便自动赔付，无需现场查勘。这样农户和脆弱地区能在灾害后快速获得资金，缩短了传统理赔的漫长流程。但高风险的地区保费随之水涨船高，私人市场往往定价失灵，需要政府补贴和再保险机制托底。同时必须认识到，保险只分担财务损失，不能替代根本性的减排与适应行动。�IParametric (index) insurance pre-agrees payout thresholds for weather indicators such as rainfall and typhoon intensity, and pays out automatically once a threshold is crossed, without on-site claims inspection. This lets farmers and vulnerable regions receive funds quickly after a disaster, bypassing slow traditional claims processes. But in high-risk zones premiums soar and private markets often fail, so government subsidies and reinsurance backstops are needed. It must also be recognised that insurance only shares financial losses and cannot replace mitigation and adaptation.�ans��src�ُBarnett, Barrett, Skees,《Poverty Traps and Index-Based Risk Transfer Products》,World Development,2008 (DOI: 10.1016/j.worlddev.2007.10.016)ٍBarnett, Barrett, Skees, 'Poverty Traps and Index-Based Risk Transfer Products', World Development, 2008, DOI: 10.1016/j.worlddev.2007.10.016��id�7cac17689a45�body���二者常同源（富营养化与CO2），叠加时钙化能耗上升而缺氧限制代谢供能，使生物在更小范围内同时承受能量赤字与壳溶解，临界氧与pH阈值彼此下移，死亡区扩张更快。�Both often share drivers (eutrophication and CO2); together, calcification costs rise while hypoxia limits metabolic energy, so organisms face energy deficit and shell dissolution at once, with critical O2 and pH thresholds shifting downward and dead zones expanding faster.�ans��src���Clark, Gobler,《Diurnal fluctuations in CO2 and dissolved oxygen concentrations do not provide a refuge from hypoxia and acidification for early-life-stage bivalves》,Marine Ecology Progress Series,2016 (DOI: 10.3354/meps11852)��Clark, Gobler, 'Diurnal fluctuations in CO2 and dissolved oxygen concentrations do not provide a refuge from hypoxia and acidification for early-life-stage bivalves', Marine Ecology Progress Series, 2016, DOI: 10.3354/meps11852��id�7d50f6a91ff4�body��《斯德哥尔摩公约》（2001）要求缔约方禁止或限制生产、使用和排放那些持久、可生物累积、能长距离迁移的有毒化学品。典型例子是二噁英，它在焚烧与工业过程中产生，难以降解并在食物链中富集。�The Stockholm Convention (2001) obliges parties to eliminate or restrict chemicals that are persistent, bioaccumulative, and long-range transportable. A classic example is dioxins, formed in incineration and industry, that resist degradation and build up in food chains.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�7ebb61c40b4e�body�٬生态位是物种的"职业"：吃哪层叶、何时觅食、怎么筑巢都不同；两只鸟若错开食物与时间，就等于占了不同"工位"，便相安无事。٠A niche is a species' "job": which leaves it eats, when it forages, how it nests. Two birds using different food and times occupy different "desks" and coexist.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7f4dd07bbb87�body���船舶重油燃烧释放的二氧化硫会生成硫酸盐气溶胶，既直接反射阳光，又充当云凝结核让海洋低云更亮更持久，从而长期抵消了一部分温室气体增温。2020 年生效的 MARPOL 附则六限硫令把燃料硫含量上限从 3.5% 压到 0.5%，航道上的船舶航迹云随之显著减少。这等于突然揭掉了一层遮阳伞，研究者据此估算北太平洋等繁忙航线区域获得了额外的正辐射强迫。�#Sulphur dioxide from heavy marine fuel forms sulphate aerosol that both scatters sunlight directly and seeds brighter, longer-lived marine low clouds, offsetting part of greenhouse warming for decades. The MARPOL Annex VI cap that took effect in 2020 cut fuel sulphur content from 3.5% to 0.5%, and satellite-visible ship tracks over major shipping lanes thinned sharply. Removing that inadvertent sunshade added positive radiative forcing over busy corridors such as the North Pacific, an effect researchers have described as a termination shock.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�80d304720946�body��过量活性氮（NH3、NOy）沉降使贫氮生态系统富营养化，改变物种竞争、抑制固氮与菌根，导致生物多样性下降与土壤酸化，并可在湿地中转化为笑气（N2O）加剧温室效应，其影响常滞后数十年才显现。�Excess reactive nitrogen (NH3, NOy) deposition eutrophies nitrogen-poor ecosystems, shifts species competition, suppresses nodulation and mycorrhizae, lowers biodiversity, acidifies soils, and can convert to N2O in wetlands—effects often delayed by decades.�ans��src��!Nature;Global Nitrogen Initiative�Nature;GNI��id�80ee09d84134�body��EROI 是系统产出的能源除以其全寿命周期消耗能源的比值。现代电网级可再生能源 EROI 约 10–30，虽低于传统石油早期水平，但远高于维持经济所需的门槛；EROI 过低的社会难以支撑复杂经济活动。�EROI is the energy a system delivers divided by the energy spent across its life cycle. Grid-scale renewables show EROI around 10–30—lower than early oil but well above the threshold needed to sustain an economy; very low EROI societies struggle to support complex activity.�ans��src��UHall, Lambert & Balogh《可持续社会所需的最低 EROI》(2011, Sustainability)�nHall, Lambert & Balogh, 'What is the Minimum EROI that a Sustainable Society Requires?' (2011, Sustainability)��id�80f1679ee380�body��]基林曲线是自1958年起在夏威夷冒纳罗亚观测站连续测得的大气二氧化碳浓度曲线，由查尔斯·戴维·基林建立。它清晰显示CO2浓度从约315 ppm持续上升到如今的420 ppm以上，并叠加着年度季节波动，为人为排放导致大气温室气体累积提供了最直接、最长期的观测证据。��The Keeling Curve is the continuous record of atmospheric CO2 concentration measured since 1958 at the Mauna Loa Observatory in Hawaii, begun by Charles David Keeling. It shows CO2 rising steadily from about 315 ppm to over 420 ppm today, with a superimposed annual seasonal cycle, providing the most direct and longest-term observational evidence that human emissions are accumulating in the atmosphere.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�81adea88e90b�body���低云又白又亮，会把阳光反射回太空而起降温作用；高云像毯子一样困住热量而起增温作用。云的形成和响应很复杂，模型之间差异大，因此云反馈方向仍不完全确定。��Low bright clouds reflect sunlight and cool the planet, while high clouds trap heat like a blanket. Cloud formation and its response to warming are complex and vary across models, so the sign and size of cloud feedback remain uncertain.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�82dbbfdef4e8�body��云既能反射阳光产生冷却，也能像毯子一样截留热量产生增温，净效应取决于云的类型和高度。低云多偏冷却，高云多偏增温，而气候变暖如何改变云量仍是模型最大不确定源之一。云反馈可能放大或缓和升温。�,Clouds both reflect sunlight to cool and trap heat like a blanket to warm, with the net effect depending on type and altitude. Low clouds tend to cool, high clouds to warm, and how warming changes cloud cover is among the largest uncertainties in models. Cloud feedback can amplify or dampen warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�83a253eb97ac�body���虚拟水是生产一件商品（如1公斤牛肉、一件棉衣）在整个供应链中消耗的水；水足迹是个人或产品在整个生命周期用掉的总水量，含看不见的虚拟水。ټVirtual water is the water used across the supply chain to make a product (e.g., 1 kg beef); water footprint is the total water used by a person or product, including hidden virtual water.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�84c904fa7b6c�body���可信的净零承诺要符合1.5°C对齐框架。企业应设定经科学验证的短期与长期目标，例如通过SBTi的验证。企业还应优先削减自身价值链的排放，把抵消严格限制在剩余排放范围内，并公开年度进展。同时承诺必须覆盖范围1、2、3的全部排放，而不是只挑容易核算的部分，研究与监管也正在共同打击零碳夸大行为。��A credible net-zero commitment must follow a 1.5°C-aligned framework. Companies should set science-based near- and long-term targets, for example validated by SBTi. They should prioritise cutting value-chain emissions, strictly limit offsets to residual emissions, and publish annual progress. Commitments must also cover all Scope 1, 2, and 3 emissions rather than cherry-picking the easy parts, and research and regulation are jointly cracking down on zero-washing.�ans��src��GHG Protocol�GHG Protocol��id�85d8fe21eaf7�body���麦克阿瑟和威尔逊提出，岛屿上的物种数由“迁入”和“灭绝”两种速率平衡决定：岛屿越大、离大陆越近，物种就越丰富。这一理论后来被用来指导自然保护区的面积与连通设计。��MacArthur and Wilson argued that the number of species on an island is set by a balance of immigration and extinction: bigger islands closer to the mainland hold more species. The theory now guides the design of reserve size and connectivity.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�87c868672ae5�body��~碳定价是通过给二氧化碳排放赋予货币成本来激励减排的机制，主要工具是碳税（对单位排放直接征税）和碳排放交易体系（ cap-and-trade，设定总量上限并交易配额）。世界银行数据显示已有70多个司法管辖区实施了某种形式的碳定价，但覆盖率和价格水平仍不足以实现《巴黎协定》目标。�rCarbon pricing puts a monetary cost on CO2 emissions to incentivize reductions, mainly through a carbon tax (a direct levy per unit emitted) and a cap-and-trade system (an emissions cap with tradable allowances). World Bank data show over 70 jurisdictions have some form of carbon pricing, yet coverage and price levels remain insufficient for the Paris Agreement goals.�ans��src��R世界银行《碳定价现状与趋势》（State and Trends of Carbon Pricing）�7World Bank, 'State and Trends of Carbon Pricing' report��id�8834e0c7ae22�body��~CCS在电厂或工厂的烟囱处捕集二氧化碳，压缩后注入深部地质构造（如废弃油气藏、咸水层）永久封存，或转化为产品利用。它的意义是让现有化石燃料和工业流程也能“低碳运行”，但捕集能耗大、成本高、规模有限，IPCC强调它是实现净零排放的补充手段，不能替代大幅削减排放本身。��CCS captures CO2 at power plants or industrial stacks, compresses it and injects it deep underground (into depleted oil fields or saline aquifers) for long-term storage, or converts it into products. It lets existing fossil and industrial processes run with far lower emissions, but it is energy-intensive, costly and still limited in scale. The IPCC stresses that CCS is a complement to deep emission cuts, not a substitute for them.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�89419f22359b�body��k核裂变反应堆发电时几乎不排放二氧化碳，能量密度极高，一座机组能稳定提供大量基荷电力，因此许多气候模型把核能作为低碳组合的一部分。但核废料需要安全处置上千年、重大事故后果严重、建设周期和成本高，这些风险让各国对核能态度不一，有的扩建，有的弃核。��Nuclear fission plants emit almost no CO2 while generating, and their huge energy density lets one unit deliver steady baseload power, so many climate models include nuclear in low-carbon portfolios. But spent fuel must be contained safely for millennia, severe accidents carry catastrophic consequences, and builds are slow and costly. These trade-offs explain why some countries expand nuclear power while others phase it out.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�8a1bc15ea248�body��X温室气体核算体系把排放分为三类：自有设施的直接排放为范围一，外购电力和热力为范围二，价值链上下游的其他排放为范围三，包括采购商品与服务、运输、员工通勤、产品使用与废弃处理等十五个类别。范围三之所以难算，是因为数据掌握在供应商和用户手中，企业只能依赖行业平均排放因子或支出型估算，重复计算与边界划分争议随之出现。但对零售、金融和消费品企业而言，范围三常占总排放的七成以上，忽略它等于回避了主要减排空间。��The Greenhouse Gas Protocol splits emissions into Scope 1 from owned operations, Scope 2 from purchased electricity and heat, and Scope 3 for everything else across the value chain, spanning fifteen categories from purchased goods and services to transport, commuting, product use, and end-of-life treatment. Scope 3 is hard to measure because the data sit with suppliers and customers, forcing companies to rely on industry-average emission factors or spend-based estimates, which invites double counting and boundary disputes. Yet for retail, financial, and consumer-goods firms Scope 3 often exceeds 70% of the total, so ignoring it means avoiding the bulk of the abatement opportunity.�ans��src���《温室气体核算体系：企业价值链（范围三）核算与报告标准》（世界资源研究所与世界可持续发展工商理事会）；科学碳目标倡议（SBTi）净零标准ْGHG Protocol Corporate Value Chain (Scope 3) Accounting and Reporting Standard (WRI and WBCSD); Science Based Targets initiative Net-Zero Standard��id�8bbb6c89bbba�body��3化石记录显示地球曾发生五次自然大灭绝；如今由于栖息地破坏、气候变化和过度开发，物种灭绝速率估计为背景（自然）速率的100至1000倍。许多科学家据此认为人类活动正驱动第六次大灭绝，尽管它比以往更慢、但范围同样广泛。�YThe fossil record shows five past natural mass extinctions; today, driven by habitat loss, climate change, and overexploitation, species are vanishing at an estimated 100 to 1,000 times the background (natural) rate. Many scientists argue human activity is driving a sixth mass extinction—slower than past events but comparably broad in scope.�ans��src��mRull,《Biodiversity crisis or sixth mass extinction?》,The EMBO Reports,2022 (DOI: 10.15252/embr.202154193)�kRull, 'Biodiversity crisis or sixth mass extinction?', The EMBO Reports, 2022, DOI: 10.15252/embr.202154193��id�8ec48a5a2c5a�body��生物多样性补偿以异地保护或修复来抵偿开发造成的生态损失，理论上追求无净损失或净增益。但物种与栖息地不可完全等价替换、存在时间滞后与基线不确定性，实际常难以严格兑现，需严格的附加性与监测保障。�CBiodiversity offsets use off-site protection or restoration to compensate for development losses, aiming in principle for no net loss or net gain. But species and habitats are not fully substitutable, with time lags and baseline uncertainty, so strict achievement is hard and requires rigorous additionality and monitoring.�ans��src��#Science 生物多样性补偿研究�&Science — biodiversity offsets study��id�908ca3972caa�body���氡是土壤和岩石中铀衰变产生的无色无味的放射性气体，经地基裂缝渗入居室，长期吸入是仅次于吸烟的肺癌风险；它看不见闻不到，需专门仪器检测，因而常被忽视。��Radon is a colorless, odorless radioactive gas from uranium decay in soil and rock that seeps in through foundation cracks; long-term inhalation is the top lung-cancer risk after smoking. Invisible and odorless, it needs special testing, so it's ignored.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�91582b6800e7�body���围封禁牧能让植被覆盖和土壤碳储量回升，短期效果明显。但长期完全禁牧会引发枯草堆积、可燃物增多和物种单一化，因为草食动物的适度啃食与踩踏本身就是草原生态过程的一部分。现代草原修复因此主张轮牧、补播乡土草种、科学火烧管理，并恢复大型有蹄类与土壤动物的相互作用。只有把封育与适度利用结合起来，才能重建功能完整的草原。�UFencing and grazing exclusion let vegetation cover and soil carbon recover, with clear short-term gains. But prolonged total exclusion causes litter buildup, fuel accumulation, and species simplification, because moderate grazing and trampling by herbivores are themselves part of grassland ecosystem processes. Modern grassland restoration therefore combines rotational grazing, reseeding native grasses, and scientific fire management, while restoring interactions between large ungulates and soil fauna. Only by combining protection with moderate use can fully functional grasslands be rebuilt.�ans��src��0中国科学院（草原生态与恢复研究）�?Chinese Academy of Sciences (grassland ecology and restoration)��id�917e9c9f0850�body���动植物对温度极敏感，春季物候普遍提前、秋季推迟，长期序列能直接显示某地变暖多少天。大量市民记录填补了专业站点稀疏的空白，比单次测量更稳。��Plants and animals are temperature-sensitive; springs arrive earlier and autumns later, and long series show exactly how many warming days a place gained. Citizen logs fill gaps between sparse stations, steadier than single measurements.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9264ecfc9502�body��G科学家认为地球正经历由人类活动驱动的第六次物种大灭绝，其灭绝速率远高于自然背景水平。前五次大灭绝由小行星撞击、火山等自然灾变造成，而这一次主要源于栖息地破坏、气候变化和过度开发。阻止它需要在全球范围采取紧急的保护行动。�}Scientists argue Earth is undergoing a sixth mass extinction driven by human activity, with extinction rates far above the natural background. The previous five were caused by natural catastrophes like asteroid impacts and volcanoes, while this one stems mainly from habitat destruction, climate change, and overexploitation. Stopping it requires urgent global conservation action.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�92bf6259ad7e�body��麦克阿瑟与威尔逊 1967 年提出，岛屿物种数由迁入率与灭绝率的动态平衡决定，面积越大灭绝率越低，距大陆越近迁入率越高，可用物种-面积关系刻画。保护生物学家把破碎化生境视为陆地上的岛屿，据此主张保护区宜大、宜近、宜有廊道相连，并尽量减少边缘效应。这一推论也引发了著名的单个大保护区还是若干小保护区之争，后续研究表明答案取决于目标物种的扩散能力与干扰格局。�wMacArthur and Wilson argued in 1967 that species number on an island reflects a dynamic equilibrium between immigration and extinction, with larger area lowering extinction and proximity to a mainland raising immigration, summarised by species-area relationships. Conservation biologists treated fragmented habitats as terrestrial islands and inferred that reserves should be large, close together, connected by corridors, and shaped to minimise edge effects. The framework also sparked the single-large-or-several-small debate, and later work showed the answer depends on target species' dispersal ability and disturbance regimes.�ans��src��vMacArthur 与 Wilson《The Theory of Island Biogeography》（1967）；Diamond（1975）《Biological Conservation》�gMacArthur and Wilson, The Theory of Island Biogeography (1967); Diamond (1975), Biological Conservation��id�93caf7c5caa2�body��e阳光和风时有时无，而用电需求时刻在变。储能可以在出力高峰存电、用电高峰放电，把“间歇”的电源变成“可按需调度”的电源。抽水蓄能容量最大、最成熟；锂电池响应快、部署灵活。随着储能成本下降，电网才能在安全的前提下容纳越来越高的可再生能源比例。��Sunshine and wind come and go, but electricity demand changes by the minute. Storage charges when generation peaks and discharges when demand peaks, turning intermittent sources into dispatchable ones. Pumped hydro remains the largest and most mature option; lithium batteries respond fast and deploy flexibly. As storage costs fall, grids can safely host ever-higher shares of renewables.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�93db002516d5�body��.宏条形码对样本中所有生物的特定 DNA 片段进行高通量测序，再用通用或类群特异性引物比对参考库，一次性检出鱼类、两栖类、无脊椎类等多类群。它极大提升了监测通量，但受引物偏好与数据库完整性限制，可能出现假阴性。�UMetabarcoding sequences a specific DNA region from all organisms in a sample via high-throughput sequencing, then matches universal or taxon-specific primers to reference libraries to detect fish, amphibians, invertebrates and more at once. It boosts monitoring throughput, but primer bias and incomplete databases can cause false negatives.�ans��src���Miya 等,《MiFish metabarcoding: a high-throughput approach for simultaneous detection of multiple fish species from environmental DNA and other samples》,Fisheries Science,2020 (DOI: 10.1007/s12562-020-01461-x)��Miya et al., 'MiFish metabarcoding: a high-throughput approach for simultaneous detection of multiple fish species from environmental DNA and other samples', Fisheries Science, 2020, DOI: 10.1007/s12562-020-01461-x��id�947806074df6�body��研究者用大规模气候模式集合分别模拟两个世界：一个是含有真实人为强迫的现实世界，另一个是移除人类温室气体与气溶胶影响的反事实世界。统计同等强度事件在两个世界中的重现期，比值就是概率变化倍数，同时还会用长期观测序列做独立检验。世界天气归因联盟据此在事件发生后数周内发布快速归因结论，例如判定 2021 年北美西部热穹顶在无人类影响的气候中几乎不可能出现。�QResearchers run large climate-model ensembles for two worlds: the factual one with observed anthropogenic forcing, and a counterfactual one with human greenhouse gas and aerosol influence removed. Comparing the return periods of an equally intense event in each world yields the change in likelihood, and long observational records are used as an independent check. The World Weather Attribution collaboration applies this to publish rapid assessments within weeks, concluding for instance that the 2021 Pacific Northwest heat dome would have been virtually impossible without human influence.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�971c3d1f029a�body�ٴ每升一级，约九成能量以热和代谢散失，只剩一成左右传给下一级；所以顶层捕食者总量必然远少于底层植物，呈现底宽顶尖的金字塔。ٸAt each step about 90% of energy is lost as heat and metabolism, leaving ~10% for the next level; top predators are thus far fewer than base plants—a bottom-wide, top-narrow pyramid.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�97322bd0d7a6�body��
亚马逊约有三到五成的降水来自森林自身的蒸腾，水汽随信风向内陆逐级再循环，形成所谓飞行的河流。若森林砍伐与火灾把树冠覆盖削减到某个阈值，蒸腾输入不足会缩短旱季降水、加剧火险，使东南部逐步转为稀树草原，这一自我强化过程就是临界点假说。Lovejoy 与 Nobre 提出在叠加升温背景下，20% 至 25% 的森林损失就可能触发转变，而航空观测已发现亚马逊东南部在部分年份转为净碳源。��Between a third and a half of Amazon rainfall is generated by the forest's own transpiration, with moisture recycled inland stage by stage in what are called flying rivers. If deforestation and fire cut canopy cover past a threshold, reduced transpiration shortens the wet season and raises fire risk, converting the south-east progressively toward savanna — a self-reinforcing process that is the tipping point hypothesis. Lovejoy and Nobre argued that with added warming a loss of 20–25% of the forest could trigger the shift, and aircraft measurements have already found the south-eastern Amazon acting as a net carbon source in some years.�ans��src��kLovejoy 与 Nobre（2018）《Science Advances》；Gatti 等（2021）《Nature》亚马逊碳通量观测�hLovejoy and Nobre (2018), Science Advances; Gatti et al. (2021), Nature, Amazon carbon flux measurements��id�9f3651b6bbc4�body��强化一项服务（如单一种植固碳林）常削弱另一项（如生物多样性、水土保持），且权衡随尺度变化：局地增产可能以流域调蓄下降为代价。忽视耦合关系的最优解往往在全球或长期尺度转为次优。�*Boosting one service (e.g., monoculture carbon plantations) often weakens others (biodiversity, soil retention), and trade-offs shift with scale—local yield gains may cost watershed buffering. Ignoring these couplings, the 'optimal' solution at one scale becomes suboptimal globally or over time.�ans��src�ٱLangner 等,《Value-based ecosystem service trade-offs in multi-objective management in European mountain forests》,Ecosystem Services,2017 (DOI: 10.1016/j.ecoser.2017.03.001)ٲLangner et al., 'Value-based ecosystem service trade-offs in multi-objective management in European mountain forests', Ecosystem Services, 2017, DOI: 10.1016/j.ecoser.2017.03.001��id�a016af175fff�body��脱钩是指经济增长的同时，资源消耗或环境污染不再同步上升，甚至反而下降的现象。实现相对脱钩是增长快于影响上升，绝对脱钩则是影响绝对减少。提高能效、发展服务业和循环经济是促成脱钩的主要途径。�#Decoupling means the economy grows while resource use or environmental harm no longer rises in step, or even falls. Relative decoupling is growth faster than impact; absolute decoupling is impact actually declining. Efficiency, services, and circular economy are main pathways to achieve it.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a2688cd5456a�body�ٽ蓝水是河流湖泊和地下水等可见的地表与地下淡水；绿水是降水中被植物吸收和蒸散的土壤水；灰水是稀释污染物所需的水量，代表水质代价。ٿBlue water is visible surface and groundwater; green water is rainfall stored in soil and used by plants; grey water is the volume needed to dilute pollution, representing water-quality cost.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a4141ad14775�body���棉布袋因种植与纺织耗能高，需重复使用数十到上百次才抵得过塑料袋；纸袋生产耗水多但也较易回收。关键是“重复使用次数”，而不是材质本身——任何袋子多用一次就少一个新品。��Cotton bags need dozens to over a hundred reuses to beat plastic due to farming and weaving energy; paper uses much water but recycles more easily. The key is reuse count, not the material—every extra use avoids a new bag.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�a51e163293cd�body��研究用系统保护规划显示：覆盖更多生境的'广度'能保全稀有种，但管理薄弱的纸面保护区形同虚设；在资金受限时，优先把现有高价值保护区的巡护与执法做实，往往比新增边界带来更高物种存续收益。�%Systematic conservation planning shows breadth covers more habitats and rare species, but poorly managed 'paper parks' do nothing; under tight budgets, strengthening enforcement and management of existing high-value reserves often yields more persistence per dollar than adding new boundaries.�ans��src���Campbell 与 Gray,《Area expansion versus effective and equitable management in international marine protected areas goals and targets》,Marine Policy,2019 (DOI: 10.1016/j.marpol.2018.11.030)ٽCampbell & Gray, 'Area expansion versus effective and equitable management in international marine protected areas goals and targets', Marine Policy, 2019, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpol.2018.11.030��id�a9c4627fe117�body�٧它便宜又用途广，从饼干到洗发水都有，巨大需求推动热带雨林改种油棕；因藏在无数产品里，消费者很难在货架上"看见"它。٨Cheap and everywhere—from biscuits to shampoo—its huge demand converts rainforests to oil palm; hidden in countless products, shoppers rarely "see" it on the shelf.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ab33e43ac866�body���边界层是紧贴地面、受地表摩擦与热力直接影响的最低层大气，其高度日变化大。白天高、夜间低（稳定层结）时污染物更易累积，因此预报与管控需结合边界层结构。��The boundary layer is the lowest atmosphere directly shaped by surface friction and heating; its height varies diurnally. It is tall by day but low and stable at night, trapping pollutants—so forecasting and control must account for its structure.�ans��src��7Oke,《Boundary Layer Climates》第2版,Routledge,1987�<T. R. Oke, Boundary Layer Climates, 2nd ed., Routledge, 1987��id�ab499c080e65�body���在不少农业区，人为加速的侵蚀比自然成土快十倍甚至上百倍，导致表层沃土净流失。联合国粮农组织估计全球大量耕地正以不可持续的速度退化，威胁长期粮食生产能力。��In many farmed areas, human-accelerated erosion outpaces natural soil formation by tenfold to over a hundredfold, causing a net loss of fertile topsoil. FAO estimates large croplands are degrading unsustainably, threatening long-term food production.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ac01e1fc174d�body��被广泛引用的 Jambeck 等 2015 年《Science》研究，基于沿海人口的废物产生量与管理不当比例，估算 2010 年有 480 万至 1270 万吨塑料进入海洋。后续以河流输运实测为基础的研究把年输入量估到 80 万至 270 万吨，差距源于方法路径不同：一种自上而下推算陆源废物流，另一种自下而上测量河口通量。两类结果都表明输入集中在少数缺乏收运体系的河流和海岸段，因此改善废物管理比单纯清捞更关键。�NThe widely cited Jambeck et al. 2015 study in Science estimated 4.8–12.7 million tonnes entered the ocean in 2010, working from coastal population waste generation and the share that is mismanaged. Later work built on measured river transport put annual input at 0.8–2.7 million tonnes; the gap reflects method, one estimating land-based waste streams top-down and the other measuring estuary fluxes bottom-up. Both point to a concentration of inputs in a limited number of rivers and coastlines lacking collection systems, which makes waste management more decisive than ocean cleanup.�ans��src��gJambeck 等（2015）《Science》；Meijer 等（2021）《Science Advances》河流塑料输入研究�\Jambeck et al. (2015), Science; Meijer et al. (2021), Science Advances, river plastic inputs��id�ac6033edda06�body�٨季风源于陆地与海洋在夏季和冬季加热、冷却速度不同，造成气压差，使湿暖海风在夏季吹向陆地、干冷陆风在冬季吹回海洋。ټMonsoons arise because land and sea heat and cool at different rates across seasons, creating pressure differences that drive moist summer winds onto land and dry winter winds back to sea.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ad976be4000e�body���当冰盖坐落在向内陆倾斜的基岩上、接地线又位于海平面以下时，接地线一旦后退，冰体厚度和流出通量会随之增大，形成自我加速的正反馈，这就是海洋冰盖不稳定性。思韦茨冰川的集水盆地正处在这种地形上，且暖化的环极深层水正在从下方侵蚀其冰架。若该盆地大范围失稳，可能贡献半米以上的全球海平面上升，并连带影响西南极其他冰流。�Marine ice sheet instability arises where an ice sheet rests on bedrock that deepens inland and its grounding line lies below sea level: once the grounding line retreats, ice thickness and outflow at that line increase, creating a self-accelerating feedback. Thwaites Glacier drains a basin with exactly this geometry, and warm Circumpolar Deep Water is eroding its ice shelf from beneath. Wholesale destabilisation of that basin could add more than half a metre to global sea level and undermine neighbouring West Antarctic ice streams.�ans��src��WDeConto 与 Pollard（2016）《Nature》；国际思韦茨冰川合作计划（ITGC）�PDeConto and Pollard (2016), Nature; International Thwaites Glacier Collaboration��id�adecaf57f2f9�body�ي上升流是风把表层温水吹离海岸、深层冷水带着丰富营养盐涌上来的现象，造就秘鲁等沿岸的高产渔场。ْUpwelling is wind pushing warm surface water offshore so cold, nutrient-rich deep water rises, creating highly productive fisheries like off Peru.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�ae767b5f1f50�body�ٶ鱼需要洄游到特定浅滩或支流产卵，如果大坝、堤岸把通道切断，就算不禁渔鱼也"生不出"；保护产卵场和洄游通道，比单纯禁捕更治本。��Fish migrate to specific shallows or tributaries to spawn; if dams and banks cut the path, stocks can't breed even without fishing. Protecting spawning grounds and migration routes is more fundamental than the ban alone.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�afcaadee9fd0�body��`“行星边界”框架由罗克斯特伦（Rockström）等人于2009年提出，界定了9个维系地球稳定的关键过程。后续评估（如2022年更新）显示，气候变化、生物多样性丧失、土地系统改变、淡水使用和生化循环（氮、磷）等边界已被突破，提示地球系统正承受日益增大的风险。��The planetary boundaries framework, proposed by Rockström and colleagues in 2009, defines nine critical Earth-system processes that keep the planet stable. Subsequent assessments (e.g., the 2022 update) indicate that boundaries for climate change, biosphere integrity, land-system change, freshwater use, and biogeochemical flows (nitrogen and phosphorus) have already been crossed, signaling rising risk to the Earth system.�ans��src��ERockström 等《自然》（Nature，2009）及 2022 年更新评估�?Rockström et al., Nature (2009) and the 2022 update assessment��id�b016abbee587�body�٫本地猎物没时间演化出应对新捕食者的办法，而外来者可能更高效、没有天敌制衡；于是猎物被快速清空，本地食物网随之紊乱。٦Native prey had no time to evolve defenses, and the newcomer may be efficient with no local enemy to check it; prey are quickly wiped out and the native web unravels.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�b065d3b18bcd�body���生物炭比表面积大、表面带负电荷并含丰富含氧官能团，可通过吸附、沉淀和离子交换将重金属固定为难溶形态，降低其生物有效性。其效果受原料与热解温度影响，长期稳定性仍在研究中。�IBiochar has high specific surface area, negative surface charge and abundant oxygen-containing functional groups, fixing heavy metals into insoluble forms via adsorption, precipitation and ion exchange, lowering bioavailability. Effects depend on feedstock and pyrolysis temperature, and long-term stability is still under study.�ans��src��1Nature Sustainability 生物炭土壤修复研究�8Nature Sustainability — biochar soil remediation study��id�b14b9ad2e873�body��传统火电和水电的同步发电机转子储存着旋转动能，当负荷突增或机组跳闸时，这些动能会自动释放，减缓频率下降速率，为一次调频争取时间，这就是电网惯量。风光通过电力电子逆变器并网，本身与系统频率解耦，因此高渗透率下系统惯量减少，频率变化率变陡，保护装置更易连锁跳闸。解决办法包括虚拟同步机控制、构网型逆变器、快速电池调频以及保留同步调相机提供短路容量。�~Rotors in conventional synchronous generators store rotational kinetic energy that is released automatically when load jumps or a unit trips, slowing the rate of frequency change and buying time for primary control — that is grid inertia. Wind and solar connect through power-electronic inverters that are decoupled from system frequency, so at high penetration inertia falls, the rate of change of frequency steepens, and protection schemes trip more readily. Remedies include virtual synchronous machine control, grid-forming inverters, fast battery frequency response, and retaining synchronous condensers for short-circuit strength.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�b171629e18e7�body��8生态韧性指生态系统在受到扰动后恢复到原有状态或维持其核心功能结构的能力；而抵抗力是系统在扰动下保持不变、不被改变的程度。一个系统可能抵抗力弱但韧性很强（如草原被火烧后迅速再生），二者共同决定生态系统的稳定性。�yEcological resilience is the ability of an ecosystem to recover to its prior state or maintain its core functions and structure after a disturbance, whereas resistance is the degree to which a system stays unchanged under disturbance. A system can have low resistance but high resilience—such as grassland rapidly regrowing after fire—and together they determine stability.�ans��src��@霍林（C. S. Holling）韧性理论；千年生态系统评估�BC. S. Holling's resilience theory; Millennium Ecosystem Assessment��id�b1bd639edc0c�body���差异主要来自“气候敏感度”——云、气溶胶等反馈过程在模式中参数化近似不同。再加上排放情景不确定，集合多模型（CMIP）给出的是概率区间而非单一数字。��Differences mainly stem from climate sensitivity—feedbacks like clouds and aerosols are approximated differently across models. Combined with scenario uncertainty, the multi-model ensemble (CMIP) yields a probabilistic range, not a single number.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b37c0729c99c�body�ٴ网格太粗会平滑掉云、山地与城市等小尺度过程，而这些过程对能量平衡影响很大，只能用“参数化”近似，是模式间差异的重要来源。��Coarse grids smooth out small-scale processes like clouds, mountains and cities that strongly affect energy balance; they are approximated by 'parameterization', a major source of inter-model spread.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b40cb62298fc�body�٫演替是群落随时间有序变化的过程：裸地先长草本、再灌丛、最后乔木形成森林（原生演替），或火灾后逐步恢复（次生演替）。٠Succession is the orderly change of communities over time: bare ground first grows herbs, then shrubs, then trees (primary), or recovery after fire (secondary).�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�b452b6d25972�body��遥感提供植被指数、温度和降水等环境变量，物种分布模型据此推算物种潜在适生区并预测气候变化下的迁移。该方法弥补了地面调查覆盖不足，但依赖物种出现点质量，存在模型外推不确定性。�@Remote sensing supplies environmental variables such as vegetation indices, temperature and precipitation, which species distribution models use to map potential habitats and project climate-driven shifts. It fills gaps left by ground surveys but depends on occurrence-data quality and carries extrapolation uncertainty.�ans��src�ٱChoe 等,《Mapping Potential Plant Species Richness over Large Areas with Deep Learning, MODIS, and Species Distribution Models》,Remote Sensing,2021 (DOI: 10.3390/rs13132490)ٲChoe et al., 'Mapping Potential Plant Species Richness over Large Areas with Deep Learning, MODIS, and Species Distribution Models', Remote Sensing, 2021, DOI: 10.3390/rs13132490��id�b545d6e6e702�body��凯特·拉沃斯提出的甜甜圈模型，把社会基本需求（内圈底线）和地球生态上限（外圈天花板）之间的空间称为“安全而公平的操作空间”。它主张发展应落在甜甜圈内，既不让人掉到贫困线下，也不突破生态边界。�Kate Raworth's doughnut model calls the space between a social foundation (inner floor) and an ecological ceiling (outer roof) a 'safe and just space for humanity'. It argues development should sit inside the doughnut, meeting needs without overshooting ecological limits.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b5bb0f60c52b�body���生产者责任延伸（EPR）要求制造商对其产品的全生命周期负责，包括用后回收与处置。常见做法有饮料瓶押金制、电子产品回收基金、包装回收配额。它的巧妙之处在于把回收成本内部化进产品价格，激励企业主动设计成更易回收、更耐用的产品。EPR因此成为许多国家推行循环经济的核心政策工具。��Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) makes manufacturers accountable for their products across the life cycle, including take-back and disposal after use. Typical designs include bottle deposit schemes, e-waste recovery funds and packaging recycling quotas. The trick is that recycling costs are internalised in product prices, so companies are incentivised to design goods that are easier to recover and last longer. That makes EPR a core policy tool of the circular economy.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�b72c882d8988�body�ٰ它说两个生态位完全一样的物种无法长期共存，必有一方被挤出；这解释了为何自然界总是"你吃你的、我吃我的"，多样性由此维持。٣It states two species with identical niches can't coexist long—one is excluded. It explains why nature runs on "you eat yours, I eat mine," sustaining diversity.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�b797c251cd3c�body���政府发给重点排放企业有限配额，排放超标就得花钱买、节约的能卖出；碳价因此把污染成本内部化，倒逼企业上节能技改、低谷时关停高耗设备。��The government issues limited allowances to major emitters; those over-limit must buy, those under can sell. The carbon price internalizes pollution cost, pushing firms to upgrade efficiency and idle dirty capacity.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b83a40a2be6a�body���水蒸气确实贡献了最大的温室增温份额，但它的浓度并不由人类直接控制，而是随温度变化：空气越暖能容纳的水汽越多。二氧化碳等“外强迫”先把地球加热，升温的空气容纳更多水汽，进一步放大增温，构成水汽正反馈。因此气候学上把水蒸气视为放大变化的反馈，把二氧化碳视为驱动变化的强迫，这也是大气二氧化碳增加格外受关注的原因。�Water vapour indeed contributes the largest share of the greenhouse effect, but its concentration is not controlled directly by humans — it follows temperature: warmer air can hold more moisture. External forcings such as CO2 warm the planet first; warmer air then holds more water vapour, which amplifies the warming. This is the water-vapour feedback. So climatologists treat water vapour as a feedback that magnifies change, while CO2 is a forcing that drives change — which is why rising atmospheric CO2 gets so much attention.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b890bca35c53�body��2生命周期评估系统量化产品从原料获取、制造、运输、使用到废弃各阶段的温室气体排放，避免只盯某一环节而遗漏转移。它依赖清单数据和影响评价方法，是碳足迹核算的国际通用框架。结果透明与否取决于系统边界和数据质量。�]Life-cycle assessment systematically quantifies a product's greenhouse emissions from raw material, manufacturing, transport, use to disposal, avoiding blind spots from focusing on one stage. It relies on inventory data and impact methods and is the international framework for footprints. Transparency depends on system boundaries and data quality.�ans��src���国际标准化组织（ISO）,《DIN EN ISO 14040:2009-11, Umweltmanagement_- Ökobilanz_- Grundsätze und Rahmenbedingungen (ISO_14040:2006); Deutsche und Englische Fassung EN_ISO_14040:2006》,ISO 14040:2006 (DOI: 10.31030/1555059)��ISO, 'DIN EN ISO 14040:2009-11, Umweltmanagement_- Ökobilanz_- Grundsätze und Rahmenbedingungen (ISO_14040:2006); Deutsche und Englische Fassung EN_ISO_14040:2006', ISO 14040:2006, DOI: 10.31030/1555059��id�ba17babd0723�body��生产者责任延伸要求制造商对其产品从设计、生产到使用后的回收处理全过程负责，而不仅是销售环节。它促使企业设计更易回收、更耐用的产品，并出资建设回收体系。电子电器和包装物常是EPR的重点对象。�Extended producer responsibility makes manufacturers accountable for their products across design, production, and end-of-life recycling, not just sale. It pushes firms to design durable, recyclable goods and fund collection systems. Electronics and packaging are common EPR targets.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ba3cd9b93d36�body��7该假说认为污染随人均收入先升后降，呈倒 U 形，最早的实证来自跨国截面数据中二氧化硫与颗粒物的表现。质疑有三层：倒 U 形主要出现在有明确健康危害、治理成本较低的局地污染物，二氧化碳和生物多样性损失并未显现类似拐点；下降往往由污染密集产业外移和进口替代造成，是空间转移而非总量改善；截面回归还容易混淆国家间差异与单国时间路径。因此曲线更像是政策与制度作用的结果，而非收入增长的自动结果。��The hypothesis holds that pollution rises then falls with income per capita in an inverted U, with early evidence drawn from cross-country data on sulphur dioxide and particulates. Three objections stand out: the inverted U appears mainly for local pollutants with clear health damage and cheap abatement, while carbon dioxide and biodiversity loss show no comparable turning point; declines often stem from relocating dirty industry and importing the goods instead, a spatial shift rather than a real reduction; and cross-sectional regressions conflate differences between countries with the trajectory of any single one. The curve is better read as the imprint of policy and institutions than as an automatic dividend of growth.�ans��src�مGrossman 与 Krueger（1995）《Quarterly Journal of Economics》；Stern（2004）《World Development》对 EKC 的批判性综述�xGrossman and Krueger (1995), Quarterly Journal of Economics; Stern (2004), World Development, critical review of the EKC��id�bae526a66731�body��甲烷（CH4）在分子层面捕获热量的能力约为同等质量二氧化碳的80多倍，因而短期增温潜力极高。不过它在大气中的寿命只有约12年，远短于可存留数百年的CO2。主要来源包括反刍动物、稻田、垃圾填埋和天然气泄漏。�>Methane (CH4) traps heat about 80-plus times more powerfully per unit mass than CO2 over a 20-year span, giving it very high short-term warming potential. However, it lasts only about 12 years in the atmosphere, far shorter than CO2's centuries. Major sources include ruminants, rice paddies, landfills, and gas leaks.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�bafd2af5928d�body��2基林曲线是美国科学家查尔斯·基林自1958年起在夏威夷冒纳罗亚天文台连续测量的大气二氧化碳浓度变化曲线。它直观地显示CO2浓度逐年上升，并呈现随季节呼吸的波动。该曲线是证明人类导致大气温室气体增加的最著名证据之一。�&The Keeling Curve is the record of atmospheric CO2 concentration measured continuously since 1958 by Charles Keeling at Mauna Loa, Hawaii. It shows CO2 rising year by year with a seasonal breathing wobble. It is among the most famous evidence that human activity is increasing greenhouse gases.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�bf72f93eb352�body���微塑料是直径小于 5 毫米的塑料碎片，源自大塑料破碎与化妆品微珠等。研究已在浮游动物、鱼类乃至人体血液与胎盘中检出，显示其可经捕食从低营养级向高营养级传递与富集。�	Microplastics are plastic fragments under 5 mm from the breakdown of larger plastic and microbeads. They have been detected in zooplankton, fish, and even human blood and placenta, showing trophic transfer and accumulation from lower to higher levels via predation.�ans��src�ٰCole, Lindeque, Halsband, Galloway,《Microplastics as contaminants in the marine environment: A review》,Marine Pollution Bulletin,2011 (DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.09.025)ٮCole, Lindeque, Halsband, Galloway, 'Microplastics as contaminants in the marine environment: A review', Marine Pollution Bulletin, 2011, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.09.025��id�c06aca60b8b2�body�ٽ热岛提高了本地温度与热胁迫频率，压缩了冷适应物种的适宜区并改变物候。叠加不透水面对栖息地的割裂，城市中心物种丰富度常显著下降。��The heat island raises local temperature and heat-stress frequency, shrinking suitable ranges for cool-adapted species and shifting phenology. Combined with impervious-surface habitat fragmentation, city centers often lose species richness.�ans��src��-《Nature Sustainability》城市生态研究�#Nature Sustainability urban ecology��id�c29673a01c37�body���新烟碱类是选择性作用于昆虫烟碱型乙酰胆碱受体的神经毒剂，作为种子包衣被植物吸收后进入木质部并出现在花粉与花蜜中，使传粉者长期低剂量暴露。田间尺度研究发现，暴露会损害蜜蜂的导航与学习能力、降低蜂王产卵与野生蜂群建群成功率，属于亚致死但影响种群续存的效应。欧洲食品安全局的评估支持了风险结论，欧盟自 2018 年起禁止吡虫啉、噻虫嗪和噻虫胺的户外使用。�pNeonicotinoids are neurotoxins that act selectively on insect nicotinic acetylcholine receptors; applied as seed coatings, they move systemically through the xylem and appear in pollen and nectar, giving pollinators prolonged low-dose exposure. Field-scale studies found impaired navigation and learning in honeybees and reduced queen production and colony establishment in wild bees — sublethal effects that nonetheless undermine population persistence. After European Food Safety Authority assessments supported those risk conclusions, the EU banned outdoor use of imidacloprid, thiamethoxam, and clothianidin from 2018.�ans��src��cWoodcock 等（2017）《Science》；欧洲食品安全局新烟碱类风险评估结论（2018）�hWoodcock et al. (2017), Science; European Food Safety Authority conclusions on neonicotinoid risk (2018)��id�c29f6f34015d�body���它描述暴露剂量大小与健康或毒性效应强弱之间的对应规律，常概括为“剂量决定毒性”。理解这条曲线能帮助设定安全阈值，但也提醒有些物质（如致癌物）在低剂量下也并非绝对安全。�
It describes how the size of exposure relates to the strength of a toxic or health effect, often summed up as 'the dose makes the poison'. Knowing the curve helps set safe thresholds, yet reminds us some substances like carcinogens may not be safe even at low doses.�ans��src��lRachel Carson,《Silent Spring》Houghton Mifflin,1962;中译《寂静的春天》上海译文出版社,2011�iR. Carson, Silent Spring, Houghton Mifflin, 1962; Chinese ed. Shanghai Translation Publishing House, 2011��id�c2e2167ee558�body��d反渗透必须克服海水的渗透压，分离功存在热力学下限，现代大型海水反渗透厂配合能量回收装置，比能耗已降到每立方米三到四千瓦时，距理论最小值仅数倍之内，因此未来节能空间主要在预处理、膜寿命和厂用电而非分离本身。副产品浓盐水盐度可达进水的两倍，还含防垢剂与残余金属，密度大于海水时会在排放口附近形成盐水层，抑制底栖生物。全球评估显示浓盐水日排放量超过一亿立方米，因此扩散器设计、与电厂冷却水混排或资源化回收成为关键。�Reverse osmosis must overcome seawater's osmotic pressure, so the work of separation has a thermodynamic floor; modern large seawater plants with energy recovery devices have driven specific consumption down to three or four kilowatt-hours per cubic metre, within a small multiple of that minimum, leaving future savings mainly in pretreatment, membrane life, and plant loads rather than separation itself. The brine byproduct can be twice as saline as intake water and carries antiscalants and trace metals; being denser than seawater it can pool near the outfall and suppress benthic life. Global assessments put brine discharge above a hundred million cubic metres per day, making diffuser design, blending with power-plant cooling water, or resource recovery decisive.�ans��src�ْElimelech 与 Phillip（2011）《Science》海水淡化的未来；Jones 等（2019）《Science of the Total Environment》全球浓盐水产量ٚElimelech and Phillip (2011), Science, the future of seawater desalination; Jones et al. (2019), Science of the Total Environment, global brine production��id�c322925b8a96�body���气候模型把大气、海洋、陆冰和陆地拆成全球网格，用物理、化学与生态过程的方程组逐格模拟能量、水汽、碳与动量的交换，再输入不同的温室气体排放情景进行推演。模型经过历史气候回测与多模型交叉验证，可信度不断提升；IPCC第六次评估报告对未来的预测正是建立在这些模型的集合结果之上。��Climate models divide the atmosphere, ocean, ice sheets and land into a global grid and solve equations for the physical, chemical and biological processes that move energy, moisture, carbon and momentum between cells. Driven by different emissions scenarios, they project future climate. Their credibility rests on successfully reproducing past climate and on agreement across many independent models; the projections of the IPCC Sixth Assessment Report build on such model ensembles.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c84ab1414b97�body��G全球碳收支量化每年人为排放与自然界（大气、海洋、陆地）之间碳的源汇平衡。科学家通过排放清单、大气观测卫星、海洋浮标和生态模型综合估算各通量。若观测到的大气增长加上海洋与陆地吸收不等于排放，则表明存在未被完全理解的通量。��The global carbon budget quantifies the annual balance of carbon sources and sinks among human emissions and natural reservoirs (atmosphere, ocean, land). Scientists combine emission inventories, atmospheric satellite observations, ocean buoys, and ecosystem models to estimate each flux. A mismatch between emissions and the sum of atmospheric growth plus ocean and land uptake reveals poorly understood fluxes.�ans��src��全球碳计划;《自然》�Global Carbon Project;Nature��id�c90116282221�body���高诚信碳信用必须满足核心碳原则。具体包括：额外性，即没有资金支持项目就不会发生；永久性，即碳不会在短期内回归大气；稳健量化，即不发生重复计算；还要对可持续发展有贡献，并经过独立的第三方审定。ICVCM等组织正在对信用类别进行评估分级，帮助买方辨别优劣。同时监管强调，碳信用只能作为处理剩余排放的最后手段。�A high-integrity carbon credit must meet the Core Carbon Principles. Concretely these include additionality — the project would not happen without funding; permanence — the carbon will not soon return to the atmosphere; robust quantification — no double counting; plus contributions to sustainable development and independent third-party validation. Bodies such as ICVCM are grading credit categories to help buyers distinguish quality. Regulators also stress that credits are only a last resort for residual emissions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ca8dde7a8f8a�body��甲烷水合物是封存于海底与冻土中的固态甲烷，在升温或减压时可能不稳定释放。若大规模释放，会显著增加大气甲烷、强化变暖，构成潜在正反馈。目前其释放规模与时机仍不确定，是研究的重点风险。�3Methane hydrates are solid methane locked in seafloor and permafrost that can destabilize and release under warming or pressure drop. Large releases would sharply raise atmospheric methane and reinforce warming, a potential feedback. Their scale and timing remain uncertain, making them a key research risk.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�cb49bed04872�body���日间光伏大增压低净负荷，傍晚骤降使燃气/水电需在几小时内陡升填补，形成腹部深、颈部陡的'鸭子曲线'；同时逆变器电源不提供旋转惯量，系统频率稳定性下降，需虚拟惯量或储能支撑。�Midday solar slashes net load, then plummets at dusk so gas/hydro must ramp steeply within hours—the deep-belly, sharp-neck 'duck curve.' Inverter-based sources add no rotating inertia, weakening frequency stability and requiring virtual inertia or storage.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�ce3a69451137�body��参照生态系统指目标地区历史上存在或残存至今的健康生态系统，它为修复提供物种组成、结构和功能的基准，相当于给修复设置一个靶心。参照系统的价值在于让修复有据可依，避免随意拼凑植物。但气候与土地利用已经发生变化，原样照搬历史状态既不现实，也难以适应未来条件。因此现代修复把参照当作基线，再结合目标物种与未来气候设计多目标方案，即参照加目标导向的修复。�@A reference ecosystem is a historical or remnant healthy system in the target region that provides baselines for species composition, structure, and function — the bullseye for restoration. Its value is giving restoration a benchmark, avoiding arbitrary plant mixes. But climate and land use have changed, so copying the historical state is unrealistic and poorly suited to future conditions. Modern practice therefore uses references as baselines while designing multi-objective schemes around target species and future climate — reference plus target-driven restoration.�ans��src��'中国科学院（生态修复技术）�?Chinese Academy of Sciences (ecological restoration technology)��id�ce7dd8eb44f9�body���二氧化碳增多让低层大气（对流层）更好地留住热量而升温；同时平流层吸收的红外辐射变少，加上臭氧损耗，于是整体变冷。这种“下暖上冷”是温室气体增加的典型指纹。��More CO₂ lets the lower atmosphere (troposphere) retain heat and warm, while the stratosphere absorbs less outgoing infrared and, with ozone loss, cools overall. This 'warm below, cool above' pattern is a classic fingerprint of greenhouse forcing.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ceefefb33fbf�body�ٛ北极升温快于全球，削弱了极地与热带的温差，使急流变慢、更易打弯，于是寒潮、热浪更容易"卡"在某个地方不走。ٰThe Arctic warms faster than the globe, weakening the pole-tropics temperature gap so the jet stream slows and meanders, letting cold snaps and heat waves get "stuck" in place.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�cf70cc2fce4a�body��k河流泛滥本是自然过程：恢复泛滥平原、再连通河道与湿地，等于给河流“泄洪空间”，能削减洪峰、减轻堤防压力，同时为鱼类产卵和鸟类栖息创造生境。混凝土堤防虽能局部挡水，却抬高下游洪峰、切断生态连通，维护成本也高。把绿色与灰色基建结合，效果通常最佳。��River flooding is a natural process: restoring floodplains and reconnecting channels and wetlands gives rivers room to flood, trimming peaks and easing levee pressure while creating habitat for fish spawning and birds. Concrete levees block water locally but raise downstream peaks and sever ecological connectivity at high maintenance cost. Combining green and grey infrastructure usually works best.�ans��src��;《Nature Sustainability》2022 年防洪成本效益研究�-Nature Sustainability 2022 flood cost-benefit��id�cfeac63a1dd6�body���LAI 是单位地面上的总叶面积，叶越多蒸腾与遮荫越强；结合冠层形状和铺装反照率，模型可估算某条街道夏季能降几度、省多少空调电，用来指导种树布局。��LAI is total leaf area per ground area; more leaves mean more transpiration and shade. With canopy shape and surface albedo, models estimate how many degrees a street cools and how much AC power is saved, guiding planting.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�cffa3bf6b07c�body���植物在光合作用中偏好较轻的碳-12，所以煤和石油等化石燃料偏“轻”。燃烧它们会拉低大气 CO₂ 中碳-13 的比例，观测到这一下降恰好对应化石燃料排放，成为人为源的有力证据。��Plants favor the lighter carbon-12 during photosynthesis, so coal and oil are isotopically 'light'. Burning them lowers the carbon-13 share in atmospheric CO₂, and the observed drop tracks fossil-fuel emissions, strong evidence for human cause.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�d0c6c617a85c�body��t地球上几乎没有天然氢，需要耗能制取：用可再生能源电解水得到的叫绿氢，全程零碳；用天然气重整的灰氢仍会排放二氧化碳。氢可以长期储存电能，适合重型卡车、航运、钢铁化工等难以直接电气化的环节。目前绿氢成本仍高，扩大电解槽规模、降低电价是它能否普及的关键。��Hydrogen barely exists naturally on Earth; it must be manufactured. Electrolysing water with renewable power yields green hydrogen with zero lifecycle emissions, while reforming natural gas gives grey hydrogen that still emits CO2. Hydrogen can store electricity long-term and suits heavy trucks, shipping and steel or chemicals that are hard to electrify directly. Its future hinges on cutting cost — cheaper electrolysers and lower electricity prices.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d1023bfa9c2d�body���参数化保险在触发指标（如累积降雨量、风速）达到阈值即自动赔付，无需逐案定损，理赔快且交易成本与道德风险低。其短板是基差风险——指数与受灾户实际损失可能不匹配。�.Parametric insurance pays automatically when a trigger index—such as accumulated rainfall or wind speed—crosses a threshold, with no loss adjustment, enabling fast payout and lower transaction costs and moral hazard. Its drawback is basis risk: the index may not match a policyholder's actual loss.�ans��src�ُBarnett, Barrett, Skees,《Poverty Traps and Index-Based Risk Transfer Products》,World Development,2008 (DOI: 10.1016/j.worlddev.2007.10.016)ٍBarnett, Barrett, Skees, 'Poverty Traps and Index-Based Risk Transfer Products', World Development, 2008, DOI: 10.1016/j.worlddev.2007.10.016��id�d1d1203acc0f�body���潮汐力取决于天体对地球近侧与远侧的引力差，而非引力绝对大小；太阳质量虽极大、距离远，其造成的引力差仍约为月球的约一半，所以朔望时日月叠加出最大潮。��Tidal force depends on the difference in pull across Earth's near and far sides, not absolute gravity. The sun's huge mass still yields a differential about half the moon's, so sun and moon together make the biggest tides.�ans��src��t牛顿《自然哲学的数学原理》的引潮力理论；美国国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 潮汐说明�NNewton's tidal theory in Principia; NOAA Tides and Currents on tide generation��id�d1e9d0d4d199�body���电动力学在土壤中加电场，驱动带电离子（如重金属、某些有机物）向电极迁移被抽出，适合低渗透黏土。热脱附加热土壤使挥发性有机物汽化分离，适合石油、溶剂等有机污染。�Electrokinetics applies an electric field to drive charged ions (metals, some organics) to electrodes for extraction—good for low-permeability clay. Thermal desorption heats soil so volatile organics vaporize and separate—suited to petroleum or solvent contamination.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d286b04314f5�body�٫碳市场给排放设上限并发放可买卖的配额：减排成本低的企业多减排卖配额，成本高的企业购买，用市场机制以更低总成本减碳。ٝA carbon market caps emissions and issues tradable permits; low-cost reducers sell surplus permits to high-cost emitters, cutting carbon at lower total cost.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d2ea09957461�body���微卫星等分子标记可量化种群内等位基因丰富度与近交系数，揭示种群瓶颈与基因流；高通量测序进一步刻画全基因组水平多样性。这类数据对制定极小种群物种的保护优先级至关重要。�Molecular markers such as microsatellites quantify within-population allele richness and inbreeding, revealing bottlenecks and gene flow, while high-throughput sequencing characterizes genome-wide diversity. Such data are crucial for prioritizing conservation of small populations.�ans��src�� Science 种群基因组学研究�(Science — population genomics research��id�d406c0311c8d�body���同一服务价值随空间（下游人口、土地利用）剧烈变化，且多项服务在生境退化越过阈值后会同步骤降而非线性减少；机械加总既忽略空间异质，也掩盖临界点，易高估渐进开发的安全余地。�FThe same service's value varies sharply by location (downstream population, land use), and several services can collapse together once degradation crosses a threshold rather than declining linearly; naive summing ignores spatial heterogeneity and hides tipping points, overestimating the safety margin for gradual development.�ans��src��PNAS;Ecol. Econ.�PNAS;Ecol Econ��id�d750a55bce96�body��一吨手机电路板含金等贵金属浓度远超原生矿，回收价值高；但含铅、汞、阻燃剂，非正规酸浸火法会造成严重污染与职业暴露。正规湿法/熔炼需严格环保，使'采矿'成本与合规门槛成为回收率瓶颈。�A ton of phone boards carries gold concentrations far above ore, but also lead, mercury and flame retardants; informal acid or burning causes severe pollution and exposure. Formal hydrometallurgy needs strict controls, making cost and compliance the bottleneck on recovery rates.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d77dec09d79e�body��#反照率指地表反射太阳辐射的比例，雪、冰和云的反照率高，能反射较多阳光使地表降温。当冰川融化露出深色海洋或陆地，反照率下降，吸收更多热量，进一步加速变暖，形成正反馈。这种机制会放大初始的气候强迫。�LAlbedo is the fraction of solar radiation reflected by a surface; snow, ice, and clouds have high albedo and cool the planet by reflecting sunlight. When ice melts to reveal dark ocean or land, albedo drops and more heat is absorbed, accelerating warming in a positive feedback. This mechanism amplifies the initial climate forcing.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�d7d1d089cc33�body�ٖ在不见阳光的深海，喷口细菌利用硫化氢等化学物质通过化能合成制造有机物，支撑管虫、盲虾等独特生物群落。٢In sunless depths, vent bacteria use chemicals like hydrogen sulfide via chemosynthesis to make food, supporting unique communities of tubeworms and blind shrimp.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�d932480d73eb�body�٥蓝碳指沿海和海洋生态系统（红树林、海草床、盐沼）通过植物和沉积物长期固定的碳，单位面积固碳效率常高于陆地森林。ٟBlue carbon is carbon locked by coastal and marine ecosystems (mangroves, seagrass, salt marshes); per area they often sequester more than terrestrial forests.�ans��src��8《Nature Sustainability》2021 年红树林蓝碳研究�/Nature Sustainability 2021 mangrove blue carbon��id�da94733d9e8e�body���各国依据毒理学实验设定最大残留限量（MRL），它是在安全摄入量以内允许的残留上限。只要残留低于该限量，通常健康风险可以忽略，因此检出残留并不等于超标或有害。但这类标准主要针对单一物质，难以覆盖多种农药混合使用时产生的协同效应。此外，它也难以反映对传粉昆虫等非靶生物造成的生态毒性，这正是新烟碱类等农药被限用的原因之一。�Countries set Maximum Residue Limits (MRLs) from toxicology studies; an MRL is the upper bound on residues compatible with safe daily intake. As long as a residue stays below the limit, health risk is usually negligible, so detecting a residue is not the same as exceeding the limit or being harmful. But such standards focus on single substances and cannot capture the synergistic effects of mixed pesticides. Nor do they reflect ecotoxicity to non-target organisms such as pollinators — one reason neonicotinoids were restricted.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�dd0f251349e3�body��%向平流层注入硫酸盐前体可以模仿大型火山喷发反射阳光，理论上快速降低全球平均温度，成本相对低廉。风险在于它只遮挡阳光而不减少二氧化碳，海洋酸化继续，且降温在空间上不均匀，可能改变季风与热带降水格局，使部分地区旱涝加剧。更棘手的是终止冲击：一旦持续注入中断，被压抑的升温会在数年内集中释放。此外硫酸盐会延缓臭氧层恢复，而全球治理机制尚不存在，谁有权决定部署本身就是难题。��Injecting sulphate precursors into the stratosphere could mimic a large volcanic eruption to reflect sunlight, lowering global mean temperature quickly and at relatively low direct cost. The risks are that it masks warming without removing carbon dioxide, so ocean acidification continues, and that the cooling is spatially uneven, potentially shifting monsoons and tropical rainfall and worsening drought or flooding in some regions. More troubling is termination shock: if sustained injection stopped, suppressed warming would arrive within a few years. Sulphate would also delay ozone layer recovery, and with no governance regime in place, deciding who may deploy it is itself an unresolved problem.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�dd1de70d49a4�body��直接空气捕集（DAC）利用化学吸附材料直接从周围空气中提取稀薄的CO2，再压缩运输以便封存或再利用。它不依赖集中排放源，可在任何地方部署，但能耗与成本目前很高。它被视为抵消难减排排放的后备手段。�(DAC uses sorbent materials to extract dilute CO2 straight from ambient air, then compresses it for storage or reuse. It does not need a concentrated emission source and can be deployed anywhere, but energy use and cost are currently high. It is seen as a backup to offset hard-to-abate emissions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�dd2b5b2d3adf�body��地质记录显示哺乳动物和鸟类的背景灭绝率约每百年每万种灭绝一到两种。当前观测速率比背景值高出数十到上百倍，被许多学者称为第六次大灭绝。这一对比是判断生物多样性危机程度的重要依据。�"The fossil record suggests a background extinction rate for mammals and birds of roughly one to two species per 10,000 per century. Current observed rates are tens to over a hundred times higher, leading many to call it a sixth mass extinction. This contrast gauges the biodiversity crisis.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�ddb8510795e4�body���北极放大主要源于冰雪反照率反馈：海冰融化露出深色海水，吸收更多太阳辐射。此外，极地大气层中热量与水汽的再分配也增强了增温。结果是北极升温速度可达全球平均的二到四倍。�)Arctic amplification is driven mainly by ice-albedo feedback: melting sea ice exposes dark ocean that absorbs more solar energy. Redistribution of heat and moisture in the polar atmosphere further enhances warming. As a result, the Arctic can warm two to four times faster than the global average.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�df7214251dc3�body��G虚拟水指生产商品和服务所需的水量，例如一杯咖啡从种植、加工到运输总共耗水约200升。缺水地区可以通过进口水密集型产品（如谷物、棉花）缓解本地水压力，这就是虚拟水贸易。理解虚拟水，能帮我们看清消费模式与全球水资源的深层联系。��Virtual water is the water embedded in producing a good or service — a cup of coffee, for instance, consumes about 200 litres once growing, processing and transport are counted. Water-scarce regions can relieve local pressure by importing water-intensive goods such as grain or cotton — virtual water trade. Grasping virtual water reveals how our consumption is connected to global water resources.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�df9bb90c6f55�body���在污染土壤两端施加直流电场，使带电重金属离子在电迁移和电渗流作用下向电极区富集，再集中收集处理。该技术对细粒低渗透土壤效果好，但能耗与电极腐蚀是工程化瓶颈。�Applying a DC electric field across contaminated soil drives charged metal ions toward electrodes by electromigration and electroosmosis, where they are collected and treated. It works well in fine, low-permeability soils, but energy use and electrode corrosion limit scale-up.�ans��src��*《环境科学》土壤电动修复研究�BEnvironmental Science journal — electrokinetic remediation study��id�e0297cff1cde�body���微塑料会被浮游生物和滤食性动物摄入，并可能沿食物链传递；已在鱼贝、食盐甚至饮用水中检出。虽然对人体的确切危害仍在研究，但其广泛存在已引起全球监测和管控关注。�	Microplastics are ingested by plankton and filter-feeders and may pass up the food chain; they have been found in fish, shellfish, salt and even tap water. Exact harm to humans is still studied, but their ubiquity has prompted global monitoring and control efforts.�ans��src�ٚA. L. Andrady，《海洋环境中的微塑料》，《Marine Pollution Bulletin》第62卷（2011）：1596–1605，DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030َA. L. Andrady, 'Microplastics in the marine environment', Marine Pollution Bulletin 62 (2011): 1596-1605, DOI: 10.1016/j.marpolbul.2011.05.030��id�e1098e294b91�body���再生农业通过免耕、覆盖作物、轮作和施用堆肥来增加土壤有机质，把大气中的碳转入土壤碳库。这样做还能同时改善土壤保水能力并提升生物多样性。但土壤固碳速率会逐年递减、最终趋于饱和，而且碳难以精确测量，翻耕后又容易重新释放。因此把土壤碳当作碳信用的核算标准仍有争议，业界的共识是：再生农业作为农业转型路径的价值，大于单纯用于抵消。�<Regenerative agriculture builds soil organic matter through no-till, cover crops, rotation, and compost, transferring atmospheric carbon into the soil carbon pool. These practices also improve water retention and biodiversity. But soil carbon accrual slows year by year and eventually saturates; the carbon is hard to measure precisely and is easily released again by tillage. Accounting soil carbon as credits is therefore still contentious, and the field's consensus is that regenerative agriculture's value as a transition path outweighs using it purely for offsetting.�ans��src��kMinasny 等（2017）《Geoderma》千分之四土壤碳评估；千分之四国际倡议（COP21，2015）�kMinasny et al. (2017), Geoderma, assessment of soil carbon 4 per mille; 4 per 1000 Initiative (COP21, 2015)��id�e1a5a44be816�body��遗传多样性为种群提供应对病害、气候和环境变化的原料，多样性低的种群近交衰退风险高。瓶颈效应和栖息地隔离会快速流失遗传变异，削弱适应能力。保护中常通过栖息地连通和人工辅助基因流动来维持多样性。�2Genetic diversity supplies the raw material to cope with disease, climate and environmental change; low-diversity populations face inbreeding depression. Bottlenecks and habitat isolation rapidly erode variation and adaptability. Conservation uses connectivity and assisted gene flow to maintain diversity.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e2e71027d350�body���全球降温会改变海陆温差与大气环流，模型显示 SAI 可能削弱南亚、非洲季风降水，影响数亿人的雨养农业，且一旦停止会出现“终止冲击”式快速升温。�Global cooling alters land-sea temperature contrasts and circulation; models suggest SAI could weaken South Asian and African monsoon rains, threatening rainfed agriculture for hundreds of millions, and abrupt stopping causes rapid 'termination shock' warming.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e533459c289c�body�١顶级捕食者压制食草动物数量，一旦消失，食草者暴涨啃光植物、连带动摇整条链；这种自上而下的"级联效应"常被低估。٘Top predators cap herbivore numbers; remove them and herbivores explode, strip plants and shake the whole web—a top-down cascade often underestimated.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e8d59438d33c�body�ٱ通常如此：物种多的系统有“保险效应”，个别物种失败时有其他物种替代其功能，抵抗干扰和维持生产力的能力更强，但也有例外。٩Generally yes: diverse systems show an 'insurance effect'—if one species fails, others fulfill its role, boosting resistance and productivity, though exceptions exist.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�eb2b209f7a5a�body���多数大型火山喷发的降温效应来自注入平流层的二氧化硫转化成硫酸盐气溶胶反射阳光，例如 1991 年皮纳图博火山。汤加火山口位于浅海之下，喷发把约 1.5 亿吨水汽送入平流层，使平流层水汽总量增加约一成，而硫的注入量相对有限。水汽是强温室气体，滞留时间可达数年，因此这次事件的净效应更偏向短期增温并改变平流层化学与臭氧。�8Most large eruptions cool the surface because stratospheric sulphur dioxide converts to sulphate aerosol that reflects sunlight, as after Pinatubo in 1991. The Tongan vent sat beneath shallow ocean, so the blast injected roughly 150 teragrams of water vapour into the stratosphere — around a 10% increase in its total burden — while delivering comparatively little sulphur. Water vapour is a strong greenhouse gas with a multi-year stratospheric residence time, so the net effect leaned toward brief warming while also perturbing stratospheric chemistry and ozone.�ans��src��uMillán 等（2022）《Geophysical Research Letters》；美国国家航空航天局喷气推进实验室 MLS 观测�xMillán et al. (2022), Geophysical Research Letters; NASA Jet Propulsion Laboratory, Microwave Limb Sounder observations��id�ef7ad9ae3723�body���随气温带北移和雪线上升，许多动植物正被迫向极地或高山迁移以追随适宜气候。速度跟不上变暖的物种面临局部灭绝，并可能打乱原有食物网与授粉关系。这是生物圈对气候变化的直接信号。�CAs temperature zones shift poleward and snowlines rise, many plants and animals are forced toward poles or mountains to follow suitable climate. Species that cannot keep pace with warming face local extinction and may disrupt food webs and pollination. This is a direct signal of the biosphere responding to climate change.�ans��src��1联合国《生物多样性公约》;《科学》�CBD;Science��id�ef7f4db23cb3�body���它指出一个区域内的物种数随面积增大而增加，但通常不是线性，常用 S = cA^z 这样的幂律描述。由此推断：栖息地面积减半，往往会使物种数损失约 15%—30%，是保护规划的重要依据。��It states that the number of species rises with area but usually not linearly, often fit by a power law S = cA^z. From this, halving habitat area typically loses roughly 15%–30% of species, a key basis for reserve planning.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�env_19_003�body���三种前体物分属电力、交通与农业等不同部门,只治理单个行业无法同步削峰,农业氨至今缺乏强制性约束,硝酸盐生成又常受氨供给制约。前体物之间还存在非线性化学耦合,单独大幅削减NOx有时反而推高臭氧与硝酸盐浓度。中国蓝天保卫战和欧盟国家减排承诺指令因此都转向多污染物协同、跨行政区联防联控的框架。�The three precursors sit in different sectors such as power, transport, and agriculture, so controlling any single industry cannot cut them in step; agricultural ammonia still lacks binding limits even though nitrate formation is frequently ammonia-limited. Nonlinear coupling among precursors means deep NOx cuts alone can push ozone and nitrate concentrations upward. China's Blue Sky Defense campaign and the EU National Emission Ceilings Directive both moved accordingly toward multi-pollutant, cross-jurisdiction coordination frameworks.�ans��src��sSeinfeld 与 Pandis《Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics》；美国环境保护署臭氧生成敏感性技术文件�sSeinfeld and Pandis, Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics; U.S. EPA technical documents on ozone formation sensitivity��id�env_19_006�body���岛屿边界明确、面积有限,毒饵投放、隔离围栏与口岸检疫可以一次性切断残存个体及其外部补给,新西兰离岛鼠类清除项目已反复验证该模式。大陆拥有连续的陆生扩散走廊和海量未查验的货运通道,一旦每次引入个体数越过种群建立阈值,根除之后数年内定殖便会重演。防控重心因此整体前移到边境拦截以及早期发现加快速响应。�wIslands present bounded, finite terrain where toxic baiting, exclusion fencing, and port inspection can sever both surviving individuals and outside replenishment in a single operation, as repeated rodent eradications on New Zealand offshore islands demonstrate. Continents carry continuous terrestrial corridors plus enormous volumes of uninspected freight, and whenever introduction events exceed the establishment threshold, colonization recurs within just a few years of any successful eradication. Management emphasis has consequently shifted upstream toward border interception paired with early detection and rapid response.�ans��src��YIPBES《外来入侵物种评估报告》,2023;新西兰环保部离岛根除项目档案ٌIPBES Assessment Report on Invasive Alien Species, 2023; island eradication programme archives of the New Zealand Department of Conservation��id�env_19_009�body���白天的证据链集中于烦恼度评分与血压升高等心血管反应,夜间则以睡眠结构破坏为核心:入睡延迟、微觉醒频发、深慢波睡眠占比下降,即使当事人自觉一夜安眠,唾液皮质醇与动态血压仍出现可测量的偏移。碎片化睡眠继而放大高血压和缺血性心脏病的风险,指南因此把夜间基准值压得更低。中国2022年施行的噪声污染防治法也据此收紧了夜间施工与机动车鸣笛条款。��Daytime evidence clusters around annoyance scores and cardiovascular responses such as elevated blood pressure, whereas the nighttime burden centers on degraded sleep architecture: delayed sleep onset, frequent micro-arousals, and reduced slow-wave sleep, with measurable shifts in salivary cortisol and ambulatory blood pressure even when sleepers recall an undisturbed night. Fragmented sleep then magnifies hypertension and ischemic heart disease risk, which is why the guidance lowers the night reference value. China's Noise Pollution Prevention and Control Law, in force since 2022, tightened provisions on nighttime construction and vehicle horns along the same reasoning.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�env_19_013�body��n连片绿地内蒸散与遮荫叠加,白天蓄积的热量有限,夜间还能经由长波净辐射持续散热;其湿润下垫面热容量大,降温过程衰减缓慢。小块绿地被建筑材料的显热平流包围,湍流混合很快抹平内外温差。因此绿地冷岛强度总体随斑块面积增大而增强,规划上强调集中连片布局正源于此。�&Contiguous green space combines evapotranspiration with canopy shading, stores little heat by day and keeps shedding energy through net longwave radiation at night, while its moist substrate has a large heat capacity so the cooling decays slowly. Small patches sit amid strong sensible-heat advection from surrounding built surfaces, and turbulent mixing rapidly erases the temperature contrast between inside and outside. Cool-island intensity consequently tends to grow with patch size, which is why planners favour concentrated contiguous layouts.�ans��src���Bowler, Buyung-Ali, Knight & Pullin,《Urban greening to cool towns and cities: A systematic review of the empirical evidence》,Landscape and Urban Planning,2010 (DOI: 10.1016/j.landurbplan.2010.05.006)；Potchter, Cohen & Bitan,《Climatic behavior of various urban parks during hot and humid summer in the mediterranean city of Tel Aviv, Israel》,International Journal of Climatology,2006 (DOI: 10.1002/joc.1330)��Bowler, Buyung-Ali, Knight & Pullin, 'Urban greening to cool towns and cities: A systematic review of the empirical evidence', Landscape and Urban Planning, 2010, DOI: 10.1016/j.landurbplan.2010.05.006; Potchter, Cohen & Bitan, 'Climatic behavior of various urban parks during hot and humid summer in the mediterranean city of Tel Aviv, Israel', International Journal of Climatology, 2006, DOI: 10.1002/joc.1330��id�env_19_016�body���夏季海冰退缩令开阔水面吸收的短波辐射成倍增长,是近地表增暖的直接推手,而推迟的结冰又延长了吸能窗口,构成季节锁相的反照率反馈。水汽作为强温室气体,其向下长波辐射在秋冬主导表层升温,并把夏季热量储于上层海洋缓慢释放。辐射通量观测与模式敏感性试验都显示两条反馈的季节峰值错开,据此可将二者定量分解。�4Summer sea-ice retreat multiplies shortwave absorption over open water and directly drives near-surface warming, while delayed freeze-up lengthens the energy-gaining window, giving the albedo feedback a locked seasonal phase. Water vapour, a powerful greenhouse gas, dominates surface heating through downward longwave radiation in autumn and winter and slowly releases heat stored in the upper ocean. Radiometric observations and model sensitivity experiments alike show the two feedbacks peaking in different seasons, which permits their quantitative separation.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�env_19_019�body���高NOx环境中NO本身不断滴定消耗臭氧,VOC供给不足使自由基链式循环受限;削减NOx等于削弱这一化学汇,同时释放出的OH加速VOC氧化再生臭氧,净效果往往是浓度抬升。判别敏感区需依托甲醛与二氧化氮比值等指示剂并结合敏感性模拟。先协同压减VOC、再分阶段收紧NOx,方能避开转型期的反弹风险。�Under high-NOx conditions NO itself continuously titrates ozone away while scarce VOC constrains the radical chain; cutting NOx removes that chemical sink, and the freed OH radicals accelerate VOC oxidation that regenerates ozone, so the net effect is often higher concentrations. Identifying the regime rests on indicator ratios such as formaldehyde to nitrogen dioxide together with sensitivity modelling. Coordinated VOC cuts first and phased NOx tightening afterwards are what steer policy past the transitional rebound.�ans��src�ٯS. Sillman, Atmospheric Environment, 1999(城市与污染乡村地区臭氧-NOx-VOC关系评述);X. Jin 等,GRL, 2017(HCHO/NO2比值判定臭氧生成敏感区的卫星验证)��S. Sillman, Atmospheric Environment, 1999, relation between ozone, NOx and hydrocarbons in urban and polluted rural environments; X. Jin et al., Geophysical Research Letters, 2017, satellite verification of HCHO/NO2 as an ozone sensitivity indicator.��id�env_20_003�body��2红树林土壤长期淹水缺氧,枯落物分解极慢,有机碳得以逐年埋藏,单位面积埋藏速率可达温带森林的数倍。碳库主体并不在活体生物量,而在可累积数百年的深层沉积物中。一旦围垦排水,沉积物接触氧气,碳库会迅速转为向大气净排放。��Waterlogged, oxygen-poor mangrove soils decompose litter so slowly that organic carbon is buried year after year, at per-area rates several times those of temperate forests. The bulk of the stock sits not in living biomass but in deep sediments that accumulate over centuries. Once the forest is drained or reclaimed, oxygen reaches those sediments and the sink quickly turns into a net source.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�env_20_006�body��0该书系统揭露了滴滴涕等持久性有机氯农药沿食物链富集、导致鸟类种群锐减的证据,首次把生态毒理学推向公众视野。它直接推动了1970年美国环保署的设立和1972年联邦对滴滴涕的禁用,并被视为美国现代环境立法浪潮的思想起点。��The book marshaled evidence that persistent organochlorine pesticides such as DDT bioaccumulated along food chains and devastated bird populations, bringing ecotoxicology into public view for the first time. It directly contributed to the creation of the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency in 1970 and the federal DDT ban of 1972, and is regarded as an intellectual starting point for the wave of modern U.S. environmental legislation.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�env_20_009�body��k以希瓦氏菌和地杆菌为代表的部分细菌在无氧条件下代谢有机物时,能把电子经细胞色素c和外膜导电菌毛直接传递到阳极表面,而不依赖可溶性介体。这一胞外呼吸途径由Mtr和PilA等蛋白系统介导,其电流输出与底物氧化速率耦合,因而被同时用于废水处理产能与生物传感器研究。��Bacteria such as Shewanella and Geobacter oxidize organic substrates under anaerobic conditions and transfer electrons to the anode surface directly through outer-membrane cytochromes and conductive pili, without soluble mediators. This extracellular respiration pathway is mediated by protein systems such as Mtr and PilA, and because current output is coupled to substrate oxidation rates, these cells are used both for energy recovery from wastewater and as living biosensors.�ans��src��-Logan，《微生物燃料电池》（2008）�$Logan, 'Microbial Fuel Cells' (2008)��id�env_20_013�body��(物质流分析沿开采、加工、使用、废弃各环节追踪元素的存量和流量,把经济体当作一个代谢系统审视:在用库存越大,将来形成的报废流就越可观。铜的多层循环研究表明,全球社会在用库存已达人均约一百公斤量级且报废流持续扩张,提高再生利用率比单纯扩产矿山更能缓解原生资源与供应风险。磷的账户则揭示矿山—农田—水体之间的单向漏损及其引发的富营养化,据此应将从污泥和厨余中回收磷列为政策优先事项。��Material flow analysis follows an element's stocks and flows through extraction, processing, use and disposal, treating the economy as a metabolic system: the larger the in-use stock, the larger the eventual end-of-life flows. Multilevel copper studies find global in-use stocks on the order of one hundred kilograms per capita with steadily growing scrap flows, so raising recycling rates eases pressure on primary supply more effectively than opening new mines alone. Phosphorus accounts expose the one-way leakage along the mine-farm-water pathway and the eutrophication it causes, which argues for prioritizing phosphorus recovery from sewage sludge and food waste.�ans��src�ٽGraedel et al. 2004, Multilevel cycle of anthropogenic copper, Environmental Science & Technology 38(4); Cordell & White 2011, Peak phosphorus, Annual Review of Environment and Resources 36٢Graedel et al. 2004, Multilevel cycle of anthropogenic copper, Environ. Sci. Technol. 38(4); Cordell & White 2011, Peak phosphorus, Annu. Rev. Environ. Resour. 36��id�env_20_016�body���草方格通过增大地表粗糙度,将近地面的风速降至起沙临界值以下,从而削弱风沙流的侵蚀搬运能力。方格内部形成的稳定湍流层促使沙粒在格内沉降堆积,同时麦秸腐烂后为土壤输入有机质,改善水分入渗条件。这为固沙植物如梭梭和沙蒿的定居创造了微环境,最终形成生物与工程措施相结合的持久固沙体系。�&Straw checkerboards raise surface roughness, dropping near-ground wind speed below the threshold for sand entrainment and thereby weakening the erosive transport capacity of windblown sand. A stable turbulent layer forms inside each cell, causing particles to settle within it, while the decomposing straw adds organic matter and improves infiltration. This creates microhabitats where xerophytic shrubs such as saxaul and Artemisia sphaerocephala can establish, ultimately yielding a durable system that combines biological and engineering measures.�ans��src���Lü 等,《Aeolian sand transport above three desert surfaces in northern China with different characteristics (shifting sand, straw checkerboard, and gravel): field observations》,Environmental Earth Sciences,2016 (DOI: 10.1007/s12665-016-5361-7)��Lü et al., 'Aeolian sand transport above three desert surfaces in northern China with different characteristics (shifting sand, straw checkerboard, and gravel): field observations', Environmental Earth Sciences, 2016, DOI: 10.1007/s12665-016-5361-7��id�env_21_003�body��提前退役使电厂账面价值难以收回，形成搁浅资产：全部压在企业身上可能触发财务困境并传导至电价，全部由财政兜底则有失公平并加重纳税人负担。公正转型实践尝试用转型债券、专项基金等工具为提前退役定价补偿，并以拍卖机制和绩效条件约束资金流向，把部分私人风险社会化以换取更快的减排节奏。其成效取决于透明的资产核算和事先约定的风险分担规则，否则融资安排只会推迟而不会化解矛盾。��Early retirement strands book value on plant balance sheets: leaving it entirely with companies risks financial distress that spills into electricity prices, while absorbing it wholly through budgets is inequitable and burdens taxpayers. Just-transition practice prices early retirement through transition bonds and dedicated funds, with auctions and performance conditions steering where the money goes, socializing part of the private risk in exchange for faster abatement. Whether this works depends on transparent asset accounting and ex ante risk-sharing rules; otherwise the financing merely postpones the conflict rather than resolving it.�ans��src��>国际能源署《World Energy Outlook》(iea.org/reports/weo)�.IEA, World Energy Outlook, iea.org/reports/weo��id�env_21_006�body���单纯设定TAC只限制了总捕捞量,但每条渔船都有抢先捕捞的激励,导致“赛马式捕捞”,船队过度投资、渔季被压缩到几周内。ITQ将捕捞权分解为可持有、可交易的个体份额,使渔民从争夺存量转为经营资产,捕捞成本下降、渔获更易按市场节奏销售。冰岛、新西兰的经验表明,TAC加ITQ的组合能显著改善种群生物量并提高行业利润。�A TAC alone caps total landings but leaves every vessel an incentive to race for fish, producing derby fishing, overcapitalized fleets, and seasons compressed into a few weeks. ITQs break the catch into individual shares that can be held and traded, turning fishermen from rivals for a common stock into managers of a quasi-asset; costs fall and landings are timed to market demand. Experience in Iceland and New Zealand shows the TAC-plus-ITQ combination can rebuild stock biomass while raising industry profits.�ans��src�ِ联合国粮农组织《负责任渔业技术准则第4号：渔业管理》；粮农组织渔业技术论文404/2《渔业中产权的使用》٤FAO, Technical Guidelines for Responsible Fisheries No. 4: Fisheries Management; FAO Fisheries Technical Paper 404/2, Use of Property Rights in Fisheries Management��id�env_21_009�body��减缓针对温室气体排放总量,效益是全球共享的;适应针对已经无法避免的影响,收益主要落在具体地点的人群和系统上,因此责任主体、资金渠道和评价指标都不同。全球模式给出的升温区间分辨率过粗,而海堤标高、作物品种更换或城市排涝标准取决于本地的暴露度、敏感性和适应能力三要素。IPCC AR6强调,脱离本地脆弱性评估的适应行动容易错配资源,甚至造成适应不良(maladaptation),如硬性海堤加剧邻岸侵蚀。��Mitigation targets aggregate greenhouse-gas emissions with benefits shared globally, whereas adaptation addresses impacts that can no longer be avoided, its benefits accruing to specific places and populations — so responsibility, financing channels and evaluation metrics all differ. Global model ranges are far too coarse for decisions like seawall heights, crop varietal switching or urban drainage standards, which hinge on local exposure, sensitivity and adaptive capacity. IPCC AR6 stresses that adaptation detached from local vulnerability assessment misallocates resources and risks maladaptation, exemplified by hard seawalls that accelerate erosion on neighboring shores.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�env_21_013�body��p间伐降低单位面积立木密度,短期内往往减少林分生物量碳储量,而保留木因竞争缓解而加速生长,单木碳积累上升。净效应取决于间伐强度、轮伐期、林分年龄以及采伐剩余物与土壤碳的动态,不同研究给出的结论差异明显。若再计入木质林产品的碳替代效应,结论还会进一步分化。��Thinning lowers stand density and often reduces biomass carbon stocks in the short run, while residual trees grow faster once competition is eased, raising per-tree carbon gain. The net outcome hinges on thinning intensity, rotation length, stand age, and the dynamics of harvest residues and soil carbon, which is why published results diverge. Adding substitution credits for harvested wood products widens the disagreement further.�ans��src��JNaudts M 等,《欧洲森林经营未能缓解气候变化》,Science,2018�ZNaudts M et al., Europe's forest management did not mitigate climate change, Science, 2018��id�env_21_016�body���完整的体系一般覆盖源头减量、分类收集、运输与中转、资源化利用和安全处置五个环节。欧盟《废弃物框架指令》确立了污染者付费原则与五级废物层级——预防、再利用、回收、其他回收（含能量回收）、最终处置——要求成员国依序适用，填埋仅作最后手段。中国2019年起在重点城市推行生活垃圾分类制度，并通过原生垃圾零填埋目标倒逼焚烧和厨余处理能力建设。�uA complete system generally spans five stages: source reduction, separate collection, transport and transfer, resource recovery, and safe disposal. The EU Waste Framework Directive pairs the polluter-pays principle with a five-step waste hierarchy—prevention, reuse, recycling, other recovery including energy recovery, and final disposal—which member states must apply in order, with landfilling reserved as the last resort. Since 2019 China has enforced mandatory household-waste sorting in major cities, using zero-landfill targets for untreated waste to drive expansion of incineration and food-waste processing capacity.�ans��src��C欧盟指令2008/98/EC《废弃物框架指令》及修订版(2018)�MEU Directive 2008/98/EC on waste (Waste Framework Directive), as amended 2018��id�env_21_019�body���首要压力来自间歇性导致的系统灵活性缺口,以及退役风机叶片和光伏组件带来的固废问题,IRENA 估计到2050年全球光伏废弃量将达7800万吨。应对路径包括配置储能与需求响应以消纳波动、发展叶片可回收材料,以及建立生产者责任延伸制度规范组件回收。此外电网扩建本身占用土地并可能触及生态敏感区,需要通过叠图规划提前避让。�GThe primary pressures are a flexibility gap caused by intermittency plus solid-waste burdens from decommissioned turbine blades and PV modules — IRENA projects up to 78 million tonnes of end-of-life photovoltaic panels worldwide by 2050. Responses include pairing storage and demand response to absorb variability, developing recyclable blade materials, and extending producer responsibility schemes to mandate module take-back. Grid expansion itself consumes land and can touch ecologically sensitive areas, so overlay mapping is used to route lines around them early in planning.�ans��src��cIRENA与IEA-PVPS《光伏组件退役管理前瞻》(End-of-Life Management: Solar PV Panels), 2016�IIRENA & IEA-PVPS, End-of-Life Management: Solar Photovoltaic Panels, 2016��id�env_22_003�body���碳税与碳市场会推高电力、取暖和交通成本，而低收入家庭能源支出占总收入比重更高，相对负担因此更重，即所谓累退性。公正转型主张把碳收入以人均红利返还居民、对弱势群体定向补贴，并为受冲击行业劳动者提供再培训与社会保障，使减排成本与转型机会公平分担。国际劳工组织2015年《公正转型准则》将其确立为全球政策框架。�SCarbon taxes and emissions trading raise the cost of electricity, heating and transport, and because low-income households spend a larger share of their income on energy, they bear proportionally heavier burdens — the regressivity critics point to. Just-transition policy answers by returning carbon revenue as per-capita dividends, targeting subsidies to vulnerable groups, and funding retraining and social protection for workers in affected industries, so costs and opportunities are shared fairly. The ILO's 2015 Guidelines for a Just Transition codified this as a global policy framework.�ans��src��[国际劳工组织，《向环境可持续经济公正转型准则》，日内瓦，2015年�wILO, Guidelines for a Just Transition towards Environmentally Sustainable Economies and Societies for All, Geneva, 2015��id�env_22_006�body���氡是铀-238衰变链产生的放射性惰性气体，半衰期约3.8天，经地基裂缝与孔隙从土壤渗入室内并在低通风房间累积。其短寿命子体钋-218与钋-214附着于气溶胶，吸入后沉积在支气管壁，α粒子电离辐射直接损伤上皮细胞DNA引发癌变；氡因此被认定为仅次于吸烟的第二大肺癌病因，地坪下减压系统是主要降氡手段。�QRadon is a colorless, odorless radioactive noble gas produced in the uranium-238 decay chain, with a half-life of about 3.8 days; it seeps from soil through foundation cracks and gaps and accumulates in poorly ventilated rooms. Its short-lived progeny, polonium-218 and polonium-214, attach to airborne aerosols and deposit on bronchial walls when inhaled, where alpha-particle ionization damages epithelial cell DNA and initiates cancer. Radon is therefore recognized as the second leading cause of lung cancer after smoking, and sub-slab depressurization is the principal mitigation measure.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�env_22_009�body���CarbFix先把捕集的CO₂溶入大量水中形成碳酸水，再注入数百米深的玄武岩层。溶解态CO₂化学活性更高，能与岩石中的钙镁硅酸盐快速反应，析出方解石等碳酸盐矿物。注入井的同位素示踪表明，超过95%的CO₂在不到两年内完成矿化，被永久固定为固态碳酸盐，基本消除泄漏风险与后期监测负担；前提是有充足的水与合适岩层。�zAt CarbFix, captured CO₂ is first dissolved in large volumes of water to form carbonated fluid, then injected several hundred meters down into basaltic rock. Dissolved CO₂ is far more reactive than the supercritical phase: it rapidly reacts with calcium-magnesium silicates in the rock, precipitating calcite and other carbonate minerals. Isotope tracers in monitoring wells showed that over 95% of the injected CO₂ was mineralized in less than two years, permanently locked into solid carbonates and largely free of leakage risk and post-closure monitoring burdens; the method requires ample water and suitable rock formations.�ans��src��DMatter J M 等，《Science》，2016，DOI: 10.1126/science.aad8132�AMatter, J. M. et al., Science, 2016, DOI: 10.1126/science.aad8132��id�env_22_013�body���升温首先损伤虫黄藻的光系统II，过剩激发能生成大量活性氧并侵入宿主细胞；宿主随即激活凋亡与自噬样通路，把共生藻逐出组织。失去藻类后，珊瑚断供了占能量预算绝大部分的光合产物，捕食浮游生物仅能勉强维生，钙化速率也大幅下降。高温持续数周便耗尽储备，引发饥饿与组织崩解；即使颜色恢复，其生长与繁殖能力也已明显受损。�3Warming first impairs photosystem II in the dinoflagellate symbionts, so excess excitation energy floods cells with reactive oxygen species that invade the host. The coral responds by activating apoptosis-like and autophagy-like pathways that expel the algae. Stripped of photosynthate—which supplies most of its energy budget—the colony subsists on plankton capture while its calcification rate falls sharply. Weeks of sustained heat exhaust reserves, causing starvation and tissue breakdown; even after color returns, growth and reproduction stay depressed.�ans��src��nV. M. Weis：《实验生物学杂志》（Journal of Experimental Biology）第211卷（2008）：3059–3066�AV. M. Weis, Journal of Experimental Biology 211 (2008): 3059-3066��id�env_22_016�body���经济损害水平是害虫密度使“减产损失恰好等于防治成本”的临界点，低于它时用药得不偿失。IPM 在该点下方另设较低的防治阈值以争取提前干预的时间，并优先借助田间天敌与农艺管理压低虫口基数，让化学农药退居最后手段，从而在保住产量的同时延缓害虫抗药性演化、减少对非靶标生物的伤害。��The economic injury level is the pest density at which expected yield loss just equals the cost of control; below it, spraying costs more than it saves. IPM sets a lower action threshold beneath that point to allow timely intervention and relies first on field natural enemies and agronomic management to suppress populations, demoting insecticides to a last resort. Yield is protected while the evolution of resistance slows and harm to non-target organisms declines.�ans��src���Stern, Smith, van den Bosch, Hagen,《The integration of chemical and biological control of the spotted alfalfa aphid: The integrated control concept》,Hilgardia,1959 (DOI: 10.3733/hilg.v29n02p081)��Stern, Smith, van den Bosch, Hagen, 'The integration of chemical and biological control of the spotted alfalfa aphid: The integrated control concept', Hilgardia, 1959, DOI: 10.3733/hilg.v29n02p081��id�env_22_019�body���不公的负担分布往往源于受影响社区被排除在决策之外：信息不透明使其难以举证，听证缺位使选址与许可轻易通过。《奥胡斯公约》据此确立三大支柱——获取环境信息的权利、参与环境决策的权利以及诉诸司法审查的权利，把知情、参与、救济连成闭环，使弱势群体有机会在污染获批之前介入程序，而非事后被动承受后果。�Unfair distributions often originate in affected communities being excluded from decisions: opaque information keeps them from building a case, and missing hearings let siting and permits pass easily. The Aarhus Convention answers with three pillars—access to environmental information, public participation in environmental decision-making, and access to justice—linking knowledge, participation and remedy into one loop so that disadvantaged groups can intervene before pollution is approved rather than bear the consequences afterwards.�ans��src��:联合国欧洲经济委员会《奥胡斯公约》，1998ٛUNECE Convention on Access to Information, Public Participation in Decision-making and Access to Justice in Environmental Matters (Aarhus Convention), 1998��id�env_23_006�body���项目环评把现状本底当作固定背景，单个项目逐案达标，多个项目的排放与扰动却在区域尺度上叠加，形成累积效应导致“合规而恶化”。规划环评将评价前移到土地利用与产业布局阶段，通过方案比选核查区域总量与环境承载力，从源头调整或否决会累积超载的规划，再向单个项目分配总量指标，避免锁定不可逆退化。��Project EIA treats existing conditions as fixed background, so each development can comply case by case while their combined emissions and disturbances still accumulate regionally — compliance yet deterioration. Plan-level assessment moves evaluation upstream to land-use and industrial-layout decisions: alternatives are tested against regional totals and carrying capacity, overloaded plans are adjusted or rejected at source, and budgets are then allocated downward to individual projects.�ans��src���《中华人民共和国环境影响评价法》（2002年通过，2018年修正）第二条及第二章 ; 另见: EU Directive 2001/42/EC on the Assessment of the Effects of Certain Plans and Programmes on the Environment (SEA Directive), 2001��EU Directive 2001/42/EC on the Assessment of the Effects of Certain Plans and Programmes on the Environment (SEA Directive), 2001 ; see also: 《中华人民共和国环境影响评价法》（2002年通过，2018年修正）第二条及第二章��id�env_23_009�body���标签前半是共享社会经济路径编号，SSP1代表侧重可持续发展的世界；后半为该路径下2100年前后达到的辐射强迫值，单位瓦/平方米，2.6表示先升后降的低强迫情景。各模式差异主要源于云等次网格过程的参数化方案不同，加之分辨率、气溶胶处理与内部变率位相各异，故采用多模式集合均值与区间表达不确定性，而非依赖单一模式。�The first half names the shared socio-economic pathway — SSP1, a world prioritising sustainability; the second half fixes the radiative forcing reached around 2100 in watts per square metre, with 2.6 marking a low-forcing peak-and-decline case. Models diverge chiefly because sub-grid processes, above all clouds, are parameterised differently, compounded by varying resolutions, aerosol treatments and phases of internal variability; hence projections rely on multi-model ensemble means and ranges rather than any single run.�ans��src��TEyring 等，Geoscientific Model Development，2016年，doi:10.5194/gmd-9-1937-2016٘O'Neill et al., The Scenario Model Intercomparison Project (ScenarioMIP) for CMIP6, Geoscientific Model Development 9, 2016, doi:10.5194/gmd-9-3461-2016��id�env_23_013�body���额外性要求受偿的生态改善必须超出基准情景，即没有补偿支付时该地块本来的利用方式和退化轨迹。缺乏这项检验时，资金会流向即使没有补贴也会保留森林的业主，并未产生任何新增生态效益，单位资金的生态产出被摊薄，还挤占了真正面临开发压力地块的保护预算。因此规范的做法是设定可信基线、监测履约情况，并只对增量效益付费。�)Additionality requires that the ecological improvement being paid for exceed the baseline scenario—the land use and degradation trajectory that would prevail without the payment. Where this test is absent, money flows to owners who would have kept their forest regardless; no new ecological benefit is created, the ecological return per unit of funding is diluted, and protection budgets are diverted from plots under real development pressure. Sound schemes therefore set a credible baseline, monitor compliance and pay only for incremental outcomes.�ans��src�يEngel S.、Pagiola S.、Wunder S.，《环境服务付费设计的理论与实践综述》，Ecological Economics，2008年第65卷第4期ٮEngel S., Pagiola S. & Wunder S., 'Designing Payments for Environmental Services in Theory and Practice: An Overview of the Issues', Ecological Economics, Vol. 65 No. 4, 2008��id�env_23_016�body���认证以统一标准和独立审核压缩信息不对称：GSTC 行业标准从可持续管理、社会经济、文化与环境影响四方面设定指标，由经认可的认证机构评审并定期复核，只有进入认可体系的证书才有公信力。这让游客与采购方能识别真实的环保表现，倒逼酒店和旅行社在能耗、废弃物与社区受益方面持续改进。�1Certification narrows information asymmetry through unified standards and independent auditing: the GSTC Industry Criteria set indicators across sustainable management, socioeconomic benefit, cultural respect and environmental impact; accredited certification bodies assess compliance with periodic reviews, and only certificates issued under a recognized scheme carry credibility. This lets travellers and procurement buyers distinguish genuine performance, pressing hotels and tour operators to keep improving energy use, waste handling and community benefit.�ans��src��D全球可持续旅游委员会《GSTC 行业标准》v2.0，2016 年�EGlobal Sustainable Tourism Council, GSTC Industry Criteria v2.0, 2016��id�env_23_019�body���海水吸收二氧化碳后碳酸根减少，标志碳酸钙能否稳定存在的文石饱和度Ω随之下降。冷水溶入的CO2多、本底Ω低，故南大洋与北美西岸上升流区的文石不饱和水体会最先升抵海表附近。当Ω低于1时文石趋向溶解，翼足类等薄壳浮游生物造壳受损，而它们是鲑鱼、鲱鱼等的饵料，影响沿食物网上传。��As seawater absorbs CO2, carbonate ions decline and so does the aragonite saturation state Omega that governs whether calcium carbonate can persist. Cold waters hold more CO2 and start with lower Omega, so undersaturated water surfaces earliest in the Southern Ocean and the North American west-coast upwelling zone. Once Omega falls below 1 aragonite tends to dissolve; thin-shelled pteropods cannot build intact shells, and as prey for salmon and herring the damage propagates up the food web.�ans��src��JOrr 等，《Nature》437: 681–686，2005 年，doi: 10.1038/nature04095�?Orr et al., Nature 437, 681-686 (2005), doi:10.1038/nature04095��id�env_26_010�body���当地电厂、炼油厂、制药厂与石膏板厂历经数十年逐笔谈判,织成能流物流交织的网络:电厂余热为全镇供暖并向石膏板厂供应脱硫石膏,炼油厂处理后的中水回供电厂冷却,制药厂的生物污泥入田作肥。每个环节都由双边商业合同驱动,卖方变现废物、买方压低原料成本,全系统每年省下大量地下水与燃料并减少碳排。其精髓在于共生靠个案经济性自发涌现,而非出自行政规划。�zOver decades of deal-by-deal bargaining, the local power station, refinery, pharmaceutical plant and gypsum board factory wove a network where energy and matter interlace: surplus heat warms the town and desulphurised gypsum feeds the board factory, treated process water returns to cool the power station, and biological sludge from drug fermentation fertilises farms. Each link rides on a bilateral commercial contract - sellers monetise residues, buyers cut input costs - sparing large volumes of groundwater and fuel every year. The essence is symbiosis emerging bottom-up from deal economics, never from administrative blueprint.�ans��src��fChertow MR论文《Uncovering Industrial Symbiosis》,Journal of Industrial Ecology 2007(耶鲁大学)�dChertow MR, 'Uncovering' Industrial Symbiosis, Journal of Industrial Ecology, 2007 (Yale University)��id�env_26_014�body��指本意降低气候风险、结果却加深脆弱性的措施——或扩大暴露、或抬高未来的风险与转型成本、或把负担转嫁给弱者。越南湄公河三角洲为保两三季稻作连年加高堤坝,短期稳产增收,却拦断了滋养农田的洪水与泥沙,加剧地面沉降和土壤盐渍化,把风险挤向无堤保护的下游;农户生计越绑越深,日后退耕还洪的代价也越大。巴内特与奥尼尔由此提出检验标准:看工程究竟是缓解了脆弱性与路径锁定,还是将其固化。��Maladaptation names measures meant to lower climate risk that deepen vulnerability instead - enlarging exposure, inflating future risks and transition costs, or dumping burdens on the weakest. In Vietnam's Mekong Delta, dykes were raised year after year to secure two or three rice harvests: yields steadied at first, but floods no longer carried in nourishing sediment, subsidence and soil salinization worsened, and risk was squeezed onto unprotected communities downstream, while livelihoods grew so bound to the hazard zone that retreating later keeps getting costlier. Barnett and O'Neill's test flows from this: judge whether a project eases vulnerability and lock-in or cements them.�ans��src��oBarnett & O’Neill,《Maladaptation》,Global Environmental Change,2010 (DOI: 10.1016/j.gloenvcha.2009.11.004)�mBarnett & O’Neill, 'Maladaptation', Global Environmental Change, 2010, DOI: 10.1016/j.gloenvcha.2009.11.004��id�f012326a41c0�body��无机汞在微生物作用下转化为甲基汞，后者脂溶性强并在食物链中逐级富集。顶级捕食鱼类体内的甲基汞浓度可比水体高出上百万倍，威胁食用者神经发育。这解释了为何大型肉食鱼被建议限量食用。�5Inorganic mercury is converted by microbes to methylmercury, which is fat-soluble and accumulates up the food chain. Top predatory fish can carry methylmercury millions of times above water concentration, threatening neurodevelopment in consumers. That is why large carnivorous fish are advised in moderation.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�f1c057055ecf�body���人工湿地模拟自然湿地，依靠植物根系、砾石基质和微生物的协同作用处理污水。具体而言，颗粒物被过滤沉淀，有机物被微生物降解，氮磷则通过植物吸收和反硝化作用去除。相比传统污水处理厂，人工湿地能耗低、维护简单。它还能兼作城市绿地并为野生动物提供栖息地，尤其适合村镇和园区等分散污水的生态化处理。�'Constructed wetlands mimic natural wetlands, treating wastewater through the combined action of plant roots, gravel substrate, and microbes. Concretely, solids are filtered and settle out, organic matter is degraded by microbes, and nitrogen and phosphorus are removed through plant uptake and denitrification. Compared with conventional treatment plants they use less energy and are simple to maintain. They also double as urban green space and wildlife habitat, and are especially suited to decentralised treatment for villages and industrial parks.�ans��src��9中国生态环境部（人工湿地污水处理技术）�*China MEE (constructed wetland technology)��id�f1d89b81a328�body���仅名义设立却缺乏执法的「纸面保护区」几乎无生态收益；真正有效的 MPA 需充分禁捕、面积足够大并保持栖息地连通性。个体向周边洄游产生的溢出效应才是惠益渔业的关键。��Nominal 'paper parks' with no enforcement yield little ecological gain; effective MPAs need full no-take status, adequate size, and habitat connectivity. Spillover from individuals migrating outward is what benefits fisheries.�ans��src��6《Nature Sustainability》海洋保护区成效研究�'Nature Sustainability MPA effectiveness��id�f43e64129b4c�body���贴现率决定未来损益折算成今天的权重；高贴现率会压低远期的气候损害价值，使今天减排显得“不划算”，从而在代际公平与减排力度上产生巨大分歧。��The discount rate weights future gains and losses into today's value; a high rate shrinks distant climate damages, making current mitigation look 'uneconomic' and splitting views on intergenerational fairness and effort.�ans��src��PStern,《The Economics of Climate Change》,2007 (DOI: 10.1017/cbo9780511817434)�MStern, 'The Economics of Climate Change', 2007, DOI: 10.1017/cbo9780511817434��id�f542e9078a8b�body���深海沉积物和底栖生物长期封存了地球大部分有机碳，是气候调节的终极碳库。生物泵把表层碳输送至海底，部分被埋藏数千年以上。深海采矿或扰动可能释放这些碳并损害脆弱生物群落。�@Deep-sea sediments and benthic organisms store most of Earth's organic carbon long term, acting as the ultimate climate carbon reservoir. The biological pump carries surface carbon to the seafloor, where some is buried for millennia. Deep-sea mining or disturbance could release that carbon and harm fragile communities.�ans��src��@《自然》;联合国教科文组织政府间海洋学委员会�Nature;IOC-UNESCO��id�f60beab2e783�body���是的。物种丰富度只计'有多少种'，而功能多样性衡量性状覆盖（如根系深度、固氮能力）是否足以支撑生产力、养分循环等过程。实验显示功能冗余低时，失去个别物种即可导致功能骤降。�Yes. Species richness only counts 'how many,' while functional diversity measures whether trait coverage (root depth, N-fixation, etc.) sustains productivity and nutrient cycling. Experiments show that with low redundancy, losing a single species can collapse a function.�ans��src���Hou 等,《Functional Diversity Can Predict Ecosystem Functions Better Than Dominant Species: The Case of Desert Plants in the Ebinur Lake Basin》,Sustainability,2021 (DOI: 10.3390/su13052858)��Hou et al., 'Functional Diversity Can Predict Ecosystem Functions Better Than Dominant Species: The Case of Desert Plants in the Ebinur Lake Basin', Sustainability, 2021, DOI: 10.3390/su13052858��id�fcc8c6f1e4a5�body�١白化是胁迫下的"罢工"而非立刻死亡，若高温短期结束，虫黄藻能重新入住；但反复白化会耗尽珊瑚体力，最终真正死亡。٘Bleaching is a stress "strike," not instant death; if heat ends soon, zooxanthellae can return. Repeated bleaching exhausts corals until they truly die.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�fcfdbe93d1a6�body���并不是。地球生命力指数追踪数千个脊椎动物种群的相对变化，报告的是所监测种群规模变化率的几何平均值，而不是个体总数的加和。因此少数急剧崩溃的种群会显著拉低平均值，而指数上升的种群不会等量抵消。世界自然基金会 2024 年报告给出 1970 至 2020 年间约 73% 的平均降幅，正确读法是被监测种群的平均衰减幅度很大，淡水与热带地区最严重。�␀No. The Living Planet Index tracks relative change in thousands of vertebrate populations and reports the geometric mean of those rates of change, not a sum of individual animals. A few collapsing populations therefore pull the average down sharply, while recovering populations do not offset them proportionally. WWF's 2024 report gives an average decline of about 73% from 1970 to 2020, which should be read as a large average shrinkage among monitored populations, worst in freshwater systems and the tropics.�ans��src��J世界自然基金会与伦敦动物学会《地球生命力报告 2024》�?WWF and Zoological Society of London, Living Planet Report 2024��id�fd9e6396c8a4�body��R土壤碳封存是通过改进农林管理措施（如免耕、覆盖作物、施用有机肥、农林复合）把大气二氧化碳固定并长期储存在土壤有机质中的过程。土壤是全球最大的陆地碳库之一，IPCC 土地特别报告指出提升土壤碳汇可在减缓气候变化中发挥显著但有限的贡献。��Soil carbon sequestration is the process of capturing atmospheric CO2 and storing it long-term in soil organic matter through improved farming and forestry practices—such as no-till, cover crops, organic amendments, and agroforestry. Soil is among the largest terrestrial carbon pools, and the IPCC Land Special Report notes enhancing soil carbon can make a significant but limited contribution to climate mitigation.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�fdec9ee633ee�body��气候模型用物理方程在计算机上模拟大气、海洋、冰和陆地的相互作用，并以不同排放情景推算未来。它们能再现历史气候并给出趋势，但对云、反馈等细节仍有不确定性。多模型集合提高了结论的可信度。�FClimate models use physical equations on computers to simulate interactions among atmosphere, ocean, ice, and land, projecting futures under different emission scenarios. They reproduce past climate and show trends, though uncertainties remain in clouds and feedbacks. Multi-model ensembles increase confidence in conclusions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�fe7088b1fa6e�body��z污染物进入土壤后移动缓慢、不易降解，会在土层中长期存留，还可能通过作物进入食物链。修复手段包括物理清挖换土、化学淋洗和生物修复（微生物降解、植物吸收富集），但周期长、成本高，且很难完全恢复原有功能。因此土壤保护的第一原则是源头防控，比事后修复经济得多。��Pollutants move and degrade slowly in soil, persisting for long periods and potentially entering the food chain through crops. Remediation options — physical excavation and soil replacement, chemical washing, and bioremediation using microbes or hyperaccumulator plants — are slow, costly and rarely restore the original functions fully. That is why source prevention is the first principle: it is far cheaper than cleaning up afterwards.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�ffc1b8a0c638�body���新造林需数十年才能封存相当于清林所释的碳，期间存在'碳债务'；若林分短轮伐或遭火灾，转向性排放（已承诺但未立即释放）可能长期无法偿还，故造林时效与持久性比面积更关键。��New forests need decades to re-sequester what clearing released, leaving a 'carbon debt'; with short rotations or fire, committed emissions may never be repaid, so the timing and durability of afforestation matter more than mere area.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�0d6c86c19251�body�٘每一种"废物"都是另一环的原料：蚕沙、鱼粪、塘泥互为肥料与饲料，能量和养分多次利用，几乎不向系统外排废。٪Every "waste" is another link's input: silkworm droppings, fish waste and pond mud serve as fertilizer and feed, reusing energy and nutrients so little leaves the system.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�0de9300c1320�body���城市比郊区暖，植物更早开花，而传粉昆虫的羽化未必同步提前，二者“时间错配”会让授粉成功率下降；这提示城市规划也要为传粉者节律留缓冲。��Cities are warmer so plants flower earlier, but pollinator emergence may not advance in step; this temporal mismatch lowers pollination success, hinting that urban planning should buffer pollinator timing too.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�0ed0ce8cf92e�body���临界点指局地变暖超过某阈值后，系统发生不可逆、自我强化的转变。例如格陵兰冰盖在升温约 1.5°C 以上可能不可逆退缩，大西洋经向翻转环流（AMOC）在更高升温下存在崩溃风险。�A tipping point is an irreversible, self-reinforcing shift once local warming exceeds a threshold. Examples include the Greenland ice sheet, which may retreat irreversibly above roughly 1.5°C, and the AMOC, which risks collapse at higher levels of warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�164b7f28ff04�body�٣SAR 主动发射微波并接收回波，不受日照与云雨遮挡，可全天候成像。其相位还可用于毫米级地表形变（如地面沉降）监测。��SAR actively emits microwaves and records echoes, immune to daylight and cloud cover for all-weather imaging. Its phase also enables millimeter-level deformation monitoring such as land subsidence.�ans��src���J.F. Poland 主编,UNESCO《地下水开采引发的地面沉降研究指南》,1984;朱琳、宫辉力等,International Journal of Applied Earth Observation and Geoinformation, 2015(华北/北京平原InSAR沉降监测)�J.F. Poland ed., Guidebook to Studies of Land Subsidence due to Ground-Water Withdrawal, UNESCO, 1984; L. Zhu and H. Gong et al., International Journal of Applied Earth Observation and Geoinformation, 2015, InSAR monitoring of subsidence on the North China Plain.��id�16ede93d1059�body���回弹效应指能效提升降低单位成本后，使用量增加，部分乃至全部抵消节省的能源。极端情况下（杰文斯悖论），效率提高反而使总消耗上升，如 19 世纪燃煤效率提升反而扩大用煤。�The rebound effect occurs when efficiency lowers per-unit cost, so usage rises and partly or fully cancels the energy saved. In the extreme (Jevons paradox), higher efficiency increases total consumption—as 19th-century coal efficiency gains expanded coal use.�ans��src��H国际资源小组（IRP）《重新定义价值：制造革命》(2018)�TInternational Resource Panel, Re-defining Value: The Manufacturing Revolution (2018)��id�1d4c22ff37a4�body��
TNFD是一套帮助企业评估和披露其运营对自然依赖与影响的框架，类似气候领域的TCFD。它推动资金流向对自然友好的活动，降低生态退化带来的金融风险。越来越多企业正据此报告生物多样性相关风险。�8The TNFD is a framework helping companies assess and disclose their dependencies on and impacts on nature, analogous to the climate-focused TCFD. It steers finance toward nature-positive activities and reduces financial risks from ecological decline. A growing number of firms report biodiversity risks under it.�ans��src���Linsley, Abdelbadie, Abdelbadie,《The Taskforce on Nature-related Financial Disclosures must engage widely and justify its market-led approach》,Nature Ecology & Evolution,2023 (DOI: 10.1038/s41559-023-02113-w)��Linsley, Abdelbadie, Abdelbadie, 'The Taskforce on Nature-related Financial Disclosures must engage widely and justify its market-led approach', Nature Ecology & Evolution, 2023, DOI: 10.1038/s41559-023-02113-w��id�1ef77b91a860�body���碳市场由政府设定排放总量并分发或拍卖配额，企业实际排放低于配额可出售盈余，超标则需购买。碳价由此反映减排成本并引导资金流向低碳项目。设计不佳会导致价格过低或分配不公。�A carbon market sets a total cap and distributes or auctions allowances; firms below cap sell surplus and those above must buy. The carbon price reflects abatement cost and steers funds to low-carbon projects. Poor design yields low prices or unfair allocation.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�20d4c2d67e37�body���化学回收通过解聚或热解处理受污染和混合废塑料，可得单体或油；但能耗与成本较高且规模有限。机械回收更节能，却难以处理多层复合与污染料。�Chemical recycling uses depolymerization or pyrolysis to handle contaminated and mixed waste into monomers or oil, but is energy-intensive, costly, and limited in scale. Mechanical recycling is more efficient yet struggles with multilayer and dirty streams.�ans��src��-《Nature Sustainability》塑料回收综述�&Nature Sustainability recycling review��id�22fcb2b3c002�body��EU ETS是全球最大的碳市场，对电力、工业等行业的排放设定逐年下降的总量上限。企业须持有与排放相等的配额，超额可从市场购买，剩余可出售。其限额与交易机制已推动欧盟减排并影响全球碳定价。�LThe EU ETS is the world's largest carbon market, capping emissions from power, industry, and other sectors with a declining total limit. Firms must hold allowances equal to their emissions, buying shortfalls and selling surpluses in the market. Its cap-and-trade design has driven EU reductions and influenced global carbon pricing.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2eb7b333bb41�body���钴多伴生于刚果（金）的手工矿，存在童工与酸性废水；锂盐湖开采耗巨量淡水、扰动高原湖泊。回收旧机、拉长换机周期，能直接压低对新矿的需求。��Cobalt often comes from artisanal mines in DRC with child labor and acid drainage; lithium brine uses huge freshwater and disturbs plateau lakes. Recycling old phones and keeping them longer cuts new-mining demand.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2f5ba7e03b18�body�ٹ野外生存需要识别天敌、找食、避险和领地行为，圈养个体缺乏这些学习机会；放归前要循序渐进地"去人类化"和野化训练，否则难以存活。��Wild life needs recognizing predators, foraging, avoiding danger and holding territory—skills captive pandas never learn. Pre-release "de-humanizing" and rewilding training are essential, or survival fails.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�32cc967ff388�body���会。沾了食物油、脏污或混入不可回收物的“低质量回收料”常被降级为焚烧或填埋，甚至让整条分拣线停摆。干净、分开、按本地规则投放，才保住回收价值。��Yes. Food-stained or wrong items create 'low-quality' stock that gets downgraded to incineration or landfill and can stall sorting lines. Clean, separated, rule-following disposal preserves recycling value.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�39f5a4fcfaa8�body���该理论指出，片段越大、离种源越近，物种数越多，达到的平衡由迁入率与灭绝率决定。它预测破碎化森林中较小、孤立的斑块会更快丧失物种，为保护区的设计提供依据。��The theory holds that larger, nearer-to-source fragments hold more species, with richness set by a balance of immigration and extinction rates. It predicts that small, isolated patches in fragmented forests lose species faster, guiding reserve design.�ans��src��;MacArthur 与 Wilson《岛屿生物地理学理论》(1967)�<MacArthur & Wilson, The Theory of Island Biogeography (1967)��id�42e7edda9b65�body�ٶ通过绿证（如 RECs / GEC）把发电的环境属性与物理电量分离并登记，配合电网计量与注销机制，确保一份绿色属性只被一个用户声明使用。ٿRenewable certificates (RECs/GEC) separate a unit's environmental attribute from physical power and register it; grid metering and retirement ensure each green attribute is claimed only once.�ans��src��RE100 / 绿证机制�RE100; certificate��id�430978a1e971�body��回收含量指产品中来自消费后或工业后回收料的质量占比，通常按质量分数计算并需第三方认证追溯。计算要区分消费前废料和消费后废料，后者环境价值更高。可靠的核算依赖供应链的质量平衡法和票据追踪。�Recycled content is the mass share of a product coming from post-consumer or post-industrial recyclate, usually expressed as a mass fraction with third-party certification. It distinguishes pre-consumer scrap from post-consumer material, the latter being more valuable environmentally. Reliable accounting relies on mass-balance methods and document tracking across the supply chain.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�536f865ff044�body��水泥排放约六成来自石灰石煅烧的工艺过程本身，碳酸钙分解释放二氧化碳；其余来自粉磨和高温煅烧所烧化石燃料。由于过程排放难以用电替代，行业依赖替代原料、熟料替代和碳捕集来减排。�+About 60 percent of cement emissions come from the calcination process itself, as limestone releases CO2, with the rest from grinding and fossil fuel burned for high heat. Process emissions are hard to electrify, so the sector leans on alternative materials, clinker substitution and carbon capture.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�54256b47331e�body���绿色屋顶的基质与植物在降雨时截留、蓄渗水分，延缓并减少径流峰值。效果取决于基质厚度、植物覆盖、坡度与降雨强度，厚基质（>10 厘米）通常可滞留 50–80% 的年降雨。��Green roofs' substrate and plants intercept and store rainfall, delaying and reducing peak runoff. Effectiveness depends on substrate depth, vegetation cover, slope, and storm intensity; deeper substrates (>10 cm) can retain 50–80% of annual rainfall.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�54da80894b9f�body��晶硅组件含玻璃、铝和少量银、硅及含氟背板，层压结构使分离困难且经济价值偏低。随着早期装机进入退役期，废旧组件量将快速上升。机械破碎加分选或热解可回收大部分材料，但需完善回收体系。�VCrystalline panels contain glass, aluminium and small amounts of silver, silicon and fluorinated backsheets; their laminated structure is hard to separate and low in value. As early installations retire, end-of-life volumes will rise fast. Crushing plus sorting or pyrolysis can recover most materials, but a sound recycling system is needed.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�617df3bf80b7�body�٫化石燃料与化肥使活性氮随降雨沉降，富营养化让少数喜氮植物生长旺盛、遮盖并排挤其他物种，贫瘠生境的特有植物首先消失。ٽFossil fuels and fertilizers send reactive nitrogen down as deposition; eutrophication lets a few nitrogen-loving plants outcompete others, and specialist plants of poor soils vanish first.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6716e96c2ee4�body���能量回收期指光伏板从制造到发电所偿还其生产耗能所需的时间。现代晶硅组件通常只需一到两年即可回收制造能耗，而寿命可达25年以上。因此其一生的净清洁能源产出远大于投入。�Energy payback time is how long a panel must operate to generate the energy used to make it. Modern crystalline modules typically repay their manufacturing energy in one to two years and last over 25 years. So their lifetime net clean output far exceeds the input.�ans��src��%国际可再生能源署;《自然》�IRENA;Nature��id�67f88fe3e1d2�body���核电运行几乎零碳、稳定可调，利于替代煤电；但面临高建设成本、长周期、核废料处置与安全风险，是否纳入脱碳组合取决于各国条件与公众接受度。ٽNuclear runs near-zero carbon and steady, aiding coal replacement; but high cost, long build time, waste disposal and safety risks mean inclusion depends on national context and acceptance.�ans��src��>国际能源署《World Energy Outlook》(iea.org/reports/weo)�.IEA, World Energy Outlook, iea.org/reports/weo��id�6c6ff2d31971�body�ٱ国际协议先定目标，再靠各国立法、地方限排、企业转型和民众行动层层分解；全球承诺最终变成你身边的制冷剂标准与电动车补贴。ٱTreaties set goals, then national laws, local caps, corporate shifts and public action break them down; global promises become your local refrigerant standards and EV subsidies.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6c7ec36ec845�body���LCA系统量化产品从原料开采、制造、使用到废弃各阶段的资源消耗与环境排放。它能避免转移污染——只优化某一环节却加重另一环节。LCA是绿色设计和碳足迹核算的科学基础。�LCA systematically quantifies a product's resource use and environmental emissions across raw extraction, manufacturing, use, and disposal. It avoids shifting pollution by optimizing one stage while worsening another. LCA is the scientific basis of green design and footprint accounting.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�6cd09c4c1163�body�� 土壤储存的有机碳超过大气和植被碳之和，其微小变化就会影响大气二氧化碳浓度。耕作、排干湿地和升温会加速有机碳分解而释放碳；反之免耕、覆盖作物和泥炭保护可固碳。土壤管理是潜力大且低成本的碳汇选项。�%Soils hold more organic carbon than the atmosphere and vegetation combined, so small changes move atmospheric CO2. Tillage, wetland drainage and warming speed decomposition and release carbon; no-till, cover crops and peat protection store it. Soil management is a large, low-cost sink option.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6fe825bd21ee�body�ٜ真实世界里物种有多条取食路径，一条断了还能走别的；网络越密，系统抗冲击能力越强，单一链条则脆得像一根线。٠Real species have multiple feeding paths, so one break still leaves alternatives; denser webs resist shocks better, while a single chain is fragile as a thread.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�7125432ab21f�body���已在血液、胎盘、粪便中检出微塑料，但在人体的明确致病证据仍有限；主要担忧是作为载体吸附持久污染物、引发慢性炎症。结论共识是“需要警惕、但危害剂量与机制尚未完全定论”。��Microplastics are found in blood, placenta and stool, but clear human disease proof is still limited; the worry is as carriers of persistent pollutants and chronic inflammation. The consensus: be alert, but dose and mechanism are not yet settled.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7144f0257ea6�body�ٴ风光的出力随天气剧烈波动，需用储能、可调负荷、灵活气电与跨境互联来削峰填谷、保持供需秒级平衡，否则会出现弃风弃光或停电。ٺWind and solar swing with weather, so storage, flexible demand, dispatchable plants and interconnection balance supply second-by-second; without them grids face curtailment or blackouts.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�81838d258b23�body���绿氢通过可再生电力电解水制取，目前电解槽成本与可再生电力价格偏高，能效约 60–70%。蓝氢来自天然气重整并配套碳捕集，碳足迹较低但依赖化石燃料与封存可靠性。�5Green hydrogen is made by electrolyzing water with renewable power, but electrolyzer costs and renewable electricity prices keep it expensive, with about 60–70% efficiency. Blue hydrogen comes from natural-gas reforming with carbon capture—lower footprint but tied to fossil fuels and storage reliability.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�83f641e1c26b�body�٨卫星与无人机获取作物长势与水分胁迫图，指导变量施肥灌溉，减少过量投入与径流污染。它把管理从地块均一转向按需分区。��Satellites and drones map crop vigor and water stress to guide variable-rate fertilization and irrigation, cutting excess input and runoff pollution. Management shifts from uniform to on-demand zoning.�ans��src��$《环境科学》精准农业遥感�1Environmental Science China precision agriculture��id�862a78632fb9�body�ٱ持久性按封存介质从百年到万年级不等：矿化最稳，森林与土壤易受火灾、病害逆转。核算需设定监测期、缓冲账户与逆转扣减规则。��Permanence ranges from centuries to tens of millennia by medium: mineralization is most stable, while forests and soils are reversible via fire or disease. Accounting needs monitoring periods, buffer accounts, and reversal deductions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8cba8607269d�body�ٳ蛙鸣、鸟叫、虫声是生物活跃的信号，噪声盖过它们说明生境受压；用录音监测"声音多样性"，能不惊扰动物就估出城市的生物多样性。٪Frog, bird and insect sounds signal life; noise drowning them shows stressed habitat. Recording "sound diversity" estimates urban biodiversity without disturbing animals.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�961bf6008d64�body��&机械回收通过清洗、破碎、熔融再造粒，过程简单但会使材料性能下降。化学回收用解聚、热解或气化把塑料还原成单体或油类原料，可处理混杂和受污染塑料并保持品质。其缺点是能耗高、成本大，目前多处于示范阶段。�hMechanical recycling cleans, shreds and re-pelletises plastic; it is simple but degrades material quality. Chemical recycling uses depolymerisation, pyrolysis or gasification to revert plastic to monomers or oil, handling mixed and contaminated feedstock while preserving quality. Its downside is high energy cost, and it remains mostly at demonstration scale.�ans��src��-《Nature Sustainability》塑料回收综述�&Nature Sustainability recycling review��id�980cb75cd00d�body���达峰只是增长停下，靠效率提升和结构优化就能部分实现；中和要求剩余排放被森林、CCUS 等完全抵消，涉及钢铁、水泥、航空等难减排部门，几乎要改造整个经济底色。��Peaking just stops growth via efficiency and restructuring; neutrality demands remaining emissions be fully offset by forests or CCUS, tackling hard sectors like steel, cement and aviation—essentially remaking the economy's base.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9903cb1382e4�body���增加植被覆盖与高反照率材料、减少人为废热可显著降低地表与近地气温，其中绿地与蓝色空间通过蒸散提供局部降温。降温幅度受植被类型、布局与水体可达性影响，需结合通风廊道规划。�:Increasing vegetation and high-albedo surfaces and reducing anthropogenic waste heat lower land and near-surface temperatures, with green and blue spaces cooling locally through evapotranspiration. The magnitude depends on vegetation type, layout and water access, and should be planned with ventilation corridors.�ans��src���Bowler, Buyung-Ali, Knight & Pullin,《Urban greening to cool towns and cities: A systematic review of the empirical evidence》,Landscape and Urban Planning,2010 (DOI: 10.1016/j.landurbplan.2010.05.006)；Potchter, Cohen & Bitan,《Climatic behavior of various urban parks during hot and humid summer in the mediterranean city of Tel Aviv, Israel》,International Journal of Climatology,2006 (DOI: 10.1002/joc.1330)��Bowler, Buyung-Ali, Knight & Pullin, 'Urban greening to cool towns and cities: A systematic review of the empirical evidence', Landscape and Urban Planning, 2010, DOI: 10.1016/j.landurbplan.2010.05.006; Potchter, Cohen & Bitan, 'Climatic behavior of various urban parks during hot and humid summer in the mediterranean city of Tel Aviv, Israel', International Journal of Climatology, 2006, DOI: 10.1002/joc.1330��id�9dc836b2bf67�body���当水体缺氧、pH 升高或扰动增强时，沉积物中铁结合态磷会被还原释放回上覆水，形成内源负荷。即使外源截污，内源释放仍可使水华持续多年，需辅以底泥疏浚或锁磷剂。�2Under anoxia, rising pH or strong disturbance, iron-bound phosphorus in sediments is reduced and released back into the overlying water, creating internal loading. Even after external pollution is cut, internal release can sustain blooms for years, requiring sediment dredging or phosphorus-locking agents.�ans��src��*《环境科学》湖泊内源污染研究�=Environmental Science journal — lake internal loading study��id�a011468e0a1f�body���生物炭是生物质在缺氧下热解得到的稳定炭，结构多孔且抗分解。施入土壤后可存留数十年甚至更久，把碳锁在地下并改善保水和肥力。其净固碳效果取决于原料来源和避免与能源用途竞争。�$Biochar is stable carbon made by heating biomass without oxygen; it is porous and resistant to decay. Added to soil it can persist for decades, locking carbon underground while improving water retention and fertility. Net storage depends on feedstock and avoiding competition with energy use.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a1ff0fe8781f�body���Revelle 因子描述海水碳酸盐化学对额外 CO₂ 的非线性响应，数值约 9–13。它意味着海洋吸收人为 CO₂ 的效率随浓度升高而下降，因为碳酸根被消耗、缓冲能力减弱。�	The Revelle factor describes the nonlinear carbonate chemistry of seawater to added CO₂, with values around 9–13. It means the ocean's efficiency at taking up anthropogenic CO₂ falls as concentrations rise, because carbonate is consumed and buffering weakens.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b4fd3a585439�body��现代核电在严格监管下每发电单位的事故致死率远低于煤电、石油等化石燃料。重大事故如切尔诺贝利和福岛极为罕见，且新一代反应堆设计进一步提升了安全裕度。其主要争议更多在于核废料处置与高成本。�*Under strict regulation, modern nuclear power's deaths per unit of electricity are far lower than fossil fuels like coal and oil. Major accidents such as Chernobyl and Fukushima are extremely rare, and newer reactor designs add safety margins. Its main debates concern waste disposal and high cost.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b72ac59100c5�body��研究常沿公园到周边建成区的断面布设温度传感器，比较同时间地表和空气温差，得到冷却强度和影响半径。卫星地表温度与移动观测结合可量化大面积效应。公园大小、植被覆盖和水体是决定冷却范围的关键。�KStudies place temperature sensors along transects from park to surrounding built-up areas, comparing surface and air temperature differences to derive cooling intensity and radius. Satellite land-surface temperature with mobile surveys quantifies broad effects. Park size, vegetation cover and water bodies drive the cooling range.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�c4f7d59b4415�body��SLOSS（Single Large Or Several Small）争论是应该建一个大保护区还是多个小保护区。岛屿生物地理学支持大斑块，但多个小斑块可覆盖更多生境类型并降低灾难性风险；当代共识倾向依目标组合，且连通性至关重要。� SLOSS (Single Large Or Several Small) debated whether one big reserve beats several small ones. Island biogeography favors large patches, but several small ones cover more habitat types and lower catastrophic risk; current consensus favors context-specific mixes with connectivity as key.�ans��src��;MacArthur 与 Wilson《岛屿生物地理学理论》(1967)�<MacArthur & Wilson, The Theory of Island Biogeography (1967)��id�c8950c5f1334�body�٨碳价会抬高能源与必需品价格，对低收入家庭负担更重，可能加剧不平等。将收入以普惠返还或定向补贴返还可抵消累退效应。��Carbon pricing raises energy and staple prices, burdening low-income households more and possibly worsening inequality. Recycling revenue as universal or targeted rebates offsets the regressive effect.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ccdc086614a5�body�ٶ林带降低近地面风速，使风中挟带的沙尘在林前林下落下；多条带"网格式"布局还能把风切成小股、减少起沙，相当于给农田加了缓冲层。٨Belts slow near-ground wind so carried dust drops before and inside them; a grid of belts splits wind into weaker streams and reduces sand lift—a buffer for farmland.�ans��src��@生态环境部,《中国生态环境状况公报》年度发布�IMinistry of Ecology and Environment, annual state-of-environment bulletin��id�d191980e981a�body���热泵不直接燃烧产热，而是用少量电能把外界低温热搬到室内，能效比可达三倍以上的热量输出。它还可反向制冷，一机两用。其减碳效果取决于电网清洁度，绿电比例越高越环保。�A heat pump does not burn fuel for heat; it uses a little electricity to move low-temperature heat indoors, delivering over three times the energy as output. It can reverse for cooling, doing both jobs. Its carbon benefit depends on grid cleanliness; more green power means more savings.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d355a14c8453�body�� 红树林通过高生产力与厌氧沉积物环境实现碳封存：凋落物与根系分泌物进入缺氧土壤后分解缓慢，使有机碳长期埋藏。单位面积红树林土壤的碳密度常高于热带雨林，但盲目造林可能释放原有沉积物碳，需因地制宜。�Mangroves combine high primary productivity with anoxic sediments: litter and root exudates become slowly decomposing buried organic carbon. Their soil carbon density can exceed that of tropical forests per unit area, though ill-planned planting may release pre-existing sediment carbon.�ans��src��8《Nature Sustainability》2021 年红树林蓝碳研究�/Nature Sustainability 2021 mangrove blue carbon��id�d61e1cc3ed34�body���整合依赖多种手段：扩大储能与需求响应、建设跨区域输电以平滑风光波动、并用气电或水电作灵活调节。数字化调度与更高电网互联度也至关重要。系统灵活性而非单纯装机决定可消纳比例。�HIntegration relies on several means: scaling storage and demand response, building cross-regional transmission to smooth wind and solar variability, and using gas or hydro as flexible backup. Digital dispatch and greater interconnection are also vital. System flexibility, not just capacity, determines how much can be absorbed.�ans��src��B国际能源署《Renewables》年度市场报告(iea.org/reports)�.IEA, Renewables Market Report, iea.org/reports��id�d8c2b971bce2�body���渠化把自然弯曲河道改成笔直硬化的沟渠，加快了流速并抹去浅滩、湿地和洪泛区等生境。这削弱河流自净能力、切断水陆联系并使洪峰更猛。近自然的生态护岸和再蜿蜒化可部分恢复功能。�
Channelisation straightens and hardens rivers, speeding flow and erasing habitats like shoals, wetlands and floodplains. It weakens self-purification, severs land-water links and sharpens flood peaks. Near-natural banks and re-meandering can partly restore function.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d97363a7db8b�body�� 好氧工艺在供氧条件下用微生物分解有机物，出水清澈但耗能较高，并产生大量剩余污泥。厌氧工艺在无氧条件下发酵，产生可作能源的甲烷，适合高浓度有机废水且污泥量少。两者常组合使用以兼顾效率与能源回收。�EAerobic processes use oxygen-fed microbes to break down organics, giving clear effluent but higher energy use and more sludge. Anaerobic processes ferment without oxygen, producing methane as energy and suiting high-strength wastewater with little sludge. The two are often combined to balance efficiency and energy recovery.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�dbf5b23d533d�body���EPR 把产品废弃后的回收处置成本前移给生产/进口商，促使他们在设计时就减少包装、用易回收材料，并用基金支持本地回收体系，从源头减轻垃圾。ٵEPR shifts end-of-life costs onto producers/importers, pushing them to use less and more recyclable packaging at design stage and fund local recycling—cutting waste at the source.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e3aef5e700b6�body�ٰ发达国家历史上排得多、如今财力技术强，发展中国家还要兼顾脱贫；"共同但有区别的责任"就是承认这种不公平的历史与能力差异。��Developed nations emitted more historically and have more wealth and tech, while developing ones still fight poverty; "common but differentiated responsibilities" acknowledges that unfair history and capacity gap.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f47e0c8a53a9�body���磷主要来自有限的磷矿石，无法像氮那样靠大气补充；开采峰值临近、集中产地少，且农业流失造成水体富营养化，形成“缺而污染并存”的矛盾。��Phosphorus comes mainly from finite phosphate rock, not replenished from air like nitrogen; peak extraction nears, supply is concentrated, yet farm runoff causes eutrophication—a scarcity-pollution paradox.�ans��src��Global Phosphorus Research�global P research��id�f64208a612ef�body��)二噁英主要在含氯有机物不完全燃烧以及某些化工和漂白过程中生成，是无意产生的副产物。它极难降解，可在脂肪中富集并具有致癌、干扰内分泌和免疫毒性。控制焚烧温度超过850摄氏度并采用活性炭吸附可显著降低排放。�{Dioxins are mainly formed during incomplete combustion of chlorinated organics and in some chemical and bleaching processes, as unintentional by-products. They are extremely persistent, accumulate in fat, and are carcinogenic with endocrine-disrupting and immunotoxic effects. Keeping combustion above 850 degrees Celsius plus activated-carbon adsorption markedly cuts emissions.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�f78663169598�body���LCA 需从车辆制造、能源生产到报废全链条核算能耗与排放，而非仅看行驶阶段。电动车若电网高碳则优势收窄，且电池生产与回收的隐性负担必须计入，否则会低估真实环境影响。�LCA must account for energy and emissions across manufacturing, energy production and end-of-life, not just the driving phase. An EV on a high-carbon grid loses much of its advantage, and battery production and recycling burdens must be included or the true impact is understated.�ans��src��&Science 交通生命周期评价研究�1Science — transport life-cycle assessment study��id�f970b5a4235c�body�ٱ廊道需连接核心栖息地、宽度足以维持目标物种移动并降低边缘效应。应结合景观连通性模型识别关键节点，避免被道路割裂成孤岛。ٿCorridors must link core habitats with widths sufficient for target-species movement and reduced edge effects. Landscape connectivity models identify key nodes and avoid road-severed islands.�ans��src��$《环境科学》景观生态研究�-Environmental Science China landscape ecology��id�fdbb68c3c480�body��气候正义强调应对气候变化时须兼顾公平：排放少的发展中国家与未来世代却承受最严重后果。它要求历史排放大国承担更多责任并提供资金技术支持。正义维度把道德与权利纳入气候政策核心。�WClimate justice stresses fairness in climate response: those who emitted least—developing countries and future generations—often bear the worst consequences. It demands that major historical emitters take greater responsibility and provide finance and technology. The justice dimension puts ethics and rights at the core of climate policy.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�ff6f9148df0a�body���因空气中 CO2 浓度仅约 420 ppm，捕集需大量风流与高品位热能再生吸附剂，单位能耗远大于点源捕集。当前成本远高于多数减排手段，依赖廉价零碳热与电才能规模化。��At about 420 ppm, DAC needs huge airflow and high-grade heat to regenerate sorbents, giving far higher energy per ton than point-source capture. Current costs far exceed most mitigation, requiring cheap zero-carbon heat and power to scale.�ans��src��%《Nature Sustainability》DAC 综述� Nature Sustainability DAC review��id�0f2f8807f496�body�ټ它接近"人与自然是耦合系统"的观点：人的活动改变环境，环境反过来约束人的选择；可持续不是征服自然，而是把自己放进生态循环里统筹。��It resembles the view that nature and people are coupled systems: human acts change the environment, which in turn constrains choices. Sustainability means placing ourselves inside ecological cycles, not conquering them.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�1e07bad29fe5�body���硅酸盐岩石风化会消耗大气中的 CO₂，生成的离子经河流入海并沉淀为碳酸盐岩，把碳长期封存在地壳。火山活动再把碳释放回大气，这一慢速循环在百万年尺度上维系着地球的宜居温度。��Weathering of silicate rocks consumes atmospheric CO₂, and the resulting ions flow to the sea to form carbonate rocks that lock carbon in the crust. Volcanism returns carbon to the air, so this slow cycle keeps Earth habitable over millions of years.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�27accfbd1d91�body��净零排放通常指人为温室气体排放量与被移除量在核算边界内相互抵消；气候中和范围更广，还把对气候的其他影响（如航空凝结尾迹）也纳入考量。前者侧重碳的收支平衡，后者强调对气候系统的整体净影响为零。�(Net zero usually means human greenhouse gas emissions are balanced by removals within an accounting boundary; climate neutrality is broader, also counting other climate effects like aviation contrails. The former focuses on the carbon balance, the latter on zero net impact on the climate system.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�28f311619ac0�body���地球轨道的偏心率、地轴倾角和岁差以数万年的周期缓慢变化，改变各地接收的日照量。这些天文节律与冰盖反照率反馈相配合，塑造了过去数百万年的冰期—间冰期循环。�Slow changes in Earth's orbital eccentricity, axial tilt, and precession alter how much sunlight reaches different regions over tens of thousands of years. Combined with ice-albedo feedback, these astronomical rhythms shaped the ice-age cycles of the past millions of years.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�2af8b167ac62�body�ٺ转型会淘汰煤矿、油田相关岗位，若只谈减碳不顾劳动者生计，会制造新的不公；公正转型要求配套再培训、新产业和社保，让没人被落下。��The shift ends coal and oil jobs; if we cut carbon but ignore workers' livelihoods, we create new injustice. A just transition adds retraining, new industries and social support so no one is left behind.�ans��src��JILO 2015《公正转型指南：迈向环境可持续的经济与社会》�mILO 2015 Guidelines for a just transition towards environmentally sustainable economies and societies for all��id�30ca7ba9ef2c�body�ٶ核电几乎不排 CO₂，但存在事故、乏燃料处置与成本问题；严谨的说法是"在严格监管下，它是低碳但需谨慎管理"的能源，而非非黑即白。ٳNuclear emits almost no CO₂ but carries accident, waste and cost issues; precisely, under strict regulation it's a low-carbon yet carefully-managed energy—not black-and-white.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�32e9c4584286�body���除肉眼可见的皆伐外，高分辨率与时间序列影像能识别零星采伐、林冠退化与道路侵入等缓慢变化，结合雷达可穿透云层，捕捉传统统计遗漏的小规模破坏。پBeyond clear-cuts, high-resolution time-series and radar see through clouds to catch sporadic logging, canopy degradation and road incursion—slow changes missed by conventional statistics.�ans��src��Global Forest Watch�Global Forest Watch��id�3be579156ab3�body�ٳ反硝化菌在缺氧条件下把硝酸盐还原成氮气（N2）返回大气，是氮循环“出口”，能削减水体富营养化，但也可能把氮肥变气体损失掉。٥Denitrifying bacteria in low-oxygen conditions convert nitrate back to N2 gas, the cycle's 'exit' that curbs aquatic eutrophication but also loses fertilizer as gas.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�47283de95bcf�body���微生物分解枯落释放矿质养分，线虫等微型动物捕食微生物调控其数量与活性，跳虫破碎有机质增大表面积，层层传递给植物可利用的氮磷，是地下养分的“发动机”。��Microbes decompose litter releasing mineral nutrients; microfauna like nematodes graze microbes, regulating their activity, while springtails shred litter, all passing plant-available N and P—the engine of belowground nutrients.�ans��src��Soil Biology & Biochemistry�Soil Biol Biochem��id�475cc3ed5c9e�body�٠公平贸易常要求少用有毒农药、保护水源与林地，并把更高收购价反哺小农；它把"对人公平"和"对土地友好"绑在了一起。ٜFair trade often demands fewer toxic pesticides and protects water and forest while paying small farmers more; it ties "fair to people" with "kind to land".�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�4e5c957dd13b�body��气溶胶的直接效应是散射或吸收阳光，多数情况下使地表降温；间接效应是作为云凝结核改变云的厚度与寿命，通常也让云更亮、反射更多阳光。二者部分抵消了温室气体造成的升温，但本身也是健康污染物。�$Aerosols' direct effect is scattering or absorbing sunlight, usually cooling the surface; their indirect effect is changing cloud brightness and lifetime by acting as cloud condensation nuclei, also tending to cool. They partly offset greenhouse warming yet are themselves harmful pollutants.�ans��src��E戴树桂 主编,《环境化学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2006�NDai Shugui ed., Environmental Chemistry, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�5a0f06dcbef8�body�ٶ用大量有/无人为强迫的气候模拟对比该事件的出现概率，估算“人类使之更可能/更强”的倍数；这是一种概率性结论而非单一因果判定。ٸIt compares event probability in model worlds with and without human forcing to estimate how much we made it more likely or intense—a probabilistic statement, not single-cause proof.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�645a90e70a27�body�٬它每五年综合评估集体进展与 1.5°C 目标的差距，形成政治与技术信号，促使各国在下一轮 NDC 中提高雄心、弥补资金与技术缺口。ٶEvery five years it assesses collective progress and the gap to 1.5°C, sending political and technical signals that push countries to raise NDC ambition and close finance/tech gaps.�ans��src��《巴黎协定》公开文本�Paris Agreement public text��id�715a23ddccdf�body���若为原料新开农田而砍伐森林或排干湿地，释放的碳远超燃料节省；化肥与运输也有排放。只有用废弃物或边际土地、全生命周期核算，才谈得上减碳。��If new farmland clears forest or drains wetland, the released carbon dwarfs fuel savings, plus fertilizer and transport emissions. Only waste feedstocks or marginal land with full life-cycle accounting truly cut carbon.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�763c7dafd25c�body��␀IPAT 把环境影响 I 表示为人口 P、富裕程度 A 和技术 T 的乘积（I=P×A×T）。它说明环境压力来自人口规模、人均消费和技术效率三方共同作用，提醒我们仅控制人口或只靠技术都不足以解决问题。�IPAT expresses environmental impact I as the product of population P, affluence A and technology T (I=P×A×T). It shows that pressure comes from population size, per-capita consumption and technical efficiency together, so neither population control nor technology alone suffices.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�86dfda268ace�body�ٱ表层升温加强层化、抑制营养盐上涌，浮游植物生长受限；同时呼吸与分解在深层相对增强，使下沉颗粒碳通量减少，封存的碳变少。��Surface warming strengthens stratification, curbing nutrient upwelling and phytoplankton growth, while respiration gains relatively, reducing sinking particulate carbon flux and less sequestration.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8cdd82cf7647�body�ٟ人工亮光扰乱候鸟夜间导航使其撞楼，也改变昆虫的羽化、交配与趋光行为，打乱捕食与被捕食关系，波及整条食物链。ٳArtificial light confuses nocturnal bird navigation causing collisions, and alters insects' emergence, mating and attraction, disrupting predator-prey links across the food chain.�ans��src��Frontiers in Ecology�Front Ecol��id�9ac838e011fd�body���从水样、土壤或空气中提取生物脱落的 DNA，用测序比对就能无接触地检出隐存物种与入侵种，比传统样线调查更快、更广，但需注意污染与数据库完整性。��Extracting DNA shed into water, soil or air and sequencing it detects cryptic and invasive species without contact, faster and broader than transects—though contamination and database gaps need care.�ans��src��Methods in Ecology�Methods Ecol Evol��id�9b3cca1de77a�body���评级机构按环境、社会、治理指标给企业打分，高分意味着更低的政策与气候风险、更易获资金和客户；资金因此流向更可持续的公司，间接倒逼减排。��Raters score firms on environmental, social and governance metrics; high scores signal lower policy and climate risk and easier capital, so money flows to greener companies, indirectly pushing cuts.�ans��src���Messie Pondie, Berriche, Laroutis,《The weight of silent criteria: ESG score performance and investment attractiveness in sub-Saharan Africa》, Journal of Environmental Management, 2026 (DOI: 10.1016/j.jenvman.2025.128192)��Messie Pondie, Berriche, Laroutis, 'The weight of silent criteria: ESG score performance and investment attractiveness in sub-Saharan Africa', Journal of Environmental Management, 2026, DOI: 10.1016/j.jenvman.2025.128192��id�9ff6c503813a�body���用户上传带定位和时间的现象照片，经社区与专家鉴定后汇入公开数据库，可用来绘制物种分布、追踪入侵种扩散、评估保护成效，甚至辅助新种发现。ٳUsers post geotagged, time-stamped photos; community and expert IDs feed public databases used to map distributions, track invasions, gauge conservation and even flag new species.�ans��src�ٰChandler, See, Copas, Bonde,《Contribution of citizen science towards international biodiversity monitoring》,Biological Conservation,2017 (DOI: 10.1016/j.biocon.2016.09.004)ٮChandler, See, Copas, Bonde, 'Contribution of citizen science towards international biodiversity monitoring', Biological Conservation, 2017, DOI: 10.1016/j.biocon.2016.09.004��id�a5a00509da17�body�٠SIF 是植物光合过程中逸出的微弱红光，直接反映真实光合作用强度，比叶面积指数更早指示干旱、物候与碳吸收的变化。��SIF is faint red light leaking from photosynthesis, directly tracking actual photosynthetic activity—earlier than leaf-area indexes at signaling drought, phenology and carbon uptake changes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c1a93cbc758d�body���它们在环境中难降解、可长距离迁移、易在脂肪中富集并通过食物链放大（生物放大），即使源头禁用，存量仍会长期危害野生动物与人类健康。٢They resist degradation, travel far, accumulate in fat and magnify up the food chain; even after a source ban, legacy stocks harm wildlife and health for decades.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c95b6d6282f7�body���它对应"生态系统服务"与"自然资本"思想：清洁水源、固碳、生物多样性等生态功能本身就值钱，保护不是发展的对立面，而是可持续收益的来源。��It maps to ecosystem services and natural capital: clean water, carbon storage and biodiversity have real value, so protection is not the opposite of development but a source of lasting returns.�ans��src��&TEEB / Millennium Ecosystem Assessment�TEEB; MEA��id�d0f8b30e37be�body���PM2.5 足够细小，可穿过肺泡进入血液，并携带重金属、多环芳烃等有害物质随循环到达心脏、大脑等器官。长期暴露与心脏病、中风、肺癌和认知下降相关，因此 WHO 不断收紧其浓度指导值。�
PM2.5 is small enough to cross the lung alveoli into the blood, carrying heavy metals and PAHs to organs like the heart and brain. Long-term exposure links to heart disease, stroke, lung cancer and cognitive decline, so the WHO keeps tightening its guideline values.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�d51e00f5f804�body���一件普通棉T恤从种棉到成衣大约耗水 2000–3000 升，还伴随农药与印染污染。理性消费不是不买，而是少买、买耐穿、买二手，把每件衣服的“环境账”用足。��A typical cotton T-shirt uses roughly 2000–3000 L from farm to finish, plus pesticides and dye pollution. Mindful consumption means buying less, durable or secondhand, and wearing each item fully.�ans��src��=G. Tyler Miller,《Living in the Environment》Cengage 多版�KG. T. Miller, Living in the Environment, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�dd875f323506�body��这是描述陆地景观结构的框架：斑块是相对均质的小块生境（如林地），廊道是连接它们的线性通道（如林带、河流），基质则是占主导的背景景观（如农田）。廊道的连通性直接影响物种迁移和基因交流。�%It is a framework for landscape structure: patches are relatively uniform habitat fragments (e.g. woods), corridors are linear connectors (e.g. hedgerows, rivers), and the matrix is the dominant background (e.g. farmland). Corridor connectivity directly affects species movement and gene flow.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�e758eb313028�body���向上散射的人造光在城市上空形成亮穹，淹没暗弱星光，让城市居民难见银河；同时打乱夜行昆虫、鸟类与植物的光周期，干扰觅食、迁徙与开花。��Upward-scattered light forms a bright dome over cities, drowning faint stars so the Milky Way vanishes; it also disrupts the light cycles of nocturnal insects, birds and plants, disturbing feeding, migration and flowering.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�ede566051c7b�body���磷是生命必需、且几乎全部依赖开采磷矿的养分，而高品位磷矿被认为会在本世纪走向枯竭。与可循环的氮不同，磷一旦随废水入海便难以回收，因此“磷峰值”提醒我们要提高磷的循环利用。�"Phosphorus is essential to life and almost entirely sourced from finite phosphate rock, whose high-grade reserves are expected to deplete this century. Unlike recyclable nitrogen, phosphorus lost to the sea via wastewater is hard to recover, so 'peak phosphorus' calls for better recycling.�ans��src��B左玉辉 主编,《环境学》第2版,高等教育出版社,2009�KZuo Yuhui ed., Environmental Science, 2nd ed., Higher Education Press, 2009��id�env_26_004�body���为治理配额长期过剩导致的碳价失灵。危机后排放需求下滑而分配规则未变,流通过剩配额一度超过20亿吨,碳价低迷到失去减排投资信号。MSR自2019年按规则自动运行:流通配额高于阈值时,每年将其中的24%(2024年起降为10%)转入储备库冻结,跌破下限再逐步回流拍卖;这相当于给供给装上自动稳定器,不重开立法谈判即可恢复稀缺性与价格发现功能。��To cure a structural flaw: a chronic allowance surplus that wrecked the price signal. The crisis depressed emissions while allocation rules stayed frozen, outstanding spare allowances once piled past two billion tonnes, and prices sank until they no longer rewarded abatement investment. Running automatically since 2019, the reserve diverts twenty-four percent of circulating allowances above a threshold into storage each year (ten percent from 2024) and returns them through auctions once circulation falls below the floor - an automatic stabiliser on supply that restores scarcity and price discovery without reopening legislative negotiations.�ans��src�٧Perino G与Willner M论文《Procrastinating Reform: The Impact of the Market Stability Reserve on the EU ETS》,Journal of Environmental Economics and Management 2016١Perino G & Willner M, 'Procrastinating Reform: The Impact of the Market Stability Reserve on the EU ETS', Journal of Environmental Economics and Management, 2016��id�env_26_007�body���依据《环境法案》,2024年2月起英格兰多数新建项目须使生物多样性较开发前基线提高至少10%,数值由法定栖息地积分体系按生境类型、面积与状况测算,可通过原地改良、异地购地或购买政府信用交付,并以规划义务锁定至少30年管护。批评集中于:积分只度量栖息地外壳而不计物种组成,稀有难替代生境被折价置换,30年承诺远短于群落演替时标且监测经费悬空,净增益恐停留于账面。��Under the Environment Act, most new development in England since February 2024 must leave biodiversity at least ten percent above the pre-development baseline. A statutory habitat metric scores gains by type, extent and condition of habitat, deliverable on site, through off-site land purchases or government credits, with upkeep locked in for at least thirty years. Critics object that the metric prices habitat shells while ignoring species composition, lets rare irreplaceable habitats be traded away cheaply, and rests on thirty-year pledges far shorter than succession timescales, with monitoring funding unresolved - gains that may live mostly on paper.�ans��src��]英国议会立法《Environment Act 2021》生物多样性净增益条款(2024年2月生效)�hUK Parliament, Environment Act 2021, statutory biodiversity net gain provisions (in force February 2024)��id�env_26_013�body��%主要靠构网型变流器在毫秒尺度主动撑住电压与频率,辅以调相机与快速调频备用。传统电网的稳定依赖同步机转子动能缓冲功率失衡;风机光伏经电力电子变流器并网,常规跟网型控制用锁相环跟随既有电压,只注入电流、不提供惯量,低惯量下频率跌落极快,易触发低频减载。构网型控制则自建电压相量与频率基准,借助直流侧储能模拟虚拟惯量并输出故障电流,让逆变器从跟随者变成电源,从而支撑高比例可再生电网。��Stability now rests chiefly on grid-forming converters that actively prop up voltage and frequency within milliseconds, backed by synchronous condensers and fast frequency reserves. Conventionally, generator rotors cushioned every imbalance with kinetic energy; wind and solar instead connect through power-electronic inverters, and standard grid-following control merely chases the existing voltage with a phase-locked loop, injecting current but no inertia - so frequency falls dangerously fast once rotating mass thins out. Grid-forming control builds its own voltage phasor and frequency reference, drawing on DC-side storage to emulate inertia and deliver fault current, turning inverters from followers into anchors.�ans��src��bKroposki B等论文《Achieving a 100% Renewable Grid》,IEEE Power and Energy Magazine 2017(NREL)�aKroposki B et al., 'Achieving a 100% renewable grid', IEEE Power and Energy Magazine, 2017 (NREL)��id�env_26_018�body���因为补偿惯用未来的恢复承诺兑换当下的生境丧失,两者在时间尺度上严重错位。栖息地随开工即刻消失,新建的林地湿地却需数十乃至上百年才逼近参照生态系统,空窗期内物种持续流失,累积成可能永不结清的恢复债;再叠加恢复失败的不确定性与忽视时滞的折算比率,账面平衡实为生态透支。Maron等人据此主张,时滞风险必须计入补偿设计、折算系数与许可审查。�pBecause offsetting habitually trades present habitat loss for promises of future restoration, two processes wildly out of step in time. Habitat vanishes the day bulldozers arrive, while newly planted woodland or recreated wetland takes decades to centuries to approach a reference ecosystem; through that window species keep disappearing, piling up a restoration debt that may never be settled. Add the genuine odds that restoration fails outright, and exchange ratios that ignore the delay, and balance exists only on paper. Maron and colleagues therefore insist temporal risk enter offset design, ratios and permit review.�ans��src���Maron、Hobbs、Moilanen 与 Matthews,《Faustian bargains? Restoration realities in the context of biodiversity offset policies》,Biological Conservation,2012 (DOI: 10.1016/j.biocon.2012.06.003)پMaron, Hobbs, Moilanen & Matthews, 'Faustian bargains? Restoration realities in the context of biodiversity offset policies', Biological Conservation, 2012, DOI: 10.1016/j.biocon.2012.06.003��id�faf4d453f733�body���AMOC 是一股把温暖表层水向北输送、把冷水向南下沉返回的大洋环流，对西欧的温和气候至关重要。观测显示它已明显减弱，若进一步减弱会导致北大西洋沿岸变冷、季风与降雨格局紊乱。�The AMOC is an ocean current that carries warm surface water northward and returns cold deep water southward, helping keep Western Europe mild. Observations show it has weakened markedly; further weakening could cool the North Atlantic and disrupt monsoon and rainfall patterns.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�023cec23961b�body�ٽ数数给情绪一个短暂的“冷却窗口”，让负责冲动的杏仁核稍作平复，前额叶重新接管理性。哪怕只是停顿几秒，也能少说很多事后后悔的话。ٮCounting creates a brief cooling window so the amygdala eases and the prefrontal cortex regains rational control. Even a few seconds of pause prevents many regrettable words.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0278a862e3d7�body�ل人类依赖交流维持联结，沉默被大脑解读为“关系可能出问题”的信号，于是产生不适并急于填补。ٟHumans rely on communication to maintain connection; silence is read by the brain as a possible relational problem, creating discomfort and an urge to fill it.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�04e27857767c�body�ٱ照顾自己是维持助人能力的底座：耗干了的自己既帮不了人，也更容易崩溃。把自己当需要维护的“设备”，反而能更久地支持别人。٭Self-care is the base that keeps your ability to help; a drained self helps no one and breaks easier. Treat yourself as equipment that needs upkeep to support others longer.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�070220a6ad9b�body���旁观者效应指紧急事件中有越多旁观者，任一个出手帮忙的概率反而越低。因为责任被分散，且大家互相观察以判断“是否真有危险”。它提醒我们在现场应明确指向某人求助会更有效。��The bystander effect is that the more onlookers at an emergency, the lower the chance any one helps. Responsibility diffuses and people watch each other to judge if it is real danger. It reminds us to single out a specific person when asking for help.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�07651cc124c2�body���从众是改变自己的行为/判断以迎合群体，Asch 实验显示即使答案明显错误，约 1/3 的人也会附和。动机包括想被接纳（规范性）和认为群体更对（信息性）。��Conformity is adjusting behavior/judgment to the group. Asch's experiments showed ~1/3 conformed to obviously wrong answers. Motives: wanting acceptance (normative) and assuming the group is right (informational).�ans��src��Asch (1951)�Asch (1951)��id�076c50a39fcb�body���21 天来自整形外科观察的误传，并非普适规律。Lally 等研究发现，自动化的平均天数约 66 天，且因行为与个体差异从 18 到 254 天不等。耐心与重复比追求天数更重要。��21 days came from a misread of plastic-surgery observations, not a universal rule. Lally et al. found habit automation averaged ~66 days, ranging 18-254 by behavior and person. Patience and repetition matter more than a number.�ans��src��Lally 等 (2010)�Lally et al. (2010)��id�0823d03fd5bc�body�ٜ认知偏差是大脑为快速做决策而产生的系统性“思维捷径”错误，如以偏概全或受近期信息影响，虽快却常偏离真相。ٝA cognitive bias is a systematic thinking error from mental shortcuts the brain uses to decide fast—like overgeneralizing—speedy but often off the truth.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�08f3105b9b6d�body���睡眠在 NREM（1-3 期，深度递增）与 REM 之间循环，每夜约 4-6 个周期。NREM 深睡助身体修复与记忆巩固，REM 伴做梦、脑活跃而肌麻痹，与情绪加工和学习有关。��Sleep cycles between NREM (stages 1-3, deepening) and REM, about 4-6 cycles a night. Deep NREM aids physical repair and consolidation; REM brings vivid dreams, active brain, muscle paralysis, and links to emotion and learning.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0d5e0fc254cd�body�ٓ强烈情绪会同时激活交感与副交感神经，造成生理“过载”，流泪是身体平衡激越状态的方式，也是情绪宣泄。٧Intense emotion simultaneously activates sympathetic and parasympathetic systems, creating physiological 'overload'; tears help the body rebalance and release emotion.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（情绪章）�/Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), emotion chapter��id�10c11ce3c874�body���从众是指个体在群体压力下改变自己的行为或看法以与多数人一致。阿希的线段实验显示，即便答案明显，约三分之一的人也会跟随群体错误判断。��Conformity is changing one's behavior or opinion to match the majority under group pressure. Asch's line experiment showed that even with obvious answers, about a third of people will follow the group's wrong judgment.�ans��src��$《社会心理学》（阿伦森）�The Social Psychology (Aronson)��id�12286fc6bb47�body��感觉是感官接收外界刺激（如眼睛看到光、皮肤感到冷），感知是大脑对这些信号的组织和解释（认出那是一只猫）。没有感觉就没有材料，没有感知信息就只是杂乱信号。两者共同让我们认识世界。�5Sensation is the senses receiving stimuli (eyes catching light, skin feeling cold), while perception is the brain organizing and interpreting those signals (recognizing it as a cat). Without sensation there is no material; without perception the information is just noise. Together they let us know the world.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1267d1b87477�body���必要难度指那些增加当下提取努力、却提升长期学习的干扰（如间隔、交错、自测）。它们降低流畅感却强化记忆，提醒我们“学得轻松”不等于“学得牢”。��Desirable difficulties are manipulations that increase retrieval effort now but boost learning later (spacing, interleaving, self-testing). They reduce fluency yet strengthen memory, reminding us that easy now is not learned well.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�126f7ad77fd1�body���微笑和笑声会向大脑传递积极信号，轻度提升情绪并缓解紧张。即使刻意微笑，也可能产生微弱的愉悦效应。当然笑不能替代对真实困扰的处理。��Smiling and laughing send positive signals to the brain, mildly lifting mood and easing tension. Even forced smiles can produce a small pleasant effect. Laughter, of course, cannot replace addressing real distress.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1303256b740c�body��h奥尔波特的“接触假说”（Allport, 1954）认为，当不同群体在平等地位、共同目标、合作且权威支持的条件下接触，刻板印象会被真实经验瓦解。皮尤与特罗普的元分析（Pettigrew & Tropp, 2006）汇总数百项研究证实，单纯增加接触就能小幅降低偏见，满足最佳条件时效果更强。�)Allport's contact hypothesis (1954) says prejudice erodes when groups meet as equals, toward shared goals, cooperatively and with institutional support. Pettigrew and Tropp's meta-analysis (2006) of hundreds of studies confirms mere contact lightly reduces bias, and optimal conditions amplify it.�ans��src�فPettigrew, T.F. & Tropp, L.R. (2006)《群体间接触的元分析》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 90(5):751-783ٖPettigrew, T.F. & Tropp, L.R. (2006). A meta-analytic test of intergroup contact theory. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 90(5), 751-783.��id�160c8560b890�body���习惯由神经回路在提示（触发）到例行（行为）到奖励（满足）的重复中固化。大脑为省能会把频繁行为自动化，所以改习惯要替换例行或改变提示，而非只靠意志力。ټHabits solidify via repeated cue to routine to reward loops. The brain automates frequent behavior to save energy, so changing habits means swapping the routine or cue, not just willpower.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�162ff89884f0�body��␀工作记忆的中央执行像调度员：它能把不再相关的信息从注意中清掉，并主动把新信息“刷新”进意识焦点（如把“2+3”更新成“5”）。这种更新能力往往比单纯容量更能预测阅读与推理成绩。�The central executive acts like a dispatcher: it clears no-longer-relevant items from attention and actively refreshes new information into the focus of consciousness (e.g., updating 2+3 to 5). This updating ability often predicts reading and reasoning better than raw capacity.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�165360373f26�body���重评是改变对事件的解读（如“这不是威胁而是挑战”），通常减负且不伤社交；表达抑制是压住外显情绪，短期有效却增加生理唤醒、损害记忆与关系。长期看重评更可持续。�Reappraisal changes how you interpret an event ('a challenge, not a threat'), usually lowering distress without social cost; expressive suppression hides outward emotion, works briefly yet raises physiological arousal and harms memory and relationships. Reappraisal is more sustainable.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�18ed2db6566c�body�ٴ这叫门生效应：为了教，你得先理清结构、填补漏洞，并预测问题。输出迫使深度加工，比单纯输入记得更牢，也更易发现自己的误解。��The protégé effect: to teach, you must organize structure, fill gaps, and anticipate questions. Producing forces deep processing—better recalled than mere input and reveals your own misunderstandings.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�1b19ebd2c398�body���人们把钱按来源或用途分进不同“账户”，对不同账户的花法心态不同（奖金敢花、工资舍不得）。这种非理性分账会扭曲消费与储蓄决策，是行为经济的核心发现之一。��People split money into mental accounts by source or purpose and treat them differently (freely spend a bonus, hoard salary). This irrational partitioning distorts spending and saving—a core behavioral-economics finding.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�1f056511418f�body��O“情绪一致性记忆”指人在某种情绪状态下更容易提取带有相同情绪色彩的记忆（Bower, 1981）。一种机制是编码时情绪为记忆“打了标签”，回忆时相似情绪像钥匙一样打开了同一类材料，于是低落时消极往事格外容易被激活，形成情绪越陷越深的循环。�?Mood-congruent memory means we retrieve material that matches our current emotional state more easily (Bower, 1981). One mechanism is that emotion tags memories at encoding, and the same mood later acts like a key that opens that category - so sadness preferentially activates negative recollections, deepening the dip.�ans��src��LBower, G.H. (1981)《情绪与记忆》, American Psychologist 36(2):129-148�KBower, G.H. (1981). Mood and memory. American Psychologist, 36(2), 129-148.��id�2058042c820f�body�ٺ热线提供即时、匿名、不评判的倾听与初步支持，帮你在危机或孤单时稳住，并转介进一步资源。它不诊断、不开药，而是先接住你这个人。��A hotline offers immediate, anonymous, non-judging listening and first support, helping you steady in crisis or loneliness and pointing to further resources. It does not diagnose or prescribe, but first holds the person.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�20e9bab02da1�body���发展心理学研究人从出生到老年的心理如何随年龄变化，包括语言、思维、情绪和人际关系的发展。它关心先天和后天各自起多大作用。理解发展规律能帮家长和教育者更好地支持成长。�
Developmental psychology studies how people's minds change from birth to old age, including language, thinking, emotion, and relationships. It examines how much nature and nurture each contribute. Understanding development helps parents and educators support growth.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�2275c24044c2�body���研究表明，过多的选项会增加决策负担和事后后悔，降低满意度，这被称为选择过载。有限而精的选项往往让人更从容。超市果酱实验是经典例证。��Studies show too many options raise decision burden and later regret, lowering satisfaction, called choice overload. Fewer, well-curated options often leave people calmer. The supermarket jam study is a classic example.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�22cee6767919�body���巴甫洛夫发现，把原本中性的刺激（如铃声）与能天然引发反应（如食物引起唾液）的刺激反复配对，中性刺激也能单独引发该反应。这就是“望梅止渴”背后的学习机制。��Pavlov found that pairing a neutral stimulus (like a bell) with one that naturally triggers a response (food causing saliva) makes the neutral stimulus alone elicit that response. This is the learning mechanism behind 'mouth-watering at the thought.'�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�235b7a1c5f6f�body��感觉适应指持续接触同一刺激后，感官对该刺激的反应逐渐减弱，比如进游泳池不久就觉不冷了。它帮助大脑忽略恒定背景信息，把注意留给变化的新异信号。适应是感受器疲劳与中枢调节共同作用的结果。�?Sensory adaptation is that with continued exposure to the same stimulus, the sense response weakens, such as no longer feeling the cold after a while in the pool. It lets the brain ignore constant background and attend to changing, novel signals. Adaptation arises from receptor fatigue and central regulation together.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�25ad994d588d�body��缪勒-莱尔错觉中，两条等长线段因两端箭头方向不同（向内或向外）而被看成长度不一。向外的箭头让线段显得更长，向内的显得更短。它揭示了大脑在判断长度时会自动调用深度线索，从而产生系统性的视觉误判。�?In the Müller-Lyer illusion, two equal-length lines appear unequal because of arrowheads at their ends pointing inward or outward. Outward arrows make the line look longer, inward arrows shorter. It reveals that the brain automatically applies depth cues when judging length, producing a systematic visual misjudgment.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�26e1886ed0a9�body���不会有两个人格，但双语者在切换语言时常伴随轻微认知与情绪风格变化，因为不同语言关联不同记忆与社交语境。研究还显示双语可能延缓痴呆并提升某些执行功能，但效果并非绝对。�$No split personalities, but bilinguals often show subtle shifts in cognition and emotional style when switching languages, since each language evokes different memories and social contexts. Bilingualism may delay dementia and boost some executive functions, though effects are not guaranteed.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�27d6764d37dc�body���网络让人看不到对方表情、离得很“远”，责任感下降，这种现象叫“去个体化”。匿名和缺少即时反馈也削弱了自我约束。意识到这一点能让我们在网上更友善。��Online, we cannot see the other person's face and feel distant, so our sense of responsibility drops—a phenomenon called 'deindividuation'. Anonymity and lack of immediate feedback also weaken self-control. Recognizing this helps us be kinder online.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2826594339dc�body���确认偏误指人倾向于寻找、解读和记住支持自己既有观点的信息，而忽视相反证据。它在阅读新闻、辩论和科学推理中都很常见。意识到这一偏差有助于主动接触不同立场，减少误判。�'Confirmation bias is the tendency to seek, interpret, and remember information that supports one's existing beliefs while ignoring contrary evidence. It appears in reading news, debate, and scientific reasoning alike. Recognizing it helps one deliberately engage opposing views and reduce error.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�2a2b016eed8b�body���纯粹接触效应指仅仅反复看到某刺激，就会增加对它的好感，无需任何奖励。扎荣茨用无意义图形与面孔证明，熟悉本身就能催生偏好。它解释了为何熟面孔往往更讨喜。��The mere exposure effect is that simply seeing a stimulus repeatedly increases liking it, with no reward. Zajonc showed it with nonsense shapes and faces: familiarity alone breeds preference. It explains why familiar faces tend to please more.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2a8c6ac44d60�body���围观会唤醒驱力：对熟练任务表现提升（社会助长），对生疏任务则因焦虑而变差（社会抑制）。所以观众未必帮倒忙，关键在你是否已自动化该动作。��An audience arouses drive: skilled tasks improve (social facilitation), unfamiliar ones worsen via anxiety (social inhibition). So spectators aren't automatically bad—it depends if the action is automated.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2ae6322b74c9�body�ٮ手机屏幕的蓝光会抑制褪黑素分泌，推迟睡意，加上内容刺激让大脑兴奋。建议睡前一小时放下屏幕。换成阅读纸质书更有助入睡。��Blue light from phone screens suppresses melatonin and delays sleepiness, and engaging content keeps the brain alert. It is best to put screens away an hour before bed. Reading a paper book helps more.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�312101380ffc�body��n1977年 Rogers 等人发现，当人们判断一条信息是否“与自己有关”时，大脑会以更深的自我参照方式编码它，复述与提取都更牢固，这被称为“自我参照效应”。后续脑成像显示内侧前额叶（与自我加工重叠的脑区）在此被显著激活，所以“和我有关”成了一种强大的记忆标签。�QIn 1977 Rogers and colleagues found that judging whether information is self-relevant leads the brain to encode it more deeply, making later recall more reliable - the self-reference effect. Neuroimaging shows the medial prefrontal cortex, a region tied to self-processing, is strongly engaged, so about me becomes a powerful memory tag.�ans��src�فRogers, Kuiper & Kirker (1977)《自我参照与个人信息编码》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 35(9):677-688٨Rogers, T.B., Kuiper, N.A. & Kirker, W.S. (1977). Self-reference and the encoding of personal information. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 35(9), 677-688.��id�320db7c9597d�body���人们往往高估自己的知识、能力和对未来预测的准确性，这称为过度自信偏差。部分原因是只想到支持自己的理由。在重要决策前多征询他人可减少偏差。��People tend to overestimate their knowledge, ability, and accuracy of predictions, called overconfidence bias. Partly it comes from thinking of only supportive reasons. Seeking others' input before big decisions reduces it.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�328d9f7040c2�body���愤怒管理先从生理降温（离开现场、慢呼吸、冷水敷脸）再处理认知；也可练习“我语句”表达需求而非指责。关键是给前额叶时间重新上线，而非当场争输赢。��Anger management first cools physiology (leave, slow breathing, cold water on face) then addresses thoughts; use 'I-statements' to state needs, not blame. The point is to let the prefrontal cortex come back online rather than win on the spot.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3302df2ead24�body�ٖ即视感是明明第一次经历却觉得“以前来过”的错觉，可能与大脑记忆系统短暂误匹配、把当下误标为熟悉有关。٭Déjà vu is the illusion of having already experienced a new situation, likely from a brief mismatch in the brain's memory system that wrongly tags the present as familiar.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�352ae1fe2fbf�body�ٟ本我追求本能快乐、遵循即时满足，超我代表道德理想，自我在两者间协调并面对现实。健康的人格需要三者相对平衡。��The id seeks instinctual pleasure on the principle of immediate gratification, the superego represents moral ideals, and the ego mediates between them while dealing with reality. A healthy personality needs relative balance among the three.�ans��src��!《人格心理学》（伯格）�Personality (Burger)��id�36cecdc3a4b9�body��	Iyengar 与 Lepper 发现，亚裔美国儿童在“自己挑任务”时动机并不比“妈妈帮挑”更高，而欧裔儿童则明显更高。这反映互依型自我中，选择的意义常与关系绑定；自由不是普世同款，而是被文化框定。�Iyengar and Lepper found Asian-American children were no more motivated when choosing their own task than when their mother chose, while European-American children were. In interdependent selves, choice is often framed through relationships; autonomy is culturally shaped, not universal.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�378c264f2be3�body�ِ正念是有意识、不评判地关注当下体验的练习，能降低压力、提升专注，常见形式包括呼吸觉察与身体扫描。٥Mindfulness is purposefully paying attention to the present without judgment, reducing stress and improving focus via practices like breath awareness and body scans.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�38adb1bf3fa6�body��b皮亚杰将儿童认知发展分为四个阶段：感知运动期（0-2岁，靠感官动作认识世界）、前运算期（2-7岁，以自我中心表象思维为主）、具体运算期（7-11岁，能逻辑但依赖具体事物）、形式运算期（11岁以上，可进行抽象假设推理）。各阶段有质的差异而非单纯知识增多。�bPiaget divided cognitive development into four stages: sensorimotor (0-2, knowing through senses and action), preoperational (2-7, egocentric representational thought), concrete operational (7-11, logical but tied to concrete things), and formal operational (11+, abstract hypothetical reasoning). Stages differ qualitatively, not just by more knowledge.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�38b356b5e28b�body��从众分规范性从众与信息性从众：前者为被接纳、避免排斥而附和群体，后者因相信群体更懂而接受其判断。两者都让人改变行为或看法，但动机不同。理解类型有助于区分“想合群”与“以为你对”。�Conformity splits into normative and informational: normative to be accepted and avoid rejection, informational to accept the group's view as more correct. Both change behavior or belief but for different motives. The types distinguish wanting to fit in from thinking the group is right.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3c67e73dff53�body���具身认知研究发现，身体洁净体验会降低道德严厉判断（洗去罪感），而想到不道德事会增加想清洁的冲动。说明道德概念部分建立在身体经验隐喻之上，而非纯抽象推理。��Embodied cognition finds physical cleanliness softens moral judgment (washing away guilt) and immoral thoughts raise the urge to clean. Moral concepts are partly built on bodily metaphors, not purely abstract reasoning.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3c84c4120a40�body�ٷ睡眠不足会削弱情绪调节能力，让人更容易烦躁、焦虑和情绪低落。连续熬夜还会降低注意力和判断力。保证规律睡眠是情绪稳定的基础。پLack of sleep weakens emotion regulation, making people more irritable, anxious, and low. Consecutive late nights also lower attention and judgment. Regular sleep is the base of stable mood.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3cb0e8d27e80�body���拖延通常不是懒惰，而是对困难或负面情绪的任务的回避，用短期轻松换取长期代价。它和情绪调节、完美主义更相关。把任务拆小、降低启动门槛能改善。��Procrastination is usually not laziness but avoidance of tasks linked to difficulty or negative feeling, trading short ease for long cost. It relates more to emotion regulation and perfectionism. Breaking tasks small and lowering startup friction helps.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3e11bd81e288�body���班杜拉提出，自我效能是对“我能完成某行为”的信心，常比能力更预测是否行动（如戒烟、运动）。高效能者在挫折中坚持，低效能者易放弃；小胜积累可提升它。��Bandura's self-efficacy is confidence 'I can do this behavior,' often predicting action (quitting, exercising) more than ability. High efficacy persists through setbacks, low gives up; small wins build it.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3e1580d47904�body�ٺ这叫乐观偏差，人们倾向于相信自己比他人更可能遇上好事、避开灾祸。它带来信心和动力，但也可能让人忽视风险防范。适度警惕更健康。��This is called optimism bias, the tendency to believe we are more likely than others to experience good and avoid bad outcomes. It brings confidence and drive but can also make people skip risk prevention. Moderate caution is healthier.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�3fbc42e66668�body��大五人格包括开放性（Openness）、尽责性（Conscientiousness）、外向性（Extraversion）、宜人性（Agreeableness）、神经质（Neuroticism），首字母合为 OCEAN。它是目前最被广泛验证的人格描述框架，用连续维度而非类型。پThe Big Five are Openness, Conscientiousness, Extraversion, Agreeableness, Neuroticism—OCEAN. It is the most validated descriptive framework, using continuous dimensions rather than types.�ans��src��Costa 与 McCrae�Costa & McCrae��id�405fc78145d7�body���缓慢的深呼吸能激活副交感神经系统，降低心率和血压，让身体从应激状态放松下来。它是一种随时可用的简单调节方法。配合数拍呼吸效果更好。��Slow deep breathing activates the parasympathetic nervous system, lowering heart rate and blood pressure and shifting the body out of a stressed state. It is a simple technique available anytime. Pairing it with counted breaths works even better.�ans��src�لLehrer, P. M. 与 Gevirtz, R. (2003). 《心率变异性生物反馈：它如何及为何有效？》. CNS Spectrums, 8(4), 282-291.ـLehrer, P. M., & Gevirtz, R. (2003). Heart rate variability biofeedback: How and why does it work? CNS Spectrums, 8(4), 282-291.��id�411bbad1c960�body�ٺ大量研究显示，善意行为会激活大脑的奖赏回路，带来短暂的愉悦和长期的幸福感提升。这被称为助人者的快乐效应。小到让座都可能有用。��Many studies show kind acts activate the brain's reward circuits, bringing brief pleasure and longer-term well-being gains. This is called the helper's happiness effect. Even small acts like giving up a seat can help.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�42a49be832bb�body���群体讨论常使成员的态度走向更极端，称为风险转移或群体极化，责任分散也降低了顾虑。这既能带来大胆创新，也可能导致冒进决策。团队决策时需警惕。��Group discussion often pushes members toward more extreme positions, called risk shift or group polarization, and shared responsibility lowers caution. This can yield bold innovation but also rash decisions. Teams should watch for it.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�430ccdff4d35�body���工作记忆是大脑临时存放并操作信息的系统，相当于心理上的“便签纸”，容量有限（约 4±1 个组块）。它不同于长期记忆：工作记忆负责当下正在使用的信息，而长期记忆负责持久存储。��Working memory is the brain's system for temporarily holding and manipulating information—a mental sticky note with limited capacity (about 4±1 chunks). Unlike long-term memory, it handles what you are using right now, not permanent storage.�ans��src��Baddeley 工作记忆模型�Baddeley's working memory model��id�4373db76098c�body���对蛇、蜘蛛、高度的恐惧有进化准备性：远古环境中这些是真实威胁，人类进化出快速习得该类恐惧的倾向。现代危险（电、车）出现太晚，尚未写进我们的“恐惧预设”。�␀Fear of snakes, spiders and heights is evolutionarily prepared: they were real threats in ancestral environments, so we evolved a readiness to learn such fears fast. Modern dangers (electricity, cars) appeared too recently to be baked into our fear priors.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4831362d1d19�body��克制情绪常被视为成熟与顾全大局；但压抑与重新评估不同：前者压抑表达，后者改变解读。研究显示长期表达抑制会升高生理唤醒、削弱积极社交，而认知重评更健康——关键在方式而非忍与否。�Restraint is often seen as maturity and concern for the whole; but suppression differs from reappraisal: one blocks expression, the other changes interpretation. Long-term expressive suppression raises arousal and weakens social bonding, while reappraisal is healthier.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4aae99b7dfa3�body�ٱ适度压力（良性应激）提升唤醒与专注、促成长；只有长期失控的压力才伤身。把压力当“资源”的人，生理反应更健康、表现更好。��Moderate stress (eustress) boosts arousal and focus and aids growth; only chronic uncontrollable stress harms. Those who view stress as a resource show healthier physiology and better performance.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4b8b690ab14e�body�ٟ梦可能源于睡眠中脑的随机神经活动被编成故事，也被认为有助于情绪调节、记忆整理与问题解决。确切功能仍在研究。��Dreams may arise from random neural activity woven into stories during sleep and are thought to aid emotion regulation, memory consolidation, and problem-solving. Their exact function is still studied.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4c8046dd3f65�body���研究显示，随着年龄增长，多数人变得更有尽责性、更情绪稳定和更宜人，尤其在成年期。重大生活事件也会带来变化。性格并非一生完全固定。��Studies show that with age most people become more conscientious, emotionally stable, and agreeable, especially through adulthood. Major life events also bring change. Personality is not wholly fixed for life.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4e688ef93d51�body�ٴ没有科学证据。大量跨文化研究未发现血型与性格特质存在可靠关联，这更多是一种流行文化信念。性格受基因、环境与经历共同塑造。��No scientific evidence exists. Large cross-cultural studies find no reliable link between blood type and personality traits; it is mostly a pop-culture belief. Personality is shaped by genes, environment and experience together.�ans��src�ٌCramer, K. M. 与 Imaike, E. (2002). 《血型与人格：对日本“血型人格论”的检验》. Psychological Reports, 90(1), 286-288.ٞCramer, K. M., & Imaike, E. (2002). Personality and blood type: A test of the Japanese "blood-type" personality theory. Psychological Reports, 90(1), 286-288.��id�52118dd8acf6�body�ٺ这是“感官着陆”：把注意力从脑内担忧拉回到此刻真实的看、听、触，打断焦虑的螺旋。它不消灭焦虑，而是先把你带回当下，再谈应对。��This is sensory grounding: it pulls attention from inner worry back to real sights, sounds and touch in the moment, breaking the anxiety spiral. It does not erase anxiety but first brings you back to now.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�58f40a9ee1cb�body���“先天”指基因和生物学因素，“后天”指环境和经历，两者共同塑造人的心理和行为。比如身高更多受基因影响，而语言则极度依赖后天学习。现代心理学认为几乎没有只由一方决定的特质。�'Nature' refers to genes and biology, while 'nurture' refers to environment and experience; both shape our mind and behavior. Height is more genetic, while language heavily depends on learning. Modern psychology holds that almost no trait is determined by only one side.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�59fd478018c0�body���留面子效应是先提一个会被拒绝的大请求，再退而求其次提较小请求，对方更易答应。因为对比之下小请求显得合理，且对方有回报妥协的互惠感。它常用于募捐与谈判中的让步策略。�The door-in-the-face technique makes a large request likely refused, then a smaller one that is more readily accepted. By contrast the small one seems reasonable, and the other feels reciprocal obligation to compromise. It is used in fundraising and negotiation concessions.�ans��src��bRobert Cialdini,《Influence: The Psychology of Persuasion》Harper Business;中译《影响力》�7R. B. Cialdini, Influence, Harper Business; Chinese ed.��id�59fdd4f57d72�body���首因效应指最先信息影响最大（形成第一印象），近因效应指最后信息最易被记住。在连续呈现时两者并存；理解它有助于意识到“顺序”本身就在塑造判断。��Primacy effect: first info weighs most (first impressions); recency effect: last info is easiest to recall. Both coexist in serial presentation; knowing this shows order itself shapes judgment.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5aa9b20219c3�body���缓慢深呼吸激活副交感神经系统，降低心率与皮质醇，打断交感过度唤醒的循环。它是少数能直接自上而下调节自主神经的反应之一，见效快且无需工具。��Slow deep breathing activates the parasympathetic system, lowering heart rate and cortisol and breaking the sympathetic over-arousal loop. It is one of the few ways to directly, top-down regulate the autonomic nervous system—fast and tool-free.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5b00ce42b5a7�body���社会懈怠指个人在群体中出力的意愿下降，因为贡献难以被单独评价，如拔河时每人比单独拉时用力小。它随群体变大而增强。明确个人责任与让任务有意义可抵消这种现象。��Social loafing is reduced effort in a group because individual contribution is hard to judge, like pulling less in a tug-of-war than alone. It grows with group size. Clear personal accountability and meaningful tasks counter it.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5b847957f02e�body���听喜欢的音乐可以降低压力激素、提升愉悦感，帮助放松或集中注意力。不同节奏的音乐对不同情绪状态有不同效果。它是一种便捷的日常调节工具。��Listening to favored music can lower stress hormones, boost pleasure, and help relaxation or focus. Different tempos affect different mood states in different ways. It is a convenient everyday regulation tool.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5cbc56106bd8�body���互惠规范指社会普遍期望“受人好处要回报”，使一次小帮助常引发后续回馈。它是合作与礼尚往来的基础，也被营销用来提升成交。违背互惠会让人感到不舒服甚至内疚。��The norm of reciprocity is the widespread expectation to return a favor, so a small help often triggers later payback. It underlies cooperation and gift exchange and is used in marketing to close sales. Violating it feels uneasy or guilty.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5ccbc045611e�body�٨没有科学证据显示梦能预知未发生的事。梦多是对记忆、情绪和当天碎片的重组，偶尔“像应验”多为巧合或事后的重新解读。ٺNo scientific evidence shows dreams foresee events. Dreams mostly recombine memory, emotion and the day's fragments, and apparent hits are coincidence or after-the-fact reinterpretation.�ans��src��9Hobson, J. A. (1988). 《做梦的大脑》. Basic Books.�6Hobson, J. A. (1988). The Dreaming Brain. Basic Books.��id�5e37997e55a1�body���当几个缺角的圆盘围成一圈，大脑会自动补全出白色三角形及其清晰边界，这叫主观轮廓。它说明知觉是大脑主动“填充”而非被动记录视网膜图像。��When notched disks surround a gap, the brain completes a white triangle with crisp borders—a subjective contour. Perception is the brain actively filling in, not passively recording the retinal image.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�60483334bd7c�body��人格在成年后相对稳定，但并非一成不变；重大生活事件、长期努力和心理咨询都可能带来缓慢改变。比如随着年龄增长，多数人变得更尽责、更情绪平稳。所以“江山易改”只是夸张，性格其实可以成长。�"Personality is fairly stable after adulthood but not fixed; major life events, sustained effort, and counseling can bring slow change. For example, with age most people become more conscientious and emotionally stable. So 'character never changes' is an exaggeration—personality can grow.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�60ed98973686�body�٫情绪唤醒会促使大脑释放肾上腺素和皮质醇，增强杏仁核与海马体的互动，从而把事件编码得更牢固。这叫“情绪性记忆增强”。��Emotional arousal releases adrenaline and cortisol, strengthening interaction between the amygdala and hippocampus so the event is encoded more firmly—a phenomenon called emotional enhancement of memory.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�61716c6735ce�body���儒家学而优则仕的传统、家庭对学业的高度投入，以及将成绩与家庭荣誉绑定的面子，共同放大了考试压力。研究显示，东亚青少年的学业焦虑常与怕让父母失望高度相关，而不只是个人竞争。�The Confucian tradition of advancement through study, heavy family investment in schooling, and tying grades to family face together amplify exam stress. Research shows East Asian teens' academic anxiety is strongly linked to fear of disappointing parents, not just personal competition.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�629969bcf8de�body���相关只说明两变量共变，可能 A→B、B→A，或被第三变量 C 同时驱动（如冰淇淋销量与溺水同升，因夏天）。要证因果需控制变量的实验或纵向设计。ٺCorrelation only shows co-variation—A→B, B→A, or both driven by C (ice cream and drowning rise together via summer). Causation needs controlled experiments or longitudinal designs.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�63369dfff1c1�body���是的，重复学习能强化记忆痕迹，让记忆更牢固。但机械重复效果有限，结合理解和间隔复习效果更好。分散的多次练习比一次性死记硬背更持久。�	Yes, repeated study strengthens memory traces and makes recollection more durable. But mechanical repetition has limited value; combining it with understanding and spaced review works better. Distributed practice across multiple sessions lasts longer than cramming.�ans��src�نCepeda, N. J. 等 (2006). 《言语回忆任务中的分散练习：综述与定量综合》. Psychological Bulletin, 132(3), 354-380.٘Cepeda, N. J., et al. (2006). Distributed practice in verbal recall tasks: A review and quantitative synthesis. Psychological Bulletin, 132(3), 354-380.��id�65d2ee5949b5�body���运动促进内啡肽、多巴胺与脑源性神经营养因子（BDNF），后者助海马体新生与抗压；还能降低应激激素。研究支持规律有氧与力量训练对中轻度抑郁焦虑有接近药物的效果，但需坚持数周。�Exercise boosts endorphins, dopamine and BDNF, which aids hippocampal growth and stress resistance, and lowers stress hormones. Trials support regular aerobic and resistance training having near-medication effects on mild-moderate depression and anxiety, but it takes weeks.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�677102e9f6d5�body��客体永久性是指理解“看不见的物体依然存在”的能力，是感知运动期的重要成就。在此之前，婴儿认为物体消失就不存在，所以会停止寻找。大约8-12个月婴儿开始在遮挡后主动寻找藏起的玩具，标志该能力出现。�5Object permanence is the understanding that things continue to exist even when out of sight, a key achievement of the sensorimotor stage. Before it, infants act as if a disappeared object ceases to exist and stop looking for it. Around 8-12 months they begin searching for a hidden toy, marking its emergence.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�6a8de525c7f7�body�ٟ没有可靠证据显示惯用左手与更高的智力和创造力相关。左撇子只是大脑偏侧化的一种自然变异，和天赋没有必然联系。٪No reliable evidence links left-handedness to higher intelligence or creativity. It is simply a natural variation in brain lateralization, not necessarily tied to talent.�ans��src��VAnnett, M. (2002). 《利手与大脑不对称性：右移理论》. Psychology Press.�\Annett, M. (2002). Handedness and Brain Asymmetry: The Right Shift Theory. Psychology Press.��id�6a9e1cefb096�body���分散学习（把学习分成多次）比临时抱佛脚更能形成长期记忆，因为每次提取都会加深记忆痕迹。这叫“间隔效应”。考试前突击虽然短期有效，但很快会忘。��Distributed practice—spacing study into several sessions—builds long-term memory better than cramming, because each retrieval strengthens the memory trace. This is called the 'spacing effect'. Cramming helps short-term but is quickly forgotten.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6cdf204feb3f�body���关系指建立在互惠义务与长期人情之上的社会联结网络，常超越单纯友谊，带有“欠人情—还人情”的隐性契约。心理学研究发现，强关系网络能提供支持，但也可能带来顺从压力与心理负担。��Guanxi refers to social ties built on reciprocal obligation and long-term renqing (favor); beyond friendship, it carries an implicit contract of owing and returning favors. Strong networks give support but can also create conformity pressure.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6d07b6bf32ef�body�ٴ大脑天生更留意问题（负面偏差），感恩练习会刻意训练注意力去捕捉积极细节。坚持几周，人对日常好事会更敏感，整体情绪也更稳。��The brain is wired to notice problems (negativity bias), and gratitude practice deliberately trains attention to catch positive details. After a few weeks people grow more sensitive to daily good things and steadier in mood.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6e324744b511�body���在许多东亚文化里，爱更多通过行动与付出表达——做饭、供读书、牺牲自己，而不是常说“我爱你”，因为直白的语言可能显得突兀或难为情。这并不代表爱得更少，而是源于一种以“做”而非“说”来体现关怀、看重克制与责任的文化模式。孩子往往从持续的支持中感受到这份爱，而非从言语里。��In many East Asian cultures love is expressed through action and provision—feeding, educating, sacrifice—rather than frequent verbal 'I love you,' which can feel overly direct or embarrassing. This doesn't mean less affection; it reflects a model where care is shown by doing, within norms that value restraint and duty. Children usually read the love through consistent support rather than words.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6e7e2ed3115b�body�ٽ给予让人感到与他人的连接和自己的价值，这种“被需要”的体验很难靠消费获得。一次小的分享或帮忙，就足以提醒自己“我对别人有用”。ٖGiving creates a sense of connection and personal value that consumption rarely matches. A small share or help reminds you that I am useful to others.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7018139a8868�body�ٽ情绪粒度低的人难以精确命名感受，更难匹配调节策略，也更易患焦虑、抑郁与冲动发泄。能细分“失望、委屈、嫉妒”更易找到对症的应对。��People with low emotional granularity struggle to name feelings precisely, match regulation strategies, and are more prone to anxiety, depression and impulsive outbursts. Distinguishing disappointment, grievance or envy helps pick the right response.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�70435547cf77�body�٥助人会激活与奖赏相关的脑区，并强化“我被需要、我有能力”的感受，也常带来一段真实连接。所以善意对双方都是滋养。ٜHelping activates reward-related brain regions and strengthens feeling needed and capable, often adding a real connection. So kindness nourishes both sides.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�714365d48201�body��5“享乐适应”（Brickman, Coates & Janoff-Bulman, 1978 对彩票赢家与事故受害者的研究）指人会对重大正负事件快速回到原有幸福基线。这意味着外在收获带来的快乐是暂时的，持续提升幸福感更靠习惯、关系与目标感，而非不断加码的奖赏。� Hedonic adaptation (Brickman, Coates & Janoff-Bulman, 1978, studying lottery winners and accident victims) means we quickly return to our baseline happiness after major good or bad events. Lasting well-being comes more from habits, relationships and purpose than from ever-bigger rewards.�ans��src�ٓBrickman, P., Coates, D. & Janoff-Bulman, R. (1978)《彩票赢家与事故受害者》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 36(8):917-927٘Brickman, P., Coates, D. & Janoff-Bulman, R. (1978). Lottery winners and accident victims. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 36(8), 917-927.��id�72a1f0607155�body���强版本（语言决定思维）已被否定，但弱版本有证据：语言提供的词汇和语法范畴会便利某些认知，比如有更细颜色词的人辨色更快。语言更像思维的“助推器”而非“牢笼”。�The strong version (language determines thought) is rejected, but a weak version has support: the words and grammar a language offers make some distinctions easier—e.g., speakers with finer color terms discriminate colors faster. Language nudges thought rather than imprisoning it.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�732cc01a3055�body���研究表明，手写笔记因为需要概括和筛选，往往比逐字打字更有利于理解和记忆。打字容易变成机械记录，削弱思考。听课或读书时适当手写效果更好。�Studies suggest that handwriting notes, which forces summarizing and selection, tends to aid understanding and memory more than verbatim typing. Typing easily becomes mechanical recording that weakens reflection. Writing by hand during lectures or reading often works better.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�74b413f58a31�body���刻板印象是对某群体成员过度简化、固定化的信念，如“某类人都会怎样”。它可帮大脑快速分类，却常以偏概全、忽略个体差异。刻板印象不等于歧视行为，但是偏见与歧视的认知基础。�$A stereotype is an oversimplified, fixed belief about members of a group, like people of a type all act a certain way. It helps the brain categorize fast but generalizes and ignores individual difference. It is not discrimination itself but the cognitive base of prejudice and discrimination.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7559dc6eed18�body�ٷ高度警觉时大脑以更高频率采样周围环境，主观上“记录”了更多瞬间，回忆时就觉得那段时间被拉长了。这多是回忆错觉而非真实变慢。��Under high arousal the brain samples the environment at a higher rate, so more moments are 'recorded'; recalling them makes the episode feel stretched. It's largely a memory illusion, not real slowdown.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�759184dba1c2�body�ٴ睡眠帮助身体修复、巩固白天的记忆，并清理大脑代谢废物。长期缺觉会损害注意力、情绪和免疫力，儿童和青少年尤其需要更多睡眠。��Sleep helps the body repair, consolidates the day's memories, and clears metabolic waste from the brain. Chronic sleep loss harms attention, mood, and immunity; children and teens need especially more sleep.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�76ca844e289f�body���“情绪表达规则”规定何时、对谁、以何种强度表达情绪。比如东亚文化更鼓励抑制负性表达以维持和谐，欧美文化更接受外露。同一情绪内在相似，表达却被文化训练塑形。�Display rules dictate when, to whom and how strongly to show emotion. East Asian cultures often encourage suppressing negative expression for harmony; Western cultures accept more openness. The inner feeling may be similar, but expression is culturally trained.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�777fcf70424b�body�ٽ一旦拥有了某物，我们给它的估价往往高于未拥有时，源于损失厌恶与所有权依恋。它解释了为何清仓、退换货和谈判中人们难以接受公平价。��Once we own something, we value it above what we would pay to acquire it, driven by loss aversion and ownership attachment. It explains why clearing clutter, returns and negotiations feel so hard at fair prices.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�77d903fe3cdd�body�٥“你总是”是绝对化标签，会让对方觉得被冤枉和定义，本能地想反驳。换成描述具体那一次的行为，争论更容易变成讨论。ٴYou always is an absolute label that makes the other feel falsely defined and instinctively defensive. Describing the specific behavior this time turns the fight into a discussion.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�78bb590048a9�body��\“决策疲劳”指随着当天决策数量累积，自我控制资源被消耗，后续选择更短视、更易受诱惑（Baumeister, 2007；Baumeister & Tierney, 2011）。法官假释裁决在饭后更宽、饿时更严的研究，正是这种“意志电量”随时间跌落的生动证据——尽管该资源模型近年也受到质疑。�XDecision fatigue means self-control resources drain as the day's decisions pile up, making later choices short-sighted and temptation-prone (Baumeister, 2007; Baumeister & Tierney, 2011). Judges granting parole more often after meals than when hungry illustrates this falling willpower battery - though the resource model itself is now debated.�ans��src��CBaumeister, R.F. & Tierney, J. (2011)《意志力》, Penguin Press�kBaumeister, R.F. & Tierney, J. (2011). Willpower: Rediscovering the Greatest Human Strength. Penguin Press.��id�7988fcaece13�body���受道家与佛教因缘观影响，东亚更易接受事有因果、不必强求的控制观，心理学称次级控制——调整自己以适应现实，比初级控制更被看重，这有助于在不可控压力下维持平和。�Influenced by Daoist and Buddhist views, East Asians more readily accept cause and effect rather than forcing outcomes; psychology calls this secondary control—adjusting oneself to reality—which is valued over primary control and helps maintain calm under uncontrollable stress.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7c58b61ff335�body���“你怎样”容易让对方竖起防线，而“我觉得、我需要”说的是自己的感受，不否定对方。同样的意思，换成第一人称，对方更可能接住而不是回击。��You-statements raise the other person's guard, while I feel, I need expresses your own experience without negating them. Same point in first person is more likely to be received than returned.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7d297a31f087�body���过度使用外在奖励可能挤出内在动机，让人把活动看成“为钱而做”，这称为过度辩护效应。尤其当奖励变成预期时更明显。保留自主感能保护兴趣。��Heavy use of external rewards can crowd out intrinsic motivation, making people see the activity as 'for the money,' called the overjustification effect. It is stronger when rewards become expected. Preserving a sense of autonomy protects interest.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7da4d04dab15�body�ٴ自律更多来自习惯、环境和目标设计，而非单纯“意志力”。减少诱惑、建立固定流程的人更容易坚持。把自律理解为情境管理更实用。��Self-discipline comes more from habits, environment, and goal design than sheer 'willpower.' Those who reduce temptations and build routines persist more easily. Seeing discipline as situation management is more useful.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7eb55a84bf26�body���当注意力集中在某任务时，即便明显刺激出现在视野中也可能被完全忽略，经典实验是数传球时看不见穿大猩猩服的人。它揭示注意是有限资源，看不见不等于没“看到”视网膜。�When attention is locked on a task, even obvious stimuli in view can be wholly missed—the classic demo is failing to notice a gorilla-suited person while counting passes. It shows attention is a limited resource; not perceiving is not the same as not hitting the retina.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�81151a80709f�body���面对威胁时，交感神经系统与肾上腺素让心跳加快、肌肉供血增加、注意力聚焦，为应对或逃离做准备。这是进化的生存机制，短期有用，长期频繁激活则伤身。��Facing threat, the sympathetic nervous system and adrenaline speed the heart, send blood to muscles, and narrow attention to prepare fight or flight. An evolutionary survival mechanism—useful short-term, harmful if chronically activated.�ans��src��Cannon 应激理论�Cannon's stress theory��id�825dd2b54682�body���晕轮效应指对某人一个正面特质（如长相好看）的好印象，会“溢出”到对其能力、品格等其他方面的评价。它让我们以偏概全，形成整体光环。招聘与教学评分中它都可能悄悄扭曲判断。��The halo effect is that a good impression of one trait, like attractiveness, spills over to judgments of ability or character. It makes us generalize from a part to a glowing whole. It can quietly bias hiring and teaching ratings.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�842b26b11783�body�ٱ从底层到顶层依次是：生理需求、安全需求、归属与爱的需求、尊重需求、自我实现需求。低层满足后，人会更追求高层的精神成长。٩From bottom to top: physiological, safety, love and belonging, esteem, and self-actualization needs. Once lower needs are met, people pursue higher psychological growth.�ans��src��!《人格心理学》（伯格）�Personality (Burger)��id�84ed039a5715�body���认知是指人脑接收、加工、存储和使用信息的过程，包括注意、记忆、语言、推理和解决问题等。它帮助我们理解世界并做出适当的反应。认知心理学研究这些心理过程是如何运作的。�&Cognition refers to the mental processes of receiving, processing, storing, and using information, including attention, memory, language, reasoning, and problem solving. It helps us make sense of the world and respond appropriately. Cognitive psychology studies how these mental processes work.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�86bb676f2685�body�ٮ明确的目标给行动提供方向和可衡量的标准，让人更容易坚持。把大目标拆成小步骤还能减少畏难。目标具体且可达成时效果最好。ٯClear goals give direction and measurable standards, making persistence easier. Breaking big goals into steps also reduces dread. Goals work best when specific and achievable.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�87c1abba805d�body���双过程理论把思维分为快速、自动、省力的系统1（直觉）与缓慢、可控、费力的系统2（理性）。我们多数日常判断靠系统1，省力但易偏；系统2负责核查与深思。��Dual-process theory splits thinking into fast, automatic, effortless System 1 (intuition) and slow, controlled, effortful System 2 (reason). Most daily judgments use System 1—efficient but biased; System 2 checks and deliberates.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�896a7e5c9228�body�ٮ安慰剂效应指仅因相信治疗会有效（如服用无药效的糖丸）而出现真实症状改善的现象。它说明心理期待能影响身体的感受与恢复。��The placebo effect is a real improvement in symptoms caused merely by believing a treatment works, such as taking a sugar pill. It shows that psychological expectation can influence bodily sensation and recovery.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8980a73d5086�body���从众是个体在群体压力下改变行为或看法以与多数人一致。它既可能出于想被接纳，也可能因为相信群体更正确。适度从众有助于融入，过度则丧失独立判断。��Conformity is changing behavior or opinion to match the majority under group pressure. It may stem from wanting acceptance or from believing the group is more correct. Some conformity aids belonging; too much costs independent judgment.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8abeaf2de408�body��洛伦兹发现幼鹅会在出生后的关键窗口紧跟它最先看到的活动对象，哪怕那是人而非母鹅，这叫印刻。它是一种快速、单向且难以逆转的早期依恋式学习。印刻说明某些行为有严格的时间敏感期。�Lorenz found that goslings follow the first moving object they see after hatching, even a human, a process called imprinting. It is rapid, one-way, and hard-to-reverse early attachment-like learning. Imprinting shows some behaviors have strict time-sensitive periods.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�8ae251909c2a�body���斯特鲁普效应指当字词义与它的印刷颜色冲突时（如用红字写“绿”），人读出颜色会变慢且易出错。它说明自动化的阅读过程会干扰需要控制的颜色命名。该范式常用来测量注意的控制能力。�1The Stroop effect is that when a word's meaning conflicts with its ink color, such as the word green printed in red, naming the color becomes slower and error-prone. It shows that automatic reading interferes with the controlled task of color naming. The task is often used to measure attentional control.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8c20c80600b3�body���打鼾不一定代表睡得好，它常是气道不畅的信号，严重时可能是睡眠呼吸暂停，反而导致缺氧和白天困倦。若鼾声很大并伴有憋气，应就医检查。��Snoring does not necessarily mean good sleep; it often signals airway obstruction and, when severe, may be sleep apnea that causes oxygen loss and daytime drowsiness. Loud snoring with breath-holding warrants a medical check.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8df482aef3a0�body���“似曾相识”是突然觉得眼前场景曾经经历过的错觉，其实并没有。可能的原因包括大脑记忆系统短暂“误匹配”，把新信息错当成旧记忆。大多数人体验过，通常无害。�'Déjà vu' is a sudden feeling that a new scene has been experienced before, though it has not. A possible cause is a brief 'mismatch' in the brain's memory system, treating new information as old memory. Most people experience it and it is usually harmless.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�963ae322e561�body��/面子是社会学家戈夫曼提出的“社会形象管理”概念；在更看重他人评价与关系和谐的文化里，公开出丑的代价更高，因此保全面子会强烈驱动行为。跨文化研究显示，东亚被试在可能丢脸的情境下更回避风险、更在意他人眼光。�Face is sociologist Goffman's idea of managing one's public social image; in cultures that weigh others' views and harmony more, public embarrassment is costlier, so protecting face strongly drives behavior. Cross-cultural studies find East Asians avoid risk more when face is at stake.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9751803521e9�body��S“情境依赖记忆”指提取时的物理环境若与编码时一致，记忆会被线索“唤醒”（Godden & Baddeley, 1975 的潜水员实验）。同样，“状态依赖”指学习时的情绪或生理状态（如轻醉、低潮）与回忆时匹配也会提升提取，说明记忆是被环境和身体共同“打包”的。�;Context-dependent memory means recall improves when the physical setting at retrieval matches encoding - shown in Godden and Baddeley's (1975) diver study. Likewise state-dependent memory improves when mood or physiology (even mild intoxication) at recall matches learning, so memory is bundled with body and place.�ans��src�فGodden, D.R. & Baddeley, A.D. (1975)《两种自然环境中的情境依赖记忆》, British Journal of Psychology 66(3):325-331يGodden, D.R. & Baddeley, A.D. (1975). Context-dependent memory in two natural environments. British Journal of Psychology, 66(3), 325-331.��id�9abb3dbab016�body�ٙ这是“空想性视错觉”，人类大脑进化出对人脸高度敏感的检测机制，宁可误报也不漏报，于是把随机图案当成脸。ٛThis is pareidolia—our brains evolved a hypersensitive face-detection system that prefers false alarms over misses, so random patterns get read as faces.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�9b26a55de3d2�body��每个人的大脑都会根据过去的经验、情绪和知识来理解信息，所以对同一件事的解读会不一样。这叫做“图式”——我们脑中已有的框架会影响我们看世界的方式。理解这一点能让我们更包容彼此的差异。�0Each person's brain interprets information based on their past experiences, emotions, and knowledge, so people understand the same event differently. This is called a 'schema'—the mental frameworks we already have shape how we see the world. Understanding this helps us be more tolerant of differences.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9f896da2ac36�body���这就是锚定效应：先出现的不相关数字会成为后续判断的参照点，人们调整不足。即便明知数字随意，报价仍会把对方拉向自己一侧，所以谈判开局要慎给锚。��This is anchoring: an initially presented irrelevant number becomes a reference point and people adjust insufficiently. Even knowing the number was random, offers pull the other side toward it, so openings should set anchors carefully.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�a08845a1101a�body���自我服务偏差指人把成功归于自己能力、把失败推给外部因素，以维护自尊。考试好是“我聪明”，考差是“题目偏”。它普遍存在于健康人群，适度有益自信，过度则阻碍反省。�The self-serving bias is crediting success to oneself and blaming failure on outside factors, to protect self-esteem. A good grade is my smarts, a bad one is the unfair test. Common in healthy people, it helps confidence in moderation but blocks reflection in excess.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a2e0441ce46e�body�٨大任务显得困难又遥远，会触发回避；拆成五分钟就能动手的小步，启动成本骤降。一旦开始，行动本身会推动你继续做下去。��A big task feels hard and distant, triggering avoidance; cut it into steps you can start in five minutes and the cost of starting drops sharply. Once you begin, the action itself carries you forward.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a3c54e48a307�body���锚定效应指人在估计时会过度依赖最先接触到的数字（锚），后续判断围绕它上下调整。例如先看到高价的商品，再看到中等价会觉便宜。即使锚本身是随机无关的数字，也会暗中拉偏判断。�The anchoring effect is that people rely too heavily on the first number they see (the anchor) when estimating, then adjust up or down from it. For example, seeing an expensive item first makes a mid-price item seem cheap. Even a random, irrelevant anchor can silently bias the judgment.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�a48121da8a24�body���不是。情感共情是感受他人情绪（被对方感染），认知共情是理解他人视角（知道对方怎么想）。二者神经基础不同，且可分离——有人很会读人却无动于衷，也有人易伤感却读不懂人。�No. Affective empathy is feeling what others feel (emotional contagion); cognitive empathy is understanding their perspective (knowing what they think). They have different neural bases and can dissociate—some read people well but feel little, others feel easily yet misread.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a50d12d96df2�body���暴露疗法让人在安全环境下逐步接触害怕的对象或记忆，反复经验后大脑学会“没危险”，恐惧反应自然消退（习惯化与消退学习）。它是治疗恐惧症、创伤的有效方法之一。��Exposure therapy gradually and safely contacts the feared object or memory; repeated experience teaches the brain 'no danger', and fear responses fade via habituation and extinction learning. It is an effective treatment for phobias and trauma.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�a644eee87b0f�body���不评判不是不分对错，而是先如实看见体验、再决定如何反应，避免一上来就贴好坏标签引发对抗或回避。对情绪尤其有用：先承认我在焦虑，往往比急着别焦虑更能平复。��Non-judging is not about right or wrong but seeing experience as it is before reacting, avoiding good/bad labels that spark struggle or avoidance. For emotions it helps: admitting I am anxious often calms more than demanding don't be anxious.�ans��src��{Goyal 等（2014）《JAMA Internal Medicine》冥想项目系统综述；Kabat-Zinn《Full Catastrophe Living》（1990）كGoyal et al. (2014), JAMA Internal Medicine, systematic review of meditation programmes; Kabat-Zinn, Full Catastrophe Living (1990)��id�a683d7d7d42e�body���大多数人记不清三四岁以前的事，这被称为婴儿期遗忘。幼儿的自我意识和语言能力尚未成熟，难以形成可语言化的长期记忆。这是正常的发展现象。�
Most people cannot recall events before about age three or four, a pattern called childhood amnesia. Young children's sense of self and language skills are not yet mature enough to form verbally accessible long-term memories. It is a normal developmental phenomenon.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a812d22de78a�body���确认偏误指人们倾向于寻找、解读和记住支持自己已有观点的信息，而忽略相反证据。它是人类最普遍、最顽固的认知偏差之一，会强化既有信念。��Confirmation bias is the tendency to seek, interpret, and recall information that supports existing beliefs while ignoring contrary evidence. It is among the most pervasive cognitive biases and reinforces convictions.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�aa0f33e4ed0e�body��最重要的是耐心倾听、不急于说教或否定对方的感受，让他感到被理解。可以鼓励对方保持作息、运动和联系专业人士，但不要替他做决定。如果对方有自伤念头，务必尽快联系可信赖的成人或心理援助热线。�6The most important thing is to listen patiently without lecturing or dismissing their feelings, so they feel understood. Encourage routines, exercise, and contacting professionals, but don't make decisions for them. If there are thoughts of self-harm, reach a trusted adult or a mental health hotline promptly.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ab552f5e3929�body���抑郁症的核心包括持续两周以上的情绪低落和对既往喜好的兴趣丧失（快感缺失），并常伴睡眠、食欲、精力与注意力改变。它不是简单的“心情不好”，而是一种需要专业帮助的疾病。��Depression centers on a depressed mood and loss of interest or pleasure (anhedonia) lasting more than two weeks, often with changes in sleep, appetite, energy, and concentration. It is not mere sadness but a condition that warrants professional help.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�ac1eee55dc33�body�ٺ睡眠，尤其是深睡眠和快速眼动睡眠，帮助大脑巩固白天的记忆。缺乏睡眠会让学习和回忆都变困难。保证充足睡眠是提升记忆的简单方法。��Sleep, especially deep and REM sleep, helps the brain consolidate memories formed during the day. Lack of sleep makes both learning and recall harder. Getting enough sleep is a simple way to improve memory.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ad7875eb8b1e�body�ٺ第一印象形成快且持久，会作为后续判断的框架，这被称为首因效应。人们往往很难摆脱最初形成的看法。初次见面时的礼貌与得体很关键。��First impressions form quickly and last long, serving as a framework for later judgment, known as the primacy effect. People find it hard to shed initially formed views. Politeness and poise at first meeting matter.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ae3c866bb0fc�body���“客气”是中国人用来表达尊重、避免给对方添麻烦的礼貌惯例——通过推让、谦辞来维持和谐、照顾双方面子。它不等于真正的拒绝：第一次推辞往往只是礼数，真正的拒绝通常会有更明确、反复的表态或解释。要区分“客套”与“真拒”，需结合语境、语气以及对方后来的实际行为来判断。��'Kèqi' is a Chinese politeness routine that signals respect and avoids imposing—offering, declining, and deferring to keep social harmony and save face. It is not a real refusal: a first decline may be mere ritual, and genuine refusal usually comes with clearer, repeated signals or an explanation. Telling formality from a true no requires reading context, tone, and the person's later behavior.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b1617b23afbf�body���显著刺激（突然亮起、移动、声音）会由自下而上的显著网络自动触发注意捕获，即使你努力不去看。它是进化留下的警报机制，但也让通知和广告轻易劫持注意。��Salient stimuli (a sudden flash, motion, sound) automatically trigger attentional capture via the bottom-up salience network, even when you try to ignore them. It is an evolutionary alarm, but also why notifications and ads hijack attention.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b20192a7ae27�body�ّREM 是睡眠中眼球快速转动、脑波接近清醒但身体麻痹的阶段，多数生动梦境发生在此，对记忆与情绪很重要。ٜREM is the sleep stage with rapid eye movement and wake-like brainwaves but paralyzed body; most vivid dreams occur here and it's vital for memory and mood.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b3757dd43eab�body��陌生人焦虑多在6-9个月出现，婴儿对不熟悉的脸表现出紧张或哭泣。它通常与客体永久性和面孔辨识能力提升同时发生，说明孩子已能区分“熟悉”与“陌生”。这是正常发展的信号，而非性格胆怯。��Stranger anxiety usually appears around 6-9 months, with distress at unfamiliar faces. It co-occurs with object permanence and face discrimination, showing the infant can tell familiar from strange. It is a sign of normal development, not shyness.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�b43cd8b1a806�body���夸聪明把孩子绑在“证明自己聪明”上，一遇困难就怕露怯；夸努力则把成功归因为可控制的行为，失败只是“还没学会”。这更接近成长型思维。ٷPraising smart ties a child to proving intelligence and fearing failure; praising effort credits controllable behavior, so failure is just not learned yet. This fits a growth mindset.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�b599b2322dd8�body�ٴ内在动机来自活动本身的乐趣，外在动机来自奖励或避免惩罚。内在动机往往更持久、更能带来满足感。了解自己“为什么做”很重要。��Intrinsic motivation comes from the activity's own enjoyment; extrinsic motivation comes from rewards or avoiding punishment. Intrinsic drive is often more lasting and satisfying. Knowing your 'why' matters.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b60611722344�body���人倾向于维持当前选项，哪怕替代方案更优，因为改变带来决策成本、损失厌恶与禀赋感。它体现在默认选项被大量选中的现象，也常被用于器官捐献等公共政策设计。��People favor the current option even when alternatives are better, due to decision costs, loss aversion and a sense of ownership. It appears as massive uptake of default choices and is used in policy design like organ-donation enrollment.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�b6f9dfef0383�body��M费斯廷格的社会比较理论（Festinger, 1954）认为人有一种评估自己观点与能力的驱力，当缺乏客观标准时就拿别人当尺子。上行比较（和更好的人比）常激励也常挫伤，下行比较（和更差的人比）则能保护自尊，于是“比”既是校准也是情绪调节的工具。�TFestinger's social comparison theory (1954) says we have a drive to evaluate our opinions and abilities, and when no objective yardstick exists we use other people. Upward comparison with better others can motivate or wound, while downward comparison with worse others protects self-esteem, so comparing both calibrates us and manages mood.�ans��src��PFestinger, L. (1954)《社会比较过程理论》, Human Relations 7(2):117-140�^Festinger, L. (1954). A theory of social comparison processes. Human Relations, 7(2), 117-140.��id�b91337663043�body���中庸不是平庸或没有立场，而是儒家提倡的在极端之间把握恰当分寸、因时因地制宜的智慧。研究辩证思维的学者发现，东亚文化更接受矛盾共存而非非黑即白，这会影响情绪调节与决策方式。�&Zhongyong is not mediocrity or spinelessness; it is a Confucian ideal of finding the fitting middle course between extremes, adapted to context. Research on dialectical thinking finds East Asian cultures more comfortably hold contradictory ideas, shaping emotion regulation and decision-making.�ans��src��ePeng, K. & Nisbett, R.E. (1999)《文化、辩证法与推理》, American Psychologist 54(9):741-754�kPeng, K. & Nisbett, R.E. (1999). Culture, dialectics, and reasoning. American Psychologist, 54(9), 741-754.��id�ba8b6c85c1ca�body��权威型教养既高要求又高回应：设定清晰规则与期望，同时温暖、倾听并解释理由。研究普遍把它与儿童更好的自律、学业和社交结果相联系。它与专断型（高要求低回应）和放任型（低要求高回应）不同。�+Authoritative parenting is both demanding and responsive: clear rules and expectations plus warmth, listening, and explaining reasons. Research links it to better self-discipline, school, and social outcomes. It differs from authoritarian (demanding, cold) and permissive (undemanding, warm) styles.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�bb2ab9e2f132�body�٨结果目标（赢）多不受控、易焦虑；过程目标（动作、节奏）可控、稳注意。顶尖选手常以过程目标锚定当下，结果随之而来。ٻOutcome goals (winning) are uncontrollable and anxiety-provoking; process goals (form, pace) are controllable and steady. Top athletes anchor the present in process goals; results follow.�ans��src���Bird, Swann, Jackman,《The what, why, and how of goal setting: A review of the goal-setting process in applied sport psychology practice》,Journal of Applied Sport Psychology,2024 (DOI: 10.1080/10413200.2023.2185699)��Bird, Swann, Jackman, 'The what, why, and how of goal setting: A review of the goal-setting process in applied sport psychology practice', Journal of Applied Sport Psychology, 2024, DOI: 10.1080/10413200.2023.2185699��id�bb96504349c4�body��门面效应是先提一个小请求让人答应，再提更大的相关请求，成功率会提高。因为人一旦答应小请求，会调整自我形象为“乐于合作者”，从而更可能答应后续。它与留面子效应（先大后小）方向相反。��The foot-in-the-door technique first asks a small yes, then a larger related request with higher success. Agreeing small shifts self-image to helpful cooperator, aiding the next yes. It is the reverse of door-in-the-face (big then small).�ans��src��bRobert Cialdini,《Influence: The Psychology of Persuasion》Harper Business;中译《影响力》�7R. B. Cialdini, Influence, Harper Business; Chinese ed.��id�bd23b5a291ec�body��e“舌尖现象”发生在记忆被部分提取时——你清楚这个词存在、能感到它的“轮廓”（首字母、音节数、含义），却一时取不出准确读音。这是提取失败而非存储丢失：概念还在，只是语音通路暂时被阻断，往往靠一点线索或等待就能想起来。名字和生僻词最容易出现。�tThe tip-of-tongue state happens when a memory is partially retrieved—you know the word exists and feel its 'shape' (first letter, syllables, meaning) but can't access the exact sound. It's a retrieval failure, not storage loss: the concept is there, but the phonological link is temporarily blocked, often resolved by a cue or time. It's common for names and rare words.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c2a9ff4212b2�body���不能。催眠不是“失去意志”，被催眠者仍保留判断力，会拒绝违背价值观的要求，也不会吐露真不想说的秘密。它更接近高度专注的合作状态。ٺNo. Hypnosis is not loss of will; the person keeps judgment, refuses acts against values and will not reveal secrets they mean to keep. It is closer to a cooperative state of deep focus.�ans��src�ٕOrne, M. T. (1971). 《催眠的模拟：为何、如何及其意义》. International Journal of Clinical and Experimental Hypnosis, 19(4), 183-239.ٙOrne, M. T. (1971). The simulation of hypnosis: Why, how, and what it means. International Journal of Clinical and Experimental Hypnosis, 19(4), 183-239.��id�c3b504a6cf79�body�ٽ恐惧症是对特定事物或情境（如高处、蜘蛛、社交）产生的强烈、非理性且持久的恐惧，会引发回避行为并影响生活。它属于焦虑障碍的一种。��A phobia is an intense, irrational, and persistent fear of a specific object or situation—such as heights, spiders, or social settings—that causes avoidance and disrupts life. It is a type of anxiety disorder.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�c8e283c00218�body���运动能促使大脑释放内啡肽、多巴胺等让人愉悦的化学物质，并降低压力激素。所以跑完步或做完操常会觉得轻松、开心。规律的身体活动还能帮助改善长期情绪。�Exercise prompts the brain to release feel-good chemicals like endorphins and dopamine and lowers stress hormones. That is why a run or workout often leaves people feeling relaxed and happy. Regular physical activity also helps improve mood over the long term.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c90c5b122839�body���光照抑制褪黑素、提升血清素，并帮助调节昼夜节律与维生素 D；季节性情绪失调常与冬季光照不足有关，光照疗法是其循证手段之一。每天户外走走比隔着玻璃更有效。��Light suppresses melatonin and raises serotonin, helping circadian rhythm and vitamin D; seasonal affective disorder often tracks low winter light, and light therapy is evidence-based. A daily outdoor walk beats glass-filtered light.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ca1fff82f250�body���学习是经验引起行为或知识相对持久改变的过程，不只是上学读书。它可以通过练习、观察甚至被提醒而发生。人和动物都能学习，这是适应环境的核心能力。��Learning is a relatively lasting change in behavior or knowledge caused by experience, not just schooling. It can happen through practice, observation, or being reminded. Both humans and animals learn, and it is core to adapting to the environment.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（学习章）�0Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), learning chapter��id�cb536af5007b�body���情绪是人对事物产生的短暂而强烈的心理和生理反应，比如高兴、害怕、生气。它通常包含感受、身体变化和想做的行为三部分。情绪帮助我们快速判断环境是否安全、是否值得接近。�An emotion is a brief but intense psychological and physiological response to something, such as happiness, fear, or anger. It usually includes a feeling, bodily changes, and an action urge. Emotions help us quickly judge whether a situation is safe or worth approaching.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cc159adaa763�body��P过年回家交织着对归属与家庭责任的深切渴望，以及拥挤旅途、亲戚盘问、旧日角色冲突带来的压力。心理学把它看作“矛盾心理”——趋近与回避同时存在，源于理想化团圆与现实家庭期待之间的落差。人们既渴望团聚的联结，又害怕随之而来的摩擦。��Going home for Spring Festival mixes the deep pull of belonging and family duty with the stress of crowded travel, probing relatives, and old role conflicts. Psychologists frame it as ambivalence—simultaneous approach and avoidance—driven by the gap between the idealized reunion and the real pressures of family expectation. People both crave the connection and dread the friction it brings.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cc7c215c0230�body���朋友给陪伴与安慰，咨询师受过系统训练、保持中立与保密，用循证方法帮你理清模式而非只听故事。两者互补，专业帮助不等于“朋友不够好”。��Friends give company and comfort; a counselor is trained, neutral and bound by confidentiality, using evidence-based methods to map patterns not just hear stories. They complement each other, and professional help is not a verdict on friendship.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�d055a7400460�body��>米歇尔的延迟满足实验让幼儿选择立刻吃一颗糖或等一会儿得两颗，以测量自我控制。后续追踪曾显示能等待的孩子日后表现更好，但近年研究发现该相关很大程度受家庭环境与信任影响。它说明延迟满足既是能力，也受情境与安全感塑造。�:Mischel's delay-of-gratification task let children take one treat now or wait for two, measuring self-control. Follow-ups once linked waiting with later success, but recent work shows the correlation is largely shaped by family environment and trust. Delay is both a capacity and a product of context and security.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�d10e57269453�body�٧短暂的午睡（20分钟左右）能恢复精力、提升下午的注意力和情绪。过长或过晚的午睡可能影响夜间睡眠。是否午睡因人而异。ٮA short nap of about 20 minutes restores energy and boosts afternoon attention and mood. Too long or too late a nap can hurt nighttime sleep. Whether to nap varies by person.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d18399ddc0f2�body��约18-24个月，幼儿开始把两三个词连成句，却省略虚词，只留关键信息，如“妈妈抱”“要车”，像电报一样。它显示孩子已掌握词序与基本语法关系，只是表达尚简。这是从单词句到完整句的过渡。�Around 18-24 months, toddlers combine two or three words but drop function words, keeping only key content, like mommy hug or want car, like a telegram. It shows they grasp word order and basic grammar though expression is sparse. It is the bridge from single words to full sentences.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�d1fbc9ba2603�body���情绪调节是人们管理自己情绪强度和持续时间的过程，比如让愤怒平息或让悲伤缓解。它既可以是无意识的，也可以是有意识练习的。良好的调节能力有助于人际关系和心理健康。��Emotion regulation is the process of managing the intensity and duration of one's emotions, such as calming anger or easing sadness. It can be automatic or a consciously practiced skill. Good regulation supports relationships and mental health.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dacbe5c25d0d�body��_这叫“心理生理性失眠”：越是努力入睡，认知和身体唤醒就越高（注意力集中、肌肉紧绷、思绪翻涌），而这恰恰与入睡所需的平静相反。努力本身制造了对睡眠的“表现焦虑”，让神经系统保持警觉。破解之道是放下挣扎——起身放松，让睡眠被动地自然到来。�jThis is psychophysiological insomnia: trying hard to sleep raises cognitive and physical arousal (attention, muscle tension, racing thoughts), the opposite of the calm needed to fall asleep. The effort creates performance anxiety about sleep itself, keeping the nervous system alert. The fix is to drop the struggle—get up, relax, and let sleep come passively.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�daf7fa7953a2�body���当情绪持续数周、影响睡眠、工作、关系，或出现自伤念头，说明超出自助范围，应寻求心理咨询或医疗评估。求助是能力而非软弱，越早越好。��When mood lasts weeks and hits sleep, work or relationships, or self-harm thoughts appear, it exceeds self-help; seek counseling or medical assessment. Asking for help is capacity not weakness, and earlier is better.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�db1ec74666f4�body�٢慢而长的呼气激活副交感神经、降低心率，反向告诉大脑安全了。它是连接身体与情绪的快捷开关，4–6 秒呼气尤其有效。ٿSlow long exhales activate the parasympathetic nervous system and lower heart rate, signaling safety to the brain. It is a fast body-emotion switch; 4–6 second exhales work especially well.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dd8c0726ee36�body���月亮错觉中，地平线处的月亮被树木、建筑等参照物对比显得大，而高空无参照。实际角直径几乎不变，大脑对距离与大小的估计被语境“骗”了。��In the moon illusion, a horizon moon looks larger against trees and buildings, while the high moon has no reference. Its angular size is nearly constant; the brain's size-distance estimate is fooled by context.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�df8a2eaefd72�body���是的。执行功能三大核心：抑制（挡住冲动与分心）、工作记忆更新（在脑中保持并操作信息）、认知灵活性（在任务间切换）。它们由前额叶主导，是计划、自控与适应新情况的底层能力。�Yes. The three core executive functions are inhibition (blocking impulses/distraction), working-memory updating (holding and manipulating info), and cognitive flexibility (shifting between tasks). Prefrontal-driven, they underpin planning, self-control and adapting to novelty.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dfc8bcdec373�body�ٸ夸“聪明”易让孩子怕失败、回避挑战（固定型）；夸“努力/策略”鼓励坚持与投入（成长型）。关键是表扬具体过程，而非天赋或结果。ٽPraising 'smart' makes kids fear failure and avoid challenge (fixed); praising effort/strategy encourages persistence (growth). Key is to praise the specific process, not talent or outcome.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�e22d35ef5e89�body���人格是一个人相对稳定、独特的思维、情绪和行为模式，让我们在不同情境下都表现出“自己”。它受到基因和成长环境的共同影响。了解人格有助于理解和接纳彼此的不同。��Personality is a person's relatively stable, unique patterns of thinking, feeling, and behaving that make them 'themselves' across situations. It is shaped by both genes and upbringing. Understanding personality helps us accept each other's differences.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e29395c3a101�body�ٓ拖延常源于大脑对即时愉悦的偏好超过未来收益（延迟折扣），以及任务引发的焦虑让人回避，并非单纯懒惰。ٝProcrastination often stems from the brain favoring immediate pleasure over future rewards (delay discounting) and from anxiety-avoidance, not mere laziness.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�e611cc1cb0c4�body���霍尔提出：高语境文化大量信息藏在关系与情境里，说话含蓄、重言外之意；低语境文化信息主要靠字面。这能解释为何东亚沟通更重默契与留面子，也更容易因没说破产生误解。�)Hall proposed that high-context cultures bury much meaning in relationships and situation, speaking implicitly; low-context cultures rely on literal words. This explains why East Asian communication prizes tacit understanding and face, but also breeds misunderstanding when things are left unsaid.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e6f22f7140b9�body�٥嗅觉通路直接连接处理情绪与记忆的杏仁核和海马体，绕过很多中间环节，所以气味唤起的记忆往往格外生动且带情绪色彩。٧The olfactory pathway connects directly to the amygdala and hippocampus, bypassing many relay steps, so smell-evoked memories tend to be vivid and emotionally charged.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�e736ea8193f4�body�ٱ相似性带来认同感和可预测性，让人更轻松和安心，这被称为同质性吸引。共同兴趣也更容易发展成友谊。这是人际吸引的常见规律。��Similarity brings a sense of validation and predictability that makes interactions easier and safer, known as homophily in attraction. Shared interests also grow into friendship more easily. It is a common rule of interpersonal attraction.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e8bc1f83c9fb�body�ٷ大量研究把亲密关系排在幸福感因素的前列：被理解和陪伴能满足人最根本的连接需要。比起更多物质，一段专注相处的时光往往更值钱。��Many studies rank close relationships near the top of happiness factors: feeling understood and accompanied meets the core need to connect. Over more stuff, a stretch of focused time together is often worth more.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�e8f0244b3364�body�ٷ缺觉会削弱前额叶的执行功能，并让大脑出现短暂微睡眠式注意力中断。反应变慢、易分心、错误率上升，相当于轻度醉酒对认知的影响。��Sleep loss weakens prefrontal executive function and triggers brief microsleep-like attention lapses. Reactions slow, distractibility rises, error rates climb—cognitively akin to mild intoxication.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e919b7e7b11c�body��<大五人格用五个维度描述个体差异：开放性（Openness）、尽责性（Conscientiousness）、外倾性（Extraversion）、宜人性（Agreeableness）与神经质（Neuroticism），可记为 OCEAN。每个维度是连续谱系而非非此即彼。它是当今最广泛接受的人格描述框架。�The Big Five describes individual differences on five dimensions: Openness, Conscientiousness, Extraversion, Agreeableness, and Neuroticism, remembered as OCEAN. Each is a continuum, not either-or. It is the most widely accepted framework for describing personality today.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ecccd8cc5e35�body�ٷ对许多人来说，哭泣能释放压力并引发安慰感，尤其在有支持的陪伴下。但它并非对所有人、所有情境都有效。哭本身是正常的情绪表达。��For many people, crying releases tension and brings a sense of relief, especially with supportive company. But it does not help everyone or every situation. Crying itself is a normal emotional expression.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ee9447abad7c�body�ٜ多数时候对方只是想被听见，建议容易被听成“你不对，该听我的”。先听明白、复述确认，理解本身就有安抚作用。٧Most of the time the other person just wants to be heard, and advice can sound like you are wrong, listen to me. Truly hearing and reflecting back comforts on its own.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�efd7f3969719�body��外倾者从外部交往与刺激中获得能量，内向者则在独处与内省中恢复精力，二者是能量来源的差异而非社交能力高低。荣格最早提出这一维度，后被纳入大五人格。大多人落在两端之间的谱系上。�&Extraverts gain energy from external interaction and stimulation, while introverts recharge through solitude and reflection; it is a difference in energy source, not social skill. Jung proposed the dimension, later included in the Big Five. Most people fall along the spectrum between the ends.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f20ec4f02910�body���一个简单的信号是“功能受损”：睡眠、工作、学习或关系持续受影响超过两周，或出现自伤念头。越早求助，恢复通常越快，求助是照顾自己的表现。��A simple signal is impaired function: sleep, work, study or relationships are hit for over two weeks, or there are self-harm thoughts. Earlier help usually means faster recovery; seeking it is self-care.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�f236434d11aa�body��r大笑会促进内啡肽和多巴胺分泌、降低皮质醇，并放松肌肉，从生理上抵消压力反应。فLaughter boosts endorphins and dopamine, lowers cortisol, and relaxes muscles, physiologically counteracting the stress response.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f2d964377bb1�body���心理健康不只是没有心理疾病，还包括能良好应对压力、与人相处、发挥自身能力并享受生活。它和身体健康一样重要，会随生活变化而波动。保持规律作息、运动和社交都有助于心理健康。�Mental health is not just the absence of illness, but the ability to cope with stress, relate to others, realize one's abilities, and enjoy life. Like physical health, it fluctuates with life changes. Regular sleep, exercise, and social contact support mental health.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（健康心理章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), health psychology chapter��id�f35e7d9295cf�body���遗忘是人类记忆的正常现象，主要由记忆衰退、新旧信息相互干扰以及提取失败造成。比如很久不用的知识会慢慢变模糊，相似的记忆也容易互相混淆。通过复习和联想，可以有效减少遗忘。�"Forgetting is a normal part of human memory, mainly caused by decay, interference between old and new information, and retrieval failure. For example, knowledge we stop using gradually fades, and similar memories can blend together. Review and association can effectively reduce forgetting.�ans��src��XBaddeley, A., Eysenck, M. W. 与 Anderson, M. C. (2015). 《记忆》. Psychology Press.�QBaddeley, A., Eysenck, M. W., & Anderson, M. C. (2015). Memory. Psychology Press.��id�f51f465bf65c�body��抑郁症的核心症状包括持续两周以上的情绪低落、对多数活动失去兴趣或愉悦感，并常伴精力下降、睡眠与食欲改变、注意力难集中。它不是普通的心情不好，而是影响功能的综合征。严重时应寻求专业评估与干预。�'Core depression symptoms include low mood and loss of interest or pleasure in most activities for over two weeks, often with low energy, sleep and appetite changes, and poor concentration. It is not ordinary sadness but a syndrome that impairs function. Seek professional assessment when severe.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�f578cb2cd948�body��&安全型依恋的婴幼儿在照护者离开时会不安，但归来后能较快被安抚并重新探索环境。这源于照护者稳定、敏感的回应，使孩子形成“世界可预期、他人可靠”的内在工作模型。安全依恋与日后更好的人际与情绪调节相关。�?A securely attached infant is distressed when the caregiver leaves but is quickly soothed on return and resumes exploring. It comes from consistent, sensitive care, building an inner model that the world is predictable and others reliable. Secure attachment relates to better later relationships and emotion regulation.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�f7aa796bbc20�body���主动回忆指在学完後合上材料，主动从脑中提取信息（自测、做题）。提取本身会强化记忆路径，比被动重读更能暴露薄弱点，且让记忆更持久。��Active recall means closing the material and retrieving info from memory (self-testing, practice problems). Retrieval itself strengthens memory pathways, exposes weak spots better than passive rereading, and makes memory last.�ans��src��yKarpicke 与 Roediger,《The Critical Importance of Retrieval for Learning》,Science,2008 (DOI: 10.1126/science.1152408)�uKarpicke & Roediger, 'The Critical Importance of Retrieval for Learning', Science, 2008, DOI: 10.1126/science.1152408��id�f8d47efada67�body���问卷依赖自我报告，易受社会赞许（想答得好看）、记忆偏差与措辞影响，且只能测意识层面。行为、生理与大数据常作补充，单一方法都该谨慎。��Surveys rely on self-report, vulnerable to social desirability, memory bias and wording, capturing only conscious levels. Behavior, physiology and big data help; any single method deserves caution.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�f9aae9a9b636�body�ٱ睡眠（尤其慢波与REM）把白天的脆弱记忆回放并转移、整合进长时存储，同时修剪冗余。缺睡会削弱巩固，所以考前熬夜常得不偿失。��During sleep (especially slow-wave and REM), the day's fragile memories are replayed, transferred and integrated into long-term storage while redundancy is pruned. Skimping sleep weakens consolidation—cramming all night often backfires.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f9cdec679d3b�body��可用性启发法指人根据某类事件在记忆中是否容易想起，来判断它发生的概率。容易回忆的（如空难、谋杀新闻）会被认为更常见，而默默高频的事件被低估。它是对不确定性的快捷判断，却常因媒体曝光而失真。�RThe availability heuristic is judging how likely an event is by how easily examples come to mind. Events that are easy to recall, like plane crashes or murders in the news, are judged more common than they are, while quietly frequent events are underestimated. It is a mental shortcut under uncertainty that media exposure often distorts.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�faa9d710f158�body���核心区别在于从何处获得能量与多巴胺敏感度的差异：外向者从社交与外部刺激中充电，内向者在独处中恢复、对刺激更敏感易过载。它是一连续谱，并非社恐或话多的代名词。��The core difference is where one draws energy and dopamine sensitivity: extraverts recharge via social/external stimulation; introverts recover alone and are more easily overstimulated. It is a spectrum, not social anxiety or talkative.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fb4b3cada0ee�body��)格式塔心理学认为“整体大于部分之和”，并提出邻近、相似、连续、闭合、共同命运等组织原则。例如相近的图形被归为一组，不完整的轮廓会被脑补成完整形状。这些原则说明知觉会自动把零散刺激整合成有意义的整体。�xGestalt psychology holds that the whole is greater than the sum of its parts and proposed principles such as proximity, similarity, continuity, closure, and common fate. For example, nearby shapes are grouped together and incomplete contours are filled in as whole forms. These principles show that perception automatically integrates scattered stimuli into meaningful wholes.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fd4eecacd765�body���这叫“鸡尾酒会效应”：听觉系统结合空间方位、音高和语言规律，把注意力聚焦到某一语音流上，同时抑制背景噪音。它说明注意是主动选择，而非被动接收全部信息。��The 'cocktail party effect' is the auditory system using location, pitch and linguistic structure to focus attention on one voice while suppressing background noise. It shows attention is active selection, not passive intake of everything.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ff2d3e0e64c6�body���破窗效应认为环境中的小失序（如破窗、涂鸦）若不被修复，会释放出“无人管”的信号，诱使更大越轨。它强调维护秩序表象能抑制犯罪升级。该理论影响警务策略，但也因证据混杂受争议。�The broken windows theory holds that small disorder like broken windows or graffiti, left unrepaired, signals no one cares and invites bigger deviance. It stresses that keeping order curbs crime escalation. It shaped policing yet is debated for mixed evidence.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�psy_24_006�body��F心理学史为此吵了一百年。詹姆斯-兰格理论主张身体先行:心跳加速、逃跑冲动本身就是恐惧的来源,砍掉身体反应情绪便所剩无几;坎农-巴德反驳说生理唤醒太慢也太笼统,丘脑同时向身体与皮层报警才对。沙赫特与辛格1962年的双因素论折中收编:生理唤醒提供的是「强度」,认知标签决定「是什么」——同样心怦怦跳,在吊桥上被解释为心动,在考场里被解释为焦虑。当代情感神经科学则把情绪拆成效价、唤起等多维过程,不再寻找单一开关。�GPsychology argued for a century. James-Lange put the body first — racing heart and the urge to flee constitute fear itself. Cannon-Bard objected that arousal is too slow and too generic; the thalamus alerts body and cortex simultaneously. The Schachter–Singer two-factor theory (1962) split the difference: physiology supplies intensity while cognition supplies the label — the same pounding heart reads as attraction on a suspension bridge, anxiety in an exam hall. Modern affective neuroscience decomposes emotion into valence, arousal and more, abandoning any single switch.�ans��src�قSchachter 与 Singer,《Cognitive, social, and physiological determinants of emotional state》,Psychological Review 第69卷,1962قS. Schachter and J. E. Singer, Cognitive, social, and physiological determinants of emotional state, Psychological Review 69, 1962��id�psy_24_012�body��`契克森米哈赖访谈了攀岩者、棋手与艺术家后发现共同描述:目标明确、反馈即时、挑战与技能恰好匹配——太易则无聊,太难则焦虑,心流悬在两者之间的动态平衡点上。此时注意力完全投入任务,自我意识(担心别人怎么看)消退,时间感扭曲。能否主动进入?部分可以:清晰的小目标、即时反馈的环境与略高于当前水平一成的难度是可设计的入口;正念训练减少的自我干扰同样有效。它不是玄学而是注意力分配的最优解,这也是电竞与奥运队伍都聘心理教练的原因。��Interviewing climbers, chess players and artists, Csikszentmihalyi found shared ingredients: clear goals, immediate feedback, and challenge matched to skill — boredom when too easy, anxiety when too hard, flow riding the moving balance point between. Attention fuses with the task, self-consciousness dissolves, time warps. Can it be summoned? Partially: crisp subgoals, feedback-rich settings and difficulty tuned about ten percent above current skill are designable entry points, and mindfulness training removes interference. Not mysticism — optimal attention allocation — which is why Olympic and esports teams hire psychologists.�ans��src��RCsikszentmihalyi,《Flow: The Psychology of Optimal Experience»,Harper & Row,1990�SM. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow: The Psychology of Optimal Experience, Harper & Row, 1990��id�psy_24_016�body��(四大联赛数十年数据显示主场胜率长期稳定在五成以上,足球尤为显著。成因分层:裁判因素最意外——噪声压力下判罚微偏主队(加时补时更长、红黄牌更少);旅行疲劳与环境熟悉度次之;而观众激励球员的传统解释证据反而最弱,疫情期间空场比赛提供了天然实验:主场胜率明显缩水但未消失,裁判偏哨也减弱。对运动员而言,高水平发挥常伴随适度唤醒而非放松——耶克斯-多德森定律提醒我们,主场既是资源也是压力源。�`Decades of league data pin home win rates above fifty percent, strongest in football. Causes layer up: refereeing is the surprise — crowd noise nudges marginal calls toward hosts (longer stoppage time, fewer cards); travel fatigue and venue familiarity follow; the folk explanation of crowd cheering players on has weakest support. Pandemic empty stadiums served as a natural experiment: home advantage shrank but did not vanish, and referee bias weakened too. For performers, peak output rides moderate arousal rather than calm — the Yerkes-Dodson law warns that home turf is both resource and pressure.�ans��src��iNevill, Holder,《Home Advantage in Sport》,Sports Medicine,1999 (DOI: 10.2165/00007256-199928040-00001)�gNevill, Holder, 'Home Advantage in Sport', Sports Medicine, 1999, DOI: 10.2165/00007256-199928040-00001��id�psy_24_018�body��因为流利度会骗人。重读让文字越来越眼熟,大脑误把识别容易当成已掌握;而提取练习(合卷回忆、做题)强迫大脑重建检索路径,每一次成功的费力提取都在加固记忆痕迹。罗迪格与卡皮克2006年的实验:学习后一周测验,自测组保持率比重读组高约一半。更妙的是失败的自测也有用——尝试本身为后续学习铺路。应用清单很简单:间隔重复、自我提问、教是最好的学;重读和荧光笔是最受欢迎却最低效的组合。�TFluency deceives. Rereading breeds familiarity, and the brain mistakes easy recognition for mastery; retrieval practice — closed-book recall, self-quizzing — forces reconstruction of search pathways, each effortful successful pull strengthening the trace. Roediger and Karpicke showed in 2006 that after one week self-testers retained about fifty percent more than rereaders. Even failed attempts help, paving paths for later learning. The recipe is short: spaced repetition, self-questioning, teaching others; rereading plus highlighters remains the most popular yet least effective pairing.�ans��src��rRoediger, Karpicke,《Test-Enhanced Learning》,Psychological Science,2006 (DOI: 10.1111/j.1467-9280.2006.01693.x)�pRoediger, Karpicke, 'Test-Enhanced Learning', Psychological Science, 2006, DOI: 10.1111/j.1467-9280.2006.01693.x��id�psy_26_001�body��|这背后是决策后的认知失调:所选方案的缺点与落选方案的优点,同「我做了明智决定」的认知相互冲突,带来心理不适。由于木已成舟,最省力的调和办法不是撤销行为,而是调整态度——抬高已选项、贬低弃选项,Brehm让被试对家电先评分、做选择后再重评的经典实验证实了这种系统性偏移。��Post-decision cognitive dissonance is behind this: the flaws of the chosen option and the merits of the forgone one clash with the belief that you decided wisely, and the clash feels unpleasant. Because the decision cannot be undone, the cheapest fix is to shift the attitude rather than the behavior - rating the picked option higher and the rejected one lower, exactly what Brehm saw when participants re-rated appliances after choosing.�ans��src��hFestinger专著《A Theory of Cognitive Dissonance》(认知失调理论),Stanford University Press 1957�QLeon Festinger, A Theory of Cognitive Dissonance, Stanford University Press, 1957��id�psy_26_007�body���直答:因为自控像肌肉一样会被用掉一部分。机理:Baumeister等1998年先让一组人抵御刚出炉饼干的诱惑、只吃萝卜,随后让他们啃无解的几何题,这组的坚持时间只有随意吃饼干对照组的一半左右;抵御诱惑已经消耗了有限的自我调节资源,后续任务只剩更少的余量。这就是自我损耗现象的首次实验演示,说明一次用力克制会削弱紧接着的下一次。�Because self-control works like a muscle that tires with use. In 1998 Baumeister and colleagues had one group resist freshly baked cookies and eat radishes before tackling an unsolvable geometry puzzle; those participants persisted only about half as long as controls who had eaten cookies freely. Fighting the temptation had already drained a finite self-regulation resource, leaving less reserve for the next demand - the first laboratory demonstration of ego depletion, where one act of restraint weakens whatever restraint follows.�ans��src�ٰBaumeister、Bratslavsky、Muraven与Tice论文《Ego Depletion: Is the Active Self a Limited Resource?》,Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 1998(凯斯西储大学)��Baumeister RF, Bratslavsky E, Muraven M & Tice DM, 'Ego Depletion: Is the Active Self a Limited Resource?', Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 1998 (Case Western Reserve University)��id�psy_26_012�body���直答:因为榜样的吸引力决定了观察学习第一步的成败。机理:Bandura认为模仿须经注意、保持、再现和动机四个环节,地位高、讨人喜欢或与自己相似的榜样最能抓住儿童的注意,其行为也更容易被编码保持;对相似榜样的认同还会唤起「他能做到我也能」的自我效能预期,进一步强化模仿动机,于是同样的示范产生了强弱不同的学习效果。�A model's appeal decides whether the first step of observational learning succeeds at all. Bandura held that imitation passes through attention, retention, reproduction and motivation; high-status, likable, or self-similar models grab children's attention most readily, so their actions get encoded and retained better. Identifying with a similar model also raises the expectation that 'if they can do it, so can I,' which strengthens the motivation to copy - hence identical demonstrations yield different amounts of learning.�ans��src��PBandura专著《Social Learning Theory》(社会学习理论),Prentice-Hall 1977�;Albert Bandura, Social Learning Theory, Prentice-Hall, 1977��id�psy_26_016�body���直答:睡眠不是学习的暂停键,而是巩固记忆的加工车间。机理:入睡后海马把白天新编码的信息以快速重放的方式转写进新皮层,慢波与睡眠纺锤波的耦合正是这场离线回放的标志;睡眠还切断清醒时源源不断的新干扰,保护脆弱的短期痕迹不被覆盖。通宵硬撑既错过回放窗口又任由干扰累积,所以复习量相同时,睡过一夜的人提取更快也更准。�
Sleep is not a pause button for learning but the workshop where memories get consolidated. After falling asleep, the hippocampus replays freshly encoded material into neocortex, with coupling of slow waves and sleep spindles marking this offline rehearsal; sleep also cuts off the constant stream of new waking interference that would overwrite fragile traces. Pulling an all-nighter misses the replay window while interference keeps piling up, so with equal study time those who slept retrieve faster and more accurately.�ans��src��kRasch, Born,《About Sleep's Role in Memory》,Physiological Reviews,2013 (DOI: 10.1152/physrev.00032.2012)�iRasch, Born, 'About Sleep's Role in Memory', Physiological Reviews, 2013, DOI: 10.1152/physrev.00032.2012��id�1fd9f420bf4b�body��S跨文化研究显示，欧美人普遍表现出“自我提升”偏差，而东亚文化因关系自我更强调自我批评与谦逊（Heine 等, 1999）。同样的客观表现下，西方被试更倾向正面自评，东亚被试则更谨慎甚至低估自己，这并非自卑，而是不同文化对“好自我”的定义不同。�yCross-cultural work shows Westerners display a broad self-enhancement bias, whereas East Asian cultures with a relational self stress self-criticism and modesty (Heine et al., 1999). Given equal performance, Western respondents rate themselves higher; East Asians are more cautious or even self-effacing - not low self-worth, but a different cultural definition of a good self.�ans��src��vHeine 等 (1999)《对正面评价有无普遍需求？》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 77(4):800-819٫Heine, S.J., Lehman, D.R., Markus, H.R. & Kitayama, S. (1999). Is there a universal need for positive regard? Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 77(4), 800-819.��id�2384025c6695�body��2斯奈德提出的“自我监控”人格（Snyder, 1974）描述人调节公开行为的倾向：高自我监控者善于读场合、按情境调整表现，低自我监控者更忠于内在态度、较少变通。它不是“虚伪”，而是两种稳定的社交策略，各在不同场景下占优。�,Snyder's self-monitoring personality (1974) describes how readily people adjust public behavior: high self-monitors read the room and adapt, while low self-monitors stay true to inner attitudes and change little. It is not fakery but two stable social strategies, each superior in different settings.�ans��src��nSnyder, M. (1974)《表达行为的自我监控》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 30(4):526-537�xSnyder, M. (1974). Self-monitoring of expressive behavior. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 30(4), 526-537.��id�4bcb0e8907fa�body�ٖ恐惧症常由一次强烈负面经历、观察学习或进化易感性（如对蛇、高度的先天警惕）共同形成，并因回避而维持。٥Phobias often form from a single traumatic experience, observational learning, or evolved preparedness (innate wariness of snakes, heights), maintained by avoidance.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�715625a4eb7a�body���持续注意指在长时间单调任务中保持稳定警觉，容易随时间和疲劳下降；选择性注意指在众多刺激中挑出目标。两者神经基础部分重叠，但前者更依赖警觉网络与唤醒水平。��Sustained attention keeps alertness over long, monotonous tasks and wanes with time and fatigue; selective attention picks a target among many. Their neural bases partly overlap, but sustained attention relies more on the vigilance network and arousal.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8c55c74c83ca�body�٥悲伤是对具体事件的短暂情绪，会随时间缓解；抑郁是持续两周以上、影响功能的综合状态，常无缘由且伴精力与兴趣丧失。ټSadness is a temporary reaction to a specific event that eases; depression is a sustained (2+ weeks), functioning-impairing state, often without clear cause, with lost energy and interest.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�aba5618f0a2e�body�ف韧性是从逆境中恢复并适应的能力，受支持性关系、可控感和应对技能影响，且可通过练习提升。٠Resilience is the ability to recover and adapt after adversity, shaped by supportive relationships, sense of control, and coping skills—and it can be trained.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�psy_24_010�body��"1948年福勒给全班发了同一份人格分析——摘自星座读物的套话,如「你外表自律实则内心时有不安」「你有大量尚未发挥的潜能」——请学生按0到5评准确性,平均4.26,学生惊呼这就是自己。以放之四海皆准的模糊陈述换取高认同,就是巴纳姆效应(福勒效应)。它是MBTI、星座运势、冷读术的心理引擎:人们优先记住符合的部分、自动脑补事例,描述者永远立于不败。对策是盲测:不给标签只给基线,看预测能否胜过随机。��In 1948 Forer handed every student the same personality sketch assembled from horoscope boilerplate — disciplined outside, occasionally insecure within, unused potential — and asked them to rate its accuracy on a zero-to-five scale: average 4.26, many stunned by how personal it felt. Accepting vague, universally applicable statements as uniquely self-descriptive is the Barnum (Forer) effect — the psychological engine of astrology, MBTI-style reports and cold reading: we remember hits, auto-generate confirming examples, and the describer can never lose. The antidote is blind testing — strip labels, give baselines, and check whether predictions beat chance.�ans��src�٤Forer,《The fallacy of personal validation: a classroom demonstration of gullibility.》,The Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology,1949 (DOI: 10.1037/h0059240)٢Forer, 'The fallacy of personal validation: a classroom demonstration of gullibility.', The Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology, 1949, DOI: 10.1037/h0059240��id�psy_24_017�body��K1993年一项小型研究发现大学生听完莫扎特奏鸣曲后空间推理测验短暂提分,媒体把它膨胀成听古典乐让孩子聪明,催生了州政府发古典乐CD的奇观。后续大样本元分析显示:效应若存在也只有一两分且持续十几分钟,关键机制是音乐改善情绪与唤醒水平,任何喜欢的音乐都有类似效果;对婴儿则毫无证据。真正稳健的音乐相关收益来自主动学习乐器——多年训练与听觉分辨、动作协调甚至执行功能的提升相关。结论:被动聆听不是智力补品,学琴才是。�ZA small 1993 study found college students scored briefly higher on spatial tasks after a Mozart sonata; media inflated it into classical-music-smartens-babies, complete with state governments shipping CDs. Large meta-analyses since show any effect is one to two points lasting minutes, driven by improved mood and arousal — any enjoyable music works, and there is no evidence for infants. The robust benefit comes from actively learning an instrument: years of training track better auditory discrimination, motor coordination and executive function. Passive listening is no brain tonic; lessons are.�ans��src�يThompson、Schellenberg 与 Husain,《Arousal, Mood, and The Mozart Effect》,Psychological Science 12,2001 (DOI: 10.1111/1467-9280.00345)هThompson, Schellenberg and Husain, 'Arousal, Mood, and The Mozart Effect', Psychological Science 12, 2001, DOI: 10.1111/1467-9280.00345��id�0a03765e1c22�body�ٙ初次经历伴随更强的新鲜感和情绪，大脑会给它打上更重的记忆标记。所以第一次骑车、第一天上学往往历历在目。ٗFirst experiences come with extra novelty and emotion, so the brain tags them more strongly. That's why your first bike ride or school day stays vivid.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�22fdb840306f�body�ٷ当你觉得别人在评价自己、或出了小差错时，大脑会触发脸红和想躲的反应，这就是尴尬。它提醒你在意别人的看法，是正常的社交信号。ٽWhen you think others are judging you or you made a small slip, the brain triggers blushing and hiding—that's embarrassment. It shows you care about others' views, a normal social signal.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�29d739b362d8�body�ٖ大笑会让身体放松肌肉，并减少让人紧张的物质、增加愉快的物质。几分钟的笑就能给大脑按下一个“轻松键”。ٌLaughter relaxes muscles and lowers stress chemicals while raising happy ones. A few minutes of laughing presses the brain's 'relax' button.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�332a0bcde14b�body�ٖ睡眠时大脑会重放白天的片段来巩固记忆，所以梦里常出现熟悉的人或事。这其实是大脑在帮你把经验“存档”。٘During sleep the brain replays the day's bits to strengthen memory, so familiar people and events appear in dreams. It's your brain 'saving' experience.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�43d1575b144a�body�ي当手头任务很轻松时，大脑会切到“默认模式”去整理想法和计划。适度发呆是脑子在偷偷给自己放假。ٍWhen a task is easy, the brain switches to 'default mode' to sort thoughts and plan. A little daydreaming is the mind quietly taking a break.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�459813a3fac0�body���和朋友相处会促使大脑释放催产素和多巴胺等“快乐激素”，让人感到安全和愉悦。社交联系是人类的基本需求，缺位时会让人孤单难过。所以交朋友、多交流对心理健康很重要。��Spending time with friends releases 'happy hormones' like oxytocin and dopamine, bringing safety and joy. Social connection is a basic human need, and its absence brings loneliness. So making friends and talking more is important for mental health.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�4a9c10a50d75�body�ه人脸由专门脑区处理，且常带着表情和故事，所以更好记。名字只是声音符号，没画面时更容易溜走。ٝFaces are handled by a special brain area and come with expressions and stories, so they stick. Names are just sound symbols and slip away without a picture.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4eb9c6216573�body�ٟ和人相处会消耗心理能量，独处能让大脑安静地整理情绪和恢复力气。想自己待会儿不是不合群，而是正常的充电方式。ٛBeing with others spends mental energy; alone time lets the brain sort feelings and recharge. Wanting quiet time isn't unfriendly—it's normal recharging.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5293bdac81b0�body�ٙ不同的人带来不同的想法和本领，大脑在一起时还能互相补漏洞。合作让我们把大任务拆小，更快也更开心地完成。ٚDifferent people bring different ideas and skills, and brains together catch each other's gaps. Teamwork splits big tasks so we finish faster and happier.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�559aa1d7ca03�body��很小的婴儿还没有“客体恒存”概念，以为看不见的东西就消失了，所以大人藏起来再出现会让他们又惊又喜。大约8个月左右婴儿才逐渐明白人或物即使看不见也依然存在。躲猫猫正好锻炼了这种认识。�-Very young babies lack 'object permanence' and think things that disappear no longer exist, so a caregiver vanishing and reappearing surprises and delights them. Around 8 months they gradually learn that people and objects still exist even when unseen. Peek-a-boo practices exactly that understanding.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�581e737f4a3b�body�ٜ内疚是大脑在提醒你“我伤害了别人或违反了规则”，它推动你去道歉和弥补。适度的内疚能帮我们成为更善良的人。ٍGuilt is your brain saying 'I hurt someone or broke a rule,' pushing you to apologize and make amends. A little guilt helps us become kinder.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5f63463374bb�body�ٜ人会自动模仿身边人的表情和语气，这叫“情绪传染”。靠近开心的人容易也开心，所以选好朋友也是一种自我保护。٣We automatically copy nearby people's faces and tone—called 'emotional contagion.' Being near happy people makes you happy too, so choosing friends is self-care.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6aef4037075f�body���走路需要眼睛提供空间位置和方向的信息，闭眼后主要靠内耳平衡感和肌肉感觉，这些并不够精确。所以人会不自觉地偏向一边。这说明视觉在感知空间和平衡中非常重要。�Walking needs the eyes for spatial position and direction; with eyes closed we mainly rely on the inner-ear balance and muscle sense, which are less precise. So people unconsciously drift to one side. This shows vision is very important for spatial perception and balance.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�707cc77f1cd5�body�ٖ青少年奖赏系统（多巴胺）发育快于负责抑制控制的前额叶，导致对刺激更敏感而自控较弱，冒险行为因此增多。٧The teen reward system (dopamine) matures faster than the prefrontal cortex that controls inhibition, making them more sensitive to rewards and weaker at self-control.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�725f4793eae4�body�ٖ明确的目标给大脑一个清晰的“找什么”，过滤掉不相关的干扰。把大任务拆成一步步的小目标，专注就更轻松。فA clear goal tells the brain what to look for and filters out distractions. Breaking a big task into steps makes focusing easier.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7c6fa756a2f1�body�ٖ目标把模糊愿望变成可衡量的方向，提供反馈与成就感，并激活奖赏系统；具体、有挑战且可达成的目标最有效。٤Goals turn vague wishes into measurable direction, give feedback and achievement, and activate the reward system; specific, challenging, attainable goals work best.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7ef57ce72446�body���这既是“从众”，也来自“社会证明”——我们倾向于认为很多人做的事多半没错。排队还降低了不确定感，让人觉得更安心。这是群体智慧，也可能让我们盲从。��This is both 'conformity' and 'social proof'—we tend to believe that what many people do is probably right. Queuing also reduces uncertainty and feels safer. It is crowd wisdom, but can also lead to blind following.�ans��src�� 社会影响研究（Cialdini）�$Social influence research (Cialdini)��id�84d57a142d0f�body�ٓ留意并说出感谢会把注意力引向好人好事，大脑随之放出愉快信号。经常感恩的孩子往往也更满足、睡得更好。ٗNoticing and voicing thanks points attention to good things, and the brain sends happy signals. Grateful kids often feel more content and sleep better.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�85c0a03e013d�body�ٖ大脑喜欢省力，反复做同一件事就会把它变成自动模式，不再占注意力。好习惯能帮我们把精力留给更重要的事。وThe brain likes saving effort, so repeating an action turns it automatic and frees attention. Good habits leave energy for what matters.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�86d322b5619b�body���损失厌恶是前景理论的核心：同等数量的损失带来的负效用约为同等收益正效用的两倍。它解释了为何人们宁愿不亏也不愿冒险去赚，以及现状偏差。٨Loss aversion (prospect theory) means losses loom about twice as large as equivalent gains. It explains why people avoid risk to prevent loss and prefer the status quo.�ans��src��wKahneman 与 Tversky,《Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk》,Econometrica,1979 (DOI: 10.2307/1914185)�sKahneman & Tversky, 'Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk', Econometrica, 1979, DOI: 10.2307/1914185��id�8740de160a5a�body���想象力是我们在脑中创造未曾直接感知过的新形象和新想法的能力。它依赖记忆中的信息，并把它们重新组合。想象不仅能帮我们做计划，也是创造力和讲故事的基础。��Imagination is the ability to create new images and ideas in the mind that we have not directly perceived. It draws on information from memory and recombines it. Imagination helps us plan ahead and is also the basis of creativity and storytelling.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�885df3583ded�body�ٮ处理气味的通路和记忆中心离得很近，所以味道常能直接唤起很久以前的画面。这也是为什么奶奶的厨房味会让你突然想起小时候。ٜThe smell pathway sits close to the memory center, so scents can directly pull up old scenes. That's why grandma's kitchen smell suddenly recalls childhood.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8bcddf9e7c41�body���这叫“舌尖现象”，是提取信息时卡住了，虽然感觉答案就在嘴边却一时说不出。通常是因为线索不够或紧张，过一会儿放松下来常常就想起来了。这是很常见的正常记忆现象。�This is called the 'tip-of-the-tongue' phenomenon, where retrieval gets stuck even though you feel the answer is right there. It usually happens because of weak cues or nervousness, and the word often comes back once you relax. It is a very common and normal memory occurrence.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�aede71334270�body�ٮ似曾相识（déjà vu）可能是大脑在把眼前画面和旧记忆短暂接错，产生了熟悉的错觉。它通常只闪一下，是健康大脑常见的小误会。٬Déjà vu may happen when the brain briefly mismatches a sight with an old memory, creating false familiarity. It flickers for a moment—a common mix-up in healthy brains.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b367f85cdbee�body�ِ强烈情绪会让大脑释放帮助记忆的物质，把那一刻“标重要”。所以第一次上台或生日派对往往记得很清楚。ًStrong emotions release memory-helping chemicals that tag the moment as important. That's why a first stage moment or birthday stays clear.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�bb63373d1ac5�body�ِ抚摸小动物会降低紧张指标、放慢心跳，并增加让人安心的物质。宠物不评判你，这种无条件的陪伴很治愈。ُPetting animals lowers stress marks, slows the heartbeat, and raises calming chemicals. Pets don't judge, and that unconditional company heals.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ce907f3e0cd5�body�ٍ内在动机来自活动本身的乐趣或意义，外在动机来自奖励或压力。过度用外在奖励有时反而削弱内在兴趣。ٴIntrinsic motivation comes from the activity's own enjoyment or meaning; extrinsic from rewards or pressure. Excessive extrinsic rewards can sometimes undermine intrinsic interest.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d7cd04bcf4c3�body��注意力是心理活动对一定对象的指向和集中，让我们能优先处理重要的信息。由于大脑处理资源有限，我们很难同时高质量地处理两件需要专注的任务。比如一边看书一边认真听人说话通常都很困难。�QAttention is the mental process of directing and concentrating on a particular object or task, allowing us to prioritize important information. Because the brain has limited processing resources, it is hard to handle two demanding tasks at once. For example, reading a book while carefully listening to someone is usually very difficult.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�db4ae86cd16f�body�ٙ比较能帮大脑判断自己处在什么位置，原本是为了学习和进步。适度比较有用，但总盯着别人容易丢掉自己的节奏。ّComparing helps the brain gauge where you stand, originally for learning. A little is useful, but always watching others can steal your own pace.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e2e7ee72c8c1�body���当我们答错并被纠正时，大脑会因为“意外”而更专注地处理正确答案，这叫“测试效应”和“提取练习”。主动回忆比反复阅读效果更好。所以错题本其实是高效的学习工具。�When we answer wrong and get corrected, the brain pays more attention to the right answer because of 'surprise'—this is the 'testing effect' and retrieval practice. Active recall works better than rereading. So an error notebook is actually an efficient learning tool.�ans��src�٧Ebbinghaus《记忆》（Memory: A Contribution to Experimental Psychology, 1885）；Dunlosky 等 2013 年综述（载 Psychological Science in the Public Interest）�aEbbinghaus, Memory (1885); Dunlosky et al. (2013) in Psychological Science in the Public Interest��id�fd483da909c7�body��脸红是情绪（如害羞、尴尬）引起的血管扩张，让面部血流增加而出现红晕。它是一种不受意志控制的生理反应，常出现在被关注或做错事时。脸红其实传递了“我知道自己失礼了”的社交信号。�-Blushing is a vasodilation triggered by emotions like shyness or embarrassment, increasing blood flow to the face. It is an involuntary physiological response, often appearing when we are the center of attention or have done something wrong. Blushing actually signals 'I know I was impolite' socially.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fd96f2fb344a�body�ٙ因为我们把亲近的人当成“自己人”，他们高兴时我们的大脑也会奖励自己。这种共情式的骄傲能加深彼此的感情。�iWe treat close ones as 'part of us,' so their joy rewards our brain too. This shared pride deepens bonds.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fdda9b10c0f8�body���这与历史上科举以学取士、以及家庭把教育当作阶层跃迁通道有关；心理学看，这是一种成就等于家族荣誉的价值内化。积极面是强学习动力，风险是把自我价值过度绑在分数上。�It connects to the imperial exam tradition of selecting by study and families treating education as upward mobility. Psychologically it is internalizing achievement as family honor. The upside is strong motivation; the risk is over-tying self-worth to scores.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�psy_25_012�body��y记忆有分工:短期记忆像小黑板容量有限;把信息反复加工并理解关联后,才会转入长期记忆这座图书馆。临时硬塞的知识只存在黑板上,考完即擦。分散学习、自我测试、把新知识与已知内容挂钩,才能完成从黑板到图书馆的搬运。睡眠是搬运工上班的高峰期——熬夜复习等于解雇搬运工。�oMemory divides labor: short-term is a small whiteboard with tiny capacity; only processed and connected information moves into long-terms vast library. Cramming stays on the board, wiped after exams. Spaced study, self-quizzing and linking new facts to old ones complete the transfer — and sleep runs the moving shift at full speed, so all-nighters fire the movers.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�psy_25_014�body���大脑其实无法并行处理两个需要思考的任务,只能快速切换,而每次切换都有损耗:效率下降、出错率上升。听纯音乐影响较小(歌词会占用语言通道),但做数学题时刷视频就是灾难级组合。所谓的一心多用者,多数只是习惯了低效而不自知。深度工作的秘诀恰恰相反:一次只做一件事,并且屏蔽干扰源。�lBrains cannot truly parallel-process two thinking tasks; they rapid-switch, paying efficiency and accuracy tolls each time. Instrumental music interferes little (lyrics occupy language channels), but math plus videos is a disaster combo. Most self-styled multitaskers are practiced inefficiency experts. Deep work says the opposite: one task, distractions blocked.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�01a7694512e1�body���紧张是身体为重要任务动员能量的正常反应（交感激活）。适度紧张提升专注与表现（耶克斯-多德森定律）；只有过度时才拖累发挥，所以关键是把紧张控制在最佳唤醒区。��Nervousness is the body mobilizing energy for an important task (sympathetic activation). Moderate nerves boost focus and performance (Yerkes-Dodson law); only excess hurts. The key is keeping arousal in the optimal zone.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�07f5ce93f6ec�body�٨开放办公促协作却增噪音、降低隐私与专注，研究常报告满意度与专注下降；可预测的控制权（能否选择安静处）是关键调节。��Open offices aid collaboration but raise noise and cut privacy and focus; studies often report lower satisfaction and concentration. The key moderator is perceived control (choice of quiet space).�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�098be180a411�body���前瞻性记忆是“记得在将来执行某意图”（如服药、赴约），分基于时间和基于事件两类。它依赖中央执行与提醒线索，比回想过去更容易被干扰，所以“走到厨房却忘了干嘛”很常见。�$Prospective memory is remembering to perform an intention in the future (taking medicine, keeping an appointment), split into time- and event-based. It relies on the central executive and cues and is more disruption-prone than recalling the past, hence 'walked to the kitchen and forgot why.'�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0d324c0588d2�body�ي大脑的资源有限，它只会先把你留意过的东西存进记忆。没被注意的事就像没拍下的照片，很难想起来。�~Your brain has limited space, so it first saves what you focus on. Unnoticed things are like un-taken photos—hard to recall.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0ebd94d1da91�body�ِ在陌生人或很多人面前，身体会变得紧张，想躲起来一点，这就是害羞。害羞没关系，慢慢熟悉了就会放松。ًAround strangers or crowds your body gets nervous and wants to hide a bit—that's shyness. It's okay; you relax as you get used to people.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0fe7eb39f422�body���游戏让学习变得有趣、没有压力，孩子也更愿意重复和尝试，大脑在快乐时更容易形成记忆。动手操作和互动也比死记硬背更有效。所以“玩中学”是很有道理的。��Play makes learning fun and stress-free, so children repeat and try more, and the brain forms memories more easily when happy. Hands-on and interactive activities beat rote memorization. So 'learning through play' is well founded.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�11ad29347d7c�body���马斯洛于 1943 年提出，人类需求由低到高呈金字塔排列：生理、安全、归属与爱、尊重，最高为自我实现。他认为低层需求基本满足后，高层需求才成为主导动机，但该顺序并非绝对刚性。�In 1943 Maslow arranged human needs as a pyramid from basic to higher: physiological, safety, belonging/love, esteem, and self-actualization at the top. He argued higher needs drive behavior once lower ones are largely met, though the order is not strictly rigid.�ans��src��aMaslow 1943 年论文（载 Psychological Review）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�MMaslow (1943) in Psychological Review; Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�1502bcf4975b�body�ٜ人天生喜欢待在群体里，被落下会让你觉得不安全。这种难过是在提醒你：我也想加入，可以主动说“我能一起吗”。�rPeople naturally want to belong, so being left out feels unsafe. That sad feeling reminds you to say 'can I join?'�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1b537be0ed4b�body���当我们睡着时，大脑会把白天学到的内容整理、归档，变成更牢固的长期记忆，这叫记忆巩固。所以考前熬夜反而容易忘。小朋友每天睡够觉，学习和记忆都会更好。�When we sleep, the brain organizes and files what we learned during the day into stronger long-term memories, a process called consolidation. So pulling an all-nighter before a test can actually make you forget. Children who get enough sleep learn and remember better.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1df7b415c9b5�body�ٴ可预测的生活降低“接下来会怎样”的不确定感，孩子更有安全感，也更容易在固定时间入睡。规律不是束缚，而是给成长的稳定底座。٦A predictable day lowers uncertainty about what comes next, giving the child safety and easier sleep at set times. Routine is not a cage but a stable base for growth.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�26a529e014b0�body���孝是对父母与长辈的敬爱与赡养，传统上既是伦理也是日常实践。现代研究把它看作代际支持与家庭凝聚的纽带；但当孝变成过度顺从，也可能与个体的独立需求冲突，带来内疚与压力。�␀Filial piety is respect and care for parents and elders, both an ethic and a daily practice. Modern research sees it as a bond of intergenerational support and family cohesion; but when it becomes over-compliance it can clash with autonomy and cause guilt.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�32acd03ee7bc�body���这叫间隔效应：大脑在两次学习之间稍微遗忘，再次提取时会更用力地巩固记忆，形成更稳固的神经连接。集中突击（填鸭）短期有效，但遗忘得也快。ٱThis is the spacing effect: a little forgetting between sessions makes re-retrieval work harder, strengthening memory traces. Cramming helps short-term but is forgotten quickly.�ans��src��Cepeda 等 (2006)�Cepeda et al. (2006)��id�3c77ed0fe6e3�body�ٱ情绪上头时孩子听不进道理，先说出他的感受（“你很生气因为……”）能帮他感到被懂，情绪降下来才听得进话。先连接，再引导。٧In a meltdown a child cannot hear reason; naming the feeling (you are angry because) helps him feel understood, and once calm he can listen. Connect first, then guide.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�4465b926600d�body�ٟ生气是身体在提醒你“这件事让我不舒服”，比如玩具被抢走时。生气很正常，我们可以深呼吸或说出来，而不是打人。ٟAnger is your body saying 'this makes me uncomfortable,' like when a toy is taken. Anger is normal—you can take deep breaths or use words instead of hitting.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�593a89aa58ba�body�ِ要做没把握的事，比如上台说话，心脏会咚咚跳，这就是紧张。一点点紧张能帮你更认真，深呼吸就能稳住。٢Before something uncertain, like speaking on stage, your heart pounds—that's nervousness. A little nervousness helps you focus, and slow breathing steadies you.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�59c3b3bb3367�body�٥孩子先通过观察大人的反应和奖励惩罚来学习规则，慢慢内化成自己的判断。随着长大，他们会开始考虑别人的感受和公平。��Children first learn rules by watching adults' reactions and by rewards and punishments, then gradually internalize them as their own judgments. As they grow, they begin to consider others' feelings and fairness.�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�6e6cd6a82c9e�body���脸红是交感神经系统被激活，面部血管扩张导致的。它常在感到被他人评价时出现，是一种难以控制的公开信号，可能反而帮助传递我知道做错了的歉意，促进社会和解。��Blushing is sympathetic activation widening facial blood vessels, appearing when we feel evaluated by others. An uncontrollable public signal, it may convey I know I erred, aiding social reconciliation.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7314301e1983�body�ٙ害羞时脸部的血管会悄悄变宽，更多血流过来，脸就红了。脸红只是身体在说“我有点不好意思”，不是做错了事。ٖWhen shy, tiny face vessels widen and more blood flows in, turning cheeks red. Blushing just means 'I feel a bit embarrassed,' not that you did wrong.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�79f1274bb7f0�body�ي这是“变色龙效应”，镜像系统让我们自动同步他人姿态，能增进好感和信任，是社会黏合的无声机制。ٓThis 'chameleon effect' uses the mirror system to automatically sync with others, boosting liking and trust—a silent mechanism of social bonding.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7ba66e98706a�body�ل长时间用脑会让注意力变累，就像腿走久了会酸。停下来动一动或发会儿呆，大脑就能重新充满电。�qUsing your brain for a long time tires attention, like legs after walking. A short move or daydream recharges it.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�82b15e0352cc�body���神经可塑性指大脑根据经验、学习和损伤重组神经连接的能力。它伴随终身：学新技能、受训练甚至冥想都会改变脑区结构与功能，所以成年人的大脑绝非固定不变。�Neuroplasticity is the brain's ability to reorganize its connections through experience, learning and injury. It continues throughout life: learning skills, training and even meditation can alter brain structure and function, so the adult brain is far from fixed.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�859d95ae4d86�body���不科学。多数高级功能（语言、创造、逻辑）都需要两半球协作，偏侧化只是相对优势。把人分成“左脑型/右脑型”是流行误解，没有神经科学依据。��No. Most higher functions (language, creativity, logic) need both hemispheres working together; lateralization is only relative advantage. Typing people as 'left-brained' or 'right-brained' is a popular myth with no neural basis.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�86e1acf918fa�body��X格罗夫斯与汤普森的“双过程”模型（Groves & Thompson, 1970）区分两种基本学习：习惯化是重复无害刺激后反应递减，是神经系统在“省电”；敏感化则是强烈刺激后反应增强，是对潜在危险的放大。两者都是最原始的学习，让大脑该忽略的忽略、该警惕的警惕。�bGroves and Thompson's dual-process model (1970) separates two basic learnings: habituation decrements response to repeated harmless stimuli as the system saves energy, while sensitization amplifies response after intense stimuli as a danger magnifier. Both are the most primitive learning, letting the brain ignore the ignorable and flag the threatening.�ans��src��oGroves, P.M. & Thompson, R.F. (1970)《习惯化：一种双过程理论》, Psychological Review 77(5):419-450�oGroves, P.M. & Thompson, R.F. (1970). Habituation: a dual-process theory. Psychological Review, 77(5), 419-450.��id�8ad5a89293f9�body�ٍ睡觉时大脑会把白天的经历整理进记忆，梦就是这个过程里冒出来的画面。做梦帮大脑把重要的事留下来。ٜWhile you sleep, your brain files the day's experiences into memory, and dreams are pictures from that process. Dreaming helps keep important things stored.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8d14dd9ab611�body�ٓ当别人得到关注而自己没有，心里会酸酸的，这叫羡慕或嫉妒。这种感觉提醒你也需要被看见，告诉大人就好。ٌWhen others get attention and you don't, your heart feels sour—that's envy. It reminds you that you also want to be seen; tell a grown-up.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9058a260920d�body�ٷ杂乱的环境会持续占用注意力，让人潜意识里觉得“还有事没做完”。减少视觉噪音能降低心理负荷，带来一种“我可以掌控”的安心感。٪A cluttered space keeps drawing attention and quietly signals unfinished business. Cutting visual noise lowers mental load and brings a calming sense of being in control.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9139998e6016�body�٩稀缺（限时、仅剩N件）触发损失厌恶与紧迫感，降低理性比较。它常是营销制造，冷静后问“没有这紧迫我还买吗”可防冲动。٬Scarcity (deadline, only N left) triggers loss aversion and urgency, cutting rational comparison. Often manufactured, a calm 'would I buy without this rush?' curbs impulse.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�9acbea3933d7�body���弗雷德里克森提出，积极情绪不只让人舒服，还会“扩建”注意力、思维与社交资源（如玩、探索、联结），长期累积成韧性。所以快乐也是成长的养料，而非奢侈品。��Fredrickson's broaden-and-build theory says positive emotion does more than feel good—it broadens attention, thought and social resources (play, explore, connect), building resilience over time. Happiness is fuel for growth, not a luxury.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a00ca9b3a939�body��C卢钦斯的“心理定势”实验（Luchins, 1942）显示，被同一类解法训练后，人即使有更简单的办法也惯性沿用老路。邓克尔的“功能固着”（Duncker, 1945）进一步说明，我们常只看见物体的惯常用途而想不到新用法，于是被既有经验“焊死”了思路。�Luchins's mental-set experiments (1942) show that after training on one solution, people keep using it even when a simpler path exists. Duncker's functional fixedness (1945) adds that we see only an object's usual function and miss new uses, so prior experience welds the mind shut.�ans��src��~Luchins, A.S. (1942)《问题解决中的机械化》, Psychological Monographs 54(6); Duncker, K. (1945)《论问题解决》ٺLuchins, A.S. (1942). Mechanization in problem solving. Psychological Monographs, 54(6); Duncker, K. (1945). On problem solving. In W.D. Ellis (Ed.), A Source Book of Gestalt Psychology.��id�a04959c9f2cc�body�ِ练习会让大脑中负责这个动作的神经连接变得更牢固，做起来就更顺手。每天练一点，比一次练很久更有效。لPractice strengthens the brain connections for that skill, making it smoother. A little each day works better than one long session.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a221afc8ecb2�body���哭泣能帮助身体释放压力，并排出与紧张有关的化学物质，同时呼唤他人的安慰。很多人在哭过之后情绪会慢慢平复。所以难过时哭出来是很自然的缓解方式。��Crying helps the body release stress and wash out chemicals linked to tension, while also signaling others to comfort us. Many people feel calmer after a good cry. So crying when sad is a natural way to relieve feelings.�ans��src��情绪表达研究�Emotion expression research��id�a6b57121fd48�body���过去认为成年不再生神经元，现已知海马齿状回等区终生有新神经元生成（神经发生），受运动、学习、丰富环境促进，压力与衰老则抑制。它提示大脑始终保有更新潜力。�Once thought impossible in adults, new neurons are now known to form for life in areas like the hippocampal dentate gyrus (neurogenesis), boosted by exercise, learning and enrichment, suppressed by stress and aging. It shows the brain keeps a capacity to renew.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ab1377f1716a�body�ٖ遇到不开心的事，比如和朋友分开，心里会酸酸的，这就是难过。难过会慢慢过去，找人说说话或抱抱会好受些。ِWhen something unhappy happens, like parting from a friend, your heart feels heavy—that's sadness. Sadness passes, and talking or a hug helps.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ae3773b42a2b�body���禅修是佛教等传统的修行方法，正念是其中不带评判地觉察当下的心智状态，现代心理学把它去宗教化后用于减压。简单说：禅修是路径，正念是其中被科学检验的核心能力。�Meditation is a practice from Buddhist and other traditions; mindfulness is its core state of non-judgmental present-moment awareness, later secularized for stress reduction. Simply: meditation is the path, mindfulness the scientifically tested capacity within it.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�b2f319450d95�body�ٓ做梦时大脑里的画面很生动，醒来那一瞬还会以为是真的。这是大脑在认真“播放”记忆，并不是真的发生了。ّDreams can look vivid, so for a second after waking you think they're real. Your brain is just playing memories vividly, not showing real events.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�bd508a439065�body���严格说没有真正的并行多任务，大脑只是快速切换注意。边开车边打电话会占用同一套注意资源，降低反应与觉察，因此所谓多任务多是“切换”而非“同时”。��Strictly, there is no true parallel multitasking; the brain rapidly switches attention. Talking while driving draws on overlapping resources, impairing reaction and awareness, so 'multitasking' is mostly switching, not simultaneity.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�be23b22c3846�body���艾宾浩斯发现，记忆保留率在学习后迅速下降，之后变缓，形成一条指数衰减曲线。刚学完的短时间内大量信息未被巩固就流失，及时复习能显著拉平曲线。ٵEbbinghaus found retention drops sharply right after learning then levels off—an exponential decay curve. Much unconsolidated info is lost early; timely review flattens the curve.�ans��src��Ebbinghaus (1885)�Ebbinghaus (1885)��id�c22773f3f04e�body���早期人类靠群体生存，跟随多数常等于跟随安全与正确（如哪条路有食物）。从众因此被保留，今天多数情境仍便捷，只是网络时代它也可能放大错误。��Early humans survived via groups; following the majority often meant safety and correctness (which path has food). Conformity persisted, still handy today, though online it can also amplify error.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c27151c4612e�body��)“社交时差”指工作日的起床时间与周末自然醒的时间相差太大，使内在生物钟和外界时钟错位（Wittmann 等, 2006）。这种慢性错位像轻度持续倒时差，会打乱褪黑素与皮质醇节律，与注意力下降、情绪变差甚至代谢问题相关。�KSocial jetlag is the gap between your weekday alarm clock and your natural weekend wake time, misaligning the internal clock with the external one (Wittmann et al., 2006). This chronic mismatch acts like mild persistent travel fatigue, disrupting melatonin and cortisol rhythms and linking to poorer attention, mood and metabolism.�ans��src��jWittmann 等 (2006)《社交时差：生物钟与社会时钟的偏差》, Current Biology 16(9):R286-R287ٛWittmann, M., Dinich, J., Merrow, M. & Roenneberg, T. (2006). Social jetlag: misalignment of biological and social time. Current Biology, 16(9), R286-R287.��id�c4c38739524d�body�ٟ远古时动的东西可能是朋友或危险，所以大脑把“动”标成重要信号。现在这让我们看书时也会被晃来晃去的东西吸引。ُLong ago, movement meant a friend or danger, so the brain flags motion as important. Today it's why moving things catch your eye while reading.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c8a72d7f75d8�body���奖励会让好行为变得更开心、更愿意重复，这是“做了好事有好处”的学习方式。不过太依赖奖励，有时也会让人只为奖品而不为事情本身去做。��Rewards make good behavior feel happier and more worth repeating—a way of learning that 'doing right brings good things.' But relying too much on rewards can sometimes make people act only for the prize.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ca211c9d228c�body��O“味觉厌恶学习”是生物进化出的快速防御：只要一次进食与恶心配对，动物甚至人就会长期回避该味道（Garcia & Koelling, 1966）。它违反了“多次邻近才能学会”的常规规律，说明味觉与呕吐回路在进化上被预先“接线”，用来以最小代价躲开有毒食物。�DTaste-aversion learning is an evolved fast defense: a single pairing of a flavor with nausea produces long-lasting avoidance in animals and people (Garcia & Koelling, 1966). It breaks the usual rule that learning needs repeated contiguity, showing that taste and vomit circuits are pre-wired to dodge poison at minimal cost.�ans��src��}Garcia, J. & Koelling, R.A. (1966)《线索与后果的关系：味觉厌恶的生物学》, Psychonomic Science 4(3):123-124�}Garcia, J. & Koelling, R.A. (1966). Relation of cue to consequence in avoidance learning. Psychonomic Science, 4(3), 123-124.��id�cd893a924c4f�body���沉没成本谬误指因为已经投入时间或金钱，就继续做本该放弃的事。理性决策只看未来收益，已花掉的成本无法收回，但人会因不甘心而被过去绑住。��The sunk cost fallacy is continuing a doomed action because you have already invested. Rational choices weigh only future payoff; spent costs are unrecoverable, yet we stay stuck out of not wanting to waste it.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�d59035aeefd8�body���褪黑素是大脑松果体在黑暗中分泌、标示夜晚到来的激素，主要作用是调节睡眠时机（生物钟），而非直接催眠。对时差和作息紊乱有帮助，但对一般失眠效果有限。��Melatonin is a hormone from the pineal gland released in darkness, signaling night is here. It mainly tunes sleep timing (the clock), not direct sedation. It helps jet lag and shifted schedules more than ordinary insomnia.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d61842fa0eee�body�ِ大脑里有一类“镜像”细胞，会悄悄模仿看到的表情，所以笑会传染。对着人笑，常常能换来一个微笑回来。قSpecial 'mirror' cells in the brain quietly copy the faces we see, so smiles spread. Smiling at someone often brings a smile back.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d7a222e15610�body�ٍ看到绿色和听到自然声音，身体会放慢紧张反应，心跳也更平稳。大自然像温柔的安抚，让大脑休息一下。لGreen sights and natural sounds slow your body's stress response and steady your heartbeat. Nature gently calms and rests the brain.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e400c40b0d58�body�ل靠自己的努力完成目标，大脑会奖励你一种成就感，这就是自豪。自豪鼓励你下次继续挑战新事情。٧When you reach a goal through your own effort, your brain rewards you with a sense of achievement—that's pride. Pride encourages you to try new challenges next time.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e46abb4b1890�body�ه玩的时候你主动尝试和探索，大脑会更积极地把新本领记下来。边玩边学让知识变得有趣又容易记住。ٝWhile playing you try and explore on your own, so your brain stores new skills more actively. Learning through play makes knowledge fun and easy to remember.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e63e7e7cdbeb�body��U“定向遗忘”实验要求被试在学习部分词表后收到“请忘掉”的指令，结果显示这些项目之后的回忆显著变差，说明大脑具备主动抑制特定记忆痕迹的能力（Bjork, 1972）。这种“想忘却更牢”的反弹属于另一套思维压抑机制，并不能否定记忆抑制本身的存在。�NIn directed-forgetting experiments, people told to forget part of a list later recall it much worse, showing the brain can actively suppress specific memory traces (Bjork, 1972). The ironic rebound where trying not to think of something makes it pop up reflects a separate monitoring process and does not contradict memory inhibition.�ans��src��mBjork, R.A. (1972)《有意遗忘的理论意涵》, in Melton & Martin(编) Coding Processes in Human MemoryىBjork, R.A. (1972). Theoretical implications of directed forgetting. In A.W. Melton & E. Martin (Eds.), Coding Processes in Human Memory.��id�e779a06c2829�body���颜色恒常性让我们根据光照环境自动校正物体颜色，使白墙在明暗下都判为白。它极大帮助识别，但也会骗人——同一条裙子在不同光下会被看成不同颜色。��Color constancy lets us auto-correct for lighting so a white wall reads white in shadow or sun. It aids recognition but can trick us—the same dress is seen as different colors under different light.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�eefc6c748994�body�ف知道每天先做什么后做什么，大脑就不用一直担心未知。稳定的作息还能帮身体和情绪保持平稳。نKnowing the order of your day means your brain doesn't worry about the unknown. Steady routines also keep your body and mood balanced.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f55cfb5508cd�body���睡眠（尤其慢波与 REM 期）负责把白天的短期记忆巩固到长期存储，并清理脑内代谢废物。熬夜学习事倍功半：你记下的内容因缺乏巩固而易流失。ٿSleep—especially slow-wave and REM—consolidates daytime memories into long-term storage and clears metabolic waste. Pulling all-nighters backfires: unconsolidated material is easily lost.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�f79ca7c70998�body�ٖ助人时大脑会放出让人愉快的物质，这叫“助人带来的好感觉”。看到别人因为自己而轻松，你也会更喜爱自己。وHelping releases feel-good chemicals, known as the 'helper's high.' Seeing someone relieved because of you helps you like yourself more.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f7fce00b2d24�body���小朋友正处在快速学习阶段，好奇心极强，通过不断提问来弄清世界运行的规则。这是他们建构知识和语言能力的重要方式。耐心回答能保护他们的求知欲。��Young children are in a rapid learning stage with strong curiosity, asking questions to figure out how the world works. It is an important way for them to build knowledge and language skills. Patient answers protect their desire to learn.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�fc72d42f52c5�body�ٍ朋友给我们陪伴和理解，让我们在难过时有地方倾诉。研究表明，有好朋友的孩子更容易感到快乐和自信。ٙFriends give us company and understanding, so we have someone to talk to when sad. Research shows kids with good friends feel happier and more confident.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�psy_25_006�body���眼泪来自身体里的盐水,和血浆成分差不多,所以尝起来咸咸的。哭一点也不丢人:情绪的眼泪里还带着压力激素,哭出来等于给心情排毒。大人小孩都需要哭,哭完擦干脸,再想办法解决问题。��Tears come from the body's salt water, close to blood plasma — hence salty. Crying is never shameful: emotional tears even carry stress hormones out, detoxing your mood. Everyone needs a cry sometimes; wipe your face, then tackle the problem.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�psy_25_008�body��习惯是大脑走熟的近路:做得越多,神经通路越宽,自动跑得越欢。改掉它不能靠硬憋,要用新路线替换:想少看电视,就把书放在遥控器旁边。好习惯同理——每天固定时间做一点点,坚持得越久,新路就修得越牢。�2Habits are brain shortcuts: the more you repeat, the wider the path and the faster it auto-runs. Breaking them needs replacement, not willpower wrestling — want less TV, park books beside the remote. Good habits work the same: fixed time, tiny dose, and the longer you stick, the stronger the road grows.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�psy_25_009�body��批评针对的是那件事的做法,不是你这个人。老师说字写得潦草,意思是这一页可以更工整,而不是你不好。把批评当成地图上的红圈:圈出需要加油的位置,改掉它你就升级了。会接受批评的人进步最快。��Criticism targets the work, not the person. Messy handwriting feedback means that page can improve, not that you are bad. Treat criticism as red circles on a map marking where to train — fix it and level up. Those who accept feedback improve fastest.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�02b81cb91cdb�body��u每练一次，大脑里的小路就变得更顺，动作也越来越熟。慢慢来，多试几次你就会更棒。َEach time you practice, the pathways in your brain get smoother and the action becomes easier. Go slowly—after a few tries you'll do better.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�049a4c85c38a�body���面部反馈假说认为，做出表情会向大脑回送信号，轻微影响情绪。研究发现，用嘴含笔（模拟微笑肌肉）的人看卡通更觉得好笑，说明身体姿势能反向塑造感受。��The facial feedback hypothesis: making an expression sends signals back to the brain, subtly shaping emotion. People holding a pen with their teeth (mimicking a smile) found cartoons funnier—bodily pose can reverse-shape feeling.�ans��src��Strack 等 (1988)�Strack et al. (1988)��id�11c634328058�body���约 8–14 个月，婴儿形成稳定依恋后开始懂得妈妈会离开，于是用哭抗议来保护联结；这是健康发展的信号，而非黏人。稳定回应能逐步建立安全感。��Around 8–14 months, after stable attachment forms, babies realize mom can leave and cry to protect the bond; this is a healthy-development sign, not clinginess. Consistent response builds security.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�17b4bc78d135�body��~一起玩、一起笑、互相帮忙，慢慢地你们就成了好朋友。好朋友是愿意陪你、对你好的小伙伴。َPlaying, laughing, and helping together slowly turns you into good friends. A good friend is someone who stays with you and treats you kindly.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�18e6f08cbbbd�body��G玩耍不是“浪费时间”，而是大脑发育最重要的活动之一。自由玩耍能促进神经元连接，提升专注力、情绪调节和社交能力，孩子正是在游戏里学习解决问题和与人相处。每天留出一段无忧无虑的玩耍时间，对记忆、创造力和心理健康都很有好处。�cPlay is not wasted time—it is one of the most important activities for brain development. Free play builds neural connections and strengthens attention, emotional regulation, and social skills; children learn problem-solving and how to relate to others through games. A daily stretch of unhurried play supports memory, creativity, and mental well-being.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2c9cbf17f0eb�body��~把玩具或零食分给朋友，你们会一起笑，大脑也会放出快乐小信使。分享让你和朋友都暖暖的。�zWhen you share a toy or snack, you laugh together and your brain sends happy chemicals. Sharing warms you and your friend.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�38fbe9ebf5e0�body��u靠近喜欢的人，身体会慢下来，紧张的警报也会关小一点。安心的感觉帮你放松和入睡。�wBeing close to someone you love slows your body and turns down the worry alarm. Feeling safe helps you relax and sleep.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4219806da394�body�ٺ孩子在安全依恋与“允许犯错”的环境里最易长出抗挫力：成人做安全基地，鼓励尝试、把失败当信息而非羞耻。过早施压或代劳反而削弱。��Kids build resilience in secure attachment and mistake-friendly settings: adults as a safe base, encouraging tries and treating failure as info, not shame. Early pressure or doing-it-for-them backfires.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�49e33b593630�body�ٓ这是自我意识萌芽的表现，孩子通过拒绝来确认“我能自己做主”。是独立性发展的正常阶段，而非故意对抗。ٖIt signals emerging self-awareness—children assert 'I can decide for myself' by refusing. It's a normal stage of independence, not willful defiance.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�588e206ba19f�body�ٍ玩的时候你会在不知不觉中学会很多本领，比如怎么轮流和怎么想办法。玩也是身体和大脑在快乐地长大。فWhile playing you quietly learn skills like taking turns and solving problems. Play is also how your body and brain grow happily.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5a655191614a�body�ل笑是大脑在说“这真好玩”，它会让你和身体都放松下来。和朋友一起笑，还会让你们变得更亲近。لLaughing is your brain saying 'this is fun,' and it helps your body relax. Laughing with friends also makes you feel closer to them.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5b9c18c197ac�body��{帮别人完成一件事，会让你觉得自己很能干，心里甜甜的。看到别人笑了，你也会跟着开心。�sHelping someone finish a task makes you feel capable and sweet inside. When the other person smiles, you smile too.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5e8ece93dd20�body�٫韧性并非天生硬扛，而来自保护因素：稳定关系、掌控感、意义感与善用支持。它们像缓冲垫，让人在冲击后回弹甚至重组生活。ٶResilience isn't innate toughness but protective factors: stable bonds, mastery, meaning and using support. Like cushions, they let a person bounce back or even rebuild after shocks.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�5f80d624d540�body��{朋友会陪你玩、听你说话，让你觉得自己不孤单。有朋友在身边，开心会变大，难过会变小。�xFriends play with you and listen, so you don't feel alone. With friends nearby, happy feelings grow and sad ones shrink.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�684ac82b8f0f�body�ه当你自己学会一件难事，心里会挺起小胸膛，这就是骄傲。骄傲告诉你“我做到了”，让你更有信心。مWhen you learn something hard by yourself, your chest puffs up—that's pride. Pride tells you 'I did it' and builds your confidence.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�73539029b210�body��~最喜欢的玩具让你觉得熟悉和安全，像一个小伙伴陪着你。抱着它，陌生地方也没那么可怕了。�sA favorite toy feels familiar and safe, like a little friend with you. Holding it makes new places feel less scary.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�85807237a529�body�ٷ害怕是大脑里一个叫杏仁核的小部分在发现危险时发出的警报，让身体做好准备逃跑或躲起来。它帮我们避开危险，是很正常的保护反应。ٵFear is an alarm sent by a small brain part called the amygdala when it senses danger, preparing the body to run or hide. It helps us avoid harm and is a normal protective reaction.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�89aa4fb7ecf7�body�ل白天用了一天的大脑和身子需要休息，睡着时它们会悄悄充电。睡饱了，第二天才能开心地玩和学。ٌAfter a busy day your brain and body need rest, and sleep quietly recharges them. A good sleep lets you play and learn happily the next day.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8b0eead02d1d�body���两条等长线段因两端箭头朝向不同而被误判长短，一种解释是大脑把向外的角当成凸角、向内的角当成凹角，按三维角落深度自动“校正”了长度。它揭示深度线索会干扰二维判断。��Two equal lines look unequal by arrow direction; one explanation is the brain reads outward fins as convex and inward as concave corners, auto-correcting length by perceived 3D depth. It shows depth cues hijack flat judgments.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9b651b7eb5bb�body���当你玩喜欢的游戏或抱抱家人时，大脑会放出一种叫“快乐小信使”的东西，让你觉得暖暖的、想笑。开心是正常的，它会帮助你更有力气去探索世界。ٸWhen you play a favorite game or hug family, your brain sends out happy chemicals that make you feel warm and smiley. Feeling happy is normal and gives you energy to explore the world.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a053c445b934�body�ٍ哭是身体在帮你在难过或疼的时候把情绪放出来，就像下雨洗掉灰尘。哭完抱一抱，心情常常会轻松一些。كCrying helps your body let out sad or hurting feelings, like rain washing away dust. After a cry and a hug, you often feel lighter.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a28eded1ef08�body��2“蔡加尼克效应”（Zeigarnik, 1927）指人对中断、未完成的任务记忆优于已完成任务，因为未闭合的目标在脑中保持“激活”状态，不断抢占注意。它解释了为何悬而未决的待办会让人坐立难安，也提示“写下来”能帮大脑暂时放下。�The Zeigarnik effect (Zeigarnik, 1927) is that interrupted, unfinished tasks are remembered better than completed ones, because an unclosed goal stays active and keeps grabbing attention. It explains why dangling to-dos make us restless and why writing them down lets the brain let go.�ans��src��_Zeigarnik, B. (1927)《已完成与未完成任务之保持》, Psychologische Forschung 9:1-85�vZeigarnik, B. (1927). Uber das Behalten von erledigten und unerledigten Handlungen. Psychologische Forschung, 9, 1-85.��id�a90cdcc1a7fe�body���Ekman 提出六种跨文化普遍的基本情绪：快乐、悲伤、愤怒、恐惧、厌恶、惊讶，各有独特的面部表情。这为情绪有生物学基础提供了证据，但当代理论也强调情绪的建构性与文化差异。��Ekman proposed six universal basic emotions—happiness, sadness, anger, fear, disgust, surprise—each with a distinct facial expression. It supports biology-based emotion, though modern views stress construction and culture.�ans��src��Ekman 跨文化研究�Ekman's cross-cultural work��id�ad55d795943a�body���客体永久性指明白看不见的东西依然存在。皮亚杰发现约 8-12 个月婴儿开始在第 1 类 A-not-B 任务中表现出来，是符号思维与分离焦虑发展的基础。ٳObject permanence is understanding things exist even when unseen. Piaget found it emerging around 8-12 months (A-not-B task), underpinning symbolic thought and separation anxiety.�ans��src��Piaget 认知发展�Piaget's cognitive development��id�b453f6489a86�body��u大脑喜欢新奇的东西，会马上把眼睛和耳朵指向它。发现新事物帮你更快认识这个世界。قYour brain likes new things and points your eyes and ears toward them. Noticing new things helps you learn about the world faster.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b9f0114569df�body��扎荣茨的“纯粹接触效应”（Zajonc, 1968）表明，仅仅反复暴露某刺激就能提升好感，无需任何正面经验或清醒评价。一种解释是熟悉带来“安全信号”降低警觉，所以广告洗脑、邻座脸熟都靠这个无声的偏好工厂。�7Zajonc's mere-exposure effect (1968) shows that simply repeating exposure to a stimulus raises liking, with no positive experience or conscious judgment needed. Familiarity reads as a safety signal that lowers vigilance, so ad repetition and the friendly face next door both ride this silent preference factory.�ans��src��lZajonc, R.B. (1968)《纯粹接触的态度效应》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 9(2):1-27�tZajonc, R.B. (1968). Attitudinal effects of mere exposure. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 9(2), 1-27.��id�c63ab0084ed1�body�ٖ当期待好玩的事情时，心脏会跳快一点，让你觉得精神十足。兴奋说明你很喜欢这件事，慢慢呼吸就能安静下来。ٰWhen you expect something fun, your heart beats a little faster and you feel full of energy. Excitement means you really like something, and slow breathing helps you calm down.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c8a0d6d1fac8�body�ٽ假装游戏（过家家）锻炼符号思维、换位思考与执行功能：孩子把积木当蛋糕，练习“代表”与“抑制真实”。它是早期抽象与社会的训练场。��Pretend play (house) trains symbolic thought, perspective-taking and executive function: a block becomes a cake, practicing 'represent' and 'inhibit real.' It is early drill for abstraction and social skill.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�c8ef16b62b52�body���当亮点依次快速闪现，大脑会把它们连成连续运动，这就是似动（如霓虹招牌、电影原理）。它说明运动知觉可以由离散信号“编造”出来，而非必须真实位移。��When dots flash in sequence fast enough, the brain links them into smooth motion—apparent motion (the basis of neon signs and film). Motion perception can be 'invented' from discrete signals, not requiring real movement.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cc757c9e0601�body�ٽ害怕是身体的小警报，它帮你在遇到危险时快快躲开或跑向大人。害怕一点都不丢人，很多小朋友和大人都会害怕，抱着安心的人就会好很多。ٯBeing scared is your body's alarm that helps you run to a grown-up or hide from danger. Feeling scared is okay—lots of kids and grown-ups feel it, and a hug makes it better.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d843c51040f2�body��~抱抱时身体会放出让人安心的物质，心跳也会慢慢变稳。被抱着的时候，你会觉得自己被爱着。�lDuring a hug your body releases calming chemicals and your heartbeat slows. Being held makes you feel loved.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dcfee99e60db�body�ٱ人的记忆像一个暂时放东西的小架子，新东西放太多时，旧的就容易暂时找不到。大脑还需要时间把重要的事搬进能长期保存的地方。��Our memory is like a small shelf for temporarily holding things; when too many new things pile up, older ones can be hard to find for a while. The brain also needs time to move important things into long-term storage.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e2e50263d7a1�body��*经典性条件反射中，一个原本中性的刺激（如铃声）反复与能引发反应的无条件刺激（如食物）配对后，单独呈现该中性刺激也能引发类似反应（如狗分泌唾液）。巴甫洛夫在 20 世纪初通过狗的实验系统揭示了这一学习机制。�In classical conditioning, a neutral stimulus (e.g., a bell) repeatedly paired with an unconditioned stimulus (e.g., food) comes to elicit a similar response (e.g., salivation) on its own. Pavlov systematically demonstrated this learning mechanism in dogs in the early 20th century.�ans��src��V巴甫洛夫《条件反射》（1927）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�KPavlov, Conditioned Reflexes (1927); Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�psy_25_002�body���害羞是很正常的,很多人都会有。你可以先从一个微笑开始,再递过去一个玩具或说一句一起玩好吗。友谊常常是从很小很小的一步开始的,就像小芽慢慢长大。ٹShyness is normal — everyone feels it sometimes. Start with a smile, offer a toy, or simply say want to play? Friendships often begin with one tiny step, like a sprout growing slowly.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�psy_25_004�body�پ怕黑不代表不勇敢,连大人和小动物都会怕黑呢!黑暗让眼睛看不见,大脑就会多想一点。开着小夜灯、抱着心爱的玩偶,勇敢是一点一点练出来的。��Fear of dark is not weakness — grown-ups and animals feel it too! In darkness eyes cannot see so brains imagine more. A little night light plus your favorite plush helps; bravery grows bit by bit.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�psy_25_005�body�ٿ排队就像红绿灯:一次一个人,大家才都不会撞到。你排队等一小会儿,别的小朋友也会为你等——这样每个人都能开心地玩很多次,还能认识新朋友!ټLines work like traffic lights: one at a time keeps everyone safe. You wait a little now and friends wait for you later — then everybody plays many happy turns and makes new friends too.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�00bdc519d70e�body���复原力指个体在逆境中维持或恢复心理功能的能力，其保护因素包括稳定的社会支持、有效的情绪调节策略、自我效能感与意义感。它并非固定特质，而可在关系中培养与发展。��Resilience is the capacity to maintain or regain functioning under adversity, protected by stable social support, effective emotion regulation, self-efficacy, and sense of meaning. It is not a fixed trait but can be built through relationships.�ans��src��`《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 健康心理卷;美国心理学会(APA)�YAnnual Review of Psychology (health psychology); American Psychological Association (APA)��id�011c1ed27ed4�body���羊群效应来自社会证明（别人买必有理）、损失厌恶与对不确定性的回避，个体会放弃独立判断跟随群体。它放大泡沫与踩踏，说明市场并非总是理性有效。��Herding stems from social proof (others must know), loss aversion and aversion to uncertainty, leading individuals to abandon independent judgment. It amplifies bubbles and crashes, showing markets are not always rationally efficient.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�054e41bdcfd3�body���前摄抑制是旧记忆干扰新记忆的学习，倒摄抑制是新记忆干扰旧记忆的回忆。两者都属于相似记忆之间的竞争效应。在相似内容之间安排休息，可以减轻这种干扰。�%Proactive interference occurs when old memories disrupt the learning of new ones, while retroactive interference occurs when new learning disrupts recall of old memories. Both are forms of competition between similar memories. Taking breaks between similar topics can reduce this interference.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�05fc8d56eda9�body���哈洛发现幼猴更偏好能提供接触安抚的绒布「代母」而非仅提供食物的铁丝代母，说明依恋基于触拂与安全感而非单纯喂养。这一结果重塑了人们对母婴依恋与情感需求的理解。��Harlow found infant monkeys preferred a soft cloth surrogate offering contact comfort over a wire one offering food, showing attachment rests on touch and security rather than feeding alone. It reshaped understanding of maternal bonding.�ans��src��S哈洛,《The nature of love.》,American Psychologist,1958 (DOI: 10.1037/h0047884)�QHarlow, 'The nature of love.', American Psychologist, 1958, DOI: 10.1037/h0047884��id�06337e593932�body���提取记忆是重建过程：大脑用线索把碎片重新拼装，并容易混入事后信息，产生“错误记忆”。实验里给误导性提问，受试者会“记得”从未发生的细节，所以证词不是录像。��Retrieval is reconstructive: the brain reassembles fragments from cues and readily mixes in post-event information, creating false memories. Misleading questions make people recall details that never happened, so testimony is not a video.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0749747c883c�body��
保罗·艾克曼通过跨文化研究提出六种基本情绪：快乐、悲伤、愤怒、恐惧、厌恶和惊讶，它们的面部表情在不同文化中高度相似。近年研究也常把“轻蔑”列为第七种。基本情绪被认为具有进化意义。�$Paul Ekman's cross-cultural research identified six basic emotions—happiness, sadness, anger, fear, disgust, and surprise—whose facial expressions are similar across cultures. Some recent work also lists contempt as a seventh. Basic emotions are thought to have evolutionary significance.�ans��src��Ekman 基本情绪理论�Ekman basic emotions theory��id�079ffc6b91b9�body���锚定效应指人们在对不确定量做估计时，过度受最初接触的数字（锚）影响，即使该数字与问题无关。它出现在价格谈判、司法量刑与医疗判断中，且调整往往不足。��Anchoring is the tendency for an initial number to pull subsequent estimates, even when irrelevant. It appears in price negotiation, judicial sentencing, and medical judgment, where adjustments from the anchor are typically insufficient.�ans��src��{Tversky, Kahneman,《Judgment under Uncertainty: Heuristics and Biases》,Science,1974 (DOI: 10.1126/science.185.4157.1124)�yTversky, Kahneman, 'Judgment under Uncertainty: Heuristics and Biases', Science, 1974, DOI: 10.1126/science.185.4157.1124��id�08e82b1ecdb3�body���反复追问是认知快速发展期的自然表现：他们在练习因果推理、扩充词汇并建立对世界的心智模型。回应时多给因为……的因果解释，比简单回答更能促进理解。��Relentless why is natural during rapid cognitive growth: they practice causal reasoning, build vocabulary, and construct a mental model of the world. Giving causal because answers aids understanding more than one-word replies.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�0acf77e525d3�body���盲视患者声称看不见视野缺损区的刺激，却能较准地猜出位置或运动方向。说明视觉加工可在无主观视觉体验下进行，把“有信息加工”与“有意识看见”分了家。��Blindsight patients claim not to see stimuli in a blind field yet can accurately guess location or motion. It shows visual processing can occur without conscious visual experience, separating 'information processed' from 'consciously seen'.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0b833362c06f�body��_一部分语言用绝对方向（东、南、西、北）而不是“前后左右”来描述空间，使用这些语言的人会从小保持方向感，即使在陌生环境也能指出方向。这并不意味着他们更聪明，而是说明语言能塑造注意习惯——用什么词描述空间，会影响我们注意和记忆空间的方式。�cSome languages describe space with absolute directions (east, south, west, north) rather than “left and right,” and their speakers maintain a constant sense of orientation, even in unfamiliar places. It isn't about being smarter; it shows language can shape attentional habits — the words we use for space influence how we attend to and remember it.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�0b9fc6d27c8f�body���退休剥离了角色与作息，失去结构的老人易空虚；保留社交、目标与规律活动的人则更自在。关键是把身份不绑死在职业上，提前建立多重角色。��Retirement strips role and routine; elders losing structure feel empty, while those keeping social ties, goals and rhythm stay well. The key is not pinning identity to a job and building multiple roles early.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�0c5ba171eb34�body���坎贝尔与米勒区分了浮夸型自恋（外向、好表现、寻求钦佩）与脆弱型自恋（防御、敏感、易羞耻）。两者都含自我中心，但情绪调节与人际模式不同，且分别与不同风险行为相关。�,Campbell and Miller distinguish grandiose narcissism (outgoing, exhibitionistic, admiration-seeking) from vulnerable narcissism (defensive, hypersensitive, easily shamed). Both involve self-centeredness but differ in emotion regulation and interpersonal patterns and link to different risk behaviors.�ans��src��SCampbell, W. K. & Miller, J. D. (2011). 《自恋与自恋型人格障碍手册》.�iCampbell, W. K. & Miller, J. D. (2011). The Handbook of Narcissism and Narcissistic Personality Disorder.��id�0c6f77158a62�body�ٽ舌尖现象指一个词或名字明明知道、却一时想不起来的状态。通常是因为提取线索不足，而非记忆真的丢失。放松或换个思路往往能帮助回忆。�The tip-of-the-tongue phenomenon is the state of knowing a word or name but being temporarily unable to retrieve it. It usually reflects insufficient retrieval cues rather than true loss of the memory. Relaxing or approaching it differently often helps recall.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0d8e672db20d�body��>现代人格研究最常用“大五”模型，把性格归为五个维度：开放性、尽责性、外向性、宜人性和神经质（情绪稳定性）。每个人的分数都落在连续的区间里，没有绝对的好与坏。大五被大量跨文化研究验证，比星座和血型更能稳定预测行为。�HModern personality research relies on the “Big Five”: openness, conscientiousness, extraversion, agreeableness, and neuroticism (emotional stability). Everyone falls somewhere along each continuum — no absolute good or bad. Validated across cultures, the Big Five predicts behavior far better than astrology or blood type.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（人格章）�3Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), personality chapter��id�0dc04d5abeee�body��8研究表明，虚假消息往往比真相传播得更快更广。谣言常带有新奇、惊悚或愤怒的情绪，更容易激起分享欲；同时它迎合人们的既有偏见（确认偏误），并让人产生“我知道内情”的优越感。真相通常平淡、复杂，反而没那么“好传”。�WResearch shows false news typically spreads faster and wider than the truth. Rumors often carry novelty and strong emotions like fear or outrage that trigger sharing, and they flatter our existing biases (confirmation bias) while giving a feeling of being 'in the know.' The truth is usually calmer and more complex, so it travels less easily.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0e66c5622da1�body���睡眠惯性指从深睡中被唤醒后持续数分钟到半小时的认知与运动功能低下，因前额叶与警觉系统尚未完全上线。它尤其常见于从慢波睡眠中醒来，可用光照和轻度活动加速消退。��Sleep inertia is impaired cognition and mobility for minutes to half an hour after waking from deep sleep, as prefrontal and alerting systems are not fully online. It is worst when roused from slow-wave sleep; light and light activity speed recovery.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0e9085e63b3c�body���旁观者效应指在场人数越多，个体出手相助的可能性反而越低。其成因包括责任分散、对情境的模糊性评估，以及从他人反应中获取的「一切正常」的社会信号。��The bystander effect is the finding that the likelihood of help decreases as the number of bystanders grows, driven by diffusion of responsibility, ambiguous situation appraisal, and social cues from others that nothing is wrong.�ans��src�ي达利、拉塔内 (1968). 紧急情况下的旁观者干预：责任分散. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 8(4), 377–383٦Darley, J. M., & Latané, B. (1968). Bystander intervention in emergencies: Diffusion of responsibility. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 8(4), 377–383��id�1031bd1c1151�body���享乐适应指人对正负生活事件的情绪反应会随时间回到稳定基线。布里克曼对彩票中奖者与瘫痪者的经典追踪显示，重大事件带来短暂波动后幸福感均回归原有水平。�,Hedonic adaptation is the tendency for emotional reactions to positive or negative life events to drift back to a stable baseline over time. Brickman's classic follow-up of lottery winners and accident victims showed that after a brief fluctuation, well-being returned to prior levels in both groups.�ans��src�ٶBrickman, Coates, Janoff-Bulman,《Lottery winners and accident victims: Is happiness relative?》,Journal of Personality and Social Psychology,1978 (DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.36.8.917)ٴBrickman, Coates, Janoff-Bulman, 'Lottery winners and accident victims: Is happiness relative?', Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 1978, DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.36.8.917��id�108339b0b6bb�body���单纯曝光效应指人们对越熟悉的事物越产生好感，哪怕没有实质理由。这会影响品牌偏好和人际吸引。它解释了重复广告为何有效，但也需警惕盲目熟悉。��The mere exposure effect is that people like things more the more familiar they are, even without real reason. It shapes brand preference and attraction. It explains why repeated ads work, though blind familiarity warrants caution.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�10d0262a2379�body���大五（OCEAN）包括开放性、尽责性、外倾性、宜人性与神经质。麦克雷与科斯塔通过词汇学与问卷研究确立了这一跨文化稳定结构，常用于预测工作与关系结果。�The Big Five (OCEAN) are Openness, Conscientiousness, Extraversion, Agreeableness, and Neuroticism. McCrae and Costa established this cross-culturally stable structure through lexical and questionnaire research and it is widely used to predict work and relationship outcomes.�ans��src��[McCrae, R. R. & Costa, P. T. (1999). 《人格的五因素理论》. 见《人格手册》.�eMcCrae, R. R. & Costa, P. T. (1999). A five-factor theory of personality. In Handbook of Personality.��id�1160d47e2b07�body�ٷ强撑正能量是否认真实感受，会制造“我连情绪都不对”的二次压力。允许低落存在一会儿，再小步做点具体的事，比假装开心更可持续。��Forcing positivity denies real feeling and creates secondary pressure that even my emotions are wrong. Letting the low mood exist for a while, then doing one small concrete thing, is more sustainable than faking cheer.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�11712d475348�body��w研究区分“过程表扬”（“你很努力”“方法用得好”）和“结果表扬”（“你真聪明”）。总被夸“聪明”的孩子，可能把失败解读为“我不够聪明”，于是回避难题；被夸“努力”的孩子更愿意尝试新挑战。表扬要真诚、具体，把注意力放在过程和策略上，才能真正帮孩子成长。�jResearch contrasts process praise (“you worked hard,” “good strategy”) with person praise (“you're so smart”). Children heavily praised for being smart may read failure as “I'm not smart” and avoid hard tasks; those praised for effort take on new challenges. Sincere, specific praise focused on process and strategy is what truly supports growth.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�122e98085070�body�� 晶体智力是积累的知识与词汇，往往随年龄稳定甚至上升；流体智力是快速推理、加工速度等新能力，通常中年后缓慢下降。因此老人可能在解字谜、懂人情上更强，却在限时新任务上变慢。理解差异有助于扬长避短。�<Crystallized intelligence is accumulated knowledge and vocabulary, often stable or rising with age; fluid intelligence is speed and novel reasoning, usually declining slowly after middle age. So elders may be stronger at crosswords and social wisdom yet slower at timed novel tasks. Knowing this helps use strengths.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�1235775b36ad�body��心理自助包括规律运动、睡眠、写日记、正念等维护情绪的方法，对轻度困扰有帮助。但当情绪持续两周以上、影响学习工作或人际，或出现自伤念头时，应尽早寻求心理咨询师或医生。求助是勇敢而非软弱的表现。�Self-help includes exercise, sleep, journaling, and mindfulness to maintain mood and helps with mild distress. But when mood lasts over two weeks, disrupts work or relationships, or includes self-harm thoughts, seek a counselor or doctor early. Seeking help is brave, not weak.�ans��src�َJorm, A. F. (2000). 《心理健康的素养：公众对精神障碍的知识与信念》. The British Journal of Psychiatry, 177(5), 396-401.ٔJorm, A. F. (2000). Mental health literacy: Public knowledge and beliefs about mental disorders. The British Journal of Psychiatry, 177(5), 396-401.��id�12a17a167860�body��b领导力研究区分交易型领导（用奖惩交换）与变革型领导（描绘愿景、以身作则、关注成员成长）。变革型领导与更高的投入和满意度相关；“魅力”更像结果而不是原因。真正让人追随的，常常是言行一致、值得信任、把团队利益放在心上的行为，而不是头衔本身。��Leadership research contrasts transactional leaders (exchanging rewards and punishments) with transformational ones (articulating vision, modeling values, developing people). Transformational leadership predicts higher engagement and satisfaction; “charisma” looks more like an outcome than a cause. What earns willing followers is consistent, trustworthy, team-serving behavior — not the title itself.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�187398fdb315�body���交错学习是把不同科目或题型混合练习，而不是长时间只做同一种。相比“集中练习”，交错能提升辨别和迁移能力，虽然当下感觉更难。比如学数学时把几种题型混着做效果更好。�Interleaving mixes different subjects or problem types in practice instead of doing one kind for a long time. Compared with 'blocked practice', it improves discrimination and transfer, though it feels harder at the moment. For example, mixing math problem types works better.�ans��src�ٖRohrer, D., & Taylor, K. (2007). The Shifting of Focus Effect: Interleaving improves instructional learning.《Cognitive Instruction》25(3), 208-224.ٓRohrer, D., & Taylor, K. (2007). The shifting of focus effect: Interleaving improves instructional learning. Cognitive Instruction, 25(3), 208-224.��id�1900d7afd51f�body���仅随机分成两组就出现对内群体的偏好与对外群体的贬低（最小群体范式）。它源于身份归属需求与资源倾斜，提醒我们“我们 vs 他们”常是无中生有。��Mere random grouping yields in-group favoritism and out-group derogation (minimal group paradigm). It stems from belonging needs and resource tilt, reminding us that 'us vs them' is often conjured from nothing.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�191bb85a5ce4�body�ٽ越想压住焦虑，越是在暗示“它很危险”，反而放大它；接纳它的存在，会削弱对抗带来的紧张。接纳不等于喜欢，而是腾出空间去该做什么。��Trying to suppress anxiety signals that it is dangerous, which amplifies it; accepting its presence reduces the tension of fighting it. Acceptance is not liking it, but making room to do what matters.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�19f8f167fee6�body���去个体化指在匿名或群体氛围中，个人自我意识减弱、约束力下降，更容易做出平时不会做的冲动行为。网络匿名常放大这种现象。它解释了部分群体暴力和网络攻击。��Deindividuation is when anonymity or a group atmosphere weakens self-awareness and restraint, making people act on impulses they normally would not. Online anonymity often amplifies it. It explains some crowd violence and cyberaggression.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1a3455efc7ea�body���研究发现不同疗法疗效差异不大，真正起作用的是共同因素：治疗关系、共情、期望、卷入与给予希望。具体技术重要，但温暖可信的结盟往往是改变的核心。��Studies find modest differences between therapies; what matters are common factors: the alliance, empathy, expectation, engagement and instilled hope. Specific techniques help, but a warm, trustworthy bond is often the core of change.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�1a363b7f4370�body���睡眠不足时，注意力、工作记忆和情绪调节都会打折，新知识难以稳定存储，第二天的提取也变差。与其牺牲睡眠硬撑，不如保证充足睡眠再高效复习。规律睡眠本身就是学习计划的一部分。�	Sleep deprivation degrades attention, working memory, and emotion regulation; new knowledge doesn't consolidate well and recall suffers the next day. Rather than sacrificing sleep, protect it and study efficiently. Consistent sleep is part of the study plan itself.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1a756be7dd5f�body��位置记忆法是一种古老的记忆技巧，把要记的内容和熟悉的地点（如家里的房间顺序）一一对应，靠在脑中“走一遍”来回忆。古罗马演说家就常用它记住长篇演讲。把抽象信息变成空间画面能提升记忆效果。�5The method of loci is an ancient memory technique that links items to be remembered with familiar locations, such as rooms in your home, and recalls them by mentally 'walking' through the space. Roman orators used it to remember long speeches. Turning abstract information into spatial images improves recall.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1d8727dfd35c�body��为治严重癫痫切断胼胝体后，左右脑信息不互通。经典结果发现左脑擅长语言与序列分析，右脑擅长空间与面孔，但这是倾向而非绝对。它让我们看到大脑功能有偏侧化，却非神话般的“左逻辑右创意”。�6After the corpus callosum is cut to treat severe epilepsy, the hemispheres cannot share info. Classic findings show left-hemisphere strength in language and sequential analysis, right in space and faces—but tendencies, not absolutes. It reveals lateralization, not the myth of 'left logic, right creativity'.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1e50f325c0f7�body���后见之明偏误指事后觉得“我早就知道会这样”，高估自己事前的预测能力。它让人误判风险、过度责难决策者。记录事前判断有助于抵抗这种偏差。��Hindsight bias is the feeling after an event that 'I knew it all along,' overestimating one's prior predictive ability. It misjudges risk and unfairly blames decision-makers. Recording predictions beforehand helps resist it.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�1f23ce8ad26d�body�٫“免费”会不成比例地吸引选择，因省钱的快感压过理性权衡（零价格效应）。结果人们为免运费凑单、拿无用赠品，反而多花。ٲ'Free' attracts choice disproportionately as the pleasure of saving overrides reason (zero-price effect). People add items for free shipping or grab useless gifts, spending more.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�1fc3fe967837�body��M第一个报价会成为“锚点”，悄悄拉高或压低双方的预期区间，后面的讨价还价大多围绕它调整。即使明知对方开价离谱，它仍会影响判断。所以谈判前先想好合理区间，别被对方的数字带着走；反过来，如果你先出价，有理有据的锚点就是你的工具。�KThe first offer becomes an anchor that quietly shifts both sides' expectation range, and bargaining tends to adjust around it. Even an absurd opening number still sways judgment. So set your reasonable range beforehand and don't get dragged by their figure; conversely, if you go first, a well-justified anchor works in your favor.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�219423b7bee8�body�ٷ专注消耗的是同一套注意资源，再喂刺激只是在不同频道继续耗。真正的恢复是低刺激、让默认网络松弛的活动，比如发呆、散步、闭眼。��Focus spends the same attention resource, and more stimulation just keeps spending on another channel. Real recovery is low-stimulus calm that lets the default network loosen, like idling, walking or closing your eyes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�222ef6661cd9�body���多项知名发现无法被独立重复，原因包括小样本、灵活分析、发表偏倚与夸张宣传。这促使学界推动预注册、大样本与开放数据，以重建证据的可靠基础。��Many famous findings failed independent replication, due to small samples, flexible analysis, publication bias and hype. The field now pushes preregistration, large samples and open data to rebuild a reliable evidence base.�ans��src�٤Open Science Collaboration（2015）《Science》重复百项心理学研究；Simmons、Nelson 与 Simonsohn（2011）《Psychological Science》假阳性心理学ٻOpen Science Collaboration (2015), Science, Estimating the reproducibility of psychological science; Simmons, Nelson and Simonsohn (2011), Psychological Science, False-positive psychology��id�22bccfae6ba5�body�ٽ普通担心通常有明确对象且会随事情解决而消失；焦虑障碍的担忧更持久、更难控制，并伴随躯体紧张、易怒和睡眠问题，明显干扰日常功能。��Ordinary worry usually has a clear target and fades once resolved; anxiety disorders involve more persistent, harder-to-control worry with physical tension, irritability, and sleep problems that clearly disrupt daily function.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�22e9f91c8837�body��最近发展区指儿童独立能完成的水平与在更有能力者帮助下能达到的水平之间的差距。教学若落在这一区间、配合“脚手架”支持，最能促进发展。它强调社会互动与文化工具（如语言）在认知成长中的作用。�7The zone of proximal development is the gap between what a child can do alone and what they can do with help from a more capable person. Teaching within this zone with scaffolding support promotes development most. It stresses the role of social interaction and cultural tools like language in cognitive growth.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�24d52b005bbe�body���呼吸是少数能意识控制又自动进行的身体信号；把注意锚定在呼吸上，会激活副交感休息-修复反应，并给走神的念头一个回来的落点。重复练习能增强前额叶对杏仁核的调控。�Breath is one of the few signals we can both control and let run automatically; anchoring attention to it activates the parasympathetic rest-and-repair response and gives wandering thoughts a place to return. Practice strengthens prefrontal regulation of the amygdala.�ans��src��{Goyal 等（2014）《JAMA Internal Medicine》冥想项目系统综述；Kabat-Zinn《Full Catastrophe Living》（1990）كGoyal et al. (2014), JAMA Internal Medicine, systematic review of meditation programmes; Kabat-Zinn, Full Catastrophe Living (1990)��id�25e0fae50082�body�٫团队心理安全感指成员相信冒险发言、认错不会受罚。它预测学习、创新与安全感，由领导示范谦逊与对失误的良性回应所塑造。��Team psychological safety is the shared belief that speaking up or admitting error is safe. It predicts learning, innovation and safety, built when leaders model humility and respond well to failure.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�25ffdd85b5b2�body�ٱ纵向研究在多个时间点追踪同一批人，能看变化顺序与长期结果，比横断面（同一时点）更能逼近因果与发育轨迹，但更贵、易流失。��Longitudinal studies track the same people over time, revealing sequence and long-term outcomes; more than cross-sectional snaps, they approach causation and developmental paths, but cost more and lose subjects.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�260cdcd66cfe�body���更准确地说，多巴胺更多参与“想要”和预期奖励，而非享受当下。它驱动动机、渴望与目标导向行为；真正的愉悦感涉及阿片系统等其它递质。把多巴胺简单等同于快乐是常见的误解。�#More precisely, dopamine is heavily involved in 'wanting' and reward prediction rather than the pleasure of consumption. It drives motivation, craving and goal-directed behavior; actual liking engages opioid and other systems. Equating dopamine with happiness is a common oversimplification.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�26dba2fe42af�body���证据支持语言习得存在敏感/关键期：幼年暴露于语言更易达到母语水平，青春期后语法习得明显变难（如神经可塑性下降与陈述化）。但成人仍可学会二语，只是口音与语法更难地道。�Evidence supports a sensitive/critical period: early language exposure reaches native-like levels more easily; after puberty, grammar acquisition is markedly harder (declining plasticity, more explicit learning). Adults can still learn L2, just with accent/grammar hurdles.�ans��src��Johnson 与 Newport�Johnson & Newport��id�26e349354cd4�body���强烈的情绪会激活应激激素，增强对相关事件的编码和巩固。这能帮助人类记住危险或重要的事，是一种进化优势。但也可能让创伤记忆过度牢固。��Strong emotion triggers stress hormones that enhance the encoding and consolidation of related events. This helps humans remember dangers or important moments, an evolutionary advantage. But it can also make traumatic memories excessively rigid.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�275764ef2e25�body���关键他人的流失直接削减日常互动与意义感，孤独上升又推高炎症与认知下降风险。保持社群、兴趣与轻度照料角色（如带孙、志愿）是保护因素。��Losing key others cuts daily interaction and meaning; rising loneliness then lifts inflammation and cognitive-decline risk. Keeping community, hobbies and light caring roles like grandparenting or volunteering protects.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�29ac652a3618�body���睡眠纺锤波是 N2 期出现的短暂高频脑电爆发，被认为在丘脑与新皮层间搬运记忆，参与将陈述性记忆从海马转移到长期存储，也与抗干扰和智力相关。�␀Sleep spindles are brief high-frequency EEG bursts in N2 sleep, thought to shuttle memory between thalamus and cortex, helping transfer declarative memory from hippocampus to long-term store; they also relate to resilience to interference and intelligence.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2a41cfd0c3f4�body��切换代价指在不同任务间来回切换时会损失时间与正确率，因为大脑需要重新配置规则和注意。研究普遍表明，人并非真正同时做两件需注意的事，而是在快速串行切换。减少频繁切换能显著提升效率。�)The switching cost is the loss of time and accuracy when jumping between tasks because the brain must reconfigure rules and attention. Research shows people do not truly do two attention-demanding tasks at once but switch rapidly in series. Reducing frequent switches markedly improves efficiency.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2b93a86e5f5a�body���IQ 主要测推理、工作记忆、处理速度和语言等通用认知能力，对学业与部分工作表现有中等预测力。它并不涵盖创造力、情商或实践智慧，且深受教育与文化环境影响。�IQ chiefly measures reasoning, working memory, processing speed and verbal ability—general cognitive skill with modest prediction of school and some job performance. It does not capture creativity, emotional skill or practical wisdom, and is shaped by education and culture.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�2c80e19aac9e�body���持续压抑情绪会增加慢性压力、损害人际关系，并与焦虑和躯体化症状相关。适度表达而非压抑，更有利于心理健康。表达方式可以温和而有边界。��Continually suppressing emotion raises chronic stress, harms relationships, and is linked to anxiety and bodily symptoms. Moderate expression rather than suppression supports mental health. Expression can be gentle and boundary-respecting.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2ca605ab0135�body�٥“想开点”常被听成否定痛苦，而稳定的陪伴传递“你不是一个人”。先接住情绪，等对方有力气了，建议才可能被听进去。٭Look on the bright side is often heard as denying pain, while steady presence says you are not alone. Hold the feeling first; advice lands only once the person has strength.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�2cbbdf92e314�body���白天被各种安排填满，夜晚想找回一点掌控感，于是用熬夜来补偿，却透支了第二天的精力，形成越累越熬的循环。用一段短暂的、只属于自己的放松替代熬夜更有效。��When days are packed with obligations, late night feels like reclaiming control, so you stay up to compensate, but this drains next-day energy and feeds a worse cycle. A short wind-down block of your own time works better than staying up.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2d2cd0053143�body��z巅峰表现常伴随“心流”状态：注意力完全锁定在当前动作，脑中自我评价的声音消失，时间感知也随之改变。这不是魔法——高度专注减少了无关信息的处理，让决策和动作更顺畅。进入心流要靠“目标清晰、反馈即时、难度与能力匹配”，普通人也可以在练习中刻意创造这些条件。��Peak performance often involves “flow”: attention fully locked on the present action, self-critical chatter silenced, and time perception distorted. It's not magic — intense focus reduces irrelevant processing, making decisions and movements smoother. Flow arises from clear goals, immediate feedback, and challenge matched to skill, conditions anyone can deliberately create in practice.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�2f13a67b50f9�body���加德纳提出智力是相对独立的多种能力，最初包括语言、逻辑数学、空间、音乐、身体动觉、人际与内省等。该理论强调单一智商无法概括个体优势，常用于教育差异化。�NGardner proposed that intelligence consists of relatively independent abilities, initially including linguistic, logical-mathematical, spatial, musical, bodily-kinesthetic, interpersonal, and intrapersonal intelligences. The theory stresses that a single IQ cannot capture individual strengths and is used in differentiated education.�ans��src��*Gardner, H. (1983). 《智力的结构》.�IGardner, H. (1983). Frames of Mind: The Theory of Multiple Intelligences.��id�30925a5f45ef�body��认知偏差是指人在思考时系统性偏离理性、导致判断出错的思维习惯。例如“确认偏误”指人们倾向于只关注支持自己已有观点的信息，而忽略相反的证据。认识这些偏差能帮我们做出更客观的决定。�4A cognitive bias is a systematic deviation from rational thinking that leads to errors in judgment. For example, confirmation bias is the tendency to notice only information that supports our existing beliefs and ignore contradicting evidence. Recognizing these biases helps us make more objective decisions.�ans��src��!Kahneman 《思考，快与慢》�!Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow��id�3209243327a0�body���塞利格曼发现，反复承受不可控电击的狗后来即便可逃脱也不尝试。这种控制感丧失被推广到人类抑郁：认为努力无效会削弱动机与希望，是抑郁的认知模型之一。�Seligman found that dogs subjected to uncontrollable shocks later stopped trying to escape even when they could. This loss of perceived control was extended to human depression: believing effort is futile erodes motivation and hope, forming one cognitive model of depression.�ans��src��ESeligman, M. E. P. (1975). 《无助: 论抑郁、发展与死亡》.�OSeligman, M. E. P. (1975). Helplessness: On Depression, Development, and Death.��id�32c7bbbc1dd3�body�ٽ“选择过载”会让每个选项的取舍成本上升，担心选错又放大了后悔的预期。先定一个标准（比如今晚想吃辣还是清淡）能大幅降低决策负担。��Choice overload raises the cost of weighing every option, and fear of picking wrong magnifies expected regret. Picking one criterion first, like do I want something spicy or light tonight, sharply cuts the decision load.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�33241d02d776�body���长期压力持续激活下丘脑-垂体-肾上腺轴，使皮质醇长期偏高，进而削弱免疫、扰乱睡眠并损伤海马。这种「劳损」效应将心理压力转化为心血管与代谢疾病的生理风险。�Chronic stress keeps the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis activated, sustaining high cortisol that suppresses immunity, disrupts sleep, and damages the hippocampus. This allostatic load translates psychological stress into cardiovascular and metabolic risk.�ans��src��G《神经科学》(Bear 等);《心理学年度评论》健康心理卷�KNeuroscience (Bear et al.); Annual Review of Psychology (health psychology)��id�333a66443b42�body��,缓慢深长的呼吸会激活副交感神经系统——身体的“刹车系统”，让心跳放慢、肌肉放松，同时给大脑发出“安全”的信号。反过来，短促的呼吸会维持紧张状态。这也是为什么许多压力缓解技术都以“慢慢呼吸”作为第一步。�-Slow, deep breaths activate the parasympathetic nervous system — the body's brake — slowing the heart, relaxing muscles, and signaling “safe” to the brain. Rapid shallow breathing, by contrast, keeps tension running. That's why so many stress-relief techniques start with “breathe slowly.”�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3345129b1e5a�body���大多数中年人并无戏剧性危机；研究更支持中年是重评期：在责任最重时重新平衡工作、家庭与意义。真正风险来自未达成预期的落差，而非年龄本身。��Most midlife adults have no dramatic crisis; research supports midlife as a re-evaluation period rebalancing work, family and meaning at peak responsibility. Real risk comes from gaps between expectation and reality, not age itself.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�338ee7e7d18d�body���选择过载指当选项过多时，人们反而更难抉择、满意度更低且更易后悔。施瓦茨与同事的研究表明，适度限制选项能提升决策信心与后续满意度，这对产品设计与公共选择有重要启示。�Choice overload is the finding that too many options reduce ease of choosing, satisfaction, and increase regret. Schwartz and colleagues showed that limiting options can raise confidence and post-choice satisfaction, with implications for design and policy.�ans��src��Y《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 决策卷;Nature Human Behaviour�EAnnual Review of Psychology (decision making); Nature Human Behaviour��id�33dad06102d1�body�ٺ社会懈怠指个人在群体中出力少于单独时，因贡献难被识别、责任分散。可逆：让个人产出可衡量、目标有意义、成员相互依存时懈怠下降。��Social loafing is exerting less in a group because effort is hard to spot and responsibility diffuses. It reverses when individual output is measurable, goals matter, and members depend on each other.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�34c857b5d85a�body���聚光灯比喻注意像一束光，照亮某处并提升该处加工；变焦镜头比喻注意范围可大可小——范围越大，每点分辨率越低。两者说明注意既可选位置，也可调广度。��The spotlight metaphor says attention illuminates a location and boosts its processing; the zoom-lens metaphor says its scope can widen or narrow—wider scope lowers resolution per point. Both show attention selects location and adjusts breadth.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�34d48c3fe8f5�body���睡眠不足会放大情绪反应、削弱前额叶调控并升高焦虑与抑郁风险；反过来，抑郁与焦虑也常伴失眠。改善睡眠常能缓解情绪症状，使其成为心理干预的重要切入点。��Poor sleep amplifies emotional reactivity, weakens prefrontal control, and raises anxiety and depression risk, while those disorders also commonly cause insomnia. Improving sleep often eases mood symptoms, making it a key intervention target.�ans��src��@《神经科学》(Bear 等);Nature Human Behaviour 睡眠研究�CNeuroscience (Bear et al.); Nature Human Behaviour (sleep research)��id�34f86658c769�body���班杜拉指出，人可以通过观察别人的行为及其后果来学习，而不必自己试错，这叫观察学习或模仿。他的“波波娃娃实验”显示儿童会模仿成人对玩偶的攻击。榜样和媒体内容因此影响很大。�"Bandura showed that people learn by observing others' behavior and its consequences without trial and error, called observational learning or modeling. His 'Bobo doll experiment' showed children imitate adults' aggression toward a doll. Role models and media therefore have great influence.�ans��src��Bandura 波波娃娃实验�Bandura Bobo doll experiment��id�3517753b61c5�body���在最后通牒博弈中，接受方常拒绝明显不公的分配，哪怕自己也会损失——说明人愿意花钱惩罚不公平。这表明经济行为深受公平规范与情绪驱动，而非纯自利。��In the ultimatum game, responders often reject unfair splits even at personal cost, showing willingness to pay to punish unfairness. Economic behavior is driven by fairness norms and emotion, not pure self-interest.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�3519a537344f�body��皮亚杰所说的前运算期自我中心，指儿童难以从他人视角看世界，常以为自己看到的别人也看到。例如三山任务中，孩子会选自己视角下的山的样子当作别人的答案。这并非自私，而是视角采择能力尚未成熟。�Piaget's preoperational egocentrism is the child's difficulty taking another's viewpoint, assuming others see what they see. In the three-mountains task, a child picks the view from their own seat as the other's answer. It is not selfish but an immature ability to take perspectives.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�352240fc0c48�body���行为成瘾（游戏、手机）和物质成瘾共享核心特征：失控地重复、耐受（需要更多刺激才满足）、戒断时不适、影响学习生活。但它们的危害程度通常不同，且机制是过度激活同一套奖赏回路。重要的是别污名化：这不是“意志力差”，而是习惯与神经适应。减少使用靠改变环境线索和寻找替代活动，而不是自我惩罚。��Behavioral addictions (gaming, phone use) share core features with substance addiction: loss of control, tolerance (needing more stimulation), discomfort when stopping, and harm to life. But their harm is usually milder, and both over-activate the same reward circuitry. Importantly, avoid stigma: this isn't weak willpower — it's habits and neural adaptation. Cutting back works through changing environmental cues and finding alternatives, not self-punishment.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�35a8bb3f0fe2�body���研究者为得到显著的 p<0.05，会偷偷尝试多种分析、剔除离群或只报告成功变量，人为抬高假阳性。它源于发表偏倚与“显著才发表”的奖励结构，是可信危机的重要来源。��To reach p<0.05, researchers may try many analyses, drop outliers or report only winning variables, inflating false positives. Driven by publication bias and 'significant-or-buried' incentives, it is a major source of the credibility crisis.�ans��src�٤Open Science Collaboration（2015）《Science》重复百项心理学研究；Simmons、Nelson 与 Simonsohn（2011）《Psychological Science》假阳性心理学ٻOpen Science Collaboration (2015), Science, Estimating the reproducibility of psychological science; Simmons, Nelson and Simonsohn (2011), Psychological Science, False-positive psychology��id�35b193364e33�body���内在动机（因兴趣/意义而为）通常更持久、带来更深投入；外在动机（为奖赏/避免惩罚）短期有效但易依赖。不过外在动机可通过内化转化为自主驱动，关键是让人感到行为与自身价值相连。�Intrinsic motivation (for interest/meaning) is usually more durable and deeply engaging; extrinsic (rewards/punishment) works short-term but breeds dependence. Yet extrinsic can be internalized into autonomous drive—when behavior feels linked to one's values.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�38bf25b8436f�body��u这叫“社会促进/观众效应”：他人在场会提高唤醒水平，让熟练、简单的动作做得更好，却让不熟练或需要精细思考的任务更容易出错。所以“人来疯”和“一上台就紧张”都有道理——关键在任务的熟练程度和对评价的敏感度。把技能练到足够熟练，观众常常会从干扰变成助力。��That's social facilitation: the presence of others raises arousal, boosting well-learned, simple performance while making unfamiliar or mentally demanding tasks more error-prone. So both “shows off with a crowd” and “freezes on stage” are real — it depends on skill mastery and sensitivity to evaluation. Practice a skill to fluency, and the audience often shifts from interference to fuel.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会心理学章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social psychology chapter��id�3beb7c8e6ce4�body���去个体化指匿名与群体淹没感削弱自我觉察与规范约束，使人更易随群体冲动（如网络喷子、骚乱）。责任分散与自我意识降低是主因，恢复可识别身份可抑制。��Deindividuation: anonymity and being submerged in a crowd weaken self-awareness and norms, making people follow group impulses (trolls, riots). Diffusion of responsibility and lowered self-awareness drive it; restoring identifiability curbs it.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3c5ea033ba4f�body�ٿ该模型说行为取决于对威胁的感知（易感性+严重度）与行动收益/障碍。人们常低估风险、高估麻烦，所以科普要同时降障碍、增易感与效能感。��The model says behavior hinges on perceived threat (susceptibility+severity) vs. action benefits/barriers. People under-rate risk and over-rate hassle, so messaging must cut barriers and raise susceptibility and self-efficacy.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3c5ecc4e7e67�body���Deci 与 Ryan 提出，满足自主（autonomy）、胜任（competence）、关系（relatedness）三种基本心理需求时，内在动机最强且最持久；靠外部奖惩驱动的行为一旦奖励撤走就易停止。��Deci and Ryan argue that satisfying autonomy, competence, and relatedness yields the strongest, most lasting intrinsic motivation; externally rewarded behavior often stops once rewards vanish.�ans��src��uDeci & Ryan,《Intrinsic Motivation and Self-Determination in Human Behavior》,1985 (DOI: 10.1007/978-1-4899-2271-7)�rDeci & Ryan, 'Intrinsic Motivation and Self-Determination in Human Behavior', 1985, DOI: 10.1007/978-1-4899-2271-7��id�3d9eb470ead5�body���疼痛既是生理信号，也受注意和情绪放大：越关注、越焦虑，大脑对痛的感知就越强。分散注意力（如听音乐、聊天）能有效减轻痛感。这叫“闸门控制理论”的部分体现。��Pain is both a physiological signal and amplified by attention and emotion: the more we focus and worry, the stronger the brain's pain perception. Distraction (music, talking) can effectively reduce pain. This partly reflects the 'gate control theory'.�ans��src��&闸门控制理论（Melzack & Wall）�$Gate control theory (Melzack & Wall)��id�3e61bf3cc5a0�body���适度紧张能让人集中注意力，但过度焦虑会占用工作记忆、扰乱思路，按“倒U型”规律，唤醒过高反而让表现下降。深呼吸和充分准备有助于把紧张控制在合适水平。��A little nervousness sharpens focus, but too much anxiety eats up working memory and tangles thinking; by the inverted-U rule, excessive arousal lowers performance. Deep breathing and preparation help keep nervousness in the right range.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3e76475cfd39�body��G这叫安慰剂效应：当人期待治疗有效时，大脑会启动自己的调节系统，缓解疼痛、改善情绪，甚至产生可测量的生理变化。这不是“骗自己”，而是身心联结的真实证据。正因为期待影响结果，正规的临床试验都要设置安慰剂对照来排除这种效应。�EThe placebo effect: when we expect a treatment to work, the brain activates its own regulatory systems, easing pain and mood with measurable physiological changes. It's not “fooling yourself” — it's real evidence of mind-body connection. That's why proper clinical trials use placebo controls to filter this effect out.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（健康与治疗章）�4Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), health and treatment��id�3eff29611494�body���把创伤或压力事件写下来，有助于理清思绪、降低情绪强度，并改善身心健康状况。研究表明它能减少就医次数和提升情绪调节力。关键在于坦诚、持续地书写。��Writing down traumatic or stressful events helps organize thoughts, lower emotional intensity, and improve mental and physical health. Studies link it to fewer doctor visits and better emotion regulation. The key is honest, sustained writing.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�40211c142c92�body���心理学家乔治·米勒提出，工作记忆的容量约为 7±2 个组块，即大约 5 到 9 条独立信息。通过把零散信息组块化（如把数字组合成电话号码），人们可以突破单纯的容量限制。�Psychologist George Miller proposed that working memory holds about 7±2 chunks, roughly five to nine independent units. By chunking scattered information (for example combining digits into a phone number), people can effectively exceed the raw capacity limit.�ans��src��MMiller, G. A. (1956). 《神奇的数字 7±2》. 《心理学评论》63卷.�\Miller, G. A. (1956). The magical number seven, plus or minus two. Psychological Review, 63.��id�4054dca43038�body���沉没成本谬误指因为已经投入时间或金钱而继续一项本应放弃的行动。理性决策只看未来成本与收益，但人们常把已付出且不可收回的投入当作继续的理由，造成进一步损失。��The sunk cost fallacy is continuing a failing course of action because of prior investment. Rational choice weighs only future costs and benefits, yet people treat irrecoverable past costs as reasons to persist, deepening losses.�ans��src�ِArkes 与 Blumer,《The psychology of sunk cost》,Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes,1985 (DOI: 10.1016/0749-5978(85)90049-4)ٌArkes & Blumer, 'The psychology of sunk cost', Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes, 1985, DOI: 10.1016/0749-5978(85)90049-4��id�418a9658ad90�body���双盲中研究者和参与者都不知道谁在接受处理，避免期望与行为泄露影响结果（如安慰剂效应、观察者偏差）。单盲只藏一方，三盲还含数据分析者。��In double-blind, neither researcher nor participant knows who gets the treatment, blocking expectation and behavior leakage (placebo, observer bias). Single-blind hides one side; triple-blind also hides analysts.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�41a0baf0aaac�body��J大脑短时存储的项目有限，但可以给信息“打包”。把 137911844 分成 137-911-844 三组，就只用占三个位置，这就是组块策略。组块的内容可以是一个数字、一个词，甚至一个有意义的短语——所以记忆高手记东西靠的是给信息“编故事”，而不是硬背。�7Short-term storage holds only so many items, but the brain can “package” information. Splitting 137911844 into 137-911-844 takes just three slots — that's chunking. A chunk can be a digit, a word, or a meaningful phrase, which is why memory experts weave facts into stories instead of rote repeating them.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（记忆章）�.Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), memory chapter��id�4283d91bfa08�body�٨不是。共情是努力理解对方的感受和立场，赞同是价值判断，两者可以分开。你能懂他为什么生气，同时仍认为他的做法不对。��No. Empathy is trying to understand the other person's feeling and view, while agreement is a value judgment, and the two can be separate. You can get why he is angry and still think his action is wrong.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�439785e71215�body��慈心禅是把善意依次导向自己、亲友、陌生人甚至难相处的人的练习，目标是培养温暖与联结感；而呼吸专注训练的是稳定注意。研究发现慈心禅可提升积极情绪与社会连接，对自我批评高的人尤其有帮助。�(Loving-kindness meditation directs goodwill in turn to self, loved ones, strangers and even difficult people, aiming to cultivate warmth and connection; breath focus trains stable attention. Studies link it to more positive emotion and social connection, especially helpful for the self-critical.�ans��src��o《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 冥想研究卷;Nature Human Behaviour 正念元分析�eAnnual Review of Psychology (meditation research); Nature Human Behaviour (mindfulness meta-analysis)��id�43d743b864f2�body��焦虑障碍涵盖广泛性焦虑、惊恐障碍、社交焦虑与特定恐惧等类型。认知行为疗法通过识别并修正导致焦虑的扭曲认知，并结合系统性暴露练习来降低回避行为，其疗效已被大量随机对照试验证实。�2Anxiety disorders include generalized anxiety, panic disorder, social anxiety, and specific phobias. Cognitive behavioral therapy reduces avoidance by identifying and restructuring distorted thoughts and pairing them with systematic exposure, an approach validated by numerous randomized controlled trials.�ans��src��B美国心理学会(APA)循证治疗指南;《心理学与生活》�jAmerican Psychological Association (APA) Evidence-Based Practice Guidelines; Psychology: The Adaptive Mind��id�453e77f88522�body��强烈的情绪（如惊吓或喜悦）会促使身体释放肾上腺素等激素，帮助大脑更牢固地编码记忆。这叫“闪光灯记忆”，比如很多人清楚记得自己听到重大新闻时的场景。但情绪也可能让记忆细节出现偏差。�Strong emotions such as fear or joy trigger hormones like adrenaline that help the brain encode memories more firmly. This is called a 'flashbulb memory'—many people vividly recall where they were during major news events. However, emotion can also distort memory details.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�45b8ba089a9a�body���内部语言（内心独白）是默念而不出声的语言活动，借助布罗卡等语言区运行。它用于计划、自我指导和调节情绪，并非所有人每时每刻都有，强度因人而异。��Inner speech is silent, unvoiced language activity engaging Broca's and related areas. It is used for planning, self-guidance and emotion regulation, and not everyone experiences it constantly—its vividness varies between people.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�483232849a02�body���自我决定理论提出，当自主、胜任和关系三种基本心理需求被满足时，人的内在动机和幸福感最强。它强调外部环境要支持而非控制。常用于教育和职场激励。�Self-determination theory proposes that when the three basic needs of autonomy, competence, and relatedness are met, intrinsic motivation and well-being are strongest. It stresses environments should support rather than control. It is used in education and workplace motivation.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4a99865f262f�body��G这就是“心流”：当任务难度正好匹配你的能力、目标明确、反馈即时时，人会全神贯注到忘了时间和自己。奇克森特米哈伊通过访谈艺术家、运动员等人发现了这种状态。心流能带来纯粹的满足感，而“做太难或太简单的事”都不容易进入心流。�]That's “flow”: when challenge matches your skills, goals are clear, and feedback is immediate, attention becomes so absorbed that time and self-consciousness disappear. Csikszentmihalyi discovered this state by interviewing artists, athletes, and others. Flow brings deep satisfaction, and it's hard to enter when a task is too hard or too easy.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（幸福与心流章）�3Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), flow and well-being��id�503a688261b2�body���正念不消除痛的感觉信号，而是改变你对痛的反应用——少灾难化、少对抗；脑成像显示它降低痛的不快评级多于痛的强度。对慢性痛患者，这能减少痛苦与药物依赖。��Mindfulness does not erase the pain signal but changes your reaction—less catastrophizing, less struggling; imaging shows it lowers pain unpleasantness more than intensity. For chronic pain this reduces suffering and medication reliance.�ans��src���Price, C. C., Dolezal, C. S., Carmody, J., Guckerman, C., & Erlikh, J. (2008). The effects of mindfulness-based stress reduction on pain, mood, and immune function in persons with knee osteoarthritis.《Journal of Behavioral Medicine》31(5), 399-412.��Price, C. C., Dolezal, C. S., Carmody, J., Guckerman, C., & Erlikh, J. (2008). The effects of mindfulness-based stress reduction on pain, mood, and immune function in persons with knee osteoarthritis. Journal of Behavioral Medicine, 31(5), 399-412.��id�50c0910b4298�body��马基雅维利主义指一种策略性、工具性的人际操纵倾向：为达目的灵活变通、冷淡算计、不介意利用他人。它与自恋、精神病态共同构成暗黑三联征。适度时表现为务实，过度则损害信任与合作。�
Machiavellianism is a strategic, instrumental tendency to manipulate: flexible, coolly calculative, and willing to use others for goals. With narcissism and psychopathy it forms the dark triad. In moderation it is pragmatic; in excess it harms trust and cooperation.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�531162efa79e�body�ٺ生态效度指研究发现推广到真实情境的程度。高度控制常牺牲真实（如记忆用无意义音节），所以结论外推要小心，需用现场研究交叉验证。ٺEcological validity is how well findings generalize to real life. Tight control often costs realism (memorizing nonsense syllables), so generalization needs field studies to cross-check.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�5395d5443cd7�body���“成为谁”太抽象、难检验，容易停在想象；“每天做一点”是可执行、可反馈的具体行为，更容易积累成改变。身份是行动的结果，不是起点。��Who to become is too abstract and hard to check, stalling in imagination; what to do each day is actionable and feedback-rich, easier to accumulate into change. Identity is the result of action, not its start.�ans��src�وGollwitzer,《Implementation intentions: Strong effects of simple plans.》,American Psychologist,1999 (DOI: 10.1037/0003-066x.54.7.493)نGollwitzer, 'Implementation intentions: Strong effects of simple plans.', American Psychologist, 1999, DOI: 10.1037/0003-066x.54.7.493��id�53a0e16d8d71�body���对自己我们掌握全部“幕后信息”，任何小错都被反复回放；对别人我们只看到结果。练习用对待朋友的方式对待自己，能减少这种自我批评的偏差。��For ourselves we hold all the behind-the-scenes details and replay every small error, while for others we see only the outcome. Treating yourself as you would a friend reduces this self-critical bias.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�53ef0d0ced3d�body���Zimbardo 让学生随机扮演看守/囚犯，迅速出现虐待与顺从，意在显示情境与角色的力量。但后来被批评方法不严谨、实验者引导、样本小且不可重复，提醒我们谨慎推广情境决定一切。��Zimbardo had students randomly play guards/prisoners; abuse and submission emerged fast, meant to show situational/role power. Later criticized for weak method, experimenter coaching, small non-replicable sample—caution against situation explains all.�ans��src��Zimbardo (1971)�Zimbardo (1971)��id�5471fd438952�body���常模是某一代表性群体的分数分布，用来解释个人分数是高还是低。脱离常模，单个原始分没有意义；好的常模需与受测者同文化、同年龄层才有参考价值。��A norm is the score distribution of a representative reference group, used to interpret whether a person's score is high or low. Without norms a raw score means little; good norms must match the test-taker's culture and age to be useful.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�5865403351ec�body���Posner 与 Petersen 提出警觉（维持唤醒）、定向（选位并移动注意）、执行控制（解决冲突）三个独立又协作的网络，分别关联不同脑区。该框架成为研究注意障碍与 ADHD 的常用基础。�Posner and Petersen proposed three interacting networks—alerting (sustaining arousal), orienting (selecting and moving attention), and executive control (resolving conflict)—linked to distinct brain regions. It is a common framework for attention deficits and ADHD.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�58f2c679a8d2�body���特质是相对稳定、跨情境的人格倾向（如容易焦虑）；状态是特定时刻的暂时心理生理状况（如此刻很紧张）。同一个人特质高，但在不同状态下表现波动，测量时需区分基线与即时。��A trait is a stable, cross-situational disposition (e.g., anxious-prone); a state is a temporary here-and-now condition (e.g., tense right now). A high-trait person still fluctuates by state; assessment must separate baseline from momentary.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5a57ab3b2d37�body���维果茨基提出，最近发展区是孩子“在帮助下能做到、单独还做不到”的任务区间。成人和同伴的恰当引导（脚手架）能帮孩子跨越这个区。这提示教学应略高于孩子当前水平。�Vygotsky described the zone of proximal development as tasks a child can do with help but not yet alone. Proper guidance (scaffolding) from adults or peers helps the child cross this zone. It suggests teaching should be slightly above the child's current level.�ans��src��Vygotsky 社会文化理论�Vygotsky sociocultural theory��id�5b30ae428356�body��责任分散指当多人可提供帮助时，每个人觉得“总有人会做”，于是个人责任感被稀释。它是旁观者效应的核心机制之一。明确指派具体人（如“穿蓝衣的你，请报警”）能打破分散、提高救助率。��Diffusion of responsibility is that when many could help, each feels someone else will, so personal duty thins. It is a core mechanism of the bystander effect. Naming a specific person, like you in blue, call the police, breaks diffusion and raises help.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5b4b6aaefbbc�body���实验发现语言习惯会影响非语言任务：如把时间想成“前/后”还是“上/下”会影响记忆排列；说强时态语言的人更倾向储蓄。这表明语言范畴会渗透进抽象的推理与决策。�Experiments show linguistic habits leak into non-linguistic tasks: whether time is framed as front/back or up/down shifts how memories are arranged; speakers of strong-future-tensed languages save more. Language categories can seep into abstract reasoning and decisions.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5c50bb1297d6�body��w这是巴甫洛夫发现的经典条件反射：原本中性的刺激（铃声）反复与重要事件（上课）配对后，单独出现也能引发相同的反应。铃声本身不会让人想回教室，但无数次与上课同时出现后，大脑就把它们绑在了一起。很多“下意识反应”（闻到某种味道就想起某件事）都是这么形成的。�hDiscovered by Pavlov, classical conditioning means a neutral cue (the bell) paired repeatedly with something important (class time) starts triggering the same response by itself. The bell means nothing alone, but after countless pairings the brain binds them together. Many automatic reactions — a smell instantly recalling a place — form exactly this way.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（学习章）�0Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), learning chapter��id�5f0309790276�body��基本归因错误指解释他人行为时过度归因于其性格，而低估情境因素，比如看到人摔倒就怪其笨而非地面滑。自己出错时却更强调情境，这叫行动者-观察者差异。它揭示我们评价自己与他人的双重标准。�(The fundamental attribution error is over-explaining others' acts by personality and under-weighting situation, like blaming a faller for clumsiness not the slippery floor. For our own errors we cite situation more, the actor-observer difference. It reveals a double standard for self and others.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5f57c912dc75�body�ٷ刻板印象是对某群体的笼统看法，偏见则是对该群体带有负面评价的情绪态度。偏见可能导致歧视行为。两者相关但分属认知与情感层面。��A stereotype is a generalized belief about a group, while prejudice is a negative evaluative attitude toward that group. Prejudice can lead to discriminatory behavior. They are related but sit at the cognitive and affective levels respectively.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�605005276310�body��谢里夫把男孩随机分组夏令营，组内很快形成认同，组间因竞赛爆发冲突；但当安排需两组合作才能完成的共同目标时，敌意下降。它实证了现实利益冲突制造偏见，而超级目标（superordinate goals）能缓和群际对立。�"Sherif randomly grouped boys at camp; identities formed fast and competition bred conflict, but shared goals needing both groups' cooperation lowered hostility. It showed real conflict creates prejudice while superordinate goals ease intergroup rivalry. It is a classic field demonstration.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�610b0b843b50�body��费孝通用差序格局描述以自己为中心、按亲疏远近外推的关系圈。心理学上这对应关系取向：对内圈偏情感与责任，对外圈偏规则与交换，这种弹性并非双标，而是关系文化的运作方式，也会影响公平判断。�&Fei Xiaotong described a differential mode: relation circles centered on the self, widening by closeness. Psychologically this is relational orientation: more emotion and duty inside, more rules and exchange outside. This flexibility is how relation-culture works and shapes fairness judgments.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�61a6eb97533e�body�٥散步结合轻微活动、自然光和脱离屏幕，能重置注意力并提升下午的警觉；刷手机则继续喂给大脑碎片刺激，休息得不彻底。ٵA walk mixes light movement, daylight and screen break, resetting attention and lifting afternoon alertness, while scrolling keeps feeding fragmented stimuli and rests incompletely.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�621bf8fbd7cf�body���自我怜悯是用善待朋友的方式对待自己的失败与痛苦，包含正念、共通人性与自我友善。与依赖“比别人好”的自尊不同，它不靠比较，因此更稳定且更少引发防御。��Self-compassion treats your own failure and pain as you would a friend's, with mindfulness, common humanity and self-kindness. Unlike self-esteem, which leans on 'being better', it needs no comparison, making it steadier and less defensive.�ans��src��ZNeff, K. D. (2003). 《自我关怀量表的开发与验证》. 《自我与身份》2卷.�kNeff, K. D. (2003). Development and validation of a scale to measure self-compassion. Self and Identity, 2.��id�636fd3555247�body���2010 年代多项大型重复实验发现，许多经典与高影响力研究无法被成功复制，效应显著缩水。这暴露了 p-hacking、灵活分析与发表偏倚等问题，推动了开放科学改革。��In the 2010s large replication projects found many classic and high-impact findings failed to reproduce, with sharply reduced effects. This exposed p-hacking, flexible analysis, and publication bias, spurring open-science reform.�ans��src��Y《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 方法卷;Nature Human Behaviour�=Annual Review of Psychology (methods); Nature Human Behaviour��id�6434bc402c42�body���共情型 AI 能基于语言与语调匹配恰当回应、提供陪伴与情绪支持，但它没有真实感受，只是对线索的模式拟合。它可辅助疏导，却不能替代人际共情与专业帮助。��Empathetic AI can match apt responses from language and tone, offering companionship and support, but it has no real feelings—only pattern fitting to cues. It can assist soothing yet cannot replace human empathy or professional help.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�66b761ec027c�body���道德心理学家海特提出，很多道德判断首先来自快速的情绪直觉，理性的理由常常是“事后的解释”。比如面对某些场景，人的反应先于论证。这并不意味着直觉不可靠，而是提醒我们：既然直觉先于理由，反思“我为什么会这么想”就格外重要，也能帮助我们理解为什么他人的道德反应与自己不同。��Moral psychologist Haidt proposes that many moral judgments begin as fast emotional intuitions, with rational reasons often arriving as after-the-fact explanations. Faced with certain situations, people react before they can argue. This doesn't make intuition unreliable — it just means reflecting on “why do I feel this way” matters, and it helps explain why others' moral reactions differ from ours.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�694cfe65fcb6�body���定期记录感恩事项会训练注意偏向积极、削弱适应（hedonic treadmill），提升主观幸福感，部分研究亦报告睡眠改善。关键是具体、真诚，而非机械打卡。��Regularly noting gratitude trains attention to the positive and slows adaptation (hedonic treadmill), lifting well-being; some studies also report sleep benefits. Keys are specificity and sincerity, not mechanical checklists.�ans��src���Emmons 与 McCullough,《Counting blessings versus burdens: An experimental investigation of gratitude and subjective well-being in daily life.》,Journal of Personality and Social Psychology,2003 (DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.84.2.377)��Emmons & McCullough, 'Counting blessings versus burdens: An experimental investigation of gratitude and subjective well-being in daily life.', Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 2003, DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.84.2.377��id�6b125b930913�body���自控依赖前额叶，能量与睡眠不足会削弱它，同时身体用高糖高脂快速补能。这是自我损耗与代谢信号的共同结果；规律进食与睡眠比硬扛意志力更有效。��Self-control relies on the prefrontal cortex, weakened by low energy and lost sleep, while the body seeks quick fuel from sugar and fat. It is both ego-depletion and metabolic signaling; regular meals and sleep beat raw willpower.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6b646fe22496�body���反刍是反复咀嚼“我为什么这么糟/事情多糟”却不求解，会延长负面心境、强化消极自我图式并阻碍问题解决。打断它的办法常是具体行为（运动、做事）而非继续想。��Rumination is chewing 'why am I so bad / why is it so bad' without seeking solutions; it prolongs low mood, strengthens negative self-schemas and blocks problem-solving. Breaking it needs concrete action (exercise, tasks), not more thinking.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6c811528a8b9�body���身体扫描把注意力从纷乱的念头转移到身体的感觉上，降低生理唤起，让交感神经系统安静下来。配合固定作息，它会变成一个提示“该休息了”的信号。ټBody scan moves attention from racing thoughts to bodily sensations, lowering arousal and quieting the sympathetic system. With a regular schedule it becomes a cue that it is time to rest.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6d8c0715421f�body���快速眼动睡眠是睡眠中眼球快速转动、梦境生动、身体近乎瘫痪的阶段，对情绪和记忆整合很重要。它通常占总睡眠的20%左右，整夜中循环出现。缺乏它会让人情绪不稳。��REM sleep is the stage with rapid eye movements, vivid dreams, and near-paralysis of the body, important for emotion and memory integration. It is about 20% of total sleep and recurs in cycles through the night. Lacking it makes mood unstable.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6e1aacc2a2d1�body�ٺ红点触发好奇心与“万一重要”的担忧，是一种强大的注意捕获；每次点开都留下注意力残留。关掉非必要通知，是保护专注最便宜的办法。��A badge triggers curiosity and worry it might be important, a strong attention capture, and each open leaves residue. Turning off non-essential notifications is the cheapest way to protect focus.�ans��src�٠Petrić Howe, Graham,《Briefing Chat: Can’t focus? It’s not your attention span, it’s your notifications》,Nature,2026 (DOI: 10.1038/d41586-026-01510-y)ٞPetrić Howe, Graham, 'Briefing Chat: Can’t focus? It’s not your attention span, it’s your notifications', Nature, 2026, DOI: 10.1038/d41586-026-01510-y��id�6f272f29fa76�body�ٺ放空是注意力松散地飘走，而正念是带着觉察把注意力安在呼吸或身体上，不评判地回到当下。前者是休息，后者是种需要练习的专注能力。��Zoning out lets attention drift loosely, while mindfulness places attention on the breath or body with awareness and returns to the present without judgment. One is rest, the other is a focus skill that takes practice.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6f6c2e196cd1�body���该实验让志愿者随机扮演狱警与囚犯，迅速出现角色行为极端化，常被引用说明情境力量。但后续研究指出其样本小、程序缺乏盲法、实验者引导可能放大效应，结论的普适性受限。�␀The study assigned volunteers to guard or prisoner roles and observed rapid role extremism, often cited as evidence for situational power. Later critiques note its small sample, lack of blinding, and possible experimenter cueing, limiting generalizability.�ans��src���哈尼、班克斯、津巴多 (1973). 模拟监狱中的人际动力. International Journal of Criminology and Penology, 1, 69–97；Le Texier,《Debunking the Stanford Prison Experiment》,American Psychologist,2019 (DOI: 10.1037/amp0000401)�Haney, C., Banks, C., & Zimbardo, P. (1973). Interpersonal dynamics in a simulated prison. International Journal of Criminology and Penology, 1, 69–97; Le Texier, 'Debunking the Stanford Prison Experiment', American Psychologist, 2019, DOI: 10.1037/amp0000401��id�6fa9b98abe6d�body���心流是人在挑战与技能匹配时全神投入、忘记时间的最佳体验状态，由契克森米哈赖提出。它带来高度满足和高效能。设定清晰目标和即时反馈有助于进入。��Flow is a state of total absorption where challenge matches skill and time is forgotten, proposed by Csikszentmihalyi. It brings deep satisfaction and high performance. Clear goals and immediate feedback help enter it.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�709640a53c64�body���群体极化指成员原已偏向某立场，讨论后倾向更极端。机制包括信息重复强化、想显得比同伴更忠诚、以及责任分散。它解释网络回音室与陪审团极端化。��Group polarization: members already leaning one way end up more extreme after discussion, via repeated reinforcing info, wanting to out-devote peers, and diffusion of responsibility. It explains online echo chambers and jury extremism.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7122b697d58e�body���Locke 发现模糊目标（如尽力）效果差，而具体且稍有难度的目标最能提升表现，因为清晰标准指引努力与反馈。但目标过难会挫败，需配合进展反馈与能力匹配。��Locke found vague goals (do your best) underperform; specific, moderately hard goals boost performance most by directing effort and feedback. Too-hard goals frustrate—pair with progress feedback and ability fit.�ans��src��Locke 与 Latham (1990)�Locke & Latham (1990)��id�727fe7e9b080�body��青春期时，负责情绪和奖励的边缘系统先成熟，而负责自控的前额叶皮层要到二十多岁才完全发育。这种“不平衡”解释了青少年为何更容易冲动、爱冒险。充足的睡眼和稳定支持能帮助平稳度过。�In adolescence, the emotion- and reward-related limbic system matures first, while the self-control prefrontal cortex is not fully developed until the twenties. This 'imbalance' explains why teens are more impulsive and risk-taking. Enough sleep and steady support help them through it.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�73b6ce2173ec�body���p 值只说“有无信号”，却不告诉信号多大或多可靠；效应量描述实际大小，统计功效描述检出的把握。低功效研究易产出夸大的偶然显著，因此看效应量与置信区间比盯 p 值更科学。��A p-value only says 'is there a signal', not how big or reliable; effect size describes magnitude, power describes the chance of detection. Low-power studies yield inflated chance significances, so effect sizes and confidence intervals beat fixating on p.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�73f34f8ad3da�body���黑暗三联征指自恋（膨胀自我加渴求赞赏）、马基雅维利主义（操纵、冷算）、精神病态（缺乏共情加冲动）。三者都涉及冷酷自我中心，但与负面人际与职场行为相关，并非精神疾病诊断。� The Dark Triad: narcissism (inflated self plus need for admiration), Machiavellianism (manipulation, cynical calculation), and psychopathy (low empathy plus impulsivity). All involve cold self-centeredness and link to negative interpersonal/work behavior—but are not clinical diagnoses.�ans��src�ٴPaulhus 与 Williams,《The Dark Triad of personality: Narcissism, Machiavellianism, and psychopathy》,Journal of Research in Personality,2002 (DOI: 10.1016/s0092-6566(02)00505-6)ٰPaulhus & Williams, 'The Dark Triad of personality: Narcissism, Machiavellianism, and psychopathy', Journal of Research in Personality, 2002, DOI: 10.1016/s0092-6566(02)00505-6��id�74e62de5a1fb�body���阿希让被试在群体明显错误答案包围下判断线段长短，约三分之一的试验里人会附和错误多数。即使任务简单，群体压力仍让人怀疑自己的眼睛。它证明规范性从众在清晰事实面前也能发生。�Asch had subjects judge line lengths while surrounded by a group giving obviously wrong answers; about a third of trials people conformed to the false majority. Even on a simple task, group pressure made them doubt their eyes. It proves normative conformity occurs even with clear facts.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�755f23717819�body���诱饵效应：加入一个明显次优的“诱饵”选项，会改变对其他选项相对价值的判断，使目标项更受欢迎。商家用它引导选择，识破它要看“我真的需要吗”。��The decoy effect: adding an obviously inferior 'decoy' shifts perceived value of other options, making the target look better. Sellers use it to steer choice; seeing through it asks 'do I really need this?'�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�762de3a25032�body��)聚光灯模型把注意比作一束可移动的光，被照亮的区域加工得更清晰，区域外则被忽略。注意可以在视野中移动和缩放，但同一时刻能精细处理的范围有限。这一模型强调注意是一种选择性资源，而非对所有信息的平等加工。��The spotlight model compares attention to a movable beam of light: whatever it illuminates is processed more clearly, while everything outside is neglected. Attention can shift and zoom across the visual field, but the area that can be finely processed at one moment is limited. The model emphasizes that attention is a selective resource rather than equal processing of all information.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�76721bfd29ae�body���运动表象（意象）训练激活与实际执行部分重叠的脑区，强化神经通路、熟悉战术并调节唤醒。研究支持它作为身体训练的补充，尤利伤后维持技能。��Sport imagery activates brain areas partly overlapping real execution, strengthening pathways, tactics and arousal control. Evidence supports it as a complement to physical training, especially to maintain skill during injury.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7692006a30f6�body���习得性无助指个体在反复经历不可控的负面事件后，即使后来出现可改变的机会也放弃尝试。塞利格曼的实验表明，这种无助感与抑郁中的被动与无望感在机制上相似，是理解抑郁的重要模型。�Learned helplessness describes how organisms exposed to uncontrollable aversive events later fail to act even when change is possible. Seligman's experiments showed this helplessness resembles the passivity and hopelessness seen in depression, offering a key model for the disorder.�ans��src��~塞利格曼、迈尔,《Failure to escape traumatic shock.》,Journal of Experimental Psychology,1967 (DOI: 10.1037/h0024514)�wSeligman & Maier, 'Failure to escape traumatic shock.', Journal of Experimental Psychology, 1967, DOI: 10.1037/h0024514��id�770a10d09d85�body�ٱ定期记录值得感激的事，能提升积极情绪、降低抑郁并改善睡眠。它把注意从缺失转向拥有，重塑日常体验。坚持数周即可见到变化。��Regularly noting things to be grateful for raises positive emotion, lowers depression, and improves sleep. It shifts attention from what is lacking to what is present, reshaping daily experience. Changes can appear within a few weeks.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�782aefe09d9d�body�ٱ酒精是抑制剂，短暂麻木后会加重低落、扰乱睡眠并放大情绪波动，愁往往第二天更明显。它掩盖情绪而非解决，长期还会形成依赖。��Alcohol is a depressant that briefly numbs but then deepens low mood, wrecks sleep and amplifies swings, so the sorrow often returns stronger. It masks feeling instead of solving it and can build dependence.�ans��src��qJulien, R. M., Advokat, C. D. 与 Comaty, J. E. (2011). 《药物作用入门（第12版）》. Worth Publishers.�lJulien, R. M., Advokat, C. D., & Comaty, J. E. (2011). A Primer of Drug Action (12th ed.). Worth Publishers.��id�788a08c1e8dd�body���个人主义文化更强调独立自我（我是独特个体），集体主义文化更强调互依自我（我由关系定义）。这影响记忆、动机与冲突处理：前者重个人成就，后者重和谐与面子。�Individualist cultures emphasize an independent self (a unique individual); collectivist cultures emphasize an interdependent self (defined by relationships). This shapes memory, motivation and conflict handling—personal achievement versus harmony and face.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�78bd9bea6135�body���静息态功能连接指在休息时不同脑区 BOLD 信号的相关性，揭示自发协调的网络。连接组则是描绘全部神经连接图谱的宏大计划，试图用网络拓扑理解个体差异、发展与疾病。�/Resting-state functional connectivity is the correlation of BOLD signals between regions at rest, revealing spontaneously coordinated networks. The connectome is the ambitious mapping of all neural connections, aiming to explain individual differences, development and disorder through network topology.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7aa43c7c513e�body���提取练习效应表明，主动从脑中检索信息本身就能强化记忆痕迹。罗迪格发现，相比重复阅读，自测带来的长期保持率显著更高，因为它同时训练了检索路径与元认知监控。�The testing effect shows that actively retrieving information from memory strengthens memory traces. Roediger found that compared with rereading, self-testing yields significantly higher long-term retention because it trains both retrieval routes and metacognitive monitoring.�ans��src��hRoediger, H. L. & Karpicke, J. D. (2006). 《测试对记忆保持的益处》. 《心理科学》17卷.�\Roediger, H. L. & Karpicke, J. D. (2006). Test-enhanced learning. Psychological Science, 17.��id�7ac778c734fd�body�ٱ如果脑子里还一直转着工作，注意力和情绪就始终没“下班”，疲劳会累积。真正放下——哪怕一小段不看消息——才能让身心重置。٪If work keeps spinning in your head, attention and mood never clock out and fatigue piles up. Genuinely letting go, even a short no-message stretch, resets body and mind.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7b88b8459db6�body���由于雌性在妊娠哺乳上投入更大，进化使两性在择偶策略上分化：投入高的一方更挑剔，投入低的一方更竞争。它解释了许多跨文化的择偶偏好差异，但也需结合文化与个体差异看待。��Because females invest more in pregnancy and nursing, evolution splits strategies: the higher-investing sex is choosier, the lower more competitive. It explains many cross-cultural mating preferences, though culture and individual differences matter too.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7c80a38a9961�body�ٺ学校正念项目的荟萃分析显示，可小幅改善注意力、情绪调节与课堂行为，但对成绩影响不一致。它更像底层调节能力训练，而非提分捷径。��Meta-analyses of school programs show small improvements in attention, emotion regulation and classroom behavior, with inconsistent effects on grades. It trains underlying regulatory capacity more than a score-boost shortcut.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�7f057397d3a6�body�ٱ在正式学之前先来一轮困难但无害的预测试，会激活相关知识、标示空白，使后续学习更有针对性。即使答错，提取尝试本身已铺路。��A hard but harmless pre-test before learning activates prior knowledge and flags gaps, making later study targeted (pre-testing effect). Even wrong answers lay groundwork via the retrieval attempt.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�7f13d4210e94�body���关键期是能力发展有严格时限、错过则不可逆（如某些视觉发育）；敏感期是某阶段学习效果最佳，但之后仍可弥补、只是更费力。现代发展观更倾向用敏感期描述多数能力。��A critical period is a strict window where missing it means irreversible loss (e.g., some visual development); a sensitive period is when learning is optimal but still possible later, just harder. Modern views favor sensitive for most abilities.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�801fc8141348�body���班杜拉提出自我效能感指对能否完成特定行为的信念，高自我效能者更愿发起并坚持困难目标，在挫折中更快恢复。它是健康行为改变模型中的关键中介变量，可通过掌握性体验提升。�Bandura's self-efficacy is belief in one's ability to perform a behavior; higher efficacy predicts initiating and persisting at hard goals and faster recovery from setbacks. It is a central mediator in behavior-change models, raised through mastery experiences.�ans��src�هBandura,《Self-efficacy: Toward a unifying theory of behavioral change.》,Psychological Review,1977 (DOI: 10.1037/0033-295x.84.2.191)مBandura, 'Self-efficacy: Toward a unifying theory of behavioral change.', Psychological Review, 1977, DOI: 10.1037/0033-295x.84.2.191��id�80ee632965a7�body��这是著名的斯特鲁普效应：读字是高度熟练的自动加工，而说出颜色需要刻意控制，两者冲突时自动加工占上风，于是会卡壳。成人几乎人人如此，不是能力问题。这个任务常被心理学家用来测量注意和抑制能力。�8The famous Stroop effect: reading is highly practiced automatic processing, while naming a color needs deliberate control; when they clash, the automatic habit wins and you stumble. Nearly every adult does this — it's not a skill problem. Psychologists use the task to measure attention and inhibitory control.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（注意与认知章）�?Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), attention and cognition chapter��id�813a6b4e519e�body���数字健康指有意识地管理设备使用以保护注意与情绪。实证上，被动刷社交媒体更易诱发比较与低落，而主动交流、限时与使用灰阶减刺激更有益。关键在怎么用，非用不用。��Digital health means managing device use on purpose to protect attention and mood. Evidence shows passive scrolling breeds comparison and low mood, while active interaction, time limits and grayscale are healthier. It is about how you use it, not whether.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�83851ab1bf30�body���该综合征描述机体对持续压力的反应：警觉期（动员）、抵抗期（适应维持）与耗竭期（资源枯竭致病）。塞利强调长期压力会损害身体，是应激研究的基础框架。�-The syndrome describes the body's response to prolonged stress: the alarm stage (mobilization), the resistance stage (adaptation and maintenance), and the exhaustion stage (depletion leading to illness). Selye emphasized that chronic stress damages the body, providing a foundational stress framework.�ans��src��(Selye, H. (1956). 《生活的压力》.�%Selye, H. (1956). The Stress of Life.��id�83eceab55233�body��b部分老年人更容易受骗，主要和年龄相关的认知变化有关：处理速度、工作记忆和“执行功能”（判断、抑制冲动）会有所减弱，使人在面对精心设计的骗局时更难仔细核实。加上孤独、信息滞后和过分信任，更容易中招。但这不代表所有老人都易骗，个体差异很大。��Some older adults are more vulnerable to scams mainly because of age-related cognitive changes: processing speed, working memory, and executive functions (judgment, impulse control) can decline, making it harder to scrutinize a well-crafted pitch. Loneliness, outdated information, and a trusting disposition add risk—but this does not mean all elders are gullible; individual differences are large.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�84a125abc008�body��代际传递指教养方式、依恋模式或应对风格从上一代延续到下一代，比如曾被严厉对待的父母更可能延续严厉教养。它既可通过模仿学习，也通过内化工作模型实现。意识到传递链条有助于主动打断不利循环。�>Intergenerational transmission is that parenting styles, attachment patterns, or coping styles carry from one generation to the next, such as harshly raised parents tending to repeat harsh parenting. It happens through modeling and internalized working models. Seeing the chain helps deliberately break harmful cycles.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�878e11143f0c�body��#这叫“孵化”：把问题暂时放下，让注意力从固定的思路上松开，常能换来顿悟。洗澡、散步时大脑的后台还在无意识地重组信息，而且情绪更放松，也更容易注意到被忽略的线索。卡住时起身走走，往往比死磕更高效。�.That's “incubation”: setting the problem aside loosens the fixed frame and often yields insight. While showering or walking, the brain's background processes keep reorganizing information, and relaxed mood makes overlooked cues easier to spot. When stuck, taking a walk often beats grinding harder.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�87c51a45a1f6�body���情境主义（如 Milgram、Ross）指出，行为更多受具体情境与角色压力驱动，而非稳定特质。经典实验显示普通人在权威或角色下会做出惊人行为，提示我们常高估性格、低估环境的解释力。�Situationism (Milgram, Ross) argues behavior is driven more by context and role pressure than stable traits. Classic experiments show ordinary people do startling things under authority or roles, warning we overestimate character and underestimate environment.�ans��src��Milgram; Ross�Milgram; Ross��id�88ab91373632�body�ٮ心流出现在挑战与技能水平都高且相匹配时，个体全神贯注、时间感扭曲、自我意识消失。当挑战远超技能则焦虑，远低于则无聊。��Flow arises when challenge and skill are both high and well matched, with the person fully absorbed, losing self-consciousness and a normal sense of time. When challenge far exceeds skill, anxiety appears; when it falls far below, boredom.�ans��src��DCsikszentmihalyi, M. (1990). 《心流: 最优体验的心理学》.�HCsikszentmihalyi, M. (1990). Flow: The Psychology of Optimal Experience.��id�88d721daab0b�body��2大脑由约860亿个神经元组成，神经元之间通过突触连接：一个神经元末梢释放化学物质（神经递质），下一个神经元的受体接收后产生新的电信号，信息就这样一站一站传下去。一次思维、一个动作，都是无数突触信号的协同结果。�SThe brain holds roughly 86 billion neurons connected by synapses: one neuron's terminals release chemical messengers (neurotransmitters), receptors on the next neuron turn them back into electrical signals, and information relays station by station. Every thought and every movement is the coordinated result of countless synaptic signals.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（生理心理学章）�=Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), biological psychology chapter��id�8a3050336d77�body���多项影像研究发现长期正念练习与岛叶（身体觉察）、前额叶（调控）增厚及默认网络活动改变相关。关联不等于因果，但结合随机对照研究，正念对注意与情绪调节确有可测益处。�Several imaging studies link long-term practice to thicker insula (body awareness) and prefrontal cortex (control) and altered default-mode activity. Correlation is not causation, but with RCTs, mindfulness shows measurable benefits for attention and emotion regulation.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8a555028c843�body���在个人主义文化中，成就动机更多指向个人卓越与自我提升；在集体主义文化中，动机常与维护群体和谐、履行角色责任相连。这解释了不同文化下奖励设计与团队管理的有效性差异。�In individualistic cultures achievement motivation targets personal excellence and self-improvement; in collectivist cultures it ties to group harmony and role duty. This explains why reward designs and team management differ in effectiveness across cultures.�ans��src��H《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 文化心理卷�1Annual Review of Psychology (cultural psychology)��id�8a87f4271338�body���若未来可能再次相遇或声誉可传播，今天助人能在长期换来回报，哪怕非血亲。这种“你帮我、我帮你”的机制靠记忆、声誉与公平感维系，是合作进化的基石之一。��If future encounters or reputation are likely, helping today can pay off later even without kinship. This 'you help me, I help you' mechanism, sustained by memory, reputation and fairness, is a cornerstone of the evolution of cooperation.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8b13c5c67d9b�body���取决于时序与强度：急性适度压力可增强与生存相关事件的编码（肾上腺素助记忆）；但慢性或回忆时高压会损害海马依赖的精确回忆，并偏向记住负面情绪。即急性助、慢性伤。�It depends on timing and intensity: acute moderate stress can enhance encoding of survival-relevant events (adrenaline aids memory); but chronic stress or high stress at recall impairs hippocampus-dependent precise recall and biases toward negative material. Acute helps, chronic hurts.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8b1fe7be4dcb�body���走神是注意从当前任务漂向内部思绪，常由默认模式网络活跃引起。研究估计我们清醒时约 30–50% 时间在走神；它虽浪费注意，也与计划、创意和自我反思有关。�Mind-wandering is attention drifting from the task to internal thoughts, often driven by the default mode network. Studies estimate we spend about 30–50% of waking time wandering; though it wastes attention, it also aids planning, creativity and self-reflection.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8b2e9433799b�body��,这叫“代表性启发”：判断时用“像不像典型例子”代替真实依据。名校和“能力强”在印象中匹配度高，于是被当成证据，尽管个体差异很大、学历也不能替代实际表现。它帮我们快速归类，但容易忽视基础概率和具体信息。�?That's the representativeness heuristic: we judge by how closely something resembles a stereotype rather than by real evidence. A famous university matches the “competent” prototype, so we treat it as proof, even though individual variation is huge. It speeds up categorization but ignores base rates and specifics.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�8cef7f074403�body���刻板印象是对某一群体成员固定的、过度简化的看法，比如“某类人一定怎样”。它能帮大脑快速归类，但也容易导致偏见和不公平的对待。意识到刻板印象是减少歧视的第一步。�A stereotype is a fixed, oversimplified belief about members of a group, such as 'certain people are always a certain way'. It helps the brain categorize quickly but can lead to prejudice and unfair treatment. Recognizing stereotypes is the first step to reducing discrimination.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8d18412cc893�body��$米歇尔让4岁儿童选择“现在吃一颗糖”或“等一会儿吃两颗”，用来测延迟满足能力。能等待的孩子后来在学业等方面表现更好，但后续研究发现这更多与环境和信任有关。它说明自控力很重要，却非命运唯一决定因素。�Mischel offered 4-year-olds one marshmallow now or two if they waited, measuring delayed gratification. Waiters later did better academically, though follow-ups show environment and trust matter more. It shows self-control is important but not the sole determinant of destiny.�ans��src��Mischel 棉花糖实验�Mischel marshmallow experiment��id�91696cf0b5a6�body�ٽ情绪劳动指工作中需按规则管理和展露特定情绪，如服务员保持微笑。长期伪装情绪会带来疲惫和疏离感。它在服务业和护理行业中十分常见。��Emotional labor means managing and displaying prescribed emotions at work, such as a server maintaining a smile. Long-term faking of feelings brings fatigue and detachment. It is common in service and caregiving jobs.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�927454bc89ea�body���共情耗竭发生在长期替他人承压而缺乏边界，常见于照护者。保护做法包括区分“理解”与“承担”、设置情绪界限、用同情（compassion）替代沉浸式共情。��Empathy fatigue arises when someone chronically carries others' distress without boundaries, common in caregivers. Protect by separating understanding from taking on, setting emotional limits, and replacing immersed empathy with compassion.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�92d3f0dbb4de�body�٫显著、正面结果更易被发表，空结果常沉在抽屉（文件抽屉问题），使文献整体偏向夸大效应。预注册与要求发表空结果是对策。��Significant, positive results get published more; null results sit in file drawers, biasing the literature to overstate effects (file-drawer problem). Preregistration and mandating null-result publication are remedies.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�92eed84769fa�body��k变化盲视指当视觉场景发生显著变化，而观察者的注意正落在别处时，往往完全察觉不到这种变化。经典实验让人在两张几乎相同的图片之间切换，或借助眨眼、镜头切换掩盖改动，多数人漏看明显改动。它说明我们感知的“完整世界”其实依赖注意的抽样，而非全幅记录。��Change blindness occurs when a noticeable change in a visual scene goes undetected because the observer's attention is directed elsewhere. Classic experiments switch between two nearly identical images or use blanks and cuts to mask edits, and most people miss obvious changes. It shows that our sense of a complete visual world relies on attentional sampling rather than a full recording.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�94d680a3daa5�body��}根据自我决定理论，当工作满足三种基本需求时，内在动力最旺盛：自主（有选择空间）、胜任（有成长和掌握感）、归属（有好的人际关系）。工资很重要，但长期来看，能掌控节奏、学到东西、和同事处得来，才让人真正投入。这就是为什么“有意思的工作”不等于“钱多的工作”。��According to self-determination theory, intrinsic motivation thrives when three basic needs are met: autonomy (having choice), competence (growing and mastering), and relatedness (good connections). Pay matters, but long-term engagement comes from controlling your pace, learning new things, and getting along with colleagues. That's why “meaningful work” isn't the same as “high-paying work.”�ans��src��*APA（工作动机与自我决定理论）�3APA (work motivation and self-determination theory)��id�94e05fa5e0a3�body���抑郁时常卡在没动力、不动、更低落的循环；行为激活主张先安排小行动（散步、回消息），用行动撬动情绪，而非等感觉好了才动。动起来本身就会反馈给大脑我能。��Depression traps in no-motivation, no-action, lower-mood; behavioral activation schedules small acts first (a walk, a reply) to move emotion via action rather than waiting to feel ready. Acting itself tells the brain I can.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�95a3480403ec�body���Bowlby 与 Ainsworth 提出，婴儿通过安全基地探索世界，依被回应的经验形成安全/回避/矛盾/混乱等依恋类型。安全依恋预测更好的情绪与社会发展，但类型并非终身不变。�Bowlby and Ainsworth described infants using the caregiver as a secure base to explore, forming secure/avoidant/ambivalent/disorganized attachments based on responsiveness. Secure attachment predicts better socio-emotional growth, but types are not fixed for life.�ans��src��Bowlby; Ainsworth�Bowlby; Ainsworth��id�95b9a90148f7�body�ٷ研究推荐的配方是：学后尽快自测（检索）、拉开复习间隔（间隔）、把相关题型混练（交错）。三者叠加比单用任一种更接近长期掌握。��The evidence-backed recipe: self-test soon after learning (retrieval), space the reviews (spacing), and mix related problem types (interleaving). Stacking all three beats any alone for lasting mastery.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�95e751b9ed3d�body���情绪劳动指工作中必须按规则表现特定情绪（如客服保持热情），不管真实感受。表层扮演需持续压抑与伪装，易致疏离与耗竭；深层扮演（真调整心态）代价较小。��Emotional labor is displaying required emotions at work (e.g., upbeat service) regardless of true feeling. Surface acting needs constant suppression and faking, breeding detachment and burnout; deep acting (genuinely shifting) costs less.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�971065c8a2f1�body���社会时差指个体内在生物钟与社会作息之间的相位差（如夜猫子被迫早起）。伦内贝格研究发现它与代谢综合征、肥胖及情绪问题风险升高相关，因长期睡眠不规律打乱节律。�!Social jet lag is the mismatch between a person's internal biological clock and social schedules (e.g., a night owl forced to rise early). Roenneberg found it correlates with higher risk of metabolic syndrome, obesity, and mood problems because irregular sleep chronically disrupts rhythm.�ans��src��VRoenneberg, T. 等 (2007). 《社会时差及其后果》. 《当代生物学》17卷.�MRoenneberg, T. et al. (2007). Social jetlag and obesity. Current Biology, 17.��id�97185a4be262�body���群体极化指群体讨论后，成员原有倾向会被推向更极端，谨慎的更谨慎、冒险的更冒险。它来自信息相互强化与想显得比同伴更坚定的动机。网络回声室是当代群体极化的典型场景。�Group polarization is that after discussion, members' initial leanings shift to extremes, cautious become more cautious and risky more risky. It comes from mutual information reinforcement and wanting to seem more committed than peers. Online echo chambers are a modern case.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9750d31c7b18�body���自恋型人格表现为夸大自我重要性、需要过度赞赏且缺乏共情，但并非所有自信的人都是自恋。严重时会成为人格障碍，影响亲密关系。心理学用专业的量表来谨慎评估，而非随意贴标签。�(Narcissistic personality involves an inflated sense of importance, need for excessive admiration, and lack of empathy, but not everyone confident is narcissistic. In severe form it becomes a personality disorder affecting relationships. Psychology uses careful scales rather than casual labeling.�ans��src��DSM-5 人格障碍说明� DSM-5 personality disorder notes��id�976a0eda886b�body��,坐禅时念头乱飞、腿麻是完全正常的现象，并不代表“练错了”。练习的目的不是消灭想法，而是觉察到走神后，温和地把注意力拉回呼吸——每一次“拉回”本身就是训练专注的练习。不适与分心是修行的一部分，而非失败。�UA wandering mind and tingling legs are completely normal in meditation, not a sign you're doing it wrong. The practice isn't to eliminate thoughts but to notice them and gently return attention to the breath—each return is the actual 'repetition' that trains focus. Discomfort and distraction are part of the training, not a failure of it.�ans��src��{Goyal 等（2014）《JAMA Internal Medicine》冥想项目系统综述；Kabat-Zinn《Full Catastrophe Living》（1990）كGoyal et al. (2014), JAMA Internal Medicine, systematic review of meditation programmes; Kabat-Zinn, Full Catastrophe Living (1990)��id�97bd20f8beb9�body���强烈情绪触发杏仁核劫持前额叶，负责语言与理性的区域暂时被压制，于是反应快过思考。这被称为杏仁核劫持；深呼吸、暂停几秒能让前额叶重新上线。��Strong emotion triggers an amygdala hijack of the prefrontal cortex, temporarily suppressing language and reasoning, so reaction outruns thought. This is amygdala hijack; a few slow breaths or seconds of pause let the prefrontal cortex come back online.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�97e10c835be2�body���记忆宫殿利用大脑对空间和地点的敏锐记忆，把要记的内容挂靠到熟悉路线上的具体位置。把抽象信息变成生动的画面，能大幅提升回忆效率。这种方法在记忆大赛中常被使用。��The memory palace exploits the brain's strong spatial memory by anchoring items to specific locations along a familiar route. Turning abstract information into vivid images greatly boosts recall. This technique is widely used in memory competitions.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9824541e9d2a�body���不同。内疚聚焦“我做了一件坏事”（可修复、促补偿），羞耻聚焦“我这个人很糟”（指向自我、易逃避或攻击）。研究认为羞耻更伤关系与自尊，内疚更能促亲社会修复。��No. Guilt targets 'I did a bad thing' (repairable, prompts repair); shame targets 'I am bad' (self-focused, breeds hiding or aggression). Shame tends to harm relationships and self-worth more, while guilt better drives prosocial repair.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�98d29aa1f4ba�body���具身观点认为心智依赖身体与环境的实时交互，而非孤立符号运算。它推动机器人研究从纯文本走向传感器-动作闭环，认为真正灵活智能需要身体在真实世界中试错学习。�Embodied cognition holds that mind depends on real-time body-environment interaction, not isolated symbol manipulation. It pushes robotics from text-only toward sensor-actuator loops, arguing flexible intelligence needs a body learning by trial in the real world.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9a125cdc9f7b�body��\都容易——但机制不同。首因效应：最先进入的信息占先机，塑造了后续信息的解读；近因效应：最后的信息离评价时间最近，还留在短时记忆里。当评价紧跟在信息之后，近因更占优；过一段时间再评价，首因更持久。这提醒我们：开头和结尾都值得认真准备。�PBoth — but for different reasons. Primacy: the first information arrives first and frames how everything later is read. Recency: the last information is still fresh in short-term memory when you judge. If judgment comes right after, recency wins; after a delay, primacy lasts longer. Moral: prepare both your opening and your closing.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会认知章）�8Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social cognition chapter��id�9c870e6dd96f�body��元认知是“关于认知的认知”，即人对自己思考过程的觉察与调控，比如估计自己是否学会了某内容、规划学习策略。有效的元认知能让人在卡住时及时调整方法。它是自主学习与专家表现的重要基石。�0Metacognition is thinking about thinking: awareness and control of one's own mental processes, such as judging whether you have learned something and planning study strategies. Good metacognition lets you switch methods when stuck. It is a key foundation of self-directed learning and expert performance.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9daa2145738c�body��弗洛伊德的人格结构分三层：本我追求本能快乐（快乐原则），超我代表道德理想，自我在现实约束下调和二者。健康在于三者动态平衡，冲突过强会产生焦虑与防御。该模型是精神分析的核心比喻。�Freud's structure has three layers: the id seeks instinctual pleasure (pleasure principle), the superego represents moral ideals, and the ego mediates under reality. Health is their dynamic balance; strong conflict brings anxiety and defense. The model is core to psychoanalysis.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9e527a94a72c�body��从众并不全是坏事，它在进化上很有用。跟随多数能降低风险、快速学到他人的经验，也让群体更容易协调与合作。适度的从众带来归属感和安全感；只有当它压制独立思考、让人盲从错误时，才变成问题。�LConformity is not always bad—it carries real evolutionary benefits. Following the majority helps us avoid risk, learn from others' experience, and coordinate within a group. Moderate conformity brings belonging and safety; it only becomes harmful when it suppresses independent thinking or leads people to follow mistakes blindly.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9fefed3a7d67�body�ٷ研究显示自主、胜任、关系与发展空间常比薪水更能持久提升满意度（自我决定理论）。钱到基本线后边际效应递减，意义与掌控更关键。��Research shows autonomy, competence, relatedness and growth often sustain satisfaction more than pay (self-determination theory). Beyond a baseline, money's marginal return drops; meaning and control matter more.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a316ab8c4c9d�body���旁观者效应指在紧急事件中在场人数越多，个体施援概率越低。拉塔内与达利用责任扩散解释：多人情境下每个人认为别人会帮忙，从而降低个人责任感与干预意愿。�.The bystander effect is that the more bystanders present in an emergency, the lower the chance any one person helps. Latané and Darley explained it through diffusion of responsibility: in a crowd each person assumes someone else will act, lowering personal responsibility and willingness to intervene.�ans��src��@Latané, B. & Darley, J. M. (1970). 《无反应的旁观者》.�?Latané, B. & Darley, J. M. (1970). The Unresponsive Bystander.��id�a48de9cf5827�body���高糖餐后血糖骤升骤降，可引发疲倦、易怒与注意力波动（糖崩溃）；长期高添加糖与更高抑郁风险相关。稳定血糖（全谷、蛋白、纤维）比戒糖口号更实操。��After a high-sugar meal, blood glucose spikes then crashes, bringing fatigue, irritability and attention dips; long-term added sugar tracks higher depression risk. Stabilizing glucose with whole grains, protein and fiber beats slogan-level sugar-cutting.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a4a037d2b4b3�body��␀心理理论是理解他人拥有与自己不同的信念、愿望和意图，并据此预测其行为的能力。儿童约4岁能通过“错误信念”任务，明白别人可能持有错误看法。它是社交沟通、共情与欺骗识别的基础。�"Theory of mind is understanding that others have beliefs, desires, and intentions different from one's own and using that to predict behavior. Around age 4 children pass false-belief tasks, realizing others can hold wrong views. It underlies communication, empathy, and detecting deception.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�a55f4d86055f�body��}这叫“描述性规范”：人们会参考“别人怎么做”来决定自己怎么做。新班级、新公司里，怎么说话、怎么排队、用什么词，会很快“传染”给新来者。规范让群体高效运转，但也可能放大不良行为——看到有人乱扔垃圾，别人更可能跟着扔。选择你希望被其影响的环境，是聪明的做法。�]That's descriptive norms: people use “what others do” as a guide. In a new class or company, how people talk, queue, and phrase things quickly rubs off on newcomers. Norms make groups efficient, but they can also amplify bad behavior — seeing litter makes others litter more. Choosing environments you want to be influenced by is a smart move.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会心理学章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social psychology chapter��id�a56e4ac71ec2�body���刻板印象常来自对群体特征的过度概括与确认偏误：少数为例被当成全体，例外被忽略。它只是认知捷径，不等于恶意，却会借锚定与可用性影响判断。��Stereotypes form from over-generalizing group traits and confirmation bias: a few examples stand for all, exceptions ignored. It is a cognitive shortcut, not necessarily malice, yet it skews judgment via anchoring and availability.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a6d3834eef67�body��&练习会加强神经元之间的连接，同时让包裹神经的“髓鞘”变厚——它像电线的绝缘层，越厚信号传导越快越稳。所以练得越多，动作越流畅，越来越“不费脑”。大脑的这种可塑性终生存在，只是年龄越小变化往往越快。�CPractice strengthens connections between neurons and thickens myelin, the insulating coat around nerve fibers — like wire insulation, thicker means faster, steadier signals. So repetition makes skills smoother and increasingly effortless. This brain plasticity lasts a lifetime; it's just usually faster when we're young.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（神经与学习章）�8Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), neural bases of learning��id�a72682bb3ac9�body�ٺ睡眠尤其是快速眼动期会回放和巩固白天的经历，梦中出现相关片段是记忆整理的表现。这被称为记忆的离线重演。它与学习效果密切相关。ٴSleep, especially REM, replays and consolidates the day's experiences, and dream fragments about them reflect memory sorting, called offline replay. It is closely tied to learning.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a72bc419bc93�body���社会支持从情感（被理解）、信息（建议）、工具（实际帮助）三面缓冲压力，降低皮质醇与心血管反应。质量比数量重要，单向索取反而增负。��Social support buffers stress via emotional (being understood), informational (advice) and tangible (help) routes, lowering cortisol and cardiovascular response. Quality beats quantity; one-way taking backfires.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a7f05bd224e8�body���成人每晚通常经历 4 到 6 个睡眠周期，每周期约 90 分钟，交替出现非快速眼动睡眠与快速眼动睡眠。前半夜以深睡为主，后半夜快速眼动比例增加。��Adults typically cycle through four to six sleep cycles per night, each about 90 minutes, alternating non-rapid-eye-movement and rapid-eye-movement sleep. Deep sleep dominates the first half of the night and REM proportion rises toward morning.�ans��src��qCarskadon, M. A. & Dement, W. C. (2011). 《正常人类睡眠》. 见《睡眠医学原理与实践》(第5版).�tCarskadon, M. A. & Dement, W. C. (2011). Normal human sleep. In Principles and Practice of Sleep Medicine (5th ed.).��id�a82bf1858519�body��8他们大多使用“位置记忆法”（记忆宫殿）：把要记的内容转化成生动画面，放进一条熟悉的路线上，比如家里的每个房间。大脑对空间和图像特别擅长，而抽象信息很难直接记住。所以把抽象变具体、变有画面，记忆就变得容易得多。�5Most use the method of loci (“memory palace”): turning items into vivid images and placing them along a familiar route, like rooms of your own home. The brain excels at space and imagery but struggles with abstract data. Translate the abstract into vivid pictures, and memorizing gets dramatically easier.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（记忆策略章）�1Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), memory strategies��id�a8d45e947cd6�body�ٷ蓝光抑制褪黑素，通知与内容提升心理唤醒，刷到深夜又推迟作息。把手机充电放客厅、睡前 30–60 分钟停屏，是被反复验证的简单干预。��Blue light suppresses melatonin, notifications and content raise arousal, and late scrolling delays the schedule. Charging the phone in another room and a 30–60 minute screen stop before bed is a well-tested simple fix.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a9f62bc4271c�body���实施意向把意图写成“当 X 情境，我就做 Y”，把行为预绑到线索，减少临场靠意志。研究显示它能显著提升接种、运动等依从，因把决策提前自动化。��Implementation intentions state 'when X, I'll do Y,' pre-binding behavior to a cue and sparing willpower. They reliably lift adherence (vaccination, exercise) by automating the decision beforehand.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�aac83801654d�body��8联觉是一种感觉通道被激活时自发引发另一种感觉体验的现象，比如看到数字就“尝到”味道，或听到声音就“看见”颜色。它通常是先天性的，在不同个体中稳定的配对模式常能重复。联觉提示大脑感官区域之间可能存在异常的联结。�_Synesthesia is a phenomenon in which stimulating one sense automatically triggers an experience in another, such as tasting shapes when seeing numbers or seeing colors when hearing sounds. It is usually innate and the pairings are stable and repeatable across time. Synesthesia suggests unusually strong connections between sensory areas of the brain.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�abfcca56b4dd�body�ٮ把幸福一直推到“等将来”，等于把生活悬空；而投入手边的事能生出心流与满足。未来值得规划，但此刻才是唯一能体验的地方。ٮPushing happiness to someday suspends life; engaging the task at hand grows flow and satisfaction. The future is worth planning, but now is the only place experience happens.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�ace544100ac5�body���紧文化有严格规范与低容忍偏差（如强调守序），松文化规范灵活、容许多样。它受历史威胁（瘟疫、灾害）塑造，影响从排队到创新的多方面行为。��Tight cultures hold strict norms with low tolerance for deviance; loose cultures are flexible and permissive. Shaped by historical threats (plague, disaster), it affects everything from queuing to innovation.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ad31543cfb44�body���积极心理学是研究幸福感、优势和美德等正面人类特质的心理学分支，由塞利格曼等人推动。它不只关注治病，也关注如何让人活得更充实。练习感恩、发挥个人优势都是其常见应用。�0Positive psychology is a branch studying positive human traits like well-being, strengths, and virtues, advanced by Seligman and others. It focuses not only on treating illness but also on helping people live more fulfilling lives. Gratitude practice and using personal strengths are common applications.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ad7487e7b7b8�body���不少戒烟研究（包括系统综述）发现，“即刻全面停止”配合支持，成功率常高于慢慢减量——因为减量期间持续的烟草暴露让渴求和“再来一根”的机会一直存在。当然，结合替代疗法、动机访谈和防复发计划，成功率会进一步提升。哪种方式适合自己因人而异，关键是选一条并坚持，必要时请专业人士一起制定计划。��Many smoking-cessation studies (including systematic reviews) find abrupt quitting with support often beats gradual reduction — because tapering keeps exposure and craving alive, along with the chance for “just one more.” Adding nicotine replacement, motivational interviewing, and relapse-prevention plans raises success further. The best method varies by person; the key is choosing one, sticking with it, and building a plan with help if needed.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�af1e42c97f30�body��#塞利格曼发现反复遭受不可控挫折的个体（包括儿童）会学会“努力无用”，随后即便情境可变也消极放弃。在学校中，常遇失败的孩子可能形成“我学不好”的固定信念。它提示及时给予可控的成功体验能预防无助感。�;Seligman found that repeated uncontrollable setbacks lead individuals, including children, to learn that effort is useless and then give up even when change is possible. In school, frequently failing children may form a fixed belief of I can't learn. Timely experiences of controllable success prevent helplessness.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�af65a065a2ed�body���代际差异来自成长时代的不同心理脚本：物质稀缺对丰裕、权威对平等、线下对线上。双方常用自己的经验地图解读对方，误把差异当不懂事。互相讲清背景比争对错更有效。�Generational gaps come from different mental scripts of the era they grew up in: scarcity vs abundance, authority vs equality, offline vs online. Each reads the other through their own map and mistakes difference for defiance. Explaining context beats arguing right or wrong.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�afa67d2db7a7�body��A经典研究认为，快乐、悲伤、愤怒、恐惧、惊讶、厌恶这几种基本表情的识别具有跨文化普遍性，连没见过“表情图片”的偏远部落也能认出它们。但何时展现、表现多少仍受文化规则影响。可以说：核心表情是相通的，表达方式则是文化的。�1Classic research suggests recognition of basic emotions — happiness, sadness, anger, fear, surprise, disgust — is universal, found even in remote tribes unfamiliar with posed photos. But when and how much to display remains culturally regulated. Core expressions are shared; their display is cultural.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（情绪章）�/Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), emotion chapter��id�afeeb71c68d7�body��/进入青春期，人体的生物钟（昼夜节律）会整体后移：褪黑素的分泌高峰来得更晚，所以到点不困。这不是懒，而是发育中的正常变化。很多国家因此呼吁推迟中学上课时间，研究表明学生睡眠多了，出勤、情绪和成绩反而变好。�In adolescence the body clock (circadian rhythm) shifts later: melatonin peaks later, so teens aren't sleepy on schedule. That's normal development, not laziness. Many places now debate later school start times because research shows more sleep improves attendance, mood, and grades.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b08e751cfb91�body���短视频以极高频率切换刺激，不断抢夺注意力又很少给大脑整合的时间，造成“认知疲劳”。真正放松需要低刺激、能让人安静下来的活动，而不是更多碎片信息。��Short videos switch stimuli at high frequency, constantly grabbing attention while giving the brain little time to integrate, producing cognitive fatigue. Real rest needs low-stimulation calm, not more fragmented information.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b16d98baafa4�body���睡眠由多个约90分钟的周期组成，每个周期在浅睡、深睡和快速眼动之间循环。前半夜深睡较多以恢复身体，后半夜快速眼动增多以整合记忆。了解周期有助于安排起床时间。��Sleep is made of several roughly 90-minute cycles, each cycling through light, deep, and REM sleep. Early night has more deep sleep for physical recovery; later night has more REM for memory integration. Knowing cycles helps time waking.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b1e92b318474�body��fMRI 测量的是血氧水平依赖信号（BOLD），它反映的是局部脑区的血流与耗氧变化，间接提示哪些区域更活跃。它只能定位“哪片脑区在忙”，并不能解码具体念头，所谓读心仍是粗略的统计推测。�fMRI measures blood-oxygen-level-dependent (BOLD) signals, an indirect index of local blood flow and metabolism that shows which regions are active. It localizes 'where' activity happens, not the specific content of thoughts; 'mind reading' remains coarse statistical inference.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b3226e7f95b7�body��DSM-5（《精神疾病诊断与统计手册》第五版）由美国精神医学学会于 2013 年发布，为各类精神障碍提供标准化的诊断标准与分类。它既是北美临床诊断和科研的依据，也在保险报销与司法等领域被广泛采用。�QThe DSM-5 (Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, 5th ed.) was published by the American Psychiatric Association in 2013 and provides standardized diagnostic criteria and classification for mental disorders. It guides clinical diagnosis and research in North America and is widely used in insurance and forensic settings.�ans��src��]美国精神医学学会（APA）《精神疾病诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》（2013）�fAmerican Psychiatric Association, Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5) (2013)��id�b3d879b50564�body���该定律指出表现与生理或心理唤醒呈倒 U 形关系：适度唤醒最佳，过低导致松懈、过高引发焦虑。任务越复杂，达到峰值表现所需的最佳唤醒水平越低。��The law states that performance and arousal follow an inverted-U relationship: moderate arousal is optimal, too little brings lethargy and too much brings anxiety. The more complex the task, the lower the optimal arousal level for peak performance.�ans��src��pYerkes, R. M. & Dodson, J. D. (1908). 《刺激强度与习惯形成速度》. 《比较神经学杂志》18卷.ِYerkes, R. M. & Dodson, J. D. (1908). The relation of strength of stimulus to rapidity of habit-formation. Journal of Comparative Neurology, 18.��id�b5caf2a6c188�body���流泪伴随副交感神经活动上升，并可能带走与压力相关的化学物质，身体从高度唤起回到较平静的状态。所以哭不是软弱，而是情绪的一种自然释放。��Crying is accompanied by rising parasympathetic activity and may wash out stress-related chemicals, letting the body settle from high arousal. So crying is not weakness but a natural release of emotion.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b6ada9881b3d�body���健康高自尊是对自我价值的稳定、真实认可，不依赖贬低他人；自恋则是脆弱、需外部赞赏维持的膨胀自我，常伴随敌意与比较。研究发现自恋比真正高自尊更易引发攻击与关系冲突。��Healthy high self-esteem is stable, genuine self-worth not needing to demean others; narcissism is a fragile, praise-dependent inflated self with hostility and comparison. Narcissism predicts more aggression and conflict than true high self-esteem.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b6c4d4750645�body�� 米尔格拉姆让被试在“老师”角色下对他人施加看似痛苦的电击，即使不安，约65%的人仍服从穿白大褂的实验者指示，直到最高电压。它揭示了普通人在权威命令下可能做出违背良心的事。这推动了对实验伦理的反思。�3Milgram had participants, as 'teachers', deliver what seemed like painful electric shocks; about 65% obeyed the experimenter in a lab coat to the highest voltage despite discomfort. It revealed that ordinary people may act against conscience under authority orders. It spurred reflection on research ethics.�ans��src��Milgram 1963 实验�Milgram 1963 experiment��id�b6c83b83d28c�body��q计划、抑制冲动、切换任务等“执行功能”依赖前额叶皮层，而它从儿童期一路发育到青春期。六七岁的孩子不是故意丢三落四，而是大脑的“指挥中心”还没完工。家长可以用清单、把大任务拆小、即时提醒来帮孩子“外挂”这部分能力，随着大脑成熟，孩子会逐渐自己接管。��Executive functions — planning, impulse control, task switching — depend on the prefrontal cortex, which develops from childhood into adolescence. A six-year-old isn't deliberately scatterbrained; the brain's “control center” is still under construction. Lists, breaking tasks into steps, and timely reminders can outsource this skill for a while; as the brain matures, children gradually take over themselves.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�b72fc659a64e�body���认知重构的实操是：把自动念头写下，问支持与反对的证据是什么、有没有更平衡的解读。例如我全搞砸了经检验常变成这件事没做好，但其他还行，情绪随之松动。��Cognitive restructuring in practice: write the automatic thought, ask what evidence supports or opposes it and what a balanced reading is. I ruined everything often becomes this went wrong but other things are fine, and the feeling loosens.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�b78830145149�body��M“气质性乐观”是一种稳定倾向：乐观者习惯把坏事解释成暂时、具体、外部的，把好事归为自己的能力（Scheier & Carver, 1985 生活取向测验）。这种解释风格缓冲压力、促进求助与坚持，而悲观的“永久-普遍-个人”归因则更易滑向抑郁（Seligman, 1991）。�kDispositional optimism is a stable trait: optimists explain bad events as temporary, specific and external and credit good events to themselves (Scheier & Carver, 1985, Life Orientation Test). This explanatory style buffers stress and sustains effort, whereas the pessimistic permanent-pervasive-personal style slides more easily into depression (Seligman, 1991).�ans��src��nScheier, M.F. & Carver, C.S. (1985)《乐观、应对与健康》, Cognitive Therapy and Research 9(2):219-247�qScheier, M.F. & Carver, C.S. (1985). Optimism, coping, and health. Cognitive Therapy and Research, 9(2), 219-247.��id�b7da59d833e4�body�ٷ明确且有挑战的目标（SMART 类）比“尽力而为”更能提升绩效，因聚焦与反馈。但目标过难或唯一量化会诱发作弊与忽视未量化的重要事。ٵSpecific, challenging goals (SMART-like) beat 'do your best' via focus and feedback. Yet overly hard or solely quantified goals invite cheating and neglect of unmeasured essentials.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b879f47936a0�body��D心理旋转指人在脑中想象把物体旋转到某个角度来判断其形状或是否相同的过程。谢泼德的实验发现，判断两图形是否为同一物体所需的时间，随两者角度差增大而线性增加。这说明空间表象的加工类似于真实的物理旋转，需要时间与心智努力。�aMental rotation is imagining an object turned to some angle in order to judge its shape or whether two objects match. Shepard's experiments showed that the time to decide whether two figures are the same grows linearly with the angle between them. This suggests spatial imagery is processed like real physical rotation, requiring time and mental effort.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b897322e5426�body��工作记忆是我们在进行复杂认知任务时，暂时存储并同时加工信息的系统，由巴德利等人提出。它比短时记忆更进一步，强调对信息的主动操控，而不仅仅是保持。其容量有限，通常只能同时处理少量信息。�XWorking memory is the system that temporarily stores and simultaneously manipulates information during complex cognitive tasks, as proposed by Baddeley and colleagues. It goes beyond short-term memory by emphasizing active manipulation rather than mere holding. Its capacity is limited and can only handle a small amount of information at once.�ans��src��'《认知心理学》（斯滕伯格）� Cognitive Psychology (Sternberg)��id�b916dddf4a96�body�ٷ先玩容易让娱乐无限拉长、正事被推到精力最低点；先完成再放松，奖励变得确定且毫无负担。把难的事放在精力高点，是更省力的安排。��Playing first tends to stretch leisure and push real work to the lowest-energy point; finishing first makes the reward certain and guilt-free. Put hard tasks at your energy peak, a simpler arrangement.�ans��src��CBaumeister, R.F. & Tierney, J. (2011)《意志力》, Penguin Press�kBaumeister, R.F. & Tierney, J. (2011). Willpower: Rediscovering the Greatest Human Strength. Penguin Press.��id�b9daed12a795�body��h情绪是身体对环境的快速评估系统，每一种都有功能：恐惧帮你避开危险，愤怒帮你应对不公平，悲伤让你放慢脚步、反思并寻求支持，快乐激励你重复有益行为。情绪没有“坏的”，问题常在于情绪“过强、过久或不合情境”。理解情绪传递的信息，比消灭情绪更健康。��Emotions are the body's rapid appraisal system, and each serves a function: fear steers you from danger, anger mobilizes against injustice, sadness slows you down to reflect and seek support, joy motivates repeating what works. No emotion is “bad”; trouble comes when it's too intense, too long, or mismatched to the situation. Understanding the message beats suppressing the feeling.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ba488ac210b8�body��A幼儿有“快速映射”的能力：新词和新东西一起出现时，他们能迅速猜到意思，几遍之后就能建立关联。他们会借助说话者的目光、手势和语境线索来缩小猜测范围。这不是“背得快”，而是语言习得系统高效运用统计线索和社交线索的结果。�IToddlers possess “fast mapping”: when a new word and a new object appear together, they quickly guess the meaning and link them after a few exposures. They use the speaker's gaze, gestures, and context to narrow the guess. It isn't rote memorization but the language system efficiently exploiting statistical and social cues.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（语言与思维章）�<Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), language and thought chapter��id�bb0dcdcbf855�body���睡眠在记忆巩固中扮演主动角色；睡前学的东西能直接进入夜间巩固，而临考猛灌多停在脆弱的短期记忆，且缺觉直接损害提取。间隔加睡眠是记忆的两大盟友。��Sleep plays an active role in consolidation; material learned before bed enters overnight consolidation directly, while last-minute cramming stays in fragile short-term memory and sleep loss hurts retrieval. Spacing plus sleep are memory's two allies.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�bb5f3d1fdb1e�body��德韦克提出的成长型思维认为能力可通过努力与策略提升，而非固定不变。持此观点者更敢挑战、从失败中学习，而固定型思维者易因挫折否定自我。培养对“努力过程”的表扬有助于形成成长型思维。�␀Dweck's growth mindset holds that ability improves through effort and strategy rather than being fixed. Holders embrace challenge and learn from failure, while a fixed mindset ties self-worth to outcomes. Praising effort processes fosters a growth mindset.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�be7d00f69f7f�body���反复预演是想减少尴尬，但它会放大对出错的恐惧，并让人把注意力锁在自己身上而非对方。把焦点转向“我想了解对方什么”，比监视自己的表现更能缓解紧张。�Rehearsing is an attempt to avoid embarrassment, but it amplifies fear of mistakes and locks attention on yourself instead of the other person. Shifting focus to what you want to learn about the other person eases tension more than monitoring your own performance.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�be9460bd30f0�body��WEIRD 指西方、受教育、工业化、富裕、民主社会的大学生群体，他们仅占人类人口极少数却长期主导心理学样本。亨里奇等人指出，基于该群体的结论未必适用于其他文化，呼吁更具代表性的抽样。�	WEIRD stands for Western, Educated, Industrialized, Rich, Democratic samples—often undergraduates—who are a tiny fraction of humanity yet dominate psychology. Henrich and colleagues argue conclusions from them may not generalize, urging representative sampling.�ans��src��Y《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 方法卷;Nature Human Behaviour�=Annual Review of Psychology (methods); Nature Human Behaviour��id�bf022c866132�body�ٳJOMO 指主动退出信息洪流后体验到的轻松与平静。它提醒我们，并非每个热点都值得参与，留出空白反而能恢复注意力和真实的生活感。��JOMO is the relief and calm people feel after deliberately stepping off the information treadmill. It reminds us not every trend deserves attention, and leaving blanks actually restores focus and a sense of real life.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c04ecc8324e7�body���高度考试焦虑占用工作记忆、引发灾难化思维与生理唤醒，使已会的知识提取不出。降低法含充分模拟、放松训练与把焦虑重评为“准备信号”。��High test anxiety hijacks working memory and sparks catastrophic thoughts and arousal, blocking retrieval of known material. Relief includes realistic practice, relaxation, and reappraising anxiety as a readiness signal.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�c0ae98aac9ef�body���把模糊的不适具体命名为“焦虑”或“委屈”，能降低情绪唤起，这被称为影响标签。语言化让大脑的情绪反应更易被调节。它是对自己说话的简单技巧。��Pinpointing vague discomfort as 'anxiety' or 'grief' lowers emotional arousal, a process called affect labeling. Putting feelings into words makes the brain's emotional response easier to regulate. It is a simple talk-to-yourself skill.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c14efc5a8be2�body���肠道菌群通过神经、免疫与代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、血清素前体）与大脑双向沟通，称肠-脑轴。菌群失衡与焦虑抑郁风险相关，但吃益生菌治抑郁证据尚弱，健康饮食整体更可靠。�)Gut microbes talk to the brain bidirectionally via nerves, immunity and metabolites like short-chain fatty acids and serotonin precursors, the gut-brain axis. Dysbiosis links to anxiety and depression risk, but probiotics for depression are weakly evidenced; overall healthy diet is more reliable.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c1765e6adb4b�body�ٮ看来源：是否来自专业机构、是否注明依据、是否把个例当普遍结论。警惕“包好”“秒愈”的承诺，可靠信息通常谨慎、可核查。ٲCheck the source: is it from a professional body, does it cite basis, does it generalize from one case. Beware promises of instant cure; reliable info is cautious and verifiable.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�c2406929e2fd�body��费斯廷格提出当人的态度与行为冲突时会产生不适张力，便倾向于改变其中之一来恢复一致。经典实验里，付钱少却被迫为无聊任务说好话的人，后来反而更觉任务有趣。它说明行为也能重塑态度。�	Festinger proposed that conflict between attitude and behavior creates discomfort, driving change in one to restore consistency. In the classic study, those paid little to praise a boring task later found it more interesting. It shows behavior can reshape attitude.�ans��src��bRobert Cialdini,《Influence: The Psychology of Persuasion》Harper Business;中译《影响力》�7R. B. Cialdini, Influence, Harper Business; Chinese ed.��id�c267e4988cf6�body��z不同文化对直接性、眼神接触、沉默和拒绝方式的规则不同。东亚文化常用含蓄表达，直接拒绝可能显得粗鲁；许多西方文化则把直接沟通视为诚实。没有哪一套“更正确”，它们都是长期形成的沟通规范。跨文化交往中，保持好奇、多确认少猜测，比单纯套用自己熟悉的规则更有效。��Cultures differ in rules about directness, eye contact, silence, and refusal. East Asian cultures often favor indirect expression, where blunt refusal can seem rude; many Western cultures treat directness as honesty. Neither set is “more correct” — both are long-evolved communication norms. In cross-cultural encounters, curiosity and checking rather than assuming beats applying your own rules.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c4aae0de0b26�body���皮亚杰将认知发展分为感知运动、前运算、具体运算与形式运算四个阶段，认为儿童通过同化与顺应主动建构对世界的理解，思维能力随阶段跃迁而非简单累加。��Piaget proposed four stages—sensorimotor, preoperational, concrete operational, and formal operational—arguing children actively construct understanding through assimilation and accommodation, with qualitative leaps rather than mere accumulation.�ans��src��O皮亚杰 (1952). 《儿童智力的起源》. International Universities Press�\Piaget, J. (1952). The Origins of Intelligence in Children. International Universities Press��id�c545ba8a0159�body���改善失眠可从规律作息、睡前远离屏幕、营造安静黑暗环境入手，并减少床上清醒时的焦虑。认知行为疗法对慢性失眠效果优于药物。若长期严重应咨询医生。��Improving insomnia starts with regular schedules, avoiding screens before bed, a quiet dark room, and reducing anxiety while awake in bed. Cognitive behavioral therapy outperforms medication for chronic insomnia. For long severe cases, consult a doctor.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c5fba23d64d9�body���沉没成本指已经发生、无法收回的投入（如花掉的电影票钱）。理性决策应只看未来收益，但人们常因“已经投入这么多”而继续亏下去。懂得忽略沉没成本能避免越陷越深。��A sunk cost is an already spent, unrecoverable investment (like a paid movie ticket). Rational decisions should consider only future gains, yet people keep losing because 'I've already invested so much'. Ignoring sunk costs prevents digging deeper holes.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�c63a105f9ab0�body���社交媒体上人们大多只晒高光时刻，而你看到的是自己完整的日常。用全部真实的自己去对比别人精心筛选过的片段，很容易产生并不真实的失落感。��On social media people mostly post highlights, while you see your full ordinary day. Comparing your whole real self with others' curated snippets easily creates a false sense of falling short.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c6b9c4a63221�body���认知失调还能解释努力合理化（越难加入的团体越被看重）、自由选择后的偏好增强（选了 A 后更爱 A）以及为少量报酬说谎后改态度。只要行为难以外归因且感到自主，态度就会向行为靠拢。�Dissonance also explains effort justification (harder-to-join groups valued more), choice-induced preference change (loving A more after picking it), and attitude shift after low-pay lying. When behavior is hard to excuse externally and feels free, attitudes move toward it.�ans��src��Festinger 失调理论�Festinger's dissonance��id�c70e686cc706�body�� 青少年对同辈接纳高度敏感，群体在场会放大奖赏预期并削弱风险警觉，使其更易冒险或顺从。研究显示有同伴旁观时青少年冒险行为增加，而儿童与成人则不明显。理解这一点有助于用建设性同伴关系替代负面从众。�=Adolescents are highly sensitive to peer acceptance; peers present amplify reward anticipation and dull risk caution, increasing risk-taking or conformity. Studies show risk-taking rises with peers watching, unlike in children or adults. Understanding this helps build constructive peer ties over negative conformity.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�c72b1b3dd3b2�body���预注册是在数据收集前公开研究假设与分析计划，把“探险式挖数据”与“验证式检验”区分开，减少 p-hacking 与自选报告。它提高透明度，让结果更可信，而非限制探索。��Preregistration publicly fixes hypotheses and analysis plans before data collection, separating exploratory from confirmatory work and curbing p-hacking and selective reporting. It boosts transparency and trust without banning exploration.�ans��src�٤Open Science Collaboration（2015）《Science》重复百项心理学研究；Simmons、Nelson 与 Simonsohn（2011）《Psychological Science》假阳性心理学ٻOpen Science Collaboration (2015), Science, Estimating the reproducibility of psychological science; Simmons, Nelson and Simonsohn (2011), Psychological Science, False-positive psychology��id�c759cc1d1a46�body��q德韦克区分了两种心态：固定型思维认为能力是天生的、固定的，失败等于“我不行”；成长型思维认为能力可以通过努力和练习提升，失败只是过程中的反馈。持有成长型思维的人更愿意挑战难题，也更能从挫折中站起来。好消息是，心态不是固定的，可以通过练习慢慢转变。�iDweck distinguishes two mindsets: a fixed mindset sees ability as innate and fixed, so failure means “I'm not good”; a growth mindset sees ability as developable through effort and practice, so failure is just feedback. People with a growth mindset tackle harder challenges and bounce back better. The good news: mindsets themselves can shift with practice.�ans��src��GCarol S. Dweck,Mindset: The New Psychology of Success,Random House,2006�KCarol S. Dweck, Mindset: The New Psychology of Success, Random House, 2006.��id�c7c1c0d58733�body���旁观者效应指紧急事件中在场人数越多，任一个体出手概率越低。原因包括责任分散、社会影响（别人不动我也不动）和多元无知。明确指向某人求助可打破僵局。��The bystander effect: the more witnesses to an emergency, the less likely any one helps—due to diffusion of responsibility, social influence (no one else moves), and pluralistic ignorance. Singling out one person to help breaks the paralysis.�ans��src��Latané 与 Darley (1968)�Latané & Darley (1968)��id�c81c9cfbfa78�body��D正念是把注意力温和地带回当下，对此刻的念头和感受保持觉察而不评判。研究发现，长期练习可以降低压力反应、改善注意力和情绪调节，并作为抑郁复发预防的有效方法。它不需要“放空大脑”——注意到走神再轻轻拉回来，本身就是练习。�wMindfulness means gently returning attention to the present, noticing thoughts and feelings without judging them. Research shows regular practice lowers stress reactivity, improves attention and emotion regulation, and works as effective relapse prevention for depression. You don't need an empty mind — noticing you've wandered and gently returning is itself the practice.�ans��src��%NIMH（正念与心理健康研究）�-NIMH (mindfulness and mental health research)